window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":201,"title":"Chapter 201 - Want to Kill People in the Shop? The Shop Owner Is Angry!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ji Wuyou said with a chess piece in his hand, “It’s time to handle that young girl of the Nalan Family.”","“As for that girl...” The black-robed man said, “We must be cautious with that small shop; it’s not an ordinary shop.”","“I taught the assassins myself,” Ji Wuyou said, “They won’t give their target the time to react.”","“I told them to disguise themselves as civilian warriors and go into the shop. It’s said that once the customers are using the spiritual artifacts in that shop, they would sink into it. Do you think that girl will be alert at that time?”","“Right!” A sneer appeared on the black-robed man’s face. “Sometimes, people think they are in a safe place, but they might get killed there more easily!”","....","Ji Wu came to the shop with the old Eunuch Yu today.","“My lord, be careful!” Eunuch Yu sounded startled. “Those guys look weird!”","“Where are they?” Ji Wu’s eyes turned grim as he looked toward the direction that Eunuch Yu pointed at. Before the counter were about five warriors, and they were pointing their fingers at the customers in the shop. Then, two of them walked into the shop while the others walked toward the door.","Ji Wu saw that they walked directly behind Nalan Mingxue, and one of them moved his hand toward Nalan Mingxue’s tender neck.","Ji Wu was baffled. “What’s he doing?”","Then, he saw a faint chilling light flashing between that man’s fingers!","“Be careful!” Ji Wu yelled. Nalan Mingxue seemed to have sensed the danger as well, and she exited from the virtual reality mode, but it was too late to dodge the attack!","“Ahh!” Gasps sounded.","With one slight move, the assassin could instantly cut her throat!","Most of the high-level cultivators and warriors paid attention to their surroundings when they were playing games. Hearing the noises, people like Lan Mo, An Huwei, Xue Daolv, and Liang Heihu all sensed it and looked over.","However, due to the suddenness of the attack, it was too late for them to help!","At this moment, Fang Qi was in the Game Cultivating Room, and many swords hovered in the air behind him!","Opposite to him, Li Xiaoyao also controlled many swords and shot toward him!","Now, Fang Qi’s Innumerable Sword Scroll could do more than just fall from the sky or attack from one direction!","When Li Xiaoyao’s swords attacked him from different directions, Fang Qi also controlled the many swords to defend himself from all directions!","On the first floor, the assassin showed a cold smile, knowing that he would succeed!","Fang Qi was at the peak moment during the battle with Li Xiaoyao when he heard the alarm, “Intruders are detected. Danger level is high – activating emergency lightning condemnation!”","Behind Nalan Mingxue, a dark red lightning bolt flashed!","The two warriors behind Nalan Mingxue instantly froze!","Almost all the cultivators and warriors shivered at the sight!","At this moment, Fang Qi hurried down from the second floor with a dark expression. “What happened?”","Intruders didn’t sound like a good thing!","Fang Qi had never imagined that someone would try to kill his customers while they were enjoying the games!","“Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked fearful. “There were two assassins! Fortunately, they were knocked down by the Senior’s lightning spell!”","“Assassins?” In the past, the instructors of Lingyun Academy only dared to station outside of the shop; they didn’t dare to catch people in the shop!","But now, someone had entered the shop and even almost killed his customers according to Jiang Xiaoyue?!","It was outrageous!","If this situation continued, how could he keep his business going?! At this thought, Fang Qi got furious!","“They have company!” Ji Wu said in a deep voice.","As the Emperor of Dajin, he would never allow anyone to assassinate a genius in his country!","Hearing Ji Wu’s shout, the three guys waiting at the door fled instantly!","Ji Wu was the first one to dash after them. The others joined him at the same time!","The three assassins leaped onto the roof and ran in three directions! Obviously, they were high-level warriors. Two of them were at the Ancestral Warrior Realm, and the other was at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm!","With a dark expression, Fang Qi lifted his hand and a bright silver-colored sword energy shot out. Then, it split into two before turning into four. This process continued until they turned into a wave of silver white sword energies!","“You want to run?” Fang Qi had never been so furious before. “I’ll let you run 400 meters, okay?”","The silver-white sword energies split into three streaks, flying in three directions! Each of the sword energies emitted silver-white light from the blade, and their speed was beyond everyone’s imagination!","Instantly, two streaks of sword energies caught the two Ancestral Warriors and pierced them through their chests!","The remaining Grand Ancestral Warrior knew that he couldn’t outrun the sword energies, so he stopped and turned around, stabbing out a chilly sword.","“Wasp Pierce!”","The chilly sword in his hand instantly turned into many sword shadows! In the nightly sky, large numbers of sword energies collided with the sword shadows, creating loud, ear-piercing, metal-colluding noises.","People now were able to see that there were about 100 sword energies in each streak, and each blade released dazzling lightning energy when colliding!","After blocking about 10 sword energies, the assassin’s movement slowed down, and his body was engulfed by a cloud of lightning energy.","In the blink of an eye, his sword was sent flying!","“Don’t kill him!” someone yelled.","The sword energies split again and shot past the assassin from both sides. Then, the assassin dropped to the ground in spasms and was unconscious after the lightning energy overtook him.","“Is this... the sword control technique?!”","“It’s the Innumerable Sword Scroll! But I don’t know what the lightning energy is; it doesn’t look like the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell.”","“It’s horrifying!”","“No one can escape from it!”","“One can’t block it or escape from it!”","Everyone clicked their tongues at the sight of this powerful sword technique!","“Let’s find out who sent them, and then we will put them on the blacklist!”","“The shop owner is angry!” Nalan Mingxue and Lan Yan had planned to come up and thank Fang Qi, but they shivered in guilt when they saw his dark expression.","After the narrow escape, Nalan Mingxue was still pale with fright.","“Sir...” Lan Yan asked uneasily, “The shop... will guarantee the customers’ safety, right?”","Displeased, Fang Qi glared at them and said, “It’s you guys again? How come you’re so troublesome? If such things happen again, you don’t need to come here anymore!”","It was unheard of that one might be killed while playing games.","At this thought, the people in the shop were all alarmed. They shivered when they thought of the possibility of being killed while enjoying games.","Fortunately, that Senior is powerful, they thought.","They had only heard of this Senior’s great power, but now they had seen and felt it in person!","..."]},{"number":202,"title":"Chapter 202","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Not the King Warrior Realm?!” With a grim expression, Shangguan Yuan sensed Elder Fu’s aura and seemed relieved. “From his aura... I think he hasn’t reached the Emperor Warrior Realm yet!”","Otherwise, they would be absolutely no match for two Emperor Warriors!","I’m surprised that Nalan Hongwu has a master who is almost an Emperor Warrior beside him! Shangguan Yuan thought, Nalan Hongwu is indeed an old sly fox!","“No! We’re not his match!” One of the King Warriors yelled in astonishment, “We were wrong!”","“Don’t panic!” Seeing that his dress-up was useless, Shangguan Yuan dumped it and yelled in a deep voice, “I’ll handle Nalan Hongwu, and all of you try to kill Lin Fu!”","“Mr. Shangguan! You...” The others were baffled, not understanding how Shangguan Yuan, a master who was close to the Emperor Warrior Realm, could handle Nalan Hongwu, a real Emperor Warrior.","“Shangguan Yuan! It’s you!” Now that Shangguan Yuan didn’t disguise his voice, Nalan Hongwu recognized him.","“It’s me!” Shangguan Yuan threw the black sword onto the ground and sneered, “Since the sword has no effect on you, it’s useless to me! However...”","Instantly, his aura grew so violently that everyone was shocked!","This overwhelming pressure was...","“Warrior... Emperor Warrior Realm?!”","Shangguan Yan sneered, “I knew that Ji Wuyou was unreliable. Do you think that only you can conceal strength?!”","Seeing Shangguan Yuan showing such powerful strength, his companions were relieved. “Let’s kill Lin Fu first and then get rid of Nalan Hongwu! They are dead!”","Nalan Hongwu moved forward slightly as if he wanted to get to the black sword on the ground beside Shangguan Yuan.","Shangguan Yuan stepped on the sword and then kicked it behind him. “You want it?”","He beckoned at Nalan Hongwu and taunted, “Come and get it.”","He tried to anger Nalan Hongwu and stall him.","Suddenly, Nalan Hongwu pointed out his finger!","At this sight, Shangguan Yuan was startled and had a bad feeling, but he didn’t know why.","Then, he sensed a movement behind him, and he moved aside. The sword behind him flew into Nalan Hongwu’s hand as if it were alive!","Shangguan Yuan was shocked.","He stared at Nalan Hongwu as if he was looking at a ghost!","“What combat technique was that?!”","“Master of the Shangguan Family, you should have gone out and broadened your views instead of staying at home and making schemes!” Nalan Hongwu waved the black sword in his hand, and the sword let out a cry.","This sword was made of a block of tough iron that was buried deep under the Kirin Cliff. The people in the Fu Family didn’t like it, but Fu Beihai had brought it with him into battles.","As time went on, a trace of a spirit had grown inside the sword!","After 200 years, this trace of the spirit was woken up again!","Instantly, the sword cry resonated in the area with piercing power!","It sounded like a fierce tiger jumping out of the trap and a hidden dragon flying out of the water!","A fierce beast finally got out of imprisonment after 200 years!","For some reason, Nalan Hongwu felt a weak connection with the sword. Besides, he even sensed a combat technique hidden in the sword!","All the previous doubts and bafflement were gone when he sensed the combat technique left in the sword!","No one would leave their best combat techniques in the sword for the enemy if they had hatred in their hearts!","“This is the combat technique, North Ocean (Bei Ming) Sword Essence?!” Complicated expressions flashed across Nalan Hongwu’s old face, including sadness, joy, bitterness, and happiness.","When Dajin was newly established, Fu Beihai, the leader of Kirin Cliff, knew that he couldn’t turn the tide. After the battle with the troops of Dajin, he died voluntarily in the Sky Prison Mountain and left his combat technique in his sword.","Everything was clear now.","“I was the narrow-minded one!” Nalan Hongwu heaved a heavy sigh with complicated feelings inside him. Although he was still regretful, the heavy burden on his mind was removed.","His wrinkled hands caressed the body of the black sword as if he were looking at an old friend. “You can rest in peace now...”","Looking at the surging energy around Nalan Hongwu, Shangguan Yuan was alarmed and knew that he couldn’t wait any longer!","He condensed his warrior qi and smashed his fist toward Nalan Hongwu with vicious force!","However, before his fist touched Nalan Hongwu’s chest, it was blocked completely!","His fist was caught by Nalan Hongwu’s right hand, and the latter pushed and sent Shangguan Yuan flying for dozens of meters!","Holding the black sword, Nalan Hongwu looked quite different now; he looked calm and serene.","“Master! I can’t last any longer!” Elder Fu was fighting with seven peak stage King Warriors!","“I’ll allow you to attack once.”","“Arrogance!” Shangguan Yuan’s voice was chilly. “Both of us are Emperor Warriors. Do you think that you can kill me easily?”","Shangguan Yuan’s warrior qi rushed out and fluttered his clothes.","Then, the invisible force lifted him slowly into the sky, and he was hundreds of meters above the cliff.","He raised his right fist, and his dragon-like aura scattered all the raindrops within 30 meters of him into particles!","Illuminated by the lightning flashes, he looked like a demonic god!","Comparatively, Nalan Hongwu looked like a flying leaf in the sky. He showed no powerful force or any pressure.","With Shangguan Yuan punching out, the abundant and violent warrior qi on his fist dashed out like a dragon.","The force contained in the punch was so great that it felt like it was going to swallow the sky and the earth!","“Swallow Mountain!”","Meanwhile, the black sword in Nalan Hongwu’s hand moved slightly, and it looked like a small boat in the violent ocean of warrior qi released from Shangguan Yuan.","In the next moment, the black sword slashed out steadily when the punch got close to Nalan Hongwu.","An invincible sword essence spread out like ripples!","“North Ocean Sword Essence!”","Even the lightning bolts in the sky were engulfed by something at this instant!","Blood splashed out, and the 100-meter-tall cliff behind Shangguan Yuan was cut into two parts!","“How... How could it be?!” Shangguan Yuan’s expression turned from disbelief to shock and horror!","“As gentle as water benefits all things but does not compete. I finally gained some understanding of this,” Nalan Hongwu stroked his beard and said.","“Do you know why you were defeated?” Nalan Hongwu flew to Shangguan Yuan’s side and asked.","Shangguan Yuan dropped to the ground listlessly, his eyes wide with shock and bafflement. “...”","He seemed to hear his rival say something like...","“Did I hear it wrong??!!”","...","A dark beam of light flashed across the battlefield!","The peak stage King Warriors instantly flew back in horror!","“Shangguan Yuan is dead. Tell me the mastermind behind this, or you’ll die.” Nalan Hongwu stroked his beard and said mildly, “The old Shangguan Yuan wasn’t someone who could make such a crafty scheme.”","In the flashing lightning bolts, these King Warriors looked at the god-like Nalan Hongwu who was standing on the black sword and were shocked to their cores."]},{"number":203,"title":"Chapter 203 - You Must Use Your Brain While Playing Games","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“No!” In the small shop a few kilometers away, the black-robed man behind Ji Wuyou was shocked.","“What’s wrong?” Ji Wuyou asked in bafflement.","“Nalan Hongwu’s aura got stronger instead of turning weak!” The black-robed man said, “Something is wrong!”","“It can’t be...” Ji Wuyou looked confused.","Of course, he knew that Fang Qi’s shop could increase people’s cultivation strength, but it should only work on the low-level warriors such as Song Qingfeng.","How could it increase the strengths of warriors so fast?!","He didn’t know that Nalan Hongwu had gained a breakthrough after his mental burden was ditched.","He would never know that Fang Qi’s shop could solve mind issues and increase mental strength!","At this moment, a roar came from the distance and a figure appeared in the darkness nearby in the blink of an eye.","“Let’s go!” The black-robed man grabbed Ji Wuyou and patted the storage spiritual artifact hanging at his belt, and a boat-shaped spiritual artifact grew in the air. In the blink of an eye, a spiritual boat appeared, and the two of them jumped onto it.","As for their subordinates, they were all left behind.","Ignoring the subordinates, Nalan Hongwu leaped into the air and arrived above the spiritual boat instantly.","At this moment, the spiritual boat only had the time to spread out its spiritual energy shield!","Nalan Hongwu held the black sword and didn’t seem to be using any combat technique, but the sword released a power greater than ordinary combat techniques when it was slashed down.","Crack!","The overwhelming warrior qi instantly broke the spiritual energy shield!","Like a demonic god, Nalan Hongwu landed on the spiritual boat and picked Ji Wuyou up by his neck as if he were a little chick.","“Nalan Hongwu, do you want to be the enemy of the East Ocean Ji Family?!” Ji Wuyou yelled in horror.","He couldn’t understand why Nalan Hongwu didn’t die and instead got stronger!","“I was in retirement for years, and it seems that your East Ocean Ji Family has forgotten about my abilities! You sent people to attack the Nalan Family and launch sneak-attacks on me. If not for my abilities, I would have died long ago. Do you really think that I don’t dare to kill you?! I’ll settle the accounts with that old East Ocean Regional King sooner or later! I know he is behind all this!”","“Your Highness! I apologize!” The black-robed man turned into a mass of black mist and flew in the opposite direction of the spiritual boat!","The mass of black mist moved so fast that it became a black dot in the blink of an eye!","At this moment, the black sword flew out of Nalan Hongwu’s hand!","A few kilometers away, a black light pierced through the black mist!","“How... could it be?!”","A corpse dropped from the sky.","The sword control technique of the Shu Mountain (Shushan) Faction commanded swords with essence. If the sword had spirit, and the warrior qi was great, the power of this technique would at least double!","Meanwhile, Nalan Hongwu tightened his grip!","Snap!","...","“Sir...”","Fang Qi had caught the assassins with Innumerable Sword Scroll, the advanced version of the sword control technique. Even though that Grand Ancestral Warrior had blocked a lot of the sword energies, the lightning energy around the sword energies kept shocking him and helped to break his defense.","Song Qingfeng rubbed his hands and asked eagerly, “Was that the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell?”","“The Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell can activate heavenly power, but the technique that we saw didn’t do that!” Lin Shao asked in surprise, “Sir, what was that powerful technique? We’ve never seen it before!”","The other cultivators and warriors also looked toward him and exclaimed, “You broke his combat technique instantly!”","“Was that the power of the sword control technique?” Lan Mo and Xue Daolv looked at each other with bitter smiles, thinking, This kid’s cultivation strength seems to be only at the Ancestral Warrior Realm, but he just killed two Ancestral Warriors and a Grand Ancestral Warrior! He is horrifyingly powerful!","Although cultivators were more powerful than warriors when they were on a similar level, even a cultivator with Fang Qi’s cultivation strength couldn’t skip a big realm and kill a Grand Ancestral Warrior!","However, he had defeated the Grand Ancestral Warrior in one second!","It was scary!","All of them looked at Fang Qi, waiting quietly for his answer.","Fang Qi said, “My shop has many games and TV series which contain many combat techniques. No one said that you can’t use them in combination. It was Holy Shock.”","“Huh?” Song Qingfeng and An Cheng who excelled in Diablo was stupefied. “Sir, Paladins can only battle in close range, right? Can they use Holy Shock from the distance?”","“When you play Paladin, you can go and buy a javelin and see if the lightning power will be carried over!” Fang Qi rolled his eyes at them. “Who told you that Holy Shock can’t be used from a distance? You must use your brains while playing games!”","Everyone was at a loss for words. Can we do that?! We all thought that the Paladins fought at close range!","“Boss...” Jiang Xiaoyue grabbed Fang Qi’s sleeve and looked at him pitiably, saying, “I want... I want to learn the sword control technique too...”","She had been watching the others practice the sword control technique, and she couldn’t bear it anymore!","Despite the ‘suppression’ of the ‘evil’ boss, she made the decision today that she would learn the sword control today! Worst come to worst, she would just stay in the shop for a few more years and work!","“Well...” Fang Qi had been thinking of increasing employee benefits, and teaching her the sword control technique could be counted as one of the benefits.","...","Not wanting to investigate the issue since the others were already on it, Fang Qi continued his training in the Game Cultivation Room.","After the shop was closed, Fang Qi took Jiang Xiaoyue to the street outside and tossed her a wooden sword.","“Boss! Why is it a wooden sword?” Jiang Xiaoyue pouted.","“Why not?” Fang Qi said, “The true masters can inflict damage with flowers and leaves. I give you the wooden sword because I think that you are really talented!”","“Oh?! Really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s eyes lit up, and she said happily as she held onto the wooden sword with her small hands, “You finally recognized my talent! Will you teach me the sword control technique now?”","“Each night after the shop closes, you can spend two hours on cultivation, and I’ll teach you the sword control technique!” Fang Qi said, “This is the employee benefit!”","“Then, I want to learn how to fly on swords, close-range combat skill, Holy Shock, Innumerable Sword Scroll...” Jiang Xiaoyue listed about ten techniques and skills which were dashing and powerful as she imagined the scene where she mastered all of them.","Fang Qi flicked his finger on her forehead and said, “Learn the sword control technique first...”","Then, he began teaching her the technique in detail and giving her the key instructions of the sword control technique.","“The core of the sword control technique of the Shu Mountain Faction is controlling the sword with essence...”","Two hours later, Jiang Xiaoyue moved her hand, and the wooden sword at her feet shook slightly before suddenly flying up!","“Good!” Fang Qi nodded with satisfaction. “You’re as talented as Nalan Mingxue. You must practice it each day. If she dares to show off her talent, you just dazzle her with your sword control technique! Do you remember?”","The heartless and talentless shop owner taught her.","“Got it! Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s small face was full of pride.","Bam!","The wooden sword suddenly fell to the ground.","“...”"]},{"number":204,"title":"Chapter 204 - Internet Cafe Competition: Infancy of E-Sports","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The next day was Sunday.","Everything returned to normal, and it seemed that nothing had an impact on the small shop.","When Fang Qi opened the door in the morning, he received another task.","Fang Qi yawned. “You keep giving me tasks! Are you not concerned that I’ll die of fatigue? I haven’t completed the previous task yet!”","The System was silent.","Fang Qi opened the System Interface and glanced at it.","[Internet Cafe Competition]","Huh? What is this? Fang Qi wondered.","[New Task: Internet Cafe Competition","Games: Diablo 2, Counter Strike","Task Description: Organize a competition in the internet cafe; the reward for the task is in the cupboard.","Reward for Diablo 1 vs 1:","The first place – a Unique Item in Diablo 2 (below level 20), a one-month membership that offers two additional hours of play time per day, and a unique trophy.","The second place – a Rare Item (below level 15), a two-week membership with the same benefits, and a unique trophy.","The third place – a Magic Item (below level 10), a one-week membership with the same benefits, and a unique trophy.","The third to eighth places will each get a one-week membership.","Reward for Counter Strike 5 vs 5:","The first place – one AWP sniper rifle with bullets, one-month memberships that offers two additional hours of playtime per day for all team members, and a unique trophy.","The second place – one AK47 assault rifle with bullets, two-week memberships with the same benefits, and a unique trophy.","The third place – one Desert Eagle pistol with bullets, one-week memberships with the same benefits, and a unique trophy.","The third to eighth places will each get one-week memberships.","Task Procedure: Everything from the round of 16 will be broadcasted live.","Registration Time: 3 days","Preparation Time: 1 day","Task Reward: any one of the items in the games in the competition.]","Seeing this task, Fang Qi knew that he would be busy for a while.","Sitting with Jiang Xiaoyue at the counter, Fang Qi made a bowl of instant noodles and added a sausage. While he enjoyed it, Jiang Xiaoyue ate buns and glared at him in jealousy.","Today, Fang Qi put up two small blackboards. One was for the shop rules while the other was about the competition. The most eye-catching one was the Internet Cafe Competition.","Fang Qi underlined the key points with colored chalk.","Therefore, many people noticed it upon entering the shop.","“Ugh? Internet Cafe Competition?” Xu Zixin just arrived. “Sir, what’s that?”","Fang Qi knocked on the black board. “Everything’s on here.”","“Ugh...” Xu Zixin read them carefully and said, “The awards are items?! Real items?!”","“What competition? Real items?” Su Tianji strode into the shop with her two disciples.","“Look here...” Xu Zixin pointed at the small blackboard and said in amazement, “The shop owner is holding an Internet Cafe Competition, and the awards are real items in the games!”","“What?! Competition?” Su Tianji was astonished since she knew how special the items in the games were.","“Diablo 2?!” Su Tianji was full of regrets. “I haven’t played it!”","Then, she saw Counter Strike!","“The award for the first place is a sniper rifle?!” Su Tianji’s eyes lit up. “The first place of Counter Strike Competition is mine!”","Fang Qi laughed after hearing her words. “You’re a bit too confident.”","Su Tianji looked at Fang Qi murderously and said, “Will you enter the competition as well?”","“I won’t.” Fang Qi pointed at the small black board. “Didn’t you see that it’s a team competition?”","“How can you do that?!” Su Tianji said, “Don’t you have individual competitions?”","Fang Qi said, “I don’t know about the future, but this time, it’s no!”","“Besides, each player can only register for one competition.” Fang Qi continued after thinking for a bit. “You must consider which competition you want to enter carefully since you can’t enter both.”","Su Tianji looked gloomy. “Why does Diablo have individual competitions?”","Fang Qi simply replied, “I didn’t make the rules.”","Su Tianji swallowed her complaint since she couldn’t question ‘that senior’.","At this moment, people like Xue Daolv and An Huwei also came into the shop.","Seeing the group at the counter, they were baffled and then surprised when they heard about the competition.","“Competition?!”","They played games purely for fun and the increase of cultivation strength; they had never imagined that there would be a competition!","This was fun!","“How do I register for the competition?” Xue Daolv had always wanted weapons such as the sniper rifles and pistols.","If he could have a sniper rifle with array formations engraved on it, it would definitely be a killing machine.","Although the other two guns were not as powerful as the sniper rifle, the creation processes were similar, and it would be a good opportunity to study it if he could get his hands on one of them.","“A Unique Item?” Li Haoran exclaimed, “It means that we can study the different artifact-making methods of Diablo?!”","“Something like that.” Fang Qi corrected him. “It should be called crafting.”","The top-level item that a player could get from this competition was an Unique Item, which meant that the items with runewords couldn’t be obtained.","Fang Qi had to rely on his own task to get the items with runewords.","It was the reward for him as the organizer of this Internet Cafe Competition.","“I’ll enter the Diablo Competition!” An Cheng made the decision immediately since his sorcerer character was among the top ranks in the internet cafe!","They had never imagined that they could win real items through a competition!","“I’ll enter the competition too!” Su Tianji said immediately, “I’ll enter the Counter Strike team competition.”","“Where’s your team?” Fang Qi rolled his eyes since she tried to enter the team competition all by herself.","“Eh...” Su Tianji paused for a few seconds before dashing away. “Then, I’ll get people right now!”","Standing by her side, Xue Daolv was furious. “Am I not good enough?!”","While Fang Qi was busy with organizing the competition, a well-dressed and thin middle-aged cultivator brought a young man who was wearing a white robe with a golden trim to the door of the internet cafe.","This well-dressed and thin middle age cultivator was Huo Chong!","“If your information is right, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance gave up the opportunity of entering the Cultivation Realm Conference because of this shop! This shop has poisoned the whole Jiangnan Region, and now even the Wuwei Daoist Alliance is in its control!” Huo Chong said."]},{"number":205,"title":"Chapter 205 - Mr. Fang’s Second-Hand Smoke","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The word ‘Saint’ in the name of the Three Saint Gates was given to them by others.","The three big factions were the Taixi Faction, the Xuanzhong Manor, and Yuxu Mountain. They had a long history on this land, and no other forces were their match.","The three forces lived in seclusion and only showed their faces in the Cultivation Realm Conference which was held every 30 years, but their strengths were greater than that of any other forces!","It was why people called them ‘Saints’.","Feng Xi was only a first-generation disciple of the Taixi Faction. Although he was in the same generation as the Faction Master, he was an ordinary disciple.","However, this was enough for him to travel the world with honor. Besides, he had a supreme treasure on him. Even if the retired grand elders of the forces in Wuwei Daoist Alliance were here, they wouldn’t feel strange listening to Feng Xi, let alone the Faction Masters and Palace Masters.","As a disciple of the Taixi Faction, he was very confident of himself!","“Is there such a place?!” A trace of cold light appeared in Feng Xi’s narrowed eyes.","He waved his hand, and the door was supposed to open!","However, nothing happened!","Huo Chong froze. Then, he quickly glanced at Feng Xi and walked up to push open the door!","Was that just an accident? Feng Xi walked into the shop, and his gaze remained cold and distant.","Soon, he saw a group of people standing before the counter.","He recognized some of them since he had seen them at the last Cultivation Realm Conference, such as Xue Daolv, the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master, and Ye Songtao, the Cloud Ocean Faction Master.","“Sir! I want to enter the Counter Strike team competition!” Ye Songtao led his disciples and daughter, Ye Xiaoye, to register for the competition.","All the people were busy with the registration, and no one spared a glance at Huo Chong or Feng Xi.","It was probably the first time that a member of the Three Saint Gates got ignored outside of their forces!","“Ms. Feng...” Seeing the people standing around the counter and ignoring them, Huo Chong said indignantly, “These guys are disregarding you!”","“It doesn’t matter.” Feng Xi looked indifferent. “They will change their minds soon.”","A breeze blew into the shop through the open door, and this young man who was wearing a white robe with golden trim emitted an indescribable aura. It seemed like the sunlight focused on him, creating a layer of golden light around him and giving people the illusion that he was an immortal.","“Ugh?” Fang Qi was explaining the rules of the competition when all of them turned their attention away from him suddenly.","Immediately, he looked over and saw a handsome young man with sharp eyebrows and bright eyes standing at the door. The sunshine shone into the shop from his behind, giving him a golden aura and making him look like an immortal who descended from heaven!","Anyone who saw him would feel stunned!","“He’s so powerful!” Sitting beside Fang Qi, Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed and stared at the man without blinking. Before she could finish her sentence, someone covered her eyes.","“This is a cultivation method of the Taixi Faction of the Three Saint Gates, and it is called Grandeur!” Xue Daolv whispered, “It can absorb people’s minds and is very powerful!”","As the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master, he wasn’t affected, but his expression turned grim. “It doesn’t bode well that the people from the Three Saints Gate came here in person...”","“What Three Saint Gates?” Fang Qi pointed at the immortal-like young man and asked, “Do you mean this egoist who wants all the attention?”","Hearing Fang Qi’s words, the shop suddenly fell silent.","Then, Fang Qi dug out a cigarette box from his pocket and lit one of the special cigarettes that the System produced.","[TL Note: Smoking is bad. Don’t smoke unless you have the cigarettes especially made by the System.]","He inhaled lightly, and the front end of the cigarette turned red.","He blew out the smoke, and the people before the counter seemed to smell an elegant fragrance of tobacco. Many of them had been staring at the immortal-looking young man in a daze, but now they shivered and woke up!","In contrast, Fang Qi now seemed to be engulfed in a cloud of celestial smoke!","“It’s fine! It’s fine!” Fang Qi waved his hand and took a whiff. “Let’s continue with the rules of the competition.”","The two new-comers were dumbfounded.","“Mr. Feng...” Huo Chong said, “They are still ignoring us. Should I...”","“No!” As a disciple of the Taixi Faction, Feng Xi would feel ashamed if he needed Huo Chong’s help.","His squinted eyes opened slowly, and an intense light shot out from his eyes!","The people couldn’t help looking toward him again. Looking at his bright and dazzling eyes, they had the sudden urge to submit to him!","Then, a puff of smoke came up!","The thick smoke almost formed a wall.","“Now, I’ll explain the rules for the 1 vs 1 competition for Diablo 2...” Fang Qi continued.","Huo Chong coughed, and so did Feng Xi.","Feng Xi stopped coughing after a while, and his face twitched. He is indeed not an ordinary man, and he dares to challenge our Three Saint Gates!","“Mr. Feng!” Huo Chong said, “It seems that they are also having a competition! I took a look and found that the ranking system is almost the same as that of the Cultivation Realm Conference! It is a blatant challenge to you and your faction!”","“I was wondering how a small shop could control so many cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance.” Feng Xi sneered and said, “It seems that it has its ways. By promising them rewards, it persuaded them to give up entering the Cultivation Realm Conference! Very smart!”","He walked to the front of the crowd and squeezed to stand before the counter, and he said coldly, “Is this the shop that held back the cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance? Are you purposefully sabotaging the Cultivation Realm Conference?”","“Cultivation Realm Conference?” Fang Qi glanced around in confusion. “What’s that?”","“Don’t play dumb!” Huo Chong held a grudge against this shop ever since he failed the boycotting efforts. Happy that the Three Saint Gates was behind him, he accused Fang Qi, “Your small shop copied the format of the Cultivation Realm Conference and is holding a competition as well to interfere with it. Do you still want to claim that you don’t know anything about it, Mr. Fang? In my opinion, you have your own agenda, right? Mr. Fang?” Huo Chong sneered and said.","Then, he glanced at the small black board in disdain. “What are these rewards? How can they compare with the rewards offered by the Three Saint Gates?”","Fang Qi was at a loss for words. Looking at the thin cultivator who was jumping in front of him, he said impatiently, “Who is this moron? Do you two want to cause trouble?”","Feng Xi’s face turned cold since no one ever dared to speak to him like this. After all, he was from the Taixi Faction.","“Are you the owner of this shop?” He said, “Although I don’t know why you are so bold to do this, I advise you to cancel this competition. Then, I won’t make things difficult to you.” After all, Feng Xi thought that it was not necessary to deal with an ant, even if this ant caused some trouble for them.","They would be satisfied if the Cultivation Realm Competition could go on successfully."]},{"number":206,"title":"Chapter 206 - People Showing off Are Destined to Be Struck by Lightning","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: This phrase is an internet slang meant to warn people not to show off.]","Fang Qi looked around the room and then at the young man before him.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue who was sitting next to him, asked, “Who are you? Why do you want us to cancel the competition?”","Fang Qi asked Xue Daolv who was by his side, “Palace Master Xue, are these so-called Three Saint Gates very famous here? They sound lofty with the word ‘Saint’ in their name, but how come I’ve never heard of them before?”","“...”","“Mr. Fang, should I say that you’re ignorant or just playing dumb?” Huo Chong mocked.","Therefore, Xue Daolv had to explain to Fang Qi the background of the Three Saint Gates.","“Three hermit factions?” Fang Qi glanced at them. “Then, why did they come out here?”","Feng Xi’s face twitched, and he was about to lose his temper.","At this moment, Lan Mo, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Master, came in.","Is he the messenger from the Taixi Faction?! Lan Mo was surprised that a messenger from the Taixi Faction had come into the shop!","Mr. Fang knows people from the Taixi Faction? he thought.","“Alliance Master Lan,” Feng Xi snorted at the sight of Lan Mo. “Since you’re all here, I’ll go straight to the point. Now, I’ll give you one last chance to choose. Although I don’t know how this shop made you give up on the Cultivation Realm Conference, you can rest assured that you have me, a disciple of the Taixi Faction, behind you! If they dare to play dirty tricks, we’ll handle them. I’ll see if anyone dares to play tricks in front of me!”","These words were both a warning to this shop and a threat to the cultivators in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. From his perspective, the people would choose differently this time after he said that.","However, the room was silent, and no one responded!","“Why would they go to the Cultivation Realm?” At this moment, Nalan Hongwu walked into the shop. “Instead of fighting there and putting their lives on the line, they are better off staying behind and playing here for a month.”","Nalan Hongwu said those words from his own experience. Thanks to this shop, he had gained a breakthrough and improved his mental strength. Even if he went to the Cultivation Realm, he didn’t know how long it would take to achieve these results.","“It’s none of your business!”","“Saint Messenger!” Lan Mo said, “Senior Nalan is right. Please leave!”","“You...” Feng Qi’s face fell with disbelief. He looked toward Xue Daolv and Ye Songtao and asked, “Do you think the same?”","No one answered him, but it was obvious they that agreed with Lan Mo.","“Stubborn!” Feng Xi glared at Fang Qi and said, “Although I don’t know what this shop promised you, it seems that the shop owner is determined to interfere with the Cultivation Realm Conference which is held every 30 years!”","“Although our Three Saint Gates don’t care about you, it would be a disgrace if everyone else copies you and doesn’t attend the Cultivation Realm Conference! Just as my master said, since the people of the Taixi Faction rarely come to the mainland, some people don’t know who they are messing with!”","He waved his left arm, and a small bronze cauldron flew into the air from his sleeve!","The round cauldron had a cubical space inside. After it was activated, it released a shocking aura!","“No!” All the high-level cultivators exclaimed at the sight, “The Demon-Suppressing Cauldron! It’s the supreme treasure, the Demon-Suppressing Cauldron!”","“He even brought a supreme treasure with him!” Xue Daolv whispered to Fang Qi, “Can the Senior... handle it?”","Hearing Xue Daolv’s question, many other high-level cultivators also looked over.","“Supreme treasure?!” Fang Qi asked in bafflement, “Is this thing very powerful?”","“It’s more than powerful!” Xue Daolv’s face turned dark at Fang Qi’s ignorance. “Each supreme treasure could be regarded as the ultimate treasure to a faction... Besides, this supreme treasure is a high-level one... It’s quite likely that it’s the legendary Demon-Suppressing Cauldron!”","“A high-level one?” Fang Qi frowned.","Many customers exclaimed when the small cauldron grew to the size bigger than a person in a blink of an eye. If it continued growing, it would break the shop and probably crush Fang Qi and the people around him!","“Yeah...” Xue Daolv nodded.","Before he could finish, he saw a sight that dumbfounded him and everyone else.","The cauldron had grown to the height of several people, and all the customers backed away from it. At this moment, it emitted horrifying black light and shivered as if it tried to grow but couldn’t do it!","It was all because it had touched the ceiling!","“What’s wrong?!” Feng Xi immediately chanted his spiritual spell and yelled, “Suppress!”","The bronze cauldron shook, but it still couldn’t break the ceiling, let alone suppress the people!","Feng Xi activated all the spiritual essence in his body and yelled angrily, “Suppress them for me!”","He even began to sweat.","However, the big cauldron shook in vain.","Annoyed, Fang Qi waved his hand and said, “Someone is causing trouble here!”","Crack!","A lightning bolt crashed down!","Everyone was dumbfounded when they looked at the Saint Messenger of the Taixi Faction, who was now lying on the ground with white foam coming out of his mouth.","“Don’t you know that showing off will get you struck by lightning?!” Fang Qi waved his hand, and the shop door opened automatically right before Feng Xi was tossed out!","Then, Fang Qi looked at Huo Chong. “Will you go out yourself or do you want me to throw you out?”","“How did you open the door with just a wave?!” Huo Chong was slow to react.","Fang Qi grabbed his collar and tossed him out next.","“...”","“The Senior is so powerful...”","“Awesome! The Demon-Suppressing Cauldron can’t even break the ceiling!”","“What’s the realm of this cultivator? It must be above the Divine Ocean Realm, right?”","“Showing off means you will get struck by lightning!” The people talked among themselves animatedly.","“Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at the cauldron and asked, “What shall we do with this cauldron?”","Looking at the big cauldron, Fang Qi also didn’t know what to do. “Shall we electrocute it as well?”","The big cauldron seemed to understand Fang Qi’s words, and it shivered and immediately shrunk to its original size!","“Hiss! He got the supreme treasure so easily?!” Many people looked at the cauldron with greed. After all, it was a supreme treasure!","However, when they thought back to that lightning strike, they shivered in fear!","It was better not to think about this supreme treasure!","“It’s not wise to take a supreme treasure from the Taixi Faction!” The people like Xue Daolv and Ye Songtao were still logical and advised Fang Qi.","“What’s so good about this pile of rusty metal?” Fang Qi picked up the cauldron and was about to toss it out.","After a second thought, he decided not to give it back to Feng Xi.","He tossed it onto the counter and said, “Xiaoyue, you can play with it if you want.”","Jiang Xiaoyue was at a loss for words, and everyone else was dumbfounded.","That cauldron shivered on the counter."]},{"number":207,"title":"Chapter 207 - About the Competition","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Satisfied, Fang Qi returned to the counter and sat down. “Let’s continue with the explanation of the competition rules.”","“Oh... Ok!” Many of them were still dazed.","Since this thing was beyond their control, they ignored it.","“We’ll talk about the rules of the team competition,” Fang Qi said, “The members in the teams entering the Counter Strike Competition must belong to the same force, and they can have only one member from outside of the faction. The team can also have two substitutes.”","Su Tianji who had just enlisted Nalan Hongwu, Nalan Mingxue, and Xu Zixin fell silent when she heard this rule.","More importantly, cultivation strength wasn’t a key factor in the shooting game.","Tactics and experiences were valuable.","In the game, the players were all ordinary people, and they used guns which were new weapons for them. All of these were big restrictions for high-level cultivators and warriors.","They must change some of their long-standing habits.","For example, in the real world, Su Tianji could move quickly to dodge bullets or activate her spiritual energy to block them. However, in the game, she wouldn’t have the reaction speed to dodge the bullet after seeing it coming.","They had to make predictions by watching their opponents aiming angles and trigger-pulling time. That was all that they could do.","If the predictions were made a bit earlier, they didn’t know if their opponents would flick-shot or not.","Once, Fang Qi had killed Su Tianji in the game with a flick-shot!","Therefore, the high-level cultivators and warriors were not guaranteed to be stronger than the low-level ones who were proficient with this game; the former only had a little advantage.","Xue Daolv was happy. Ignoring Su Tianji who was cussing at Fang Qi silently, he praised, “Sir! This is a good rule! It helps the unity of the faction!”","“I don’t agree!” Su Tianji was furious that she wasn’t allowed to form a team after she found teammates.","“Your objection is not valid.” Fang Qi began to explain the next rule expressionlessly.","Su Tianji: “...”","“A competition?” At this moment, Emperor Ji Wu, who was disguised as a middle-aged man, walked into the shop. “These are the rewards of the competition?”","He had witnessed the power of the guns, a new type of spiritual artifacts. Although he hadn’t seen the items in Diablo 2, he guessed that they were not bad since they were listed beside guns.","However, should I enter this competition with my status? Then, he remembered that he was disguised, and thus it didn’t matter.","He looked at Nalan Hongwu by his side and asked, “Senior Duke, will you enter as well?”","Since only people of the same fraction could form a team, it was hard for him to control the result. Therefore, Nalan Hongwu decided to enter the individual competitions of Diablo.","After playing Diablo for a long time, he only killed monsters and hadn’t battled against other players yet!","He had heard about Fang Qi combining Holy Shock and Innumerable Sword Scroll, which showed that the skills in Diablo were highly useful!","His paladin character had the best items and the highest level next to Fang Qi. With his skills, he had no one to be afraid of.","Besides, different from Counter Strike, the battles in Diablo had less restrictions for the high-level cultivators and warriors.","It was worth a try!","Li Haoran also registered for the Diablo competition. Comparatively, he played Diablo longer than Counter Strike!","How should he choose his items?","He had entered the competition for the sake of items.","The items in Diablo had many properties. Besides various elemental damages such as ice and fire which were common in the cultivation world, there were many properties including indestructibility, self-healing, increase in skill level, and even invisibility.","The advantage with the indestructibility was evident.","Although there were rare spiritual artifacts that could heal themselves, the items with a self-repair property in Diablo were more common!","As for the skill-level increase, if such an attribute could be developed, the items would be highly valuable. For example, if the spiritual artifacts could improve the Blue Flame Heavenly Scroll, the cultivation technique of Blue Flame Fraction, by one level, then it would be precious! It would be as valuable as the supreme treasure of the faction that could increase the power of the Blue Flame Heavenly Scroll by 40%!","As for invisibility, it was like giving the artifacts an extra disguise spiritual spell!","“Hu! It’s hard to decide...” Li Haoran exhaled deeply. As the disciple of Jun Yangzi, the No.1 Artifact Master of the Blue Flame Faction, he was very eager to learn about these things.","After registration, he bought a bowl of instant noodles and sat down on a couch, talking about items with An Cheng and the others who had finished registration.","“Ugh? That fatty is...” While they talked, they saw a familiar figure.","“He’s Mr. Fang’s friend.” An Cheng said, “He teams with Song Qingfeng as a necromancer.”","They knew about him since Song Qingfeng’s Diablo team had the second best progress in the whole shop.","Although Fatty Wang gamed less than the others, he had a special advantage; he was the only necromancer in his team and the necromancer with the highest level and best items in the entire Origins Internet Club!","Since this class had to deal with skeletons and corpses each day, few people liked it, and not many people had such a character.","Even though this class was powerful, so were the others.","That was why few people played it.","“Qi! I’ll enter the competition!” Wang Tai walked to the counter and said excitedly.","After all, he didn’t even play the Legend of the Sword and Fairy; he focused all his attention on Diablo!","His performance during the national examination was not as good as his peers, but he had at least entered the Lingyun List. After returning to the academy, he had received more support and got more funds.","He had been saving for the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, and now he found that the shop was holding a Diablo competition!","He thought that it was a good opportunity for him. He didn’t expect to get to the top three, but if he could win a trial membership, he would have two more hours of game time each day for one week!","...","During the day, the whole shop was bustling with customers talking about registration, items, and teaming up.","It was a novelty for the people in this world that they could compete in the virtual games and win real rewards!","Even people in the Yunshan Tavern which used to be a gathering place for independent warriors began talking about it.","From Resident Evil to Counter Strike, the cheap and fun games which could increase their cultivation strengths had always been their top choices!"]},{"number":208,"title":"Chapter 208 - A New Crisis","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Dong Qingli was a loyal fan of Diablo, but she was only about level 20.","After all, she played the game to entertain herself. Besides playing Diablo, she also played the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and watched the TV series.","Obviously, she was no match in the competition for the experienced players of Diablo who had reached Act V, but it was fun to participate. Therefore, she also entered the competition.","Many Lingyun Academy instructors and other cultivators and warriors who had just begun playing the game shared her thoughts.","Not everyone entered the competition for the rewards. Many players just wanted to try fighting with other players after killing many monsters!","PVP and PVE were totally different concepts. After all, the Diablo that the System offered didn’t offer PVP as an option.","The opening of PVP caused a heated discussion in the shop!","There were brand-new skill combinations and item combinations used for fights among players!","As for the team competition for Counter Strike, the disciples of Lingyun Academy were the first team registering for the competition.","The Lingyun Team’s captain was Nalan Mingxue, and the members included Xu Zixin, Shen Qingqing, Lin Shao, and Xu Luo.","As the highest-leveled assassin who had the best items for the class in Diablo, Song Qingfeng planned to enter the Diablo competition and didn’t appear on the list for Lingyun Team.","The new players like Ji Wu naturally wouldn’t enter the Diablo competition, but he didn’t want to miss this opportunity, so he pulled the Royal Princess and the princes into his team.","Since they could master the basic knowledge around guns through watching the Resident Evil movie, they began learning about guns with eagerness.","So, the Royal Team was established.","Fang Qi was at a loss for words when he saw the name of this team.","[TL Note: Here, the author is referring back to the E-Sports Team Royal Club which was formally known as Star Horn Royal and now known as Royal Never Give Up. The name is the same in Chinese.]","While the other major forces began forming teams, people stayed in the shop until it closed for the night.","...","Meanwhile, in the Taixi Faction on the other side of the continent.","The old man looked at the information transmitted to him in the communication jade with a grim expression.","“They are organizing a competition at the same time as the Cultivation Realm Conference... the shop is trying to take the Wuwei Daoist Alliance away from the Cultivation Realm Conference?!”","“How can such a thing happen?!” The old man murmured to himself, “It has attracted so many forces that it’s too big to handle?”","“It is indeed tricky. While we were not careful, these small fishes have gained such big progress!”","At this moment, Feng Xi still didn’t dare to report that he was injured, and the ultimate treasure had been taken.","He must make a plan to take back the ultimate treasure and suppress this shop.","Right now, he considered enlisting help from the major forces around Dajin.","These forces have been trying to gain favors from our three factions, Feng Xi thought, It seems that I have to enlist their help.","Soon, Feng Xi sent the plan back for approval.","[In this situation, I approve your request. We Taixi Faction will show appreciation to the people who offer help in this issue.] The old man in the Taixi Faction replied to the request.","After receiving the approval, Feng Xi was pleased and relieved.","If the faction sent help, the news that he failed his mission and lost the ultimate treasure would probably spread all over the Three Saint Gates.","Now, he only needed to seal his lips and redeem his honor, so he wouldn’t feel too ashamed even if his failure was known to his faction after this issue was solved.","Yundian Upper Realm was a stretch of spiritual land that wasn’t too big to the southwest of Dajin.","Of course, it was not only not big when compared with the territory of Dajin. In fact, it was a large cultivating country made up of several ancient cultivation families. It occupied the entire Southwest Spiritual Land and had created laws and established cities!","They were also one of the biggest competing forces in the Cultivation Realm Conference, which was held every 30 years.","Feng Xi had his eye on them.","For cultivators, Dajin wasn’t as rich as Yundian Upper Realm which had a lot of spiritual land and cultivation resources. Dajin had fewer restrictions for warriors, but it wasn’t a perfect place for cultivators.","In fact, the major forces such as the Blue Flame Faction and the Liuyun Daoist Palace needed help from their peers in Yundian Upper Realm for resources and techniques.","Most importantly, Yundian Upper Realm had a rare mineral named Yundian Jade which was the best materials for most of the top-level spiritual artifacts!","Feng Xi thought that he didn’t need to wage a war. Instead, he would put pressure on the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and even Dajin with threats of cutting off their channels of resources. He believed that these people would make the right decisions then!","“I’ll force that kid into handing back the Demon-Suppressing Cauldron and apologizing to me!”","...","While Feng Xi hurried to Yundian Upper Realm, Fang Qi’s shop released updates to Jade Dynasty and Wind and Cloud.","In the previous episode of Jade Dynasty, the Seven Peak Competition was imminent. As for Wind and Cloud, it came to the part where Nie Feng had conquered Wushuang City, and the Sword Saint and Xiong Ba were going to battle in seven days, which meant that the two strongest people in the last few episodes would battle each other!","With the two TV series entering their respective climaxes, the fans of Jade Dynasty and Wind and Cloud were exhilarated!","“Ahh! I’m so happy!” Thinking of the excellent content in the new episodes, Dong Qingli almost skipped into the shop. “Sir, you have new episodes of Jade Dynasty, right?”","Many people were anxious about the competition, but she wasn’t since she was only at level 20.","“Sir! Hurry up and activate the 11h and 12th episodes of Jade Dynasty!” Lan Mo and Jun Yangzi hurried into the shop. “Two bowls of instant noodles with two sausages!”","These guys from the Blue Flame Faction had their eyes on the spiritual spells and spiritual artifacts in Jade Dynasty. Since they were new players to Diablo and Counter Strike, they went straight to the TV series!","Even for the players preparing for the competitions, they wouldn’t miss the new episodes!","The Seven Peak Competition in Jade Dynasty was meaningful since it would show the overall strength of the whole faction, and the cultivators of the Blue Flame Faction and Liuyun Daoist Palace would take this opportunity to see it!","So was the situation with Wind and Cloud for warriors!","Even Su Tianji who had been busy training her team took some time off and ordered a bowl of instant noodles before watching Jade Dynasty with her two favorite disciples.","While enjoying the instant noodles, Su Tianji watched the many colorful swords flying under the vast blue sky and around the magnificent mountains. It was a colorful and beautiful sight!","Seeing this, she wished that she could step on a sword and fly into that world.","I wonder when the disciples of our faction can fly on the swords and travel 1,000 kilometers in one instant... The cultivators including Su Tianji watched the TV series with envy."]},{"number":209,"title":"Chapter 209","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This girl is so beautiful!”","“Where’s she? Young Master Song, all the disciples of Small Bamboo Peak are beautiful!” On the square full of Green Cloud Faction disciples, the camera followed the cultivators of Big Bamboo Peak, but Lin Shao stepped into the neighboring group from Small Bamboo Peak when the crowds gathered together. He was dizzy as he ogled the disciples of Small Bamboo Peak, which only took in female disciples.","“I want to join the Green Cloud Faction!” Xu Luo’s eyes almost popped out of their sockets. “You mean there’s someone more beautiful than them?”","“There! Over there! Not in the group of the disciples!” Song Qingfeng said excitedly. Beside a beautiful female Daoist in a white Daoist robe stood a stunningly elegant and beauty in white. She carried a longsword on her back, and the sky-blue sheath was covered in flowing lights, showing that the sword was a celestial treasure.","“Wow!” Xue Luo and Lin Shao looked toward the direction that Song Qingfeng pointed, and their mouths formed an O-shape as they gasped.","“Where? Where’s the beauty?” An Cheng and the others were close to them, and they all kept the external communication option open. Hearing the exclamations, they couldn’t keep calm!","“Hiss! I see her too!” An Cheng stared without blinking. “Ouyang! Young Master Bu! Look this way!”","...","Su Tianji was at a loss for words when she heard all that.","“Girls, look at the 1,000-year-old Water Kirin! It’s a beast only seen in legends!”","“We can see the Fire Kirin in Wind and Cloud and the Water Kirin in Jade Dynasty! Wow!” Fenghua and Yuexin stared at the scene in excitement!","Each time Su Tianji saw this spiritual beast which was guarding the gate of Green Cloud Faction, she would lament about when her own faction could have such spiritual beasts to guard the gate!","Then, an ear-piercing roar sounded. It came from the Water Kirin, having sensed the aura of the Bloodthirsty Bead. Instantly, the wind changed directions and clouds changed colors as the sky darkened!","A huge water beam surged up from the pond on the side, and then it fell a little and surrounded the Water Kirin as if it were a translucent dragon.","Phantoms of all kinds of fierce beasts appeared in the howling water beam, and they were the beasts that the Water Kirin had killed. They were trapped in the water beam and would never enter the next reincarnation. It was a horrifying sight!","“It’s so scary...” Fenghua and Yuexin retreated several steps with fear on their faces.","“The Water Kirin has wounds on its body, but it still can control water with such great power!” Lan Mo exclaimed in amazement and wished that he could take this Water Kirin for himself!","This kind of rare beasts was precious!","...","Dong Qingli said, “It must have been caused by Xiaofan’s spiritual treasure again! Xiaofan is so pitiable!”","“Yeah!” Zhang Wanyu was sympathetic, “He has no talent for cultivation, and his beloved senior sister doesn’t seem to return his feelings...”","“Despite the great power of his spiritual treasure, it was obviously not compatible with the way of the Green Cloud Faction. What would he do if they found that it was the Bloodthirsty Bead?”","They worried for him.","– Later –","“Oh, no!” Many people almost screamed when they saw two figures hugging each other under the moonlight. The two lovers only had eyes for each other, oblivious to Zhang Xiaofan who was in the distance.","Seeing this scene, Dong Qingli felt her heart twitch. “That’s too much! While others are smart and excels in everything, Xiaofan is dumb and excels in nothing!”","Most of the other viewers shared her thoughts. Shen Qingqing looked gloomy while watching Jade Dynasty, mumbling, “How can things happen in this way?!”","“Well! This kid is too obtuse...” Even Lan Mo felt worried.","He had disliked Zhang Xiaofan in the beginning, but the more he watched, the more worried he became.","“The good thing is that his fat master is warm inside despite his cool veneer. Otherwise, Xiaofan would be in a worse situation! Too dull...” Jun Yangzi, an impatient senior, said in an angry outburst.","“Calm down and watch it!” When the time came to the second day in the TV series, Lan Mo comforted him. “In a while, Zhang Xiaofan will enter the competition!”","Before Zhang Xiaofan went on stage, his senior sister Tian Ling’er comforted him, “Xiaofan, I have to go and compete, so I can’t cheer for you. However, I believe in you!”","Then, everyone including his senior brothers, master, and master’s wife all went to watch Tian Ling’er’s competition.","When Zhang Xiaofan went up stage, no one was cheering for him.","“Well... None of his senior brothers stayed behind!”","“What’s happening? After all, he has the Swallowing Soul Staff, and he might win a match! Why did they do this to him!”","“They don’t know that he has Swallowing Soul Staff! Anyway, it’s still infuriating!”","At this moment, snickers came from the audience around the stage in the TV series.","“He even came with a burned stick! The disciples of Big Bamboo Peak are weird. Yesterday, one used dice, and another came with a burned stick today!”","“How can these disciples talk like this?!” Lan Mo almost slammed his hand on the desk. “This is the Swallowing Soul Staff! It’s much more powerful than your spiritual artifact!”","“Okay! Okay! Senior Brother, they don’t know! This disciple named Chu Yuhong looks strong! I wonder if he will win against Xiaofan!” At this moment, Zhang Xiaofan’s rival released radiant sunlight-like lights from his sword, and the light engulfed Zhang Xiaofan!","Thunderous cheering came from the audience and it sounded ear-piercing!","At this moment, Zhang Xiaofan bit on his lower lip so hard that he didn’t notice that a drop of his blood had dripped onto the Swallowing Soul Staff.","When he attacked, the black staff seemed to come to life with black presence and bright green light around it! Suddenly, Chu Yuhong roared and retreated several steps before dropping to the ground; he passed out!","The audience went silent!","“Awesome!” Song Qingfeng was the first jumping up.","“Hahaha! Look at their faces! They are so red!”","“They look as if someone slapped their faces!” Lin Shao felt that he could finally vent the frustration that had accumulated inside him.","“I guess they were all blinded by the sight!”","“Cool!” An Cheng felt great. “Well, he will get some recognition now!”","“I bet his senior brothers and sisters would look... Hahaha! I can’t stop laughing when I think of that!” Ouyang Cheng giggled.","“This spiritual treasure looks dangerous...” Dong Qingli frowned.","“Anyway, it is fun to watch this scene! Look at those disciples who laughed at him for his black stick! Can you laugh now?”","When Zhang Xiaofan returned to the group of people from Big Bamboo Peak, his master’s wife asked, “Xiaofan, you’re back? How did it go?”","“I... won with luck.”","She replied, “Oh, it’s ok that you lost. It’s a good experience... Wait, what did you just say?”","“Hahahaha!” Song Qingfeng laughed like crazy. “Surprise!”","“Are you pleasantly surprised? Are you astonished?!”","“Master! Master! Look at their expressions!” Fenghua yelled as if she had found a great treasure."]},{"number":210,"title":"Chapter 210 - Wind and Cloud’s Comeback! Suppress Space! World-Ending Sword 23! (Part 1)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[New task: A Bite in this New World","Task Target: Average of 250 activations for each episode of Wind and Cloud","Task Reward: Spicy Sticks (Latiao)","Task Description: Take a journey of food]","[TL Note: Latiao is a popular snack in China. The main ingredients are wheat flour and chili.]","Fang Qi was at a loss for words.","He was reluctant to take this task, which was given to him without warning since the average activation number per episode for Wind and Cloud was less than 100!","However, he had to take this task for the sake of the task reward.","The Seven Peak Competition was the first climax of Jade Dynasty, and all the previous episodes had been building up people’s anticipation and frustration. When the fans of Jade Dynasty watched Zhang Xiaofan win a match with poor talent, they were elated!","They had begun watching Jade Dynasty for the sake of the spiritual treasures, spiritual spells, and powerful sword techniques, but gradually they sank into the story.","“This main character is interesting...”","“Right! He’s far from Li Xiaoyao’s level, but he’s more like a main character now!”","“This episode is super cool!”","The two episodes released on Monday only covered a small part of the Seven Peak Competition, and the episodes released on Tuesday covered most of this big event. Su Tianji who had been preparing for the Counter Strike competition paused their training for the TV series.","By this time, the fans of Jade Dynasty had grown greatly.","In the morning, about 80% of the customers in the shop watched Jade Dynasty!","Comparatively, Wind and Cloud had much fewer watchers. As Nalan Hongwu said, the highest-level warriors in this TV series by now were only at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm, which couldn’t attract customers.","Except for the disciples of the academies and the story fans such as Dong Qingli, most people were busy preparing for the Competition, and they didn’t want to watch it!","This TV series was coming to the part where the battle between the Sword Saint and Xiong Ba was about to occur, but it only attracted the hardcore fans of the TV series such as Song Qingfeng and Liang Shi, the warriors of low levels.","Even the Royal Princess Ji Yu and the others who liked this TV series decided to postpone watching it.","As for the cultivators such as Su Tianji, Xue Daolv, and Lan Mo, they just didn’t watch a TV series purely about warriors. After all, warriors were weaker than cultivators until they reached the Emperor Warrior Realm.","However, it was only a small improvement since the seventh realm of warriors, Emperor Warriors, could only overpower the sixth realm of cultivators, Divine Ocean Realm. It was heard that some masters in the Three Saint Gates had reached the Divine Palace Realm, the seventh realm of cultivators.","They weren’t people whom Emperor Warriors could handle!","“Young Master Song! Are you going to watch Wind and Cloud today?” After watching Jade Dynasty, Lin Shao and Xu Luo were prepared to practice for the Counter Strike team competition when they saw Song Qingfeng clicking open Wind and Cloud.","“Are you going to practice your assassin character?”","“I’ll just watch for a little while; I’ll be fine!” Song Qingfeng waved his hand. “I’m the No. 1 Assassin in this shop and have nothing to worry about!”","“Okay! Okay! We’ll go and play Counter Strike. Just make sure that you don’t mess it up!” Seeing that he was determined to watch it, Lin Shao and the others went on with their own businesses.","Song Qingfeng thought, There were two episodes yesterday and two today. Even if the plot is slow, the Sword Saint should appear.","With this thought, he began to watch Wind and Cloud.","Meanwhile, Liang Shi and his buddies were also watching it.","Soon they came to the part where Duan Lang took the Fire Scale Sword and Wu Ming tried to stop the Sword Saint from going to the battle.","“The Sword Saint looks old...”","“The Sword Saint is so old while Xiong Ba is in his prime. I have a bad feeling about this...”","The customers watching Wind and Cloud began talking among themselves, knowing that different from cultivators, the warrior’s old age would negatively affect their abilities.","“Will the Sword Saint be defeated by Union Master Xiong?”","For people like Liang Shi, the Grand Ancestral Warriors Realm was quite high, and they were fascinated by the combat techniques in Wind and Cloud.","Soon, they watched Wu Ming block the Sword Saint’s killing strikes with ease.","Even Wu Ming was certain that the Sword Saint couldn’t defeat Xiong Ba.","By now, Song Qingfeng was regretting watching it. What’s the use of watching the old Sword Saint getting himself killed? Maybe I should have practiced my assassin character first...","In fact, the others shared his thought, but they continued watching due to their admiration for the Sword Saint’s persistent pursuit of the Sword Dao.","In contrast, the Sanfen Field in the Worldly Union looked as calm as usual without any grim atmosphere before the battle.","The many masters who were invited to watch the battle were sitting in the audience seats, and the people of Wushuang City had arrived as well. However, the Sword Saint, who was the Master of Wushuang City wasn’t here.","The sun was overhead, and the time for the battle had come!","The Sword Saint stood in front of the many steps leading to the Worldly Union, and the high steps looked as if they were reaching the sky.","While he walked up the steps, the viewers saw that the Sword Saint was nearing the end of his life.","The steps before him began to blur. When he looked up, the gate of the Worldly Union was as far as the sky!","Each step that he took was a fight with fate and nature!","Despite his hard efforts, he only covered a small part of the 1,000 steps.","He lost the battle before it even began! Everyone had predicted this ending!","What a regret it was that he lost the last battle in his life before he even began!","“I want to battle!”","The viewers saw that the Sword Saint’s steps were slow and even wobbly!","Suddenly, dark clouds covered the sky! A beam of light pierced the clouds and shone on the Sanfen Field. Then, the people found that the Sword Saint was standing proudly on the field without a sound!","“What... is this?!”","The viewers who were about to walk away from this lackluster battle were instantly stupefied!","At this moment, the Sword Saint looked magnificent and sharp, no longer tired and listless!","“What happened? Wasn’t the Sword Saint still climbing the steps a moment ago?”","“How come he got up here instantly?!”","The expressions of Song Qingfeng, Liang Shi, and the others’ faces changed drastically with bafflement.","At this moment, everyone felt a chilliness when they saw the overwhelming presence emitting from the Sword Saint’s eyes!","The presence was so sharp that everyone and everything within its range felt as if they were sliced by blades!","Before the Sword Saint showed his hand, Xiong Ba was frozen with fear!","Even the viewers such as Liang Shi and Song Qingfeng were also stunned.","“How can this horrifying presence be only at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm?!","Since the scheduled time for the battle had passed, a large group of elite warriors jumped out from behind Xiong Ba and charged forward.","The Sword Saint walked forward slowly as if he didn’t see them, and some of Xiong Ba’s fierce subordinates began hacking their sabers toward him!","However, something weird happened! The warriors all froze in mid-air!","Even the blood gushing out from their bodies froze in mid-air!","Seeing this scene, Song Qingfeng, Liang Shi, and the other viewers felt totally blank!"]},{"number":211,"title":"Chapter 211 - Wind and Cloud’s Comeback! Suppress Space! World-Ending Sword 23! (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How come they froze?!” Not only the people in the TV series but viewers such as Liang Shi and Song Qingfeng all froze!","After all, it wasn’t the kind of suppression that could immobilize opponents; any high-level warriors and cultivators could do this!","What they saw was that all the warriors froze in mid-air!","Even blood drops stopped in mid-air as if time had stopped!","This was the most horrifying part!","Death engulfed the Sanfen Field, and no one on the field could move!","At this moment, none of the thousands of warriors of the Worldly Union could move!","The viewers of Wind and Cloud watched as the Sword Saint went through the dense crowds. Wherever he went, people died!","The viewers watched quietly, afraid that if they moved, they would end up with the same fate as the elite warriors of the Worldly Union!","As if they had heard the summons of the Grim Reaper, they couldn’t even scream. The whole Sanfen Field was dead silent!","Even Xiong Ba who had the highest cultivation strength among the group couldn’t move a muscle!","He couldn’t move his finger or blink his eyes!","It seemed like the Sword Saint was in a realm that no mortal could reach!","At this moment, everyone finally realized that this old swordsman deserved the title of Sword Saint!","The Sword Saint pointed his index and middle fingers and pierced them toward Xiong Ba’s chest as if they were a sword!","The overbearing Xiong Ba now had no choice but to wait for his death!","A moment ago, the viewers admired the Sword Saint’s persistence in the pursuit of the Sword Dao and desire for battle in the last moment of his life. Now, they watched this old swordsman who gave his life to swordsmanship fighting against nature and fate and finally turning into a legend!","All previous emotions that they had felt until now turned into an amazement that they had never felt before!","Watching this scene and the horrifying sword technique, all the viewers of Wind and Cloud had tears in their eyes!","The Sword Saint was a true warrior! They had never imagined that they could see a warrior who could fight against nature and fate!","At this moment, they suddenly saw that the Sword Saint was still standing on the steps! He was barely half-way up the stairs!","What is happening?!","At this moment, they saw Bu Jingyun walking up the stairs with Kong Ci’s corpse in his arms. He finally decided to turn on Xiong Ba and came to the Worldly Union to get his revenge!","Driven by his intense hatred and the wish to kill Xiong Ba himself, he struck out with his palm.","However, when his palm touched the Sword Saint, he found that the latter was now a cold corpse!","In the distant Sanfen Field, the Sword Saint who was standing before Xiong Ba seemed to feel the palm strike, and his spirit fell!","The Sanfen Field that was suppressed and sealed was unfrozen, and the human bodies, buildings, tables, and chairs which had been slashed by sword energies collapsed with blood and flesh flying around!","Screams resonated in the sky, and blood surged up, turning the entire Worldly Union into Hell!","Now, the viewers of Wind and Cloud understood that even though the Sword Saint had died before the battle, his will was still alive. Driven by his powerful will, he had turned himself into an unrivaled force and battled with Xiong Ba!","Because he was already dead, he was no longer trapped by the restrictions set on mortal and thus understood the ultimate demonic sword technique which was beyond the understanding of mortals – Sword 23!","Unfortunately, his body was struck by Bu Jingyun, which made his will collapse!","Song Qingfeng, Liang Shi, and the others had watched the entire process of how the World Ending Sword 23 of the Saint Spirit Sword Technique was created!","However, the Sword Saint still couldn’t control fate even though he was infinitely close to that successful moment!","Song Qingfeng, Liang Shi, and the others felt more than stunned!","No words could describe what they felt at this moment!","The only feeling they could describe was regret. It was sad to see that even though the old Sword Saint had understood and created Sword 23, the horrifying technique that could destroy the world, he still didn’t kill Xiong Ba! He still lost the battle and died with regret!","Previously, Wind and Cloud was more of an educational TV series with a mature combat system and a good story. Now, it ascended to the level of legends!","“So horrifying! The Sword Saint is so powerful!” Today’s episodes came to an end, and Song Qingfeng and the others’ exclamations showed that they now regarded the Sword Saint as their hero despite his failure!","“What are you yelling about? Young Master Song? Did the Sword Saint win?” Lin Shao was playing Counter Strike with concentration, and he was bothered by the shouts.","“No...”","“Then, what are you yelling about?!” Lin Shao sounded more impatient.","“Sword 23!” Song Qingfeng yelled, “The world-destroying Sword 23! It’s so horrifying!”","Liang Shi and others also yelled in amazement! They were so stunned that their minds turned blank, and the only thing that they could think of was the horrifying technique!","“When it was used, it looked as if time had stopped!” Song Qingfeng yelled in shock, “None of them could move! They froze in mid-air, and even the blood drops were frozen! Xiong Ba could do nothing but stand there and wait for his death!”","“What?!” Hearing Song Qingfeng’s words, some warriors including Liang Heihu turned to him. “Are you exaggerating? The warriors in this TV series are no stronger than the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm!”","“He’s not exaggerating!” Liang Shi and some other warriors yelled, “I watched it too! That scene was horrifying! I’ve never heard of such a horrifying sword technique! He looked like a god descending from the heavens! Everyone just stood there waiting to be killed!”","“How can such a sword technique exist in the world?!” Xiao Lengyu and the Fifth Prince standing beside Liang Heihu looked unconvinced. “Even if it exists, the old Sword Saint couldn’t use it with his cultivation strength!”","The Fifth Prince added, “Are you saying this to trick us into wasting our training time?”","“Even Senior Nalan said that this TV series is lame!” Ji Yu joined in. “It can only help us build the foundation!”","Song Qingfeng looked helpless. “Suit yourself.”","Then, he urged Lin Shao and Xu Luo, “I do recommend it. Sword 23 is so horrifying powerful!”","“What are you arguing about?” Nalan Hongwu was sitting next to Nalan Mingxue, and the argument obviously disturbed him.","“The Senior is here. We can ask him to make the judgement!” Ji Yu said, not wanting to be outdone. “They are singing high praises about Wind and Cloud! I like this TV series, but I don’t think it’s as good as they claim!”"]},{"number":212,"title":"Chapter 212 - The Scheming Before Competition","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Since Song Qingfeng had watched the scene, he immediately explained the story.","“So powerful?!” Although the legend said that powerful warriors could easily break mountains and block rivers, no one had heard of a powerful sword technique like this one! Not even Nalan Hongwu!","Everything was immobilized as if time had stopped?! It doesn’t sound like something humans could achieve!","Who would believe that? Even Nalan Hongwu didn’t believe it!","Besides, he had told them that this TV series was only useful for the low-level warriors to build their foundations.","He trusted his judgement.","“I agree with him!” At this moment, Dong Qingli had just recovered from her shock from watching the TV series. “Sword 23 isn’t a sword technique that belongs to mortals! It’s so horrifying!”","“I second that!”","“I agree, too!”","They were some instructors of the Huang House from Lingyun Academy, and their strengths weren’t that high.","Nalan Hongwu’s face twitched, feeling a bit embarrassed. He immediately turned to Fang Qi and asked, “Kid, what do you think?”","“You mean Sword 23.” Fang Qi scratched his ear and said with a serious expression, “Do you know why I’m still watching Wind and Cloud even though my sword control technique has reached the current high realm.”","Nalan Hongwu: “...”","Everyone who didn’t support this TV series froze.","“Is... Is it true?!”","Then, they shouted, “Sir! Activate Wind and Cloud for me!”","“In which episode? I’ll watch it!”","“It might be that you guys saw it wrong due to your low cultivation strength!” Nalan Hongwu couldn’t believe that there was such a sword technique in the world!","Warriors were inferior to cultivators? If the claim about this sword 23 was true, cultivators probably would flee at the sight of warriors if they all learned this technique.","He was sure that if such a sword technique appeared, the whole world would be turned upside down!","“The last part of the 12th episode?!” Soon, all the doubtful people began to watch it.","When they saw the Sword Saint’s wobbly old body climbing the steps of the Worldly Union, no one understood how such an old man could use a sword technique which could destroy the world!","However, in the next moment, they all gasped when they saw the Sword Saint standing on the Sanfen Field in high spirits.","When they saw the Sword Saint using Sword 23 which froze everyone, they felt like their brains were shaking!","“Is he a warrior?! Then, what are we?!” Nalan Hongwu froze, and so did the other warriors!","They couldn’t believe how this warrior could be so much more powerful than the others?!","“Kid, can we learn this sword technique?!” This time, Nalan Hongwu looked desperate to learn!","He felt that the Sword Saint developed this sword technique when he went beyond the realm of death, but the others couldn’t copy his death!","Fang Qi asked, “What do you think?”","Would I watch it if I can’t learn it?","After all, in Wind and Cloud 3, the Sword Saint was reincarnated and could use all versions of Sword 23!","In other words, Sword 23 was developed due to the Sword Saint’s detachment from life and death, and it could only be understood in the Sword Realm in the world of Wind and Cloud. However, after it was created, fewer restrictions were placed on its use!","The scene where the Sword Saint developed Sword 23 in the TV series was like a live textbook of this sword technique!","“Doesn’t it mean that everyone can learn it...” Then, Nalan Hongwu caught himself and said embarrassedly, “Right. This sword technique isn’t something that everyone can understand!”","Even he, an Emperor Warrior, couldn’t understand it at the moment!","He might have a tiny possibility of understanding it after he mastered the concepts described in this TV series and the first 22 sword techniques.","“I’ve decided!” Nalan Hongwu said in a loud voice, “I’ll focus my attention on Wind and Cloud!”","“Activate the first 12 episodes of Wind and Cloud for me!” Liang Heihu claimed that he would watch every episode of Wind and Cloud!","“While we watch it,” Nalan Mingxue said musingly, “I think we should recommend it to the cultivators. After they see such a sword technique, they will doubt themselves, and we’ll have a better chance of winning against them in the competition.”","Liang Heihu: “...”","Song Qingfeng: “...”","Everyone looked at her in a daze.","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “It’s just a competition, and you want to wage psychological warfare?”","“Humph! All is fair in war!” Nalan Mingxue looked smug. “There’re no rules against it, right?”","“Not really...”","“Let’s go, Lan Yan!” Nalan Mingxue pointed at Section B of the internet café where Xue Daolv and his disciples of Liuyun Daoist Palace were staying today and said, “We’ll move to that section to discuss Wind and Cloud and Sword 23!”","Then, she pointed to Section C where the people of the Cloud Ocean Faction stayed and said, “Lin Shao, Xu Luo, you guys go there to discuss the TV series. When they ask, just recommend the TV series to them.”","“We’ll go to the shop on the other side of the street!” Royal Princess Ji Yu said.","“...”","Fang Qi’s face twitched as he watched them executing their scheme.","Soon, he saw his task progress growing swiftly!","Two days later, the cultivators who claimed that there was nothing to see in Wind and Cloud all came to Fang Qi, and some of them even had dark circles under their eyes from late-night discussions.","“Sir! Where’s the 13th episode of Wind and Cloud?!”","“You’ll have the competition in one day! Why are you watching Wind and Cloud now?!” Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “It will update next week!”","“Sir! It’s not fair! How can warriors have such a powerful sword technique! Even the spiritual spells in Jade Dynasty are no match to it!”","“Jade Dynasty is even more expensive than Wind and Cloud! Are there more powerful things in that TV series?!”","Fang Qi didn’t know what to tell them.","Meanwhile, Lan Mo, the Alliance Master of Wuwei Daoist Alliance and the Faction Master of Blue Flame Faction, Ye Songtao, the Faction Master of Cloud Ocean Faction, and Xue Daolv, the Palace Master of Liuyun Daoist Palace all sat on a couch with grim expressions.","They each bought a bowl of instant noodles.","“Alliance Master Lan, Faction Master Ye, have you received the message as well?” Xue Daolv said with a dark expression.","Lan Mo took a big bite of instant noodles before saying, “They cut off all the resources! The big cultivation families in Yundian Upper Realm are joining hands to give us pressure!”","Yinlong Elder sat beside them and asked, “Alliance Master Lan, what do you guys want to do? I want to hear your thoughts.”","Ye Songtao was busy eating noodles. “What do you think, Alliance Master Lan?”","“If we didn’t see Sword 23, I would have to reconsider our strategy now that they stopped the supply of so many resources to our Wuwei Daoist Alliance...” Lan Mo said.","They nodded at his words.","“However, since I’ve asked you guys to talk about it in this place, you must know what I plan to do,” he continued.","“Anyway, since this senior can produce such a horrifying sword technique as Sword 23, who knows if he has anything more powerful that can even change the power dynamics of our world?!”","The others nodded and thought that he had a point.","“So, I choose to continue patronizing this shop! As for the resources, our Wuwei Daoist Alliance isn’t without a stockpile or a back-up plan!” Lan Mo told them not to worry.","Then, he thought to himself, At least our resources can sustain us for a while!","“Guys, don’t worry about it for now! Let’s eat the noodles!”","“Slurp! Slurp!”","“...”"]},{"number":213,"title":"Chapter 213 - E-Sport Curse!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Today, Fang Qi’s shop was very noisy. While the cultivators wanted to see spiritual spells more powerful than Sword 23, the three-day registration was coming to an end.","Tomorrow was the last day of preparation, and the competition would begin the day after tomorrow. The competition schedule was almost done.","About 80 players registered for the individual competition of Diablo, and the registration had slowed down; eventually, the total number of participants reached about 100.","As for the competition for Counter Strike, there were about 40 teams. There were quite a few teams like the Royal Team, where they hadn’t played with guns before and had begun cramming knowledge about them after registration. It was a large number. With more than 40 teams, the number of Counter Strike players was now over 200 since there were more players who didn’t enter the competition.","With so many participants, it was impossible for them to compete with livestream and commentaries; they needed a good plan.","Each participant would compete randomly with 20 different participants for the Diablo competition, and each team in the Counter Strike competition would compete randomly with 15 different teams. Each win would get them one point, and the first 16 places would enter the next round. The people with the same number of points would be ranked according to the overall performance.","Then, the next round would begin.","After the last day of preparation, the masters all gathered in the Origins Internet Cafe on the competition day!","People like Nalan Hongwu and An Huwei who entered the individual competition of Diablo came to the shop very early!","All the participants had their names listed on the big screen.","“How come there are so many sorcerers and sorceresses?” With a bowl of instant noodles in his hands, Song Qingfeng stared at the big screen and found that among the 100 or so participants, more than half were sorcerers and sorceresses.","It was well-known that sorcerers and sorceresses had a very disgusting skill – Teleport. Skills such as Shiver Armor and Energy Shield were hard to deal with as well.","They were very tough to handle for players who played close-range combat characters such as assassins and barbarians.","Song Qingfeng’s face turned dark.","Under the lead of Fang Qi, the number of paladins was second to that of the sorcerers and sorceresses.","After them were classes such as druids, assassins, barbarians, and etc.","Meanwhile, Nalan Mingxue was also looking at the teams on the big screen with a grim expression and making plans in her head.","She still had time since the Counter Strike competition would only start the next day.","Su Tianji glanced at the big screen. Behind her, Fenghua, Yuexin, and two artifact masters of Liuyun Daoist Palace were also looking at the screen.","However, they were being scolded by Su Tianji. “What are you looking at? Come and train with me!”","Captain Su was anxious! They had spent two days studying Wind and Cloud, and they still needed a lot of practice!","Tomorrow was the big day. If her Liuyun Team couldn’t enter the top 16, she would be disgraced!","At this moment, Nalan Hongwu and An Huwei went to the counter eagerly. “Kid, when does it begin?”","Fang Qi looked at the time and told them that it would begin at 9 AM. There was still about one hour.","When all of them finished their breakfast, the participants in the Diablo competition were led to the second floor which was set aside as the competition room.","As the referee, Fang Qi stayed in the competition room. At the same time, Jiang Xiaoyue sat on a big couch in front of the big screen.","Today, even Mu Donglai, the guy who seemed busier than the Emperor, also came to watch.","Royal Princess Ji Yu and her team planned to train later, so she sat on the couch and glanced around. “Gongzi Xiao, you’re here to watch the competition?”","[TL Note: Gongzi is the title used by young men with noble or affluent background.]","“Of course!” Xiao Yulv said proudly, “According to my observations in the shop, I’ve analyzed and came up with the list of the most promising candidates for each of the competition. Royal Princess, do you want one copy of it?”","Ji Yu’s face turned dark. “I didn’t know that you were in this business.”","“Just a hobby! A hobby!” Xiao Yulv waved his hand calmly. “But I can ensure you that even the shop owner doesn’t know them as well as I do!”","“Tell us about it!” While sipping her Coke, Nalan Mingxue asked with interest, “What’s your analysis?”","“As for the most promising candidate for the Diablo competition, I’m sure that you all know that Senior Nalan is No. 1. However, I’ve noticed some low-profiled players who have the potential to get into the top eight.”","Xiao Yulv waved his folding fan and said with a chuckle, “Even Castellan An and Senior Nalan might lose to them if they are not careful!”","“Are they really this strong?” The Second Prince clicked his tongue.","“Well... You can just watch. For example, the sorcerer named Bai Lang on the screen.” While he talked, there were eight players in combat. In one of the battles, there was a sorcerer who mained cold spells with the ID of Bai Lang, and he was close to level 40.","“This guy is an old player, and perhaps you’ve met him before,” Xiao Yulv said, “The sorcerers and sorceresses are all very strong!”","They watched the screen and saw that Bai Lang’s opponent was a level 30 paladin.","When the paladin dashed up, Bai Lang was gone with Teleport, and a blizzard hit the spot.","Xiao Yulv waved his arms and explained to the people around him, “See? This is the strength of a sorcerer who mains cold spells. He can freeze his rival and keep his distance from the paladin with Teleport...”","“Ugh...” Nalan Mingxue pointed at the screen. “Gongzi Xiao, that paladin seems to be winning...”","“Bai Lang is winning?” Xiao Yulv said confidently, “It’s about right... What did you say?! Who’s winning?!”","Xiao Yulv turned to the big screen and saw that Bai Lang seemed to make a mistake while he drank mana potion. During this time, that paladin took the opportunity to knock him out with the shield and almost emptied his HP!","How could the paladin do this?!","Confused, Xiao Yulv looked at the big screen and saw the Frozen Orb and Blizzard were not doing much damage to this paladin.","To the contrary, this paladin slowly depleted Bai Lang’s HP gradually with Holy Freeze!","“He alternated Holy Freeze and Resist Cold with perfect timing! Besides, he timed his attacks well, and I believe that he is a master in the real world!” Nalan Mingxue sipped Coke and said calmly, “I must mark this paladin named Fu Jianghe and tell the others to be careful with him...”","Xiao Yulv: “...”"]},{"number":214,"title":"Chapter 214 - Unpredictable Ending, and the Second Item Trade!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Where’s Sister Lan Yan today?” while sitting beside Nalan Mingxue, Jiang Xiaoyue looked around and asked.","“She wants to have a try with Diablo and went to the competition,” Nalan Mingxue said while she watched the matches on the couch.","Many players were in the competition, but there were still many people sitting downstairs and watching the matches on the big screen.","Even the Yinlong Elder, who focused all his attention on the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, watched the matches on the couch with his disciples, let alone Lan Mo and Jun Yangzi who loved the items in Diablo.","The only thing was that in the entire Blue Flame Faction, only Li Haoran entered the Diablo competition.","Although a team of their disciples had entered the Counter Strike team competition, they didn’t place too much hope in them.","All they could count on was Li Haoran’s sorcerer character.","With the progress of the matches, the points of the individual participants changed slowly on the left side of the big screen.","“The list of the top 16 is on the screen!”","At this moment, they found that Nalan Hongwu wasn’t in the first place; the first place was currently taken by An Cheng. They both won five matches, but An Cheng’s total battle time was much less than Nalan Hongwu’s.","An Cheng fell silent while he looked at the level 9 female barbarian in front of him who was wearing rag-armor and rag shoes.","This was the second time that An Cheng encountered this kind of opponent.","“Ugh? Isn’t that Luo Yun from Xiyi Academy?” The Second Prince pointed at the level 9 female barbarian on the big screen and asked.","“It seems to be her...” Nalan Mingxue looked toward that match.","An Cheng tried to summon the Hydra.","Xiao Yulv explained with familiarity, “The sorcerers and sorceresses who main fire spells can summon this nine-headed serpent-like flame creature. It can act as a helper with strong fire-elemental spiritual spells. The sorcerers and sorceresses don’t have to fight since the Hydra will deal with the enemies!”","While looking at the Hydra spitting out hot flames, Xiao Yulv explained confidently, “This time, Brother An is lucky. I guess that his ranking will be above Senior Nalan’s. He can defeat this level 9 female barbarian with his eyes closed.”","“Gonzgi Xiao.” Ji Yu pointed at the big screen. “Young Master An surrendered.”","Xiao Yulv looked at the big screen in shock.","“The An Family of Jiuhua and the Luo Family in the north had been friendly for generations.” On the side, Mr. Mu explained, “Now that Young Master An has a high score, it’s okay for him to let her win this match...”","Xiao Yulv closed his gaping mouth and said with twitching facial muscles, “Everyone can see that this is an exception.","After failing to predict the results of these two matches, Xiao Yulv got more cautious with his comments. He still made comments about the skills but was very careful with predictions of the results, thus making no such mistakes again.","As time went on, the competition on the first day progressed uneventfully, and the players with higher rankings played cautiously to stay in the top 16.","During all that, some black horses appeared.","For example, Fu Jianghe and Bai Lang made it into the top 16.","Lan Yan also barely made it onto the list.","To their surprise, they saw a name which they had never noticed before – Wang Tai?","“Isn’t he Mr. Fang’s fat friend?” Nalan Mingxue said with some bafflement.","“Do you know him?” Ji Yu asked.","“I’ve watched this fat guy play.” Xiao Yulv looked at the only necromancer in top 16 and analyzed, “This necromancer always tossed out spiritual spells from behind Song Qingfeng and the others, and he’s cowardly! He probably entered the top 16 with pure luck. After all, few people play this class, and I don’t know much about his skills.”","“After today, the top 16 players will be analyzed by others, and their skills will be figured out. Then, it will be easier to fight them,” Xiao Yulv said logically, “After all, the necromancer can’t teleport, which means that he needs help from others to block attacks. This class is probably at a disadvantage in individual competitions.”","“Senior Nalan is meeting Bai Lang!”","Almost everyone turned their eyes to the screen!","“Is this the last match?” Nalan Mingxue asked.","Ji Yu nodded and said, “Yeah. If he wins this match, he will have 20 consecutive victories!”","Xiao Yulv was cautious this time. “Senior Nalan’s paladin character is very powerful, but his battles with Castellan An and the others looked difficult. He must be cautious with Bai Lang.”","Mu Donglai said, “This time, I think the Senior will take the No. 1 spot after this match.”","Everyone glanced at him without a word and then turned their eyes to the big screen.","“In this match, Bai Lang is very cautious with his moves.” Xiao Yulv clicked his tongue and said, “He is creating distance between him and his opponent instead of attacking!”","In fact, although Nalan Hongwu had won the last 19 matches, he knew the disadvantage of paladins when facing sorcerers and sorceresses; paladins couldn’t catch up with them!","He learned Blessed Hammer which was a long-range attack. However, the trajectory of the hammer was an arc instead of a straight line, so it required skill to land it.","While sorcerers and sorceresses teleported and created distance, they could use the powerful area spells such as Blizzard without aiming. If Nalan Hongwu was hit, he would be slowed down greatly!","Bai Lang was an old player who was very familiar with the skills of paladins and wouldn’t make a rookie mistake!","Soon, everyone saw that Nalan Hongwu fell on his way while chasing after Bai Lang.","At this moment, everyone turned to look at Mu Donglai with dumbfounded expressions.","Mu Donglai: “...”","The final list showed that only Nalan Hongwu’s paladin entered the top three list; the other two were taken by sorcerers and sorceresses.","For example, An Huwei lost one match, but due to the long time that Nalan Hongwu spent on the last match, An Huwei took the first place.","At this moment, an understanding dawned on Nalan Hongwu.","After putting down the virtual reality headset, he yelled with a dark expression, “Who has an item with Teleport?! I’ll buy it with crystals! Also, I will buy items that cannot be frozen!”","The participants couldn’t borrow items from others, but it didn’t say that one couldn’t buy them!","Right now, the first day ended, and the second floor fell silent; no one answered.","Then, Song Qingfeng yelled, “Who has items that have the ‘cannot be frozen’ property? I’ll buy one for 50 crystals!”","“I’ll pay 100!” Nalan Hongwu was furious."]},{"number":215,"title":"Chapter 215 - A New Way of Making Money","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Hearing Nalan Hongwu’s words, Fang Qi’s face twitched. You’re really rich...","“100 crystals for one item?!” Everyone slowed their steps when they heard Nalan Hongwu’s words!","After all, they were virtual items instead of real things!","Last time, An Cheng bought runes with crystals, which was the first time that someone bought virtual items. But now, the price offered wasn’t a few crystals but 100!","For the small aristocrats, 100 crystals was still a small fortune!","Of course, anyone who knew Nalan Hongwu was sure that 100 crystals meant nothing to him, but it was still shocking that a virtual item could sell for 100 crystals!","Even though many people knew that the top players of the competition would get prizes, this incident still greatly affected their value system. Many people stopped subconsciously to watch this scene!","“Who has items that have the ‘cannot be frozen’ property?” Many players asked the question for them.","“Don’t keep it! It’s worth 100 crystals!”","At this moment, a sorcerer in Bai Lang’s group said, “Brother Bai, I have an item that has that property... It’s a unique item too...”","“Don’t sell it!” Bai Lan’s face turned dark, knowing that his cold spells would be useless against these items!","“I want a staff with Teleport!”","Fang Qi was still surprised when Nalan Hongwu strode up to him impatiently. “Kid, is your teleport charged staff for sale?!”","“I’ll pay... 200 crystals!” Nalan Hongwu stated with widened eyes.","The moment he said it, the crowd bursted into murmurs!","200 crystals?! After all, it was a magic item which could only be used on special occasions, and few people paid attention to it!","However, Nalan Hongwu offered to buy it for 200 crystals!","Fang Qi shrugged. “I’m the referee, and all my items are not for sale.”","Nalan Hongwu: “...”","“I have a magic glove with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property!” At this moment, an instructor of Lingyun Academy yelled.","“I have a set of armor; it is a unique item with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property!”","Fang Qi looked at this person who was yelling and realized that it was Dong Qingli.","Although she didn’t need money, she was eager to participate in this novel thing of selling virtual items.","“Unique item?” Nalan Hongwu strode over. “Let me see the properties!”","Dong Qingli immediately opened her game, and people swarmed behind her!","“Why are they still up there?” The matches on the big screen had ended, but no one came down.","Jiang Xiaoyue also glanced at the stairs leading to the competition room on the second floor.","“Hurry up! They are selling items up here!” Someone yelled in the staircase, “Someone offered to buy an item with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property for 100 crystals!”","“100 crystals?!” Even the players who were playing games heard it, and they immediately exited from the games, put down the virtual reality headset, and ran upstairs.","“100 crystals for one item?!” Royal Princess Ji Yu, the Second Prince, Mu Donglai, Lan Mo, and Jun Yangzi looked at each other in bafflement.","They suspected that their ears were playing tricks on them!","After all, even the spiritual artifacts produced by the Blue Flame Faction, the No. 1 Artifact-Making Faction in Dajin, couldn’t sell for this price, even if the quality was super high.","“Let’s go and have a look!” They got up from the couch before hurrying to the second floor. At this moment, Dong Qingli opened her game.","[Eagle Armor (Scale Mail)","Defense: 119","Required Level: 15","10% Faster Run/Walk","+96% Enhanced Defense","+15 Max Cold Resist","Cold Resistance +15","Cannot be frozen]","People gaped at these properties, wondering how much damage cold spells could do to a paladin with this armor.","“F*ck! He did pay 100 crystals!”","“I wish I had such a good item!”","Many people looked jealous!","“Who else has items that have the ‘cannot be frozen’ property?!” At this moment, An Cheng yelled, “I’ll pay 100 crystals for one with good properties and 50 for one with fewer properties!”","Hearing his words, people exclaimed again, “Another player is offering 100!”","“What shall we do?” In Diablo, the spells were indeed powerful. But after hearing about these items, Bai Lang and another sorcerer who focused on cold spells in the top 16 turned ashen-faced.","“When we meet him, we’ll use other spells!” Bai Lang said with a dark face. “After all, we are given a skill tree just for this competition!”","With satisfaction, Nalan Hongwu put on his new armor and looked at his paladin character happily. He felt helpless when he got defeated by the cold spells, but he regained his confidence to get the first place. He asked again, “Does anyone have an item with Teleport? I’ll pay 200 crystals for it!”","The ordinary staff with Teleport could only be used by sorcerers and sorceresses, but there was one kind of staff with limits on the usage of Teleport, and it could be used by all classes. Nalan Hongwu had seen Fang Qi use it and knew about it.","Even if such a staff had a usage limit, it would pose a great threat to sorcerers and sorceresses!","“Ahhh!” Yu Liang howled lamentingly, “I saw it in the shop, but I wasn’t able to buy it without enough gold in my account!”","After all, these things were only useful on a few occasions, and they were rare and expensive.","“If there is a second staff, I’ll take it!” Elder Fu said, “I’ll also pay 200 crystals for it! And 100 for an item with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property!”","“I will also buy an item with the property of ‘cannot be frozen’!” An Huwei chimed in.","“200 crystals for a staff with Teleport! 100 crystals for an item with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property!” Song Qingfeng couldn’t keep calm. Although he wasn’t as rich as Nalan Hongwu and An Huwei, his Song Family was a large force. Besides, his family had paid more attention to him and was willing to fund his journey.","Everyone was stunned!","These were deals totaling more than 1,000 crystals!","It wasn’t unusual to buy spiritual artifacts for 1,000 crystals, but they had never seen or imagined that someone would pay such a high price for virtual items!","Finally, all of them bought items with the ‘cannot be frozen’ property, but only Nalan Hongwu bought a staff with Teleport.","Since there was still time before the next round of competitions, players got busy. Since the offers for the items still stood, they all tried to find the hot items.","Therefore, this game attracted a large group of new players.","“It was unexpected...” while sipping Coke, Nalan Mingxue walked downstairs and said feelingly.","“It’s incredible!” Lan Yan clicked her tongue.","“I want to play, get items, and earn money...” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a bitter expression."]},{"number":216,"title":"Chapter 216 - Watch the competition While Eating Spicy Sticks","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Fortunately, we entered the Counter Strike team competition.” Seeing what happened during the Diablo individual competition, Liang Shi and the other independent warriors who entered the Counter Strike team competition clicked their tongues.","They could never afford items that cost 200 or even 100 crystals.","From the first game – Resident Evil, Liang Shi had been playing in the shop. Although he was an old player, he only played Resident Evil and Counter Strike.","People played games not only for the growth in strength.","In this world, the majority were ordinary people, but they didn’t want to be ordinary all their lives. When they watched Chris as the mansion in Resident Evil exploded, the dazzling light of the last moment shone into their hearts!","Not everyone played the games for the gains.","From newbies who couldn’t even use pistols, they had now grown proficient with any guns and close-range combat skill, and they spent more time and energy on practice than the aristocrats and geniuses!","Today is the last day before our competition. He glanced at his comrades in life and in the games.","This competition might be our best chance, he thought. They were always the audience who stood at the foot of the mountain and look up at others, and perhaps they would have the opportunity to stand on the top of the mountain and look at the scenery in the golden sunshine this time.","He imagined this scene with eagerness!","He remembered the story about competitions which once circulated in the shop that only had a beginning.","If this was also the beginning of a story, it would be the beginning of the glory that he had been hoping for.","He tightened his grip on the gun and scanned for enemies while he was distracted by these thoughts.","...","The day for the first round of Counter Strike team competitions came.","Dong Qingli was in a great mood today. Although she didn’t enter the top 16 yesterday, she wasn’t disappointed since she had entered the competition for experience and didn’t hold any high hopes for the result.","She was in a good mood because she had won a few matches yesterday. Since her rivals were chosen randomly, she was quite excited when she battled with other players instead of monsters.","After eating instant noodles, she was about to sit on the couch and wait for the livestream to begin. Then, she saw Fang Qi coming down after making all the competition related arrangements and writing something on the black board with a chalk.","“Sir! You have a new item again? Is it a snack?!” Dong Qingli immediately walked over since that was what she was most interested in!","Now, the snacks were not enough for her!","Soon, Fang Qi finished writing, and she asked, “Spicy sticks?”","Fang Qi nodded and pointed at the words on the small black board, saying, “This is the most prestigious snack in the shop for the time being. 15 crystals for one box with ten sticks. It’s the only snack that you can share with others.”","“Of course, you can’t share them with people on the blacklist. If you do, you will also be put on the blacklist,” Fang Qi said lightly, “Do you want one box?”","“I do!!” Dong Qingli raised her voice and said, “I was worried that I wouldn’t have enough snacks to eat while watching the matches!”","“What snack? Are there new snacks?” Lan Yan had finished her matches yesterday, and now she sat on the couch, ready to watch Nalan Mingxue’s matches. When she heard the mentioning of a new snack, she immediately looked over.","She clicked her tongue at the price. “This snack is three times more expensive than Haagen-Dazs?!”","“Is it good?” she asked immediately.","“...”","Fang Qi said, “To tell you the truth, I haven’t tried it yet.”","Then, he took out two boxes of spicy sticks.","Produced by the System, the spicy sticks were not wrapped in bags. Instead, they were neatly stacked in a rectangular, transparent glass box, and there were a few pairs of wooden chopsticks.","When he opened the box, they smelled a very special spicy aroma.","The orange spicy sticks looked crystal-like with some white sesame seeds on the top.","Fang Qi froze and almost couldn’t recognize them. “Are these spicy sticks?!”","“They smell delicious!” Dong Qingli sniffed with her snow-white nose.","Even Zhang Wanyu standing beside her looked eager, and she immediately paid. “Let’s try them!”","Fang Qi opened a box and saw Jiang Xiaoyue stare at it without blinking.","He grabbed the chopsticks and picked up one stick, putting it under Jiang Xiaoyue’s nose.","“Ahh!” Excited, Jiang Xiaoyue opened her mouth and was about to...","Fang Qi stuffed the stick into his own mouth and felt a delicious aroma spreading on his taste buds. Savoring the slight numbing taste mingled with spicy and sweet flavors and the chewy gluten, he exclaimed, “Wow! So delicious!”","Jiang Xiaoyue gritted her teeth.","“Take one for yourself!” Fang Qi said while enjoying the spicy stick.","“Ok.ay..” Jiang Xiaoyue looked sulky. Even though she felt like she should ignore her boss, she couldn’t help reaching out and picking up one spicy stick.","“It’s more than delicious!” Dong Qingli was also eating. “This gluten is better than those produced with the top-grade spiritual wheat! What’s this special spicy taste?!”","“When I swallowed it, I felt a warmth beginning to burn in my body!” Zhang Wanyu said in astonishment. “The warrior qi in my body seems to have become more solid!”","Jiang Xiaoyue nibbled on her spicy stick as if she were afraid that the stick would be gone if she ate too fast! After eating it, she stuck out her small tongue and licked the sesame seeds left on the corner of her mouth.","“What’s this aroma?” Lan Mo and the others also looked over.","...","At this moment, Xiao Yulv walked in smugly with a basket of snacks in his hand.","“I’ve prepared lots of snacks to watch today’s competition!”","“Ugh? What’s this aroma?” The moment he sat down, he saw Dong Qingli, Lan Yan, and even Lan Mo holding rectangular boxes before them.","“I didn’t know this shop had such a delicious snack!” Lan Mo pointed his chopsticks at the spicy sticks and said with a laugh, “Junior Brother, try one! It tastes good and helps with the purification of the spiritual essence in the body! A good snack!”","Immediately, Jun Yangzi picked up a spicy stick and bit into it. “Wow! A real delicacy!”","On the edge of the couch, Xiao Yulv watched as Jiang Xiaoyue, who had been his companion in watching others eat, ate the spicy sticks with great enjoyment.","“Let’s watch the competition! Let’s watch the competition!” some yelled.","Xiao Yulv: “...”"]},{"number":217,"title":"Chapter 217 - Continued Pressure","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Gongzi Xiao.” Mu Donglai admired Xiao Yulv’s analysis of the participants and their conditions in the matches yesterday. Today, he sat beside Xiao Yulv and asked, “What’s your opinion on today’s competition?”","Hearing Mu Donglai’s question, Lan Mo, Jun Yanzi, Li Haoran, and Song Qingfeng all looked over.","Even Mu Hongzhu and the other instructors of Lingyun Academy and disciples of the other two academies looked over since they weren’t in the competition.","Now, Xiao Yulv had obviously learned his lesson yesterday and was determined not to predict the results casually. After stuffing a piece of spiritual fruit into his mouth, he looked at the people who were eating the spicy sticks and said, “From what I know, even though Mr. Fang set the rules that each force can’t have more than one outside player, and thus there’s no absolutely strong team which is destined to win, there’re still some good teams with good players.”","“There are at least two strong teams from Lingyun Academy. One is Lingyun Team led by Ms. Nalan, and the other is Lingyun Team 2 led by Young Master Xi, who is a classmate of Ms. Nalan. This team consists of the remaining masters of Lingyun Academy, such as Guo Xiong who got the No. 1 Place in the Heaven List during the national examination... These guys are the oldest players who are the most proficient with the use of guns.”","“There is a team of independent warriors. They look quite strong, but I’m not familiar with them.”","“Of course, our Liuyun Daoist Palace’s team is also good!” Xiao Yulv added.","“What do you think of the Royal Team?” Mu Donglai asked.","After all, he came from Jingshi.","“Royal Team...” Xiao Yulv closed his folding fan and said, “According to my observations over the last few days, this team is new to guns, but their training in the past days is quite effective...”","“However,” he continued, “they seem to be playing with a substitute in today’s competition?”","“One player is missing.” Mu Donglai nodded and checked the time, realizing that the daily morning meeting had just ended.","Xiao Yulv shook his head and said, “If they are going to play with the substitute longer, I’m afraid that they can’t make the top 16.”","“Then... How about my Blue Flame Team?!” Lan Mo asked immediately.","Xiao Yulv’s handsome face twitched, and he said after a long pause, “I haven’t paid attention to it yet...”","...","As time went on, the ranking began to show on the big screen. As expected, the two teams of Lingyun Academy took the first two places, followed by Liuyun Team. The Cloud Ocean Team had dashed to the fourth place miraculously!","“Where’s the Royal Team?” Mu Donglai looked carefully but couldn’t see the Royal Team on the list.","After a long time, they saw the Royal Team beginning to rush up. The moment that they gained the 16th place, they were replaced by the Blue Flame Team.","“...”","Mu Donglai and Lan Mo looked at each other, and the atmosphere turned a bit competitive!","The traces of ‘murderous spirits’ on their faces even chilled the air around them.","“It seems that our Blue Flame Team still has hope!” Lan Mo said in a deep voice.","The Royal Family of Dajin can’t be taken out like this! Mu Donglai’s face turned grim.","They all looked toward the big screen!","“Go for it! Royal Team!”","“Go! Go! Blue Flame Team!”","“Go! Royal Team!”","“Go! Blue Flame Team!”","The people around them fell silent.","“Xiaoyue, which team are you rooting for, the Royal Team or the Blue Flame Team?” Dong Qingli asked with her eyes on the big screen while eating spicy sticks.","“Neither!” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a pout, “I wish that the boss formed a team too!”","Then, she bit on a spicy stick and ate half of it.","At this moment, she heard cheers on the side.","“Yes! It is in!”","“The Royal Team entered the top 16!”","“The Blue Flame Team entered the top 16!”","“Ugh? How come they both enter the top 16?”","They glanced at the big screen and saw that they squeezed out the 15th team.","...","– Meanwhile in the distant Yundian Upper Realm –","It was in the beautiful mountains to the southeast of Dajin.","The magnificent and lofty city in the clouds was built on the peak of the tallest mountain in the region, and even birds and monkeys couldn’t reach it. Only powerful cultivators could fly to this place.","For ordinary people, this was a place that they couldn’t get to. But for cultivators, it was the most prosperous city in Yundian Upper Realm and the most radiant pearl of the Yundian Region – Yujing.","Looking down from the highest point of Yunjing, one could see tall mountains, spiritual boats that were flying around, and winding rivers. Cities were located on the peaks of the surrounding mountains, and they looked celestial in the spiritual lights and auspicious clouds.","There were no ordinary people living in Yundian Upper Realm; big and small cultivation forces or independent cultivators lived here for cultivation. Even warriors were rarely seen here, and the residents were mostly grand cultivators and their descendants.","Since this place had abundant cultivation resources such as spiritual crystals, celestial jade, and mines, it was well-known on the continent. Compared with the resources in this place, Dajin was poor.","Despite its rich resources, few people dared to target this land since the people who tried to grab this place had been turned into nutrients for the soil.","Even Ji Xuantong, the First Emperor of Dajin, had stopped here. He came to Yujing in person and reached a non-aggression pact with Yundian Upper Realm.","In Yundian Upper Realm, the families headed by the Gongyi Family were the top beneficiaries of the Cultivation Realm Conference. They attended each of the Cultivation Realm Conferences which were held each 30 years and gained a lot of benefits.","For example, the faint blue spiritual light named Guardian Pure Light which surrounded Yujing was one of the items that they got from the Cultivation Realm!","With this light guarding the city, no one could sneak in!","In Yundian Upper Realm, the Master of the Gongshu Family, the No. 3 Family, and the Master of the Gongyang Family, the No. 4 Family, looked displeased when they heard the reports from their subordinates.","“The Wuwei Daoist Alliance is stubborn. Instead of detaching themselves from that shop, the big forces in the alliance all sent people to attend the competition organized by that shop.”","“Brother Gongshu!” Gongyang Jun, the Master of the Gongyang Family, was a white-faced Daoist looking to be in his fifties. “In my opinion, since the Wuwei Daoist Alliance doesn’t want to attend the Conference, it’s their own choice. We don’t have to...”","“Brother Gongyang! You still don’t understand the situation after so many years?” Gongshu Kuo was a middle-aged Daoist with a wide forehead and a big face. “The Journey to the Cultivation Realm! The Cultivation Realm Conference! The ranking in the Cultivation Realm Conference represents the order of the cultivation world!”","“If the Wuwei Daoist Alliance backed out the Conference on their own will, it would be fine. But obviously, that’s not the case.”","“Now, they think that someone is trying to break this order. What do you think?”","Gongshu Kuo sipped the tea and cleared his throat. “If the Wuwei Daoist Alliance doesn’t submit to us, we’ll continue to put pressure on them.”","“No... This is their business, why should we...”","Gongshu Kuo flicked dust off his sleeve and looked at Gongyang Jun. “As long as our families still want to enter the Cultivation Realm, it is better for us to... Besides, we need this order in the world as well.”"]},{"number":218,"title":"Chapter 218 - 36 Tiangang Sword Array, the Second Round of the Competition!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After the first round of the competition, there was one week until the second round began.","During this time, all of the top 16 players and top 16 teams got busy with their preparations. In the meantime, Fang Qi did his own preparations.","The System had especially given him three days to practice in the Game Cultivation Room, so he could go out and establish branches. After all, the world outside wasn’t as friendly as Jiuhua.","Fang Qi spent this period on practice in the Game Cultivation Room.","The cultivation strength he gained in the Game Cultivation Room didn’t increase as fast as his proficiency in combat techniques, but his cultivation strength increase was still substantial due to the time ratio. After a few days, Fang Qi’s cultivation strength had reached the Ancestral Warrior Realm!","Right now, Fang Qi’s status was as followed.","[Cultivation Strength: Level 2 Ancestral Warrior Realm","Combat Techniques: Sword Control Technique (Master – 36.5%); Innumerable Sword Scroll (Proficient – 88.3%); Sword Flight (Proficient – 36.56%); Holy shock (Skilled – 78.6%, equivalent to level 7); Lightning Resist (Proficient – 80%, equivalent to level 14); Close-Range Combat Skill (Grandmaster)","Enhancement: T-Virus (Enhance to physical strength, speed, reflexes, and mental strength, etc.)]","Together with the other skills he had practiced himself, such as Blessed Hammer, they formed Fang Qi’s current combat system.","Despite the excellent progress that the Game Cultivation Room offered, it wasn’t a comfortable place for Fang Qi. In the room, whenever he wasn’t careful, he would be killed by his game characters. Although he had stronger mental strength compared to the others due to the enhancement of T-Virus, the first year that he spent in the Game Cultivation Room left him with psychological trauma.","After all, he had been killed many times each day. Whenever he couldn’t defeat his opponent, he would be killed!","If not for Silent Hill 2, which increased his mental strength and removed his internal evils, Fang Qi’s mind would be greatly distorted if he didn’t collapse already.","Fortunately, the situation was better in his second year in the Game Cultivation Room since he got used to it.","In other words, he had used almost half of the three-day cultivation time that the System rewarded to him.","He had practiced Li Xiaoyao’s Innumerable Sword Scroll to the proficient level, and now he was charging at the master level!","Before him, Li Xiaoyao leaped into the sky while many swords with flashing spiritual lights on them shot up with him! At his control, the swords changed positions continuously in an exquisite pattern!","Slowly, the swords gathered in a circle and formed a Tai Chi pattern in the sky!","Seeing the swords forming a pattern, Fang Qi’s heart fell with a bad feeling!","Then, he remembered the things that he had learned in the Shu Mountain Faction after he finished the game.","Since the System’s version of the game was different from the original version, the players could stay in the game after clearing the stage. For example, Fang Qi took the quest of becoming the Faction Master of the Shu Mountain Faction as Li Xiaoyao. He had even stayed in Shu Mountain to study the sword arrays of the faction.","36 Tiangang Sword Array?! Fang Qi’s face turned dark when he saw that it was something that he had just learned. Manipulate the swords into an array?! Is this the advanced use of the Innumerable Sword Scroll?!","When the sword array pushed down, it circled swiftly in the pattern, and each route and arc that the swords took looked mysterious and profound!","Fang Qi’s face fell, knowing that he absolutely couldn’t block such an array!","Once he was trapped by the array, he would certainly die!","Immediately, he flew up on the sword, and many lights released from his body and shot toward the sword array behind him!","It must be noted that in the Game Cultivation Room, even though Fang Qi’s warrior qi was only at the Ancestral Warrior Realm in strength, he had an unlimited supply!","That was why he could progress so fast in the Game Cultivation Room. In the room, he could use his full force at anytime. Then, all of his warrior qi would be replenished fully in the next moment!","In contrast, people cultivating in the outside world must spend quite a while to recover the consumed warrior qi or spiritual essence before they could continue practicing.","At this moment, Fang Qi used almost 120% of his strength, and the Innumerable Sword Scroll created a giant cloud of swords in the sky!","Lightning flashed above the cloud of swords, and these swords crashed toward the sword array like a huge storm!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Radiant lightning energy surged around the swords, but the spiritual swords that Fang Qi created were instantly shattered when they got close to the center of the sword array.","With Sword Flight, Fang Qi kept launching the Innumerable Sword Scroll, but the sword array was still moving closer to him gradually!","Half an hour later, blood splashed!","In the respawn spot, Fang Qi looked pale while he saw the spiritual sword array in the Tai Chi pattern flying this way swiftly from the distant sky!","F*ck! Fang Qi wiped cold sweat off his forehead and felt lucky that Li Xiaoyao’s 36 Tiangang Sword Array was only at the beginner’s stage. Otherwise, Fang Qi could just stand here and wait to be killed repeatedly.","...","“Hu...” Coming out of the cultivation room, Fang Qi felt he was going to get new psychological trauma with this kind of cultivation intensity.","Fortunately, he would get some rest in these two days while acting as the referee for the competition.","More people gathered in the shop; they were excited about the matches between civilians, aristocrats, and major factions! Not only players, but the people who couldn’t afford to play the games came to the shop to watch the competition!","After all, Mr. Fang didn’t set the rule that people without money couldn’t enter the shop. In fact, when the shop livestreamed Jade Dynasty and Wind and Cloud each week, some ordinary people living nearby would come and watch.","Of course, as mentioned before, the civilians in Jiuhua City were not people living in poverty.","Fatty Wang was a civilian, a comparatively rich one, and so was Guo Xiong. The latter had reached the Ancestral Warrior Realm and was thus a successful civilian; it was only a matter of time and personal choice for him to become one of the aristocrats.","The first event today was the battles between the top 16 in the Diablo competition.","This time, the schedule wasn’t arranged randomly. Instead, the No. 1 player would battle the No. 16 player, and the No. 2 player would battle the No. 15 player, so on and so forth.","At this moment, Xiao Yulv was talking eloquently while sitting on the couch. “According to this schedule, there will be a few surprises. The results of the previous matches have shown the strength of each player, and they all got used to the environment and rules of the competition. Look, Castellan An won the first match as expected, and so did Senior Nalan in the second match. The third match...”","Nalan Mingxue stared at Lan Yan on the screen quietly.","In the match, Lan Yan’s opponent was An Cheng, one of the top sorcerers. Her odds of winning were very slim.","Listen carefully, this is the only way to deal with a sorcerer like An Cheng. Lan Yan felt calm while she remembered the tactic that Nalan Mingxie had taught her before the competition.","On the screen, the gloomy light suddenly turned darker.","The surrounding space turned dark completely!","“What’s happening?” Xiao Yulv stood up from his seat.","“What’s happening?” Mu Donglai who wasn’t familiar with the skills in Diablo asked in bafflement.","“This seems to be a skill of the assassin!”"]},{"number":219,"title":"Chapter 219 - The Strategists Are Cunning","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s Cloak of Shadows?!” Xiao Yulv suddenly recognized the skill.","“Cloak of Shadows?!” The audience looked toward him, obviously unfamiliar with this skill.","“In this Diablo World, the assassins know spiritual spells such as ‘Cloak of Shadows’, which uses mana to create a huge shadow of darkness to limit the enemy’s senses. The higher level the skill, the larger the area covered in darkness!” Xiao Yulv was quite knowledgeable about this.","However, he was baffled. “Where did the assassin come from?”","The area of the darkness was several times bigger than the casting range of sorcerers and sorceresses; this skill must be above level 10!","Ordinary assassins wouldn’t waste so many skill points on this skill.","The previous matches showed that the advantages of sorceresses were their swift teleports and large attack range.","These advantages enabled sorcerers and sorceresses to handle opponents who were good at close-range combat. However, the sorcerers and sorceresses would have to be cautious in the darkness with teleports since they didn’t know where their enemies were!","The results would be quite unpredictable!","“Runeword – Nadir. Although it is only a low-level runeword with ordinary properties, it offers level 13 Cloak of Shadows,” Nalan Mingxue sipped on the Coke and explained lightly.","The moment that An Cheng got teleported to the battlefield, he was engulfed by darkness; the only thing that gave him a sense of security was his outspreading spiritual senses.","In the boundless darkness, the sorcerers and sorceresses were at a disadvantage. Suddenly, An Cheng felt something attacking him in the darkness!","He dodged subconsciously and felt several blessed hammers twirled past him with whistling sounds! However, one of them smashed onto his shoulder!","Teleport!","After several teleports, An Cheng soon got out of the darkness. However, when he saw the paladin in the distance, a huge cloud of darkness engulfed the area he stood on again!","Subconsciously, he used teleport again!","The darkness still moved toward him!","Suddenly, he felt like he crashed into a solid wall!","He had arrived at the edge of the land, and the surrounding area was all sealed!","In the darkness, he heard whistling sounds and used teleport without thinking!","“This sorcerer is in a very bad situation!” Mu Donglai looked at the screen and said.","“I’m not sure about that!” Xiao Yulv waved his folding fan and said, “Brother An was caught off guard, and he hasn’t used the Hydra yet. We can’t say that he’s at a disadvantage!”","On the screen, An Cheng seemed to know that he couldn’t get out of the darkness no matter how many teleports he used, so he waved his staff and hurriedly chanted a short spell. Then, in a wave of flames, an ugly flame serpent with three heads stood before An Cheng!","Lan Yan dodged the flames spat out by the Hydra and disappeared into the darkness again.","“If they continue fighting this way,” Mu Donglai said, “They might get into a deadlock, right? After all, no one can stop the sorcerers and sorceresses from fleeing.”","“You’re right,” Nalan Mingxue said, “It’s no use chasing after him.”","Sure enough, Lan Yan stopped chasing.","An Cheng took this moment to regain his breath.","He summoned several Hydras. If his opponent came up, these flame monsters would attack fiercely; he didn’t need to worry.","Time ticked on, and An Cheng suddenly felt like something was wrong!","He wondered why his opponent still didn’t show up!","“How come An Cheng is running back?!” All the people watched the unusual scene on the screen!","“Passive play. It seems that he received a warning for being too passive.” Nalan Mingxue explained, “Without the teleport staff, paladins can’t catch up with sorcerers and sorceresses, so the best strategy is to force them to escape and play passively. After receiving the warning, the sorcerers and sorceresses must return and attack.”","“Since the sorcerers and sorceresses would initiate the passive play, they must initiate the battle. If they don’t, there will be a second warning. If the third warning comes, they will lose the match.”","The people in the audience exclaimed, “Young Master An kept teleporting. Since he doesn’t know his opponent’s position, he had put too much distance between him and his opponent. If he doesn’t return, he will receive the warning for playing passively?!”","What a great disadvantage it was for a sorcerer or a sorceress to look for a paladin in the darkness!","An Cheng was looking for Lan Yan when he felt a figure rushing to him from one side!","Teleport!","Obviously, they were very close, and Lan Yan had arrived before him in the blink of an eye.","A shield crashed toward him!","Shield Strike!","She rushed up and interrupted An Cheng’s teleport before it was even used! In a bout of heavy dizziness, An Cheng stumbled back under the fierce shield attack!","At this moment, An Cheng’s heart fell since the sorcerers and sorceresses had little room for error.","An Cheng was obviously panicking. When he raised his staff to teleport again, the shield crashed down almost at the same time and interrupted his teleport for the second time.","It was impossible to teleport again!","The staff and the blessed hammer crashed down at the same time!","Lan Yan won!","Xiao Yulv: “...”","All the people gaped at the sight. “How could this happen?!”","“Strengths and skills are not the only key factors in determining the result of a match,” Nalan Mingxue said, “One can gain a victory by using the rules to one’s advantage.”","[You guys are dirty for using strategies to win.] At this moment, a bullet message appeared on the big screen.","“It must be the shop owner who sent this message...”","Nalan Mingxue: “...”","The next match was between Li Haoran who was in the fourth place and Zhou Hongying who was in the 13th place.","“This girl usually plays with Bai Lang, and she is Ms. Ye’s senior sister from the Cloud Ocean Faction,” Xiao Yulv said, “She is good, but I put my money on brother Li.”","“Haoran bought an item with good properties yesterday, and it has the ‘cannot be frozen’ property.” Mu Donglai nodded and said, “He does have better odds of winning.”","“You two just shut up!” Lan Mo almost jumped up from the couch. After all, every time these two said someone would win, that person would lose!","“Li Haoran is winning.” At this moment, Li Haoran’s Hydra and his own spiritual spells crashed forward in the surging flames, and his opponent fell to the ground soon.","“He... won?”","Lan Mo and Jun Yangzi stared at the screen and then turned to look at Xiao Yulv and Mu Donglai in disbelief. “He won?!’","“Isn’t that guy the shop owner’s friend?” At this moment, people noticed that the next match was about to begin.","“His opponent is... Elder Fu?!” Even Lin Shao and Xu Luo froze at the sight.","“Can he last more than one minute?” Xiao Yulv shook his head and said, “The fatty might have a chance if he had another opponent. But now, he will lose quickly.”","“...”","Many people sent bullet messages on the big screen.","[Condolences to the Fatty!]","[Condolences to the Fatty from me as well!]"]},{"number":220,"title":"Chapter 220 - The Necromancer Without a Skeleton Army","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“When Mr. Fang made the rules, he probably forgot the necromancers.” Lin Shao obviously was familiar with this class. “The monsters and corpses will have some impact on the matches, but without them on the battlefield, how can this necromancer play? After all, he isn’t allowed to go to other maps to find corpses and monsters.”","“Right!” Xu Luo also thought that it was unfair. “The shop owner recommended this class to Fatty Wang, but he didn’t make rules properly for this class!”","Nalan Mingxue frowned since she knew a little bit about the skills of the necromancers. If there were corpses, Wang Tai might be able to battle for a while. But now that his skills were restricted, she could only send Fatty her condolence.","...","Since all the competitions and battles in this world were all best of ones, Fang Qi followed the custom, and all the participants in the Diablo competition got only one chance to defeat their opponents!","After all, a person only had one chance on the battlefield in the minds of the people in this world. It was impossible to keep calm.","At this moment, Fatty Wang’s hands were sweaty as he gripped his staff.","While a large group of people watched him, he was going to fight a opponent who was a super master in the real world!","He wasn’t a genius like Song Qingfeng and Nalan Mingxue, and he didn’t have better items than the others. In fact, he had been beaten senseless at the beginning of the competition, and he barely made it this far!","Since there were no corpses on the battlefield, he couldn’t summon skeletons. Therefore, the necromancers’ best skill at the beginning of the game, Raise Skeleton and Skeletal Mage, were useless spells in this battle.","The battle would be easy for him if there were groups of skeletons in front of him while rows of skeletal mages stood behind him!","Likewise, he couldn’t use the necromancers’ most powerful skill – Corpse Explosion!","Although this rule didn’t prohibit the necromancers from using these spells, they made these few spells useless in this kind of battle.","Therefore, Wang Tai was forced to adjust his skill tree, and he changed from a necromancer who mained summoning spells to a necromancer who mained bone spells.","Different from others who had formed a fixed battle style, he kept adjusting his battle style during the 20 matches in the first round. In fact, he had just barely formed his own battle style.","This was why he hadn’t entered the top 16 until the end of the first round despite his high level and good items.","In fact, he was still adjusting his battle style since he was still hesitating about many skill combos.","For example, he was still debating whether he should use Teeth or Bone Spear as his main offensive spells and if he should put skills into Iron Golem or Clay Golem, etc.","Since the Iron Golem needed a metal item with top properties to unleash its full power, he decided to choose Clay Golem for the sake of security.","Anyway, the only thing that he could summon was one Clay Golem. (Different kinds of golem couldn’t exist at the same time, so he could only summon one.)","On the other side, Elder Fu checked the usage counts of the teleport staff and other items. Equipped with the teleport skill, it was easy for him to handle a necromancer who couldn’t run that fast.","In fact, Elder Fu though that he didn’t even have to reveal that he had gotten a teleport staff in this match, and he could keep this secret weapon for the next match.","After they finished adjusting their items and skills, the count-down began, and the two opponents were teleported to the battlefield.","Elder Fu planned to charge at the necromancer who didn’t have the teleport skill and knock him out with a shield strike. In Elder Fu’s mind, he could end the battle instantly in this way.","However, he saw a solid high wall made of white bones rising between them as soon as the match began.","Through the crevices between the bones, he saw the fat young man scrambling to use his next spiritual spell.","Bone Prison!","Huge bone walls rose around him and formed a square prison, locking him in the center!","Since few people played this class, these skills were rarely seen. Besides, Wang Tai hadn’t used these skills in the first round of the competition, and all the people in the audience were baffled as soon as he used them","If one tried to climb out of this high bone prison, he would be shot into a sieve by his opponent!","The people who had been clamoring to pay condolences to Fatty Wang fell silent instantly!","Elder Fu knew that he couldn’t wait any longer. The only way to break out was by using the teleport staff; he would die if he kept it hidden.","While he took out the teleport staff, Wang Tai used the third spiritual spell in order.","They used spiritual spells almost at the same time, but the paladin’s speed of using spells was way slower than that of a necromancer.","Decrepify!","In the next moment, Elder Fu teleported behind Wang Tai!","Crack!","Wang Tai wasn’t aware of Elder Fu’s presence until the sound of the bone armor being knocked down came behind him; he immediately put more distance between him and his opponent.","All the people watched in astonishment when Elder Fu waved his shield with extreme slowness. After Elder Fu knocked down Wang Tai’s bone armor, he tried to hit Wang Tai, but the latter dodged his attack!","“What’s happening?!”","Elder Fu was also astonished when he found that his body was so heavy that it felt older than himself in the real world! He could unleash less than half of his strength compared to before!","Meanwhile, the Clay Golem which had been guarding Wang Tai began to attack!","Cursed by Decrepify, Elder Fu couldn’t dodge the attack!","He moved so that the Clay Golem didn’t hit his vital points; it only crashed onto his arm, and the damage was low.","However, he found his body turning even heavier as if he was being weighed down by a huge 1,000-pound rock!","Slow curse! The Clay Golem’s attack contained slow curse!","All the people watched as Elder Fu on the big screen moved in slow motion!","It was the result of both curses, Decrepify and Slow!","Meanwhile, many bone spells and the Clay Golem attacks crashed down!","“Oh! My god! How can he fight back?!”","“How can the paladin get out of it?!”","“This is harder to handle than the sorcerers and sorceresses’ teleport skill!”","“He can counter the sorcerers and sorceresses’ teleport skill with a teleport staff, but how can he deal with this slowing spell?”","The people who were in front of the big screens broke loose!","Xiao Yulv, who had claimed that Wang Tai couldn’t win, now blushed. “Senior Fu teleported with the shield! He still has hope!”","“He used several teleports consecutively! He has put enough distance between him and his opponent!” the others exclaimed.","“What am I watching?! The necromancer is hunting down the paladin!”","“What are these things?!” Then, they saw Wang Tai chasing after Elder Fu while waving his staff and summoning spirits one after another!","These spirits moved swiftly. As if they could smell humans, they floated directly toward Elder Fu!","“He’s finished!” Many people lamented with regret.","On the battlefield, one could only drink mana potions and couldn’t drink health potions. Also, the teleport staff could only be used about ten times, and Elder Fu had depleted half of the usage.","“Elder Fu gave himself a Holy Shield and teleported back!” To everyone’s horror, Elder Fu had teleported back!","The Decrepify and Slow had expired!","The moment that Elder Fu teleported back, lights flashed beneath his feet!","“Holy Shock! Smite?! He hit his target!” Without the restraint of Decrepify and Slow, Elder Fu hacked down his crystal sword like a phantom while he nimbly dodged the Clay Golem’s attack!","Wang Tai’s bone armor was instantly broken, and he stumbled and almost fell under this huge force!","Half of his HP was gone instantly!","However, Wang Tai had just released a bone spirit which could sense out life forms by itself. It instantly dashed onto Elder Fu, whose HP immediately dropped to the bottom!","“Can I curse him again?!” Wang Tai lifted his hand to use a curse.","“He teleported!” The people screamed in front of the big screens!","They watched as Elder Fu teleported before the curse was used as he had predicted it!","“He’s gone! The curse missed him!”","“Awesome!”","“Ahh! There’s a spirit behind him!”","“Continue teleporting! Teleport!”","“He’s finished!!” Two spirits were nearby and smelling life, so they crashed into him at great speed!","Wang Tai won the match?!","All the people watched this scene in disbelief!","They fell silent at this result!","The common-looking fat guy won the match?!"]},{"number":221,"title":"Chapter 221 - Sorcerers and Sorceresses Are Done; The Quarter Final Begins","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Necromancers are horrifying!","They are a horrifying class!","All of the people in the audience hadn’t realized how powerful this dirty class, which dealt with corpses on a daily basis, was until now!","Even without corpses and a large skeleton army, this class still could unleash horrifying power!","Bedlam broke loose in front of the big screens while people talked about the skills of the necromancer and the match!","Perhaps Wang Tai was the biggest dark horse in this competition!","“I won?!” Want Tai put down the virtual headset and looked around.","He still didn’t feel like he had won!","Even now, he felt like he was in a dream!","In fact, he had thought that he would lose. He had played poorly except for casting Decrepify on his opponent and making the Clay Golem slow his opponent down.","Yeah, very poorly! His performance was even worse compared to his previous matches!","For example, he had built a bone prison after building a bone wall. If he were more confident in himself, one bone prison was enough, and he would have had time to use other spells.","If he used Iron Maiden during that time, which could reflect the damage he received back to his opponent, the result would be different!","Since his opponent was a master both in games and in real life, he had been extremely nervous!","His hands were still shaking nervously right now.","“Not bad!” Fang Qi walked over and patted his shoulder, saying, “You’re the No. 1 Necromancer in the shop.”","“No. 1... Necromancer?” Fatty Wang gulped with difficulty and waved his hand immediately, saying,","“No... I’m not.”","“Kid! Keep it up! You’re the only necromancer in the top eight. Of course, you are the No.1 Necromancer.” Not expecting that he would lose to this fat guy, Elder Fu still looked embarrassed.","Compared with the others, Wang Tai was an ordinary fat guy with a round face and small eyes; it was incredible that he could play games in a team with the geniuses, such as Song Qingfeng, and could enter the national examination with good performance.","Like every small figure, he felt humble and had little self-esteem when he looked up at the geniuses and masters.","He had humbly followed the geniuses and spent each day routinely, never expecting that he would one day surpass them.","He felt no sense of existence, and no one paid attention to him either in real life or in the games.","However, at this moment, he found that in this brand-new world, there was no absolute division between the lofty and the low, and there were no absolute geniuses and ordinary people!","In the real world, he was only a humble fat guy with low self-esteem, but in this virtual world, he had gradually gotten rid of his lowly and humble status; he wasn’t weak anymore!","Unconsciously, he lost some of his inferiority complex and replaced it with a mild confidence that he had never felt before.","Living in the lower class of the city, it was the first time that he felt anything beside inferiority before the aristocrats and masters.","“Thank you!” Not knowing how to respond, Wang Tai blushed and said only two words to Fang Qi after a long pause.","He was at a loss for what to do except that he couldn’t continue his lousy plays in the future battles. If he could only win battles due to his opponent’s lack of knowledge about his skills, he would be ashamed to take their compliments, even if some had only complimented him jokingly.","I must do better in the next match!","While Wang Tai considered how to improve his battle style based on his previous mistakes, the next match began.","Song Qingfeng versus Ouyang Cheng.","“Gongzi Xiao, how about this pair?” Some people who weren’t familiar with Diablo asked.","“I think they’re on the same level...” Xiao Yulv said, “After all, someone used the Cloak of Shadows strategy before, and Ouyang Cheng must be prepared for it.”","Before he finished his words, someone yelled, “The teleport got interrupted!”","“What skill did he use?!”","Exclamations rose around him!","The moment that Ouyang Cheng entered the battlefield and was about to pull away with teleport, he felt like someone hammered his head, and he got dizzy!","Even his teleport was interrupted!","Different from other games, players of Diablo could still launch attacks and spiritual spells in dizziness instead of being rendered useless if they could focus and concentrate enough.","Nalan Mingxue squinted since she had noticed that Song Qingfeng had used a spiritual spell the moment that he entered the battlefield; obviously, he interrupted his opponent’s teleport through prediction!","She was surprised that an assassin could interrupt a teleport from such a great distance!","In the next moment, Song Qingfeng teleported with his teleport staff and attacked again to interrupt Ouyang Cheng’s next teleport!","Watching the scene on the battlefield, Fang Qi lamented silently. The teleport skill looked weak in front of the players who were warriors or cultivators in real life. When he first played the game before he traveled to this world, it was much harder to interrupt others’ teleports!","With the assassins getting close to them, the sorcerers and sorceresses were powerless. Since Ouyang Cheng couldn’t get away with teleport, and the freeze from his shiver armor was useless on Song Qingfeng, who wore an item that had the ‘cannot be frozen’ property, the outcome was evident!","Then, Bai Lang lost all of his HP under the siege of the grizzlies and wolves summoned by Bu Che, a druid, who teleported with a teleport staff as well.","As for another dark horse, Fu Jianghe, he somehow also got a teleport staff and eliminated the remaining sorcerer with the vision restriction from the Cloak of Shadows and the mobility from teleport!","This sorcerer was Ouyang Zhen, the head of the Ouyang Family!","Now, people had seen the downfall of the sorcerers and sorceresses.","In the end, the sorcerers and sorceresses who gained fame in the first round of the competition were almost all slaughtered in the round of 16 by their opponents with all kinds of restraining methods!","The only two remaining sorcerers were An Huwei and Li Haoran!","At this moment, the competition entered the quarter-finals!","According to the rules, the first match was An Huwei’s sorcerer versus Bu Che’s druid."]},{"number":222,"title":"Chapter 222 - The Curtain Falls","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Guys!” Lan Mo received a message, and his face turned grim when he read it. Then, he gathered people like Xue Daolv and Ye Songtao to his side.","“I just received a message that those big families have cut off all the spiritual artifacts and mineral resources sales channels of our Wuwei Daoist Alliance!”","“This is outrageous!” Ye Songtao’s face turned livid.","“They can only bully us! They don’t dare to smash this shop!” Xue Daolv also looked furious.","“Alliance Master Lan, what do you think that we should do?”","“In my opinion,” Lan Mo said, “We can stall them and keep this situation undercover for a while.”","“Then...”","“What else can we do?” Lan Mo said, “We’ve placed our bets. If we submit to them now, they will think that we are weak and are afraid of them. Do you think they will be good to us?”","“It is better if we work together and take the risk!”","Ye Songtao and Xue Daolv could do nothing but smile bitterly at each other.","They wondered how they got themselves in a situation where they got cliffs on both sides.","What else could they do?","...","“The druid got close to his opponent with teleport as soon as he entered the battlefield!” Xiao Yulv stood up from the couch. “Castellan An teleported away at the same moment that the druid took out the staff! He did it almost simultaneously!”","All the people stared at the screen. With his high cultivation strength, An Huwei wasn’t slow in these plays!","“Bu Che followed him with several teleports, but Castellan An teleported away almost always at the same time!” Xiao Yulv exclaimed, “He solved it! After the slaughter of sorcerers and sorceresses, Castellan An seemed to have found a way to solve the problem!”","“Castellan An seemed to have added several items that can enhance his speed of casting spiritual spells. He broke the teleport staff strategy with his powerful reflexes!”","All the people froze at An Huwei’s plays on the big screens.","“He is, after all, a grandmaster!”","“He can achieve such a feat...”","“You can’t catch old birds with chaff!” Returning to the shop, people like Lan Mo and Ye Songtao each bought a box of spicy sticks and yelled between bites.","“Bu Che will soon use up his teleports! Still, he gained no progress!” With his eyes glued to the screen, Xiao Yulv suddenly yelled in excitement, “Oh! Cloak of Shadows! This time, Castellan An can’t see Bu Che’s movements and thus can’t teleport simultaneously!”","“Wow! This spicy stick is an ultimate delicacy in the world!” While listening to Xiao Yulv’s loud commentaries, Lan Mo and the others chewed and savored the spicy sticks and watched the match. “It’s surprising that people can battle like this in the virtual world!”","“Yeah!” Jun Yangzi picked up a spicy stick. “It’s much more fun than the Cultivation Realm Conference.”","“The teleport is interrupted again!” Xiao Yulv slapped his thigh. “The sorcerer is at a disadvantage!”","Soon, An Huwei’s HP was emptied!","“So soon!?”","“Who are the competitors in the next match?”","“I want to watch more!”","“Senior Nalan versus Fu Jianghe, the second biggest dark horse!” Xiao Yulv looked at the screen. “Em? Where are they? One is missing.”","[Nalan Hongwu won the match due to the withdrawal of his opponent!] A notice appeared on the screen.","“F*ck!”","“What happened?!”","“Because he knew that he would lose?”","Fortunately, it was only a small interruption and didn’t affect the process of the competition.","No skills were prohibited in this competition because Fang Qi found that it was not necessary.","Each class had its powerful aspects and its limits, and Fang Qi never thought to change this fact. After all, people could use these spiritual spells and combat techniques in the real world. Could these players restrict and limit their enemies from using certain skills?","Of course not!","Since the competition was based on the real world, it wasn’t necessary to restrict skills.","“The next match! Lan Yan versus Song Qingfeng!”","Both excelled in close-range combats, and everything was more physical. Besides, it was a fierce battle since they were fighters on the same level in the real world. Song Qingfeng was proficient with the saber, dagger, and close-range combat skill, mastering all types of close-range combat. On the other hand, Lan Yan’s paladin activated the Holy Shield and wasn’t afraid of close-range combat!","On the big screen, people saw flashes of sword and saber!","The assassin in the black leather armor moved swiftly like a ghost while the paladin’s light shield blocked the attacks without a miss!","“Brother Xiao, what do you think?”","“I don’t know!” Xiao Yulv’s face turned dark.","“Song Qingfeng is the winner!”","“The next match! Wang Tai versus Li Haoran!”","Fatty Wang was obviously bolder in this match. While using Dim Vision to lower his opponent’s sight and senses, he used Decrepify and endless bone spirits steadily. Soon, he gained the upper hand!","Li Haoran saw silent bone spirits swarming up from all directions in the darkness, and he was forced to teleport. When he came back and was about to cast spells, all kinds of curses swarmed up to him again!","It was the second time that people witnessed the great power of this class. The powerful tracking ability of the bone spirits didn’t need necromancer’s aiming, so they didn’t need to worry even if their vision was restricted.","Even though not as mobile as sorcerers and sorceress who had teleport, the necromancers still could cause great trouble for their opponents with all kinds of curses that had long casting ranges.","With more confidence in himself, people saw Wang Tai winning the match without more trouble.","“It’s the shop owner’s scheme!” Nalan Mingxue commented while eating spicy sticks on the couch.","The Diablo competition and Counter Strike competition were held on alternative days. On the second day, the big forces showed their great power and smart strategy in the Counter Strike competition. However, the Royal Team didn’t make the top 8, nor did the Blue Flame Team which had been defeated by the two powerful teams from Lingyun Academy in the beginning!","In the end, the top four were the two teams from Lingyun Academy, the Liuyun Team led by Su Tianji, and the team of independent warriors including Liang Shi.","Although Song Qingfeng’s assassin barely defeated Lan Yan’s paladin, he was no match for Nalan Hongwu’s paladin!","Without a teleport staff, Wang Tai found that it was difficult to handle Bu Che’s strategy of teleport and siege. Despite the great power of the necromancer, this class wasn’t invincible. In a PVP against a druid on the same level, the necromancer’s lack of a teleport skill put Wang Tai at an disadvantage.","The druid summoned the wolves, grizzlies, and vines, and they sieged his opponent against the curses. The result was obvious.","In the end, Nalan Hongwu took the first place as everyone expected, but they were astonished to see that Bu Che and Wang Tai had taken the second and the third places respectively!","Song Qingfeng could do nothing but smile bitterly. After all, curses were indeed powerful in close-range combat. Besides, Wang Tai was a warrior instead of an ordinary person or a dummy. When he tossed out the Iron Maiden, it immediately turned Song Qingfeng’s assassin, who mained martial arts skills, useless.","On the other side, the Counter Strike team competition also came to an end.","The Lingyun Team led by Nalan Mingue took the first place with dominant strength. To people’s surprise, the previous second place, Lingyun Team 2, was defeated by Shanshi Team led by Liang Shi in the semifinals and got only the fourth place.","As for Liuyun Team, due to Su Tianji’s great individual strength and the gradual growth of her teammates, they finally took the second place.","The three-week competition finally ended!","“Boss! Where are the prizes?!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked around, more eager than the champions. “We haven’t handed out the prizes yet!”"]},{"number":223,"title":"Chapter 223 - Trying the Guns","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The prizes are here!” Fang Qi opened the cabinets, and in it were big and small cases with metal luster.","When Fang Qi took out the biggest rectangle case and opened it, all the people swarmed up to watch.","“Is this the AWP Sniper Rifle?” They saw that the components such as the scope and the body of the gun were dissembled and lying quietly in the case. There were also 20 orange-colored bullets which were longer than the ordinary ones, giving people chills.","Instantly, Nalan Mingxue put them together with the skill that she learned in Resident Evil. Then, she picked it up and found that it was heavy in her hands.","She put her eye on the scope and saw the things in the distance zooming up around the crosshairs.","Beside her, Su Tianji took out the prize for her team and began to put the gun together. As an experienced player, she did it with fluid movements.","Even though people knew that the gun was empty, they backed up and kept clear of it subconsciously when the gun pointed at them.","Liang Shi and his teammates were exhilarated that they got the third place while competing with these cultivators and aristocrats!","One of them played with the Desert Eagle lovingly, and then his teammates took it from his hands to admire it with wonder.","“Here.” Fang Qi took out trophies from the cabinet and handed them to the people who had won their matches and competitions. “The top three players of the Diablo competition, please give me the name of the items you want, and I’ll hand out the prizes tomorrow!”","“They are exquisitely made!” The people looked envious.","“Look at the trigger and the details!” Jun Yangzi finally had the chance to borrow the AK from Su Tianji and looked at it admiringly. “The artifact-making technique is artful, and everything fits seamlessly!”","Li Haoran nodded and said, “Indeed, it’s more exquisite than our products! This artifact-making technique includes all the small components, and it is similar to the making of elixirs where certain chemical reactions took place. It’s a wonder that it can reach such a high level without the engravings of arrays!”","“If nothing else.” Nalan Mingxue’s heart lurched while she said, “If we engraved some arrays on these sniper bullets, an ordinary person with gun training could kill an Ancestral Warrior from one kilometer away!”","Different from the sniper rifle, Su Tianji’s assault rifle had extra magazines. She looked around and asked, “Sir! Can I try the gun?”","Everyone retreated instantly.","“How do you want to try it?” Fang Qi’s face darkened. “Do you want to fire around in the shop?”","“Let’s go outside.” Li Haoran said, “I have spiritual artifact testing targets and an artifact testing rock with me.”","“Right, you run an artifact shop,” Fang Qi said.","Almost all the people swarmed out and watched while Li Haoran took out a smooth black rock from his storage spiritual artifact. “This is a low-level artifact testing rock. Try the gun on it.”","Dadadadadada!","“F*ck!” Song Qingfeng the and others watched the blazing barrel of the gun with envy and excitement.","“It’s a real Ak! A real AK!” There were many players of Resident Evil and Counter Strike and thus many gun fans. They all yelled in excitement at this sight.","“The artifact test rock was pierced!”","“I want it too...” Ji Yu and the others also looked envious since they had become gun fans after the recent training of marksmanship.","I must get some of these in my palace! Ji Wu was also tempted while he watched. Remembering that his Royal Team didn’t even make the top 8, he felt ashamed. Next time, my Dajin Royal Team must take the first place!","“Let me try!” Liang Shi had always wanted to hold a gun in real life, and he finally realized his dream. With his arm strength, he lifted the Desert Eagle with one hand effortlessly.","Boom!","Hearing the loud gunshot, people’s eyes lit up. “So powerful!”","Looking at the prizes, the members of Lingyun Team 2, which got the fourth place felt frustrated. They almost made it!","“Make way! Make way!” At this moment, Lin Shao and Xu Luo yelled smugly. “Let us try this sniper rifle!”","When they saw Nalan Mingxue raising the sniper rifle and taking aim, people retreated subconsciously.","With an ear-deafening gunshot, the black artifact test rock was broken into two halves! The bullet left a huge hole in the rock with flying debris!","People clicked their tongues while they witnessed this gun’s great power!","“Gongzi Xiao, what do you think of it?” Mu Donglai asked.","“I would be dead if I encountered such a thing!” Xiao Yulv stared at the guns. “Can I borrow it and have a try?”","After all, he could only watch Su Tianji play Counter Strike while standing behind her, and he had never got his hands on a gun!","“Sister Fenghua!” He immediately came before Fenghua who was admiring the AK and asked, “Can I hold it for a while?”","“Erm-hem!” Fang Qi cleared his throat. “The people on the shop’s blacklist...”","“Sir? He’s not allowed to touch it?” Fenghua immediately took back the gun in disdain and said, “Sorry! I can’t let you touch it!”","Xiao Yulv felt like killing, and he glared at Fang Qi murderously. “Sir, you’re outrageous!”","Fang Qi patted his head and said, “Sorry! I got it wrong. The prize is out of our hands, and the shop’s rules don’t apply to it.”","“Really!?” Xiao Yulv asked in disbelief.","“Hahahaha!” Xiao Yulv immediately put his arms around the AK in Fenghua’s hands and laughed, “I can finally play with guns!”","“It’s just a gun! It’s not a big deal!” Nalan Hongwu walked out of the shop and stuffed his prize list into Fang Qi’s hand.","He beckoned at Nalan Mingxue and said, “Come on! Xue! Shoot at me and let me see how powerful it is!”","“Boom!”","With a loud sound, Nalan Mingxue shot the gun without hesitation.","F*ck! She did shoot at him! Fang Qi’s face twitched.","Nalan Hongwu’s thick warrior qi instantly condensed into a thick invisible wall in front of his body!","“Hehe! Kid! It is still too weak for me!” Nalan Hongwu looked at Fang Qi smugly.","“F*uk!”","“Awesome!”","“He caught the bullet with bare hands!”","“It is a sniper bullet!”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “I dare you to catch a nuclear bomb.”","Damn it!","Jun Yangzi watched the scene and laughed, “That’s powerful enough! They haven’t got arrays engraved on them yet. We can try them again after we attach the arrays with attributes such as penetration, freeze, and slow!”","“Why not?” Nalan Hongwu snorted without fear. “I’ll be the first to test their power!”","...","At this moment, Lan Mo heaved a sigh of relief. The Wuwei Daoist Alliance at least got a prize even though it wasn’t his Blue Flame Faction that got it.","The Bu Family and the other cultivation families in Dajin had close relationships with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and some of them had joined the alliance early on. If they could join hands, it was possible to change the current situation!","More importantly, he saw an opportunity to take the next step!","It was why he didn’t submit despite the complete boycott against the Wuwei Daoist Alliance!"]},{"number":224,"title":"Chapter 224 - Runewords and Rune Symbols","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Since everyone is here, I have a tentative proposal,” Nalan Hongwu said at this moment.","“Please go ahead.” All the people looked at him.","“Everyone knows that Mr. Fang, Little Li, and Xue formed a so-called research institute...” Nalan Hongwu felt like the name was a bit strange, and he asked, “Did I say the name right?”","“They have gained some progress with their research and even made some products. It is a partnership that every party contributed their efforts to. I think that we can also form a partnership.”","Nalan Hongwu said the words mainly to the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. Although the Nalan Family gained the highest prize in the Diablo competition, and Nalan Mingxue was the captain of the first place Team in the Counter Strike team competition, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance was also powerful and could study the AK and the rare item through its relationship with the Bu Family.","Instead of hiding their items from each other, it was better to form a partnership. After all, although the Nalan Family recruited many cultivators, their artifact making skills were far inferior to those of Wuwei Daoist Alliance.","Meanwhile, the Nalan Family had a unique item and the sniper rifle, which were things the artifact masters craved for.","“Besides...” Nalan Hongwu looked toward Liang Shi and others and said, “If you like, you can sell your gun to me, and I’ll give you a generous price that satisfies you.”","“Ugh...” Liang Shi and the others hesitated. They indeed wanted a good gun, but crystals were quite important to them as well. More importantly, it was a prize that they won in the first competition that they participated in, and it was quite meaningful to them. If not necessary, they didn’t want to sell it.","“In my opinion, it’s not necessary for them to sell it.” Fang Qi looked at Nalan Hongwu and said, “They can loan you the Desert Eagle and get their shares of the future revenue if you get anything out of the research. What do you think?”","Fang Qi said it for the sake of Fatty Wang. After all, if Wang Tai moved around with the only magic item in the world, he would be in mortal danger. The same went for Liang Shi and his peers.","However, if they put the things in the hands of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, they would be safe.","“This method...” Liang Shi and his peers thought of it and felt like it was indeed a good solution to their dilemma.","...","“Ahh!” The moment that they left the Origins Internet Club, Liang Shi and his peers yelled at the top of their lungs!","They felt as if they had been dreaming in the last couple of days.","Liang Shi didn’t want to join any forces since he could be forced to do things that went against his principles. However, he was now in a partnership with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and the Nalan Family, two huge forces!!","It was something that he had never dared to imagine!","It seemed that his life would be completely changed!","Clasping his hands behind his head, Liang Shi said in satisfaction, “I used to dream that I could earn enough money so the talented kids in my town can learn martial arts. Now, my dream is becoming a reality!”","Like most other ordinary people, their dreams were not big","“Hahahaha!” Wu Shan’s mustache moved with his laughter. “I think we can celebrate it with bottles of Coke at that time!”","“Why don’t we celebrate it now?”","“Ugh... I don’t have enough money...” Wu Shan’s face turned dark.","...","“Qi, thank you!”","The customers came or went in groups of two or three, and the orange setting sun extended their shadows on the street.","During the competition and after it, Wang Tai heard people saying that the shop owner had recommended this class to him with today’s competition in mind.","In fact, he had never imagined that Fang Qi’s casual recommendation would bring him such glory!","Of course, he didn’t know that this dirty and unorthodox class had left many scary stories and legends in another world!","Fang Qi shrugged. “You earned it. You don’t have to thank me.”","“Anyway, I still want to thank you.” Fatty Wang grinned as a silly expression appeared on his face, “Oh, I have chosen my item. A blue staff that adds two levels to Raise Skeleton, one level to Clay Golem, and one level to the curse – Weaken.”","“Good choice. Come for it tomorrow.” Fang Qi nodded, thinking that this staff had good properties for a blue item lower than level 10.","...","“Sir! Where’s my trident?!”","“Where’s my rare item?”","In the early morning, Nalan Hongwu and Bu Che strode in; Wang Tai came quite early too.","Even Jun Yangzi and the other artifact masters came with them.","[Razortine (Trident)","Required level 12","+49% Enhanced Damage","Slow Target By 25%","30% Increased Attack Speed","-50% Target Defense","+8 To Dexterity","+15 to Strength]","When the white metal trident with a pale gold color was taken out, it attracted all the people’s attention. They saw many strange symbols engraved on the surface of the heavy trident that was one person in height. The moment that Nalan Hongwu put his hands on it, he could sense the power it contained!","There were no data and digitization in the real world, but he could tell that it was a top-quality weapon that contained immerse power!","“I’ll try it first myself!” Nalan Hongwu cut his thumb slightly with the trident blade.","With his physique, the usual weapon couldn’t wound him even when he didn’t protect himself with warrior qi. However, this trident left a small wound in his thumb.","A weird and strange energy entered his wound and spread all over his body, weighing down his limbs!","“I do feel slowed down!” Nalan Hongwu said, “Besides, when I put my hands on the weapon, I sense that my strength and dexterity have been improved! It indeed contains magic power!”","“Let me see it!” Eagerly, Jun Yangzi took the trident from Nalan Hongwu and touched the weird runes on the surface. He felt the flow of the power inside with excitement and said, “Yeah! This is the power of the rune symbols!”","“Rune symbols?!” All the people looked at Jun Yangzi in astonishment.","“They are Rune symbols!” Jun Yangzi said, “Haoran and I have studied these artifacts for a long time and found that these artifacts rely on runewords that are very similar to the rune symbols in our world. But different from our square characters, these artifacts use a weird twisted language. This artifact making technique is similar to the rune symbols but quite different in other ways.”","“Obviously, their knowledge and applications of the runewords are much deeper than our rune symbols, which are used only for storage spiritual spells for low-level cultivators!”","“This explains why we gained little success after such a long time of research,” Jun Yangzi said confidently, “However, with this weapon as a guide, we will soon make a breakthrough!”"]},{"number":225,"title":"Chapter 225 - The New Spiritual Artifact Is About to Be Born","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This slow effect feels strange!” At this moment, Nalan Hongwu furrowed his brows.","“How do you feel? How is it strange?” Jun Yangzi was the most interested in these items.","“This force exists in my body and spread all over, but I can’t track it down or remove it until it disappears on its own!” Nalan Hongwu said.","“You can’t remove it?” Lan Mo said doubtfully, “You warriors have fewer methods and techniques than us cultivators. Let me try it!”","Instead of cutting himself, he hit his arm with the body of the trident.","He found that the slow effect was released by the head of the trident. If people were touched by this part, they would be affected by this force even if they weren’t wounded by it.","A weird force entered his body!","It felt like an ancient... curse.","Then, he moved his body and instantly found that his body turned slow.","“How do you feel?”","“Very... weird... feeling...” Lan Mo slurred, and he felt like his spiritual essence went parallel with this force, and the former couldn’t touch the latter even though the latter wasn’t strong.","Instantly, an overwhelming surge of spiritual essence rushed out of the core region in his body, and it moved swiftly in his body and sped up his movements!","“Pure Void (Qing Xu) Seal! Break!” A bright light shot out from his eyes while he yelled!","“How about it?” Nalan Hongwu asked.","Lan Mo exhaled a mouthful of turbid air and said, “I can’t remove it properly, and I had to break it with force. This method consumed a lot of energy!”","Nalan Hongwu laughed and said, “Do you know why I chose this thing?”","He pointed at the dark gold trident in Lan Mo’s hand and said, “I can defeat demons and ordinary monsters with this trident! As they said in the game, this is legendary!”","Bu Che chose a rare white wolf helmet that had a yellow light around it, and it increased the level to one of the druids’ elemental skills, could self-repair, and had a charged skill.","The charged skill was firestorm, a low-level skill of the druids.","It was the most valuable rare item that he could find at this stage.","On the side, Wang Tai picked up his staff, which made of some unknown material.","The moment that he got his hands on the staff, Wang Tai ran out of the door and chanted. Then, the soil was sucked from beneath the paving stones on the street and condensed into a monster more than two meters high in front of him!","“Clay Golem?!” All the people gaped at the monster outside the shop. “F*ck!”","Bu Che ran out of the shop and shouted, “Look at my Firestorm!”","He lifted his hand, and several flame snakes crawled forward on the ground and formed a huge fire before him!","“Lame! You’re all too weak!” Song Qingfeng dashed to the Clay Golem. “Watch me use the Saint Spirit Sword Technique! Sword 1! Sword 2! Sword 3...”","While he used the sword technique, the condensed sword essence left deep cuts in the Clay Golem!","“How come you can use the Saint Spirit Sword Technique?!” Many cultivators looked baffled.","“In the last few episodes of Wind and Cloud, Bu Jingyun finally got the scroll that documented the Saint Spirit Sword Technique!” Song Qingfeng continued to use the exquisite sword technique.","“Look at me!” Eager to join in on the fun, Jiang Xiaoyue dashed out of the shop with a wooden sword in her hand and yelled, “Sword control technique!”","The wooden sword turned into a sword shadow and hacked toward the Clay Golem’s head!","Crack! Crack!","The damaged Clay Golem collapsed to the ground in flames.","Wang Tai looked at the Clay Golem that he had just summoned about ten seconds ago and was at a loss for words.","“None of it can compete with my dark gold trident!” Nalan Hongwu waved his hands and used the heavy trident magnificently!","“Enough!” With a dark expression, Fang Qi looked at the uneven street and said, “You’ll ruin the ground!”","“Come on! Let me study them carefully!” The artifact masters including Jun Yangzi, Tian Fengzi and Duan Buyi had heat in their eyes. These things that could be barely considered as artifacts were not as powerful as the ones they made, and Nalan Hongwu’s dark gold trident was only a top-tier artifact for cultivators who weren’t powerful yet. However, some of the attributes that they had, such as the slowing effect, ability to decrease its target defense, and self-repair, were very powerful!","As for the other attributes, they were not powerful but were very unique, and they could fill some gaps in the current artifact-making method.","“However...” Nalan Hongwu frowned and pulled Jun Yangzi to one side, whispering to him, “If these things are really so easy to mimic as you said, will they be safe?”","As the leader of a big family, it was natural for him to consider many things. For example, he was worried that their enemies could also mimic these weapons.","He wouldn’t allow such a thing to happen!","“Don’t underestimate us old guys.” Jun Yangzi pointed at the Razortine and said with a chuckle, “I’ve studied it and found that there aren’t many protections on the mysterious runewords.”","“After all, it was produced in a world that was about to be destroyed, and no one cared about the issue of being mimicked,” Jun Yangzi said, “Of course, things such as materials, textures, order of the runewords would take most cultivators a long time or even a lifetime to gain deep understanding!”","“Then, why did you say that you could do it?!” Nalan Hongwu’s face turned dark.","Jun Yangzi chuckled. “What do you think Haoran has been doing in Diablo this long?”","“What has he been doing?”","“He has been asking about the basic forging method and how to use the runewords!” Jun Yangzi said, “At first, the blacksmiths and sorcerers wouldn’t talk, but they began to tell him things later.”","“Only when you enter their world and get taught by them can you really understand this stuff! Otherwise, you can’t find the door no matter how smart you are!”","Being taught! Right! Diablo was a game, but no one said that other things couldn’t be learned in it!","Nalan Hongwu: “...”","“In the future, our Wuwei Daoist Alliance will engrave special arrays onto items to prevent other forces from copying them. The artifact masters who are involved in this project are all core members of each faction, and they must sign a high-level contract before joining. I’ve done this for hundreds of years; how can I make such a mistake?” While stroking his beard, Jun Yangzi said mysteriously, “I can promise you that as long as the shop owner doesn’t get involved, no one else can mimic these artifacts!”","They smiled at each other with understanding.","While nodding, Jun Yangzi said to Lan Mo by his side, “Senior Brother, we can summon the artifact masters now!”","“The new spiritual artifacts will contain the structure and runewords from Diablo and you cultivators’ own artifact-making techniques. I can’t wait to see them!” Nalan Hongwu laughed and said with a glowing face."]},{"number":226,"title":"Chapter 226 - The Legend of Mir 2, and the Grand Cultivators Playing with Magic Properties","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In Jun Yangzi’s personal artifact-making room in the headquarters of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, the core artifact masters from the Liuyun Daoist Palace, the Cloud Ocean Faction, and other factions in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance gathered together with serious expressions!","After all, this project concerned the future of the entire Wuwei Daoist Alliance and even Dajin’s future! In the center of the room, there was a huge copper-colored eight trigrams array disk, and a pale blue circular mirror stood in the center as a pale blue spiritual light enveloped it.","“Everyone, please look!” Jun Yangzi said proudly.","“This is the Tianluo Heart Mirror of our Blue Flame Faction. This mirror is magical since it can reveal the origins of any illusions or clones, and it can help us artifact masters analyze the materials used and their ratios in the composition of artifacts.”","“The more spiritual essence that is injected into it, the greater power it will release!” Jun Yangzi continued.","“Everyone, please follow my instruction and take the positions according to the eight trigrams.”","“Haoran, let’s do the sniper bullet first.” Jun Yangzi said.","Li Haoran who stood next to him nodded and handed him a bullet which was bigger than the ordinary ones.","Jun Yangzi took out an engraving knife and injected spiritual essence into it. Instantly, spiritual light flowed on the short knife, and the head of the bullet fell to the floor with one cut.","He waved his left hand, and a three-footed bronze cauldron landed in the center of the array, and the bright blue light shined on the belly of the cauldron.","Then, Jun Yangzi poured the bullet powder into the cauldron.","“Please inject spiritual essence in order! Kan! Zhen...”","[TL Note: Kan and Zhen are the names of two out of the eight trigrams.]","“Now, we continue with the staff.”","...","Only about ten days were left before the time limit for the internet-building task would be up.","“Xiaoyue...”","Fang Qi’s shop closed at 12 midnight as usual. While looking at the people who were leaving the shop, Fang Qi said, “I might need to take a long trip.”","“A long trip?” Jiang Xiaoyue furrowed her slim and cute eyebrows. “Wasn’t your trip to Jingshi a long one?”","Fang Qi replied, “Jingshi isn’t that far away. This time, my destination will be more distant than that; much more distant.”","“How long will it take you? When will you return?”","“I don’t know, but I guess it won’t be too long.” Fang Qi turned and patted her on the head, asking, “Can you manage the shop while I’m away?”","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue turned her head away. “You told me I didn’t have to manage the shop; I only need to do the laundry, cook, and be a cashier!”","“No. When I’m gone, you must know how to play games!”","“Ahh!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed and said immediately, “I can manage the shop!”","Fang Qi nodded. “After I’m gone, you can pick two games to play. During the day, especially the morning, you can play a little. You can play a bit more during the evening when there are fewer customers.”","“I got it!” Jiang Xiaoyue said excitedly, “Boss, don’t worry! I’ll manage the shop well for you! I’ll toss out anyone who makes trouble here!”","“The trouble makers?” Fang Qi glanced at the shop and said, “That senior will handle that, so you don’t have to worry about it. You can just yell when anyone makes trouble here.”","Fang Qi glanced at the System Interface and continued, “Anyone who makes trouble in or outside of the shop will be punished with lightning!”","“Besides.” Fang Qi looked at the cabinet and said, “Your pay will be one snack each week except the spicy sticks or 15 crystals each month.”","“I can play games and eat snacks as well?!” Jiang Xiaoyue widened her eyes and looked at this black-hearted boss in disbelief.","Fang Qi shrugged. Although the business of the shop was simple, it wasn’t easy to find an employee who can behave well for this long and be trustworthy. Therefore, increasing the employee benefit was only a small price to pay.","Anyway, I have enough money, he thought as he glanced at the big piles of the crystals in the storage spiritual artifact.","At this moment, the System beeped again.","[Since the host is beginning to execute the plan and complete the task of building an internet, the attaching tasks are activated.]","[Attaching Task 1: Decent Shop","Task Requirement: The new shop must not be located in remote places; they must be established in cities with higher than average population density. Also, the shop must be clean, tidy, and big enough to contain at least 100 computers.","Task Reward: Online Game – The Legend of Mir 2 virtual reality remake (This game will be the only game in the new shop, and other games will come online after three months)","Task Description: The internet era needs blood-boiling excitement]","[TL Note: The Legend of Mir 2 is a sprite-based isometric 3-D massively multiplayer online role-playing game developed by Korean-based WeMade Entertainment. There are currently two versions available: Korean Mir and Chinese Mir. Whilst being moderately successful in Europe, it has been incredibly well received in Asia and was the most popular MMORPG in China in 2002 and 2003, with over 250,000 simultaneous users being reported.]","[Attaching Task 2: Listening to the Sound of Prosperity of Another Part of the World","Task Requirement: Adjust the cross-regional teleportation distance to more than half of the limit","Task Reward: QQ special remake version","Additional description: The internet connects the world.]","Fang Qi even saw the logo of that penguin on the screen.","[TL Note: Tencent QQ, also known as QQ, is an instant messaging software service developed by the Chinese tech giant Tencent. Similar to whatsapp and facebook, but it had been around since the 2000s.]","The Legend of Mir 2!? QQ?! Fang Qi’s face spasmed. Are you serious?","[Attaching Task 3: The Last Cheer","Task Requirement: Go out and have fun with your friends for one day since you might not see them for a while in the real world.","Task Reward: QQ: Qzone special remake version","Tash Description: You saw it right]","[TL Note; Qzone is like My Space, but it was one of the features of QQ.]","Fang Qi thought, Can you give this task a less sad name? It’s not like I’m not coming back!","...","“Many things look the same but are different deeper down...” Jun Yangzi frowned. “However, the attributes such as increased dexterity and strength should be correct.”","While stroking his beard, Jun Yangzi looked at an ordinary stick before them and said, “It seems that the basic stuff isn’t very difficult.”","Jun Yangzi condensed a trace of solid spiritual essence between his fingers and drew something in the air. The pale blue spiritual essence flowed in the air and turned into an extremely weird pattern which looked like the rune symbols on the rune notes but also being quite different.","“Go!” He yelled, and the row of organized symbol-looking runes entered the wooden stick and branded the stick with a line of dark blue words.","Holding the stick in his hand, Jun Yangzi said, “Look, these are the simplest suffix of strength in the weapons with magic properties. From what I know, this artifact-making technique is divided into two parts. The first part is the engravings with basic attributes with prefixes, and the second part is what we just did, giving this item a suffix property.”","Although the attributes were invisible, Jun Yangzi and Li Haoran showed their deep knowledge of them. “I can tell you that the strength attribute is between 6 to 9, and the suffix is Bull which I derived from the suffix on the Razortine.”","“In other words, we can name this magic item Stick of Bull”","“To give magic properties to artifacts, the beginners must concentrate their mind and try all kinds of materials before they can achieve success,” Jun Yangzi said, “But with our spiritual essence, we only need to control the condensed spiritual essence and keep it steady on the artifacts!”","“Does it mean that we succeeded?!”","“Hahahaha!”","“We finally got some success!” Cheers and laughter burst out in the artifact-making room."]},{"number":227,"title":"Chapter 227 - The Group Trip to Mount Haruna","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! Are you taking a long trip?!”","Sitting around the tea tables in the lounge, people like Song Qingfeng, Nalan Mingxue, Su Tianji, Lan Mo, and Ye Songtao were eating instant noodles and chatting.","When they heard this question asked by someone, they all looked at Fang Qi, who was walking toward them with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands.","“When will you go? Why do you want to take a long trip?” Xu Zixin looked at Fang Qi curiously. This girl in purple was among the first few players of the shop and was surprised that Fang Qi, the shop owner who stayed in the shop playing games almost every day, would suddenly take a long trip.","“Qi, where are you going?” Wang Tai was also surprised. He knew Fang Qi the longest and had never seen Fang Qi taking long trips. Jingshi was probably the farthest place that he had ever gone to.","“You’re doing fine in the shop. Why do you want to go out?” Nalan Hongwu was baffled.","Fang Qi shrugged and said, “To open a branch. With the business booming, it’s a good time to open a branch.”","“Open a branch?” Ji Yu was excited. “Will you open one in Jingshi?”","“It doesn’t take long for people to travel here from Jingshi,” Fang Qi said, “When you are proficient with the sword control technique, you will travel faster, and it’s not necessary for me to go there and open a branch.”","Ji Yu: “...”","“Sir, you are going on a long trip, but you still don’t want to visit our Cloud Ocean Faction!” Ye Xiaoye complained.","“Let’s see the shop owner off,” Xu Zixin suggested.","“Not necessary.” Fang Qi waved his hand. “I’ll go with the sword control technique.”","“Don’t underestimate us!” Xu Zixin said in displeasure, “I can now fly on a sword too!”","“Me too!” Song Qingfeng said.","“Me too.” Nalan Mingxue was as cool as usual.","“Same here!” Jiang Xiaoyue said smugly.","However, Fang Qi patted her on the head and said, “You stay here and watch after the shop!”","Ignoring the sulky Jiang Xiaoyue, Fang Qi looked at the others and asked, “Are you sure? Won’t you fall from the sky?”","“Impossible!” Xu Zixin rolled her eyes. After finishing her noodles, she walked outside and said, “Watch me!”","She cast a sword spell with her hands and chanted, and a sword soared up into the sky and then came down steadily to her feet.","“It’s nothing.” An Cheng strode out, used the sword spell, and stepped on his sword, flying above the buildings!","As the son of the Castellan, he knew that he would be knocked down by the flying-prohibition array formation of the city if he flew any higher.","Incensed, An Huwei walked out and scolded, “I’ll lock you up for breaking the law intentionally!”","Obviously, no one was allowed to fly inside Jiuhua City.","Fang Qi’s face stiffened when he found that most of them had mastered the sword flight technique and that they were showing off.","With a wave of his hand, Fang Qi opened the door and flew out while stepping on a sword.","“Come and catch up with me if you can!”","“F*ck! Don’t run if you dare!” Song Qingfeng was obviously still clumsy with this technique, and he almost crashed into the wall when he flew out of the shop on a sword!","He stopped the sword before the crash and then turned around to chase after Fang Qi.","“Ms. Nalan! Let’s go!” Lan Yan said excitedly, and they flew out of the door on swords almost at the same time.","Shortly, figures flashed out of the shop on swords. These people were fast, and they instantly flew behind Fang Qi.","In the shop, An Huwei’s expression was very dark.","“Forget it, Brother An! Let them have fun.” With a chuckle, Ouyang Zhen patted An Huwei’s shoulder and comforted him.","In the sky above the streets of Jiuhua, many beams of spiritual light quickly flew pass. The cultivators and warriors on the streets looked up at the swords that were flying across the sky!","“What are those?!”","“They are flying on swords?!”","“It seems to be... the sword control technique?!”","“Sir! Stop!” Song Qingfeng casted another sword spell and instantly sped up. Then, he screamed as he leaned backward and twirled in the sky, not able to stop the fall until he almost hit the ground.","“Slow down!” Lan Yan waved at him.","“Hahaha! Dumb!” Ye Xiaoye controlled her sword steadily while she flew forward.","“Young Master Song! Do you need help?” Lin Shao and Xu Luo flew at a measured pace since they had learned the lesson from Song Qingfeng and didn’t dare to fly too fast.","Meanwhile, Royal Princess Ji Yu, the disciples of Shengjing Academy, and Xiyi Academy stood outside of the shop and watched the dashes of sword light with envy since they could only control the swords but couldn’t fly yet.","At this moment, the sword beneath Fang Qi’s feet split into dozens of sword shadows that resembled the sword under his feet!","The dozens of swords flew back to the outside of the shop, and the big screens for livestreaming were turned on with a voice saying, “This is the only free sword-flying experience in the shop! Anyone who wants to experience it can get on board now!”","Wang Tai hurried out of the shop and stepped onto a sword.","Alarmed, Nalan Hongwu looked at the swords hovering in the air. “The sword shape looks like...”","People like An Huwei looked at each other and wondered, “Broadswords?”","The crystal swords were lofty and elegant while the broadswords were low-profiled and luxurious!","“Ugh...” Wang Tai scratched his head. “It looks like the broadsword that Qi asked me to add sockets on using the reward from one of my requests...”","“It has runes! Four sockets! The runewords seem to mean... Spirit?!”","“Plus two levels to all skills!” Su Tianji gritted her teeth with envy. “No wonder this kid’s sword control technique improved so much! I’ll catch up with this kid and borrow it for our Liuyun Daoist Palace to study!”","“I’ll go as well!” An Huwei flew out on a sword.","“Me too!” Nalan Hongwu flew out directly!","At this moment, the big screens were still broadcasting, “The express to Mount Haruna will be taking off in half a minute. Please get on board now!”","[TL Note: Mount Haruna is famous for Initial D. Haruna appears under the name Akina, and Akina pass, as referred to by the characters, is actually Jomo-Sanzan Panorama Highway according to Google Maps.]","“Where’s Mount Haruna?” The people who wanted to try flying on swords such as Ji Yu, the Second Prince, and the others all stepped onto the swords in bafflement.","“Ahh!” Then, they screamed as the swords traveled at high speed!","The guards and pedestrians at the city gate gaped at the sword shadows that were shooting out of the city and into the blue sky!","Some cultivators who were stepping off a spiritual boat at the Jiuhua Harbor looked up at the sky. “Can people fly like this?”","Some guards at the city gates exclaimed, “So many people are flying on swords... It’s spectacular!”","“How much money have you saved? When we have enough money, we’ll go and learn it too!”","Above the clouds, Fang Qi slowed down intentionally for others to catch up.","Standing on the front of the sword, the air currents fluttered his clothes and hair and blew them back.","Behind him, almost 100 swords drew long silver lines in the blue sky!","Although some were not proficient yet, they were not afraid of the height since they had flown many times in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy.","“Now, here comes the airflare!” The swords suddenly tilted and the people on the sword including Fang Qi were turned upside-down as they drew an arc in the sky!","“F*ck!”","“Ahh!”","“Ahhhhh!”"]},{"number":228,"title":"Chapter 228 - Mr. Fang might take a robbers’ boat","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Seagulls groan before the tempest, – groan, and race above the sea, and on its bottom they are ready to hide their fear of the storm.”","“Like a blue flame, flocks of clouds blaze up above the sea’s abyss. The sea catches bolts of lightning drowning them beneath its waters. Just like serpents made of fire, they weave in the water, fading, the reflections of this lightning.”","[TL Note: This is from The Song of the Stormy Petrel, and it is a short piece of revolutionary literature written by the Russian writer Maxim Gorky in 1901.]","These words could be used to describe the sight before them.","“The lousy weather. Today isn’t a good day for travel...” A short young man with wind-blown, messy hair stood on the edge of a middle-sized spiritual boat and looked out of the boat with squinted eyes.","Everyone could see the melancholy on his face.","“It was clear yesterday, and now we have such a lousy day!” A bluish-grey-robed young man who was taller and more muscular than most people stood beside the short young man, appearing to be quite ordinary.","“Erm?” The short young man asked curiously, “Mr. Fang, yesterday’s weather was the same as today, no?”","“Anyway, the boat’s owner is nice. The tickets are cheap for such a spiritual boat...” The young man murmured to himself.","This Mr. Fang was the only person that he knew on the spiritual boat since they were both ordinary guys from small and remote places who were going to a big city where cultivators lived.","Of course, the ordinary people who could travel on a spiritual boat must have some cultivation strength. Take this short young man, Zou Mo, for example. He was found to have the talent to become a cultivator in a test, and his uncle who had some savings sent him on this spiritual boat to study in the distant Morning Star Sea Realm, where cultivators gathered.","“Yeah...” Fang Qi looked at the dark sky and answered casually. Of course, yesterday’s weather had been different.","Yesterday, he had been dashing in the sky and competing with his friends to see who was better at flying, and he was teleported to this damn place after he said farewell to his friends.","“By the way, it’s said that the number of cultivators in the so-called Morning Star Sea Realm is as many as ants. Is it really so prosperous?” After yesterday’s happy outing, Fang Qi was randomly teleported to a small country with few cultivators and warriors.","If he opened a shop there, only people who were close to the level of rulers of the country could afford to play in his shop if he didn’t lower the price. Therefore, he asked around and got on board a docking spiritual boat, leaving the small country.","This boat was cheap and convenient, and he would be a moron not to take it.","“Hush!” Hearing Fang Qi’s words, Zou Mo looked scared. After looking around and seeing that no one was nearby, he said in a fearful voice, “We would be killed if the powerful cultivators heard what you said!”","“By the way.” Indifferent, Fang Qi pointed forward and asked, “Isn’t the city that we are going to in the east? Aren’t we going in the wrong direction?”","“Are we?!” Zou Mo looked forward and scratched his head, saying helplessly, “Mr. Fang, you don’t know the way...”","“You’re right.” Fang Qi walked toward the cabin. “I’ll go and rest.”","“Pooh!” At this moment, a big guy wearing a short coat walked out from the cabin, and he glared at Fang Qi with his eyes that had knife scars on them when he saw Fang Qi’s glance. “What are you looking at! I’ll dig out your eyes if you do it again!”","Fang Qi frowned and thought, This guy is in the room next to me?","...","In the artifact-making room of Wuwei Daoist Alliance.","“Look at this thing.” With the white wolf helmet in his hand, Jun Yangzi was explaining the result of their research. “I wonder what you think of when you see this thing with a charged skill. What I think of is something that most of you have heard about— Jade Rune Notes.”","“The ordinary rune notes that have rune symbols on them can only cast one spiritual spell, and they would burn and disappear automatically,” Jun Yangzi said, “However, jade rune notes can store multiple spiritual spells. Can the techniques used for making jade rune notes be used on items?”","He pointed at the wolf helmet in his hand and said, “This is what we must learn from the technique contained in this thing; it is more advanced. After we gain a total understanding of it, our rune symbols might be able to be placed on the weapons and robes instead of being contained in materials such as jade and leather. They will be easier to use and carry around!”","“The only thing that’s hard to engrave now is the properties that increase skill levels,” Jun Yangzi said, “For example, the wolf helmet has a suffix of ‘nature’ to add a level to elemental skills, but we Wuwei Daoist Alliance doesn’t have the necessary materials for making this engraving.”","“I’m confident that I can copy it if we find the substitute materials, but it will take us a long time to expand on this technique and turn the spiritual spells of all major factions into affixes and magic properties!”","“Brother Jun Yangzi!” Duan Buyi from the Liuyun Daoist Palace said, “It’s enough for now! In my opinion, we must first solve the issue of incompatibility between magic affixes and our spiritual artifacts. If we solve this problem, we can add magic properties with suffixes on each of our spiritual artifacts even if we can’t put the prefixes now! This is the top priority for now!”","...","According to the local tales and legends, whenever the night came to the Morning Star Sea Realm, and the ocean wind brought veil-like mists over, the chaotic and orderless Mist City, which had survived the ancient war, would appear.","Many things that couldn’t exist in the outside world hid there.","Lying on the bed, Fang Qi played with the communication jade in boredom, and he found that in this place, the communication jade had no signal.","“Where is this place anyway? Just where did the System teleport me to?” Bored, Fang Qi looked out of the translucent window at the darkening sky.","He watched the scattered stars that were slowly appearing in the distant sky, and a trace of veil-like night fog floated outside of the window.","“The mist came up?” Fang Qi stood up from the bed.","“This boat isn’t going to Black Dragon City! I want to get off the boat!” Fang Qi heard a yell from the next room and then violent colliding noises.","“What’s that?” Fang Qi put on his boots and got off his bed. Before he walked out, he saw a streak of blood flowing in from beneath the door.","He opened the door and saw that the big guy who was wearing a short coat was being dragged out. A cultivator who had a death-like pale face glanced at Fang Qi. “If you don’t want to be like him, I advise you to return to your room.”","The atmosphere was weird and strange.","Fang Qi was at a loss for words.","“What do you want?” Seeing that Fang Qi didn’t move, the cultivator turned to look at him.","Fang Qi asked, “No, I just want to ask one question. What is the destination of this spiritual boat.”","“Half City,” one cultivator answered impatiently.","“What city?” Not interested in the name, Fang Qi asked, “Are there many people in the city? Is the living standard there high or low?”","The white-faced cultivator was stunned by his question."]},{"number":229,"title":"Chapter 229 - I’m Not Trying to Target Anyone","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Mr. Fang! The fog is rising! That’s strange!” Zou Mo walked into the cabin and saw Fang Qi and the corpse that the white-faced cultivator was dragging.","He shivered slightly!","“He’s... dead?!”","The white-faced cultivator carefully observed them and left with the body.","“Mr. Fa... Fang...” Shaking, Zou Mo walked up and looked at the blood on the floor. “What... What happened?!”","“I don’t know,” Fang Qi said, “I heard someone in the room next to mine yell ‘this boat isn’t going to Black Dragon City! I want to get off!’ When I opened the door, I saw the sight that you just saw.”","“What?!” Zou Mo looked at Fang Qi in confusion.","Fang Qi chuckled, “Just kidding. Do you know a place called Half City?”","“Half City?” Zou Mo looked at Fang Qi in bafflement, and he shivered subconsciously in alarm. “Why are you asking about that place?”","Understanding suddenly dawned on him. “Do... Do you mean the destination of this spiritual boat is Half City?!”","“Mr. Fang... We...” Hearing the name of this place, he stuttered and said, “We must run...”","“Someone else shared your thought.” Fang Qi pointed at the direction of the blood trail and replied, “His body is cold now.”","Zou Mo: “...”","Fang Qi asked, “Tell me about this Half City.”","“Half City...” Zou Mo tried to describe it with his limited vocabulary. “In fact, I don’t know much about it. I only heard that it’s a mysterious and terrifying place where many evil cultivators and bandits hide. It is the cradle of evil and crimes!”","“It’s said that they could even auction kings, emperors, and aristocrats there causally, and the monsters feeding on blood walk freely in that place.”","“It sounds like a tale used to scare the kids who don’t want to sleep...” Fang Qi rubbed his chin with a dark expression. “But it sounds like there are many rich people there. It must be richer than Black Dragon City that is said to have many cultivators, right?”","Zou Mo didn’t know how to respond.","“Then, we’ll go to Half City.”","Sweating all over, Zou Mo said, “It’s said that the city is full of evil monsters! No wonder that guy killed people like killing a chicken... He comes from that place!”","“The cultivators always kill each other.” Fang Qi waved his hands.","Zou Mo’s legs turned to jelly and he asked, “Mr. Fang, aren’t you afraid?”","“Afraid?” Fang Qi looked at this young man who was one head shorter than him and said, “I’m only afraid that they are poor.”","“Okay. Let’s return to the rooms and have a good sleep. Tomorrow, we’ll reach the new city with high spirits.” Fang Qi stretched. This city sounded to be rich, very rich! That lifted his mood that had been low since he began this long journey.","“Ugh...”","...","Where is Boss now? He isn’t doing a livestream today. In the shop, Jiang Xiaoyue ate a bowl of instant noodles and thought, He must have gone out to have fun!","Xiao Yulv walked into the shop and looked around. “Where’s the shop owner? There’s no livestream today? Isn’t he going to finish playing Diablo?”","“Boss is out on a long trip.” Jiang Xiaoyue glanced at him. “Don’t you know that?”","“A long trip?! When will he return?!” Xiao Yulv raised his voice. His favorite activity each day was watching the shop owner play games since no one could play as well as him with so few mistakes! Out of all the players here, Fang Qi’s gameplay was the most fun to watch.","“I don’t know.” Jiang Xiaoyue rolled her eyes. “You seem more eager for his return than me!”","“Ugh...” Xiao Yulv froze, and then he cleared his throat and said with an earnest expression, “I’m not eager for his return! I wish that he would never come back!”","Jiang Xiaoyue finished her noodles and patted her belly. “It’s so delicious!”","Then, she looked around and found that the peak hours had passed since all the people had finished eating instant noodles and were now playing. She immediately walked from the counter and skipped to a seat before opening the Legend of the Sword and Fairy!","“Hey! How come you can play games?!” Xiao Yulv was baffled.","Then, he said in excitement, “Well! I know everything about the plot in this game and the hidden treasures! You can’t imagine what I know! I’ll tell you how to finish the game and get the ending in which Yueru lives!”","Xiao Yulv walked over eagerly.","...","“Get off board! Get off!”","“I’m dead! I’m dead!” Hearing the shouts, Zou Mo shivered in his room. “I shouldn’t have taken this spiritual boat because of the cheap fare... I’m dead!”","Knock! Knock! Knock!","“I say, Little Mo, are you going or not?”","“Go?” Zou Mo shrunk into a ball and shivered with extreme fear in his room. “Where are we going?! Will they kill us?”","“How would I know? The boat docked. Are you going? If you aren’t going, I’ll just go.” Fang Qi opened the door and looked at Zou Mo who was hiding in the corner.","“Docked?” Zou Mo stood up slowly with gritted teeth. “The worse case is that I will die. F*ck it!”","Almost all cities prohibited spiritual boats from flying across them, and this spiritual boat docked outside of the city gate as usual.","However, when Fang Qi saw some huge spiritual boats floating in the sky above the city, he knew that this city didn’t prohibit flying. This city was huge, but close to half of the city was in ruins; it was quite a strange sight.","The other half was filled with high buildings with various styles. The tall ones had dozens to 100 floors while the short ones had one to two stories like the residential houses in Jiuhua City.","However, even the low residential houses were not crude; almost all of them emitted faint spiritual essence fluctuations, and the walls were as white as new.","At first glance, even Fang Qi hadn’t seen such a weird city before.","The people walking on the streets were cultivators in all kinds of attires, and there were almost no warriors among them.","There were altogether a little over ten people getting off the boat, and they walked after the white-faced cultivator and the spiritual boat’s owner, a thin cultivator with a mouse-whisker-like mustache.","Fang Qi followed them into the city and twisted and turned while walking down about eight streets.","He looked around and found that the streets were clean and orderly.","Of course, if he didn’t see several cultivators robbing someone in a dark alley, his impression wouldn’t have changed.","“Sell the talented ones as medicine boys and use the talentless ones to make elixirs.”","“We can make a big profit this time... The guy wearing the greyish-blue robe seems to have some cultivation strength, and the short one has some talent...”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark while he listened to them talk about him as if he were pounds of pork. I can’t take it anymore...","With this thought, Fang Qi walked up to them and said, “Guys.”","All of them looked at Fang Qi who suddenly walked up to them.","“I appreciate that you took me here, but I have to say this. I’m not trying to target anyone; all of you are trash,” Fang Qi said politely.","All of them looked at Fang Qi in astonishment.","They froze for a while and then laughed loudly.","They looked at him as if he were a moron who had no life experience outside of his home."]},{"number":230,"title":"Chapter 230 - I’m Still New, and I’ll Get Better at This","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hey! Kid, do you understand the situation?” A big cultivator behind the white-faced cultivator walked up and picked Zou Mo up by his head with one hand.","Then, he threw Zou Mo forward like a bag of garbage, and the latter crashed into a wall forcefully. The violent collision made him spit out a mouthful of blood!","The big cultivator walked up with a vicious smile. “Kid, don’t think that just because you are powerful in your small country means you can act like a hero in front of us! I can tell you that Master Warriors, Grandmaster Warriors, and even Ancestral Warriors are nothing to me!”","“What did you just say?” The big cultivator picked his ear and asked, “Can you repeat it?”","“Hehehehe! Okay! Okay! Don’t scare him out of his wits!” The thin cultivator with the mouse-whisker-like mustache snickered strangely. If Fang Qi had snickered like this when he was on Earth, he would have been beaten several times a day. “Give him a hard lesson so that he knows the rules of this place. But don’t hurt him, or we won’t be able to get a good price for him!”","The big cultivators said with dampened enthusiasm, “Got it!”","At this moment, they saw Fang Qi’s presence beginning to grow from Master Warrior Realm to Grandmaster Warrior Realm and didn’t stop until he reached the Ancestral Warrior Realm!","“An Ancestral Warrior?! Such a young Ancestral Warrior?!” All of them had light in their eyes.","Then, they laughed hysterically!","“We will be rich this time! This kid will sell for a big price!” The thin cultivator with the mouse-whisker-like mustache exclaimed with widened eyes, “Such a young Ancestral Warrior must be a genius rarely seen in the past 1,000 years! His bones will sell for a sky-high price!”","The big cultivator’s eyes lit up as well, and he said with a wicked smile, “I’ve told you that Ancestral Warriors are nothing to me. Still, you dare to show your true cultivation strength; I don’t know if you are bold or just stupid!”","“However, I’ll need some time to deal with an Ancestral Warrior.” Then, his voice turned deep and gloomy, his body expanded, and his skin turned coarse. Tiny scales grew from his skin, and fangs grew out of his mouth!","He looked like a huge monster!","It was said that some cultivators with poor talent used the evil method of swallowing monsters’ flesh and blood to increase their cultivation strength. It was an effective method but with great side effects.","For example, when they unleashed their full strength, they couldn’t maintain their human form; instead, their bodies would deform and turn into that of a half human and half monster!","“Do you think that you can get away from us, little Ancestral Warrior?”","“Sorry, I don’t have time to waste on you.” Many sword energies suddenly appeared behind Fang Qi.","The sword energies almost covered half of the sky!","All the people gaped at this horrifying sight, and the huge group of sword energies blocking the sunlight was like dark clouds in their minds!","Instantly, their mind turned blank!","“People here might have some misunderstanding about warriors,” Fang Qi said, “But in my place, the warriors can beat cultivators who are one realm higher!”","“Innumerable Sword Scroll! Go!”","Countless silver sharp blades crashed down like a storm!","The big cultivator who had claimed that Ancestral Warriors were nothing and had turned into his half-human-half-monster form turned to run with horror!","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom!","In the blink of an eye, hundreds of sword energies slashed his flesh and opened many wounds on his body.","Pinned down on the ground by the sword energies, the big cultivator still tried to get up, but the hundreds of sword energies turned the ground into a forest of swords in the next moment.","Instantly, the two leading cultivators retreated dozens of steps while they looked at the sword forest with horror. That big cultivator couldn’t be more dead.","“Do you have any last words?” It seemed like the number of sword energies hovering behind Fang Qi didn’t decrease!","“Arrogant!” The white-faced cultivators said, “Do you think that you are our match just because you could kill this wastrel?”","He picked up a leather bag from his belt and cut one of his fingertips with his fingernail before dripping a drop of essence blood onto the bag. The bag opened, and countless human faces jumped out!","The gloomy sky turned darker as if something were dragging it into the Hell!","Soon, the wicked human faces seemed to disappear!","The white-faced cultivators sneered and said, “These hell spirits were formed by countless resentful ghosts, and they are invisible and formless, which means that they can’t be injured by weapons. I’ll see how you, a warrior, can deal with them!”","At this moment, a violent surge of white lightning flashed around Fang Qi!","Then, shrill screams sounded!","Holy Shock!","The invisible lightning energy around Fang Qi attacked anything that was trying to get close to him!","In this instant, all the invisible spirits showed their forms!","This area was turned into a lightning hell!","“From where I’m from, we warriors kill ghosts and spirits in groups.” Fang Qi said, “Compared with the Gloams in the Worldstone Keep, these things are really lame since they are afraid of lightning...”","The white-faced cultivator: “...”","The thin cultivator with the mouse-whisker-like mustache: “...”","These two Spiritual Spring Realm cultivators began to feel uneasy.","“This kid is weird!”","The white-faced cultivator turned gloomy, and he said, “Let’s go and give up this deal!”","At this moment, the clouds of sword energies in the sky turned into a huge river of swords as they crashed toward them!","Instantly, they cut their tongue tips with their teeth and spat out essence blood, and their hands moved so fast that it looked like they were having a stroke as they cast several spells and escaped at top speed!","The guys beside them who were slower were pierced by the sword energies instantly!","“Faster!”","At the guidance of the sword spell, the countless sword energies condensed into two, but these two sword energies brightened suddenly with greater power!","The swords sped up and chased after the two cultivators, flying as fast as them.","In Half City, the pedestrians saw two bloody figures fleeing at top speed while two sword energies enveloped in white lightning followed them like shadows. In fact, these two sword energies were a bit faster compared to those two figures.","The two fleeing figures shot into a big shop named Red Forest (Hong Lin) Pharmacy!","They looked around the shop and heaved a sigh of relief. “The big boss is here; we’re safe!”","“Puff!”","The two sword energies fell from the sky and pierced their heads, splashing their blood all over the shop!","The customers in the shop stared at the sight dumbfoundedly!","“It’s said that people must be merciless while traveling outside. I wonder if this root-removing method meets this standard.” Fang Qi rubbed his stiff face. “Forget it. I’m still new, and I’ll get better and meet the standard eventually.”","Then, he walked toward the unconscious Zou Mo."]},{"number":231,"title":"Chapter 231 - The New Shop Clerk","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Red Forest Pharmacy was a big elixir shop, and the customers were at least above the Yuan River Realm. Some customers saw the bloody scene upon entering the shop, and the blood almost splashed onto their shoes, making them retreat several steps subconsciously.","Even the customers inside the shop backed away in alarm.","The two sword energies had been condensed by the Innumerable Sword Scroll. After finishing the task, they immediately evaporated as a mass of spiritual essence!","“Who! Who did it?!” Qin Honglin was an old man with a slightly hunched back. He had a celestial look and was wearing a pure white elixir master’s robe and holding a walking cane with a snake head on top.","Of course, he only looked ethereal and genial.","At this moment, he just walked out from the back of the shop. When he saw the sight, his face turned livid!","It had been almost 100 years since he built this Red Forest Pharmacy in Half City. Despite the big and small incidents happening in his shop, no one had ever dared to kill his people in his shop!","They were killed in front of him!","A fierce-looking bald cultivator and a coquettish woman with heavy makeup walked out behind him. “Big Boss, what happened?”","Then, they saw the two corpses in the shop, and they were stunned!","“Who?! Who is so unruly that they dare to belittle our Red Forest Pharmacy this way!” Their faces instantly turned ice-cold!","“Xue Nian! Xu Biao!”","Two red-clothed cultivators immediately walked up respectfully.","“Go and investigate this issue!”","The coquettish woman took Qin Honglin’s arm and said, “Big Boss, you still need a good main ingredient for making the Red Bone Elixir. It seems that someone is sending this ingredient to you!”","“I hope that his cultivation strength won’t disappoint me!”","...","Zou Mo opened his eyes slowly, feeling like the sensation of his internal organs being dislocated had lessened. He looked at the man before him and asked, “Mr. Fang?”","“Here! This way!” Loud footsteps sounded, and it seemed like a group of people was running this way.","“What happened?!”","Although no one intervened in the robbery that Fang Qi had just witnessed, the upheaval he had caused was too big for people not to notice.","At this moment, Fang Qi saw a team of cultivators in various clothes but had the same black tiger symbols on their chests walking up with fierceness on their faces.","“We’re the patrol team of the northern district!” The leader was a big guy with a knife scar on his face, and he yelled in a cold voice, “What happened?!”","“I don’t know.” Fang Qi said innocently. “I’m a small figure. When I walked past here, I saw these guys falling down on the ground.”","“You don’t know?” The big guy with the knife scar studied Fang Qi coldly.","A black-faced cultivator looked at the ordinary-looking Fang Qi and said with a cold sneer, “This small guy couldn’t have done it even if he wanted to.”","“Ugh?! Storage spiritual artifact!” A young cultivator seemed to have found a storage spiritual artifact on the belt of a body, and he yelled in pleasant surprise.","“Where is it? Where?!”","“We’re rich! One more here! These guys have high cultivation strengths!”","“These unconscious guys seem to be ordinary persons!”","“Don’t fight! Show them to me! How many crystals are there?!”","While they scrambled to loot the bodies, they glared at Fang Qi and said, “What are you looking at? You guys should get out of here now!”","Fang Qi, “...”","Hu... Are there security forces in this place? Damn it! For Fang Qi, he didn’t mind fighting with ordinary forces, but he didn’t like to get into a fight with the official force. After all, he was here to do business, and he didn’t want to get involved in any unnecessary conflicts.","“Mr. Fang...” Zou Mo felt better and could even walk now as if someone had healed him.","“What happened? Did you see what happened? Mr. Fang?” Zou Mo said apologetically, “Did they do anything to you?”","“I don’t know,” Fang Qi said casually. “I just saw big waves of swords crashing down. Some were killed while some fled.”","“This city is indeed dangerous...” Zou Mo coughed and spat out some blood; it was clear that his body hadn’t completely healed. “We’d better find a way to leave this place.”","“What are you afraid of?” Fang Qi said, “You’ve seen the guards of the city. The incident a moment ago was probably just an accident.”","Zou Mo felt cold sweat oozing out of his forehead when he remembered the so-called patrol team that got busy looting the bodies and kicking them away; he wondered how they could count on those guys for protection.","Fang Qi walked into the depth of the city and said, “I’ve made the decision to buy a shop in the city and do business here!”","“Do you really want to open a shop here?”","“Yeah.” Fang Qi clasped his hands behind his head and said in satisfaction, “Look at the city! There are cultivators and high buildings everywhere! Look at the neat streets paved with smooth stones, organized and vibrant trees, and the flowers in their beds under the trees!”","“Only half of the city has buildings, but this half of the city has trees and flowers everywhere! You can only see the vibrant greenness when you look around!” Fang Qi said, “Don’t you think that this place is much better than that Black Dragon City?”","Fang Qi looked up at the gloomy sky and added, “Everything looks perfect except for the possible wet climate.”","The moment that Fang Qi said those words, a bird that was passing by landed on a tree branch, seeming like it was tired from flying and wanted a rest. Suddenly, the tree branches twisted and formed a prison instantly!","Then, blood flowed down the branches, and the flowers under the tree looked brighter in color.","Zou Mo had just gotten close to the flowers and wanted to pick one to smell its fragrance. Seeing this, the hair on his body stood on ends, and he retreated several meters instantly!","Fang Qi commented, “I guess this place isn’t good for ordinary people to live.”","“Okay. Little Mo, what’s your plan? Do you want to take a spiritual boat to Black Dragon City?”","“I...” Zou Mo wanted to leave this city desperately, but he didn’t have enough crystals.","He lowered his head and said, “I will stay.”","“Mr. Fang, what shop do you want to open?” Zou Mo twisted his fingers and said embarrassedly, “I wonder if I can work in your shop. You’re the only person I know in this place... and I would feel safer in a shop...” He looked at the faint spiritual light flowing around the surrounding houses and said.","Then, he raised his voice and added, “I’ll work hard! All I want is food and shelter!”","When Fang Qi remained silent, he immediately added, “If you think that I’m asking for too much, I can buy my own food!”","“Well, although I don’t have a shop in this place yet, I’ll probably employ someone sooner or later.” Fang Qi rubbed his chin and said, “Okay. I’ll provide you food and a room, but there is probably no salary during the first stage of the business.”","“Thank you, Mr. Fang! Oh, no! Boss!” Zou Mo bowed to him with great gratitude. “Thank you so much!”","Fang Qi said casually, “Now, let’s go and see if we can find a proper place to open my shop.”"]},{"number":232,"title":"Chapter 232 - The Other Side of Half City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It would be a big mistake if one thinks that the outer city represented the whole city. This city also had beast-drawn carriages, but...","Fang Qi looked at the fierce brawny demon beast in front of him. It looked like a huge black dog, and it snorted and opened its mouth, almost swallowing Fang Qi in whole!","“Hey! Friends! Where are you going?” A guy wearing a short-sleeved shirt sat on the top of the carriage and asked with a chuckle.","Fang Qi and Zou Mo stepped onto the carriage. “Please take us to the city center and tell us if there’s a downtown area in the city.”","“First time in Half City?” The guy laughed and said, “You got the right person to answer all your questions!”","“The people outside of the city might have some misunderstandings about this city,” The guy said, “In my opinion, I think this place is much better than the big forces such as countries and empires! It’s quite safe here!”","“Are you serious?” Fang Qi was at a loss for words after what he had gone through a moment ago.","“Hehehe... sometimes, there are some incidents.” The man grinned. “But it is safe most of the time.”","“There are several busy areas in this city, and the slave market in the northern district is one of the busiest ones! Another place is the Liancheng Street in the western district; you can find everything including elixirs, spiritual artifacts, techniques, and relics dug out from the ruins!” The carriage driver said, “The area in the northern district close to the eastern district is also good.”","“However, the most awesome place is the center! It’s said that it’s a place where the real big figures live! In that place, the True Lake Realm cultivators are just ordinary ones!”","“It’s said?” Fang Qi looked at him in surprise. “You’ve never been there before?”","“How can I?” The carriage driver said with a laugh, “The ordinary people must pay 1,000 crystals to enter the inner city without the company of the people living in there! I can’t afford that!”","“1,000?!” Zou Mo clicked his tongue and said, “It’s plain robbery!”","“That’s the case for us,” the carriage driver explained with a grin, “But the inner city of Half City is the true core of the city. It’s said that you can buy anything if you have enough money, including kings, the heads of grandmasters, or even secret techniques that have been lost for thousands of years.”","“Oh!” Zou Mo pointed at the plants on the roadside and asked fearfully, “Are the plants in this city all like this?”","“Plants?’ The carriage driver glanced at the plants by the road and laughed with sudden understanding.","“You mean these things? Don’t worry about them as long as you don’t touch them. They usually prey on small animals and don’t attack people. This is a part of the security measures of the northern district, and you won’t see them in other parts of the city!”","“Ugh? They don’t hurt people?!” Astonished, Zou Mo looked at the horrifying plant which had just eaten a bird.","“Of course!” The carriage driver said, “The Blood Cage Trees in Half City usually don’t hurt people.”","Then, he stopped the carriage on the curb passionately and walked over to touch the twigs and tender leaves of a tree, saying, “Look! They don’t hurt people!”","In the next moment, the tender vines coiled toward him swiftly!","He was instantly wrapped up like a sticky rice dumpling!","“F*ck! Release me! Damn it! Let me go!” He struggled violently.","“Woo!","“Ahh!”","He tried to tear at the vines and twigs desperately.","Fang Qi: “...”","Zou Mo: “...”","The black-dog-like demon beast couldn’t bear it anymore; it turned and broke the vines and twigs with its paw, and the carriage driver finally got out.","“Hu... Hu... I almost forgot that these things will suck your blood when they are hungry... but you usually won’t be killed by them.”","Fang Qi: “...”","Zou Mo: “...”","This guy’s name was Wang Xian, and he resumed driving the carriage with a pale face, as if his essence had been sucked out of him. “Damn it! It almost got me!!”","“Thank you! Or I would’ve lost lots of blood today!” Wang Xian patted the head of the demon beast.","He drove Fang Qi and Zou Mo around the area close to the inner city, and Fang Qi finally got off the carriage in one piece.","It was a street corner, and the white and smooth stone walls were said to be built with the snowflake rocks unique in Half City. The thick snow-white walls looked quite harmonious with the two glass windows.","This place wasn’t too remote, but it also didn’t have a lot of traffic. Fang Qi stopped here because he saw that one of the shops here posted an advertisement for selling the shop.","The reason that Fang Qi didn’t go into the inner city was that the customers who lived in the outer city would have to pay 1,000 crystals to the guards of the inner city before they could go to his shop.","Fang Qi wouldn’t do such a stupid thing.","The shop owner was a white-haired old man wearing a silk coat with round straight collars; he looked quite sharp.","“Sir, you want to sell this place?” Fang Qi asked casually.","The old man glanced at him disinterestedly. “Can you afford it?”","Fang Qi laughed, “I wouldn’t ask if I couldn’t afford it. How about 30,000 crystals?”","“30,000 crystals?!” Zou Mo was startled!","Now, this old man lifted his head and took another look at Fang Qi. “30,000 crystals? You are rich, Young Man. It’s not safe to carry so much money on you.”","“How about 10,000 more? I have some connections with the local forces, and I’ll tell them to take care of you,” the old man said with a chuckle.","Fang Qi shrugged. “What kind of care is worth 10,000 crystals? I only want the shop.”","“It’s not safe here in the city!” the old man said mildly.","Fang Qi frowned. “Senior, you don’t have to worry about it.”","“Well! Suit yourself! The young guys these days are ungrateful.” The old man took out a contract. “I’ll sell it for 28,000 crystals. Pay the money and sign the contract, and the shop is yours.”","Fang Qi took the contract and asked casually, “Senior, this shop is decorated nicely. Why do you want to sell it?”","“I’m old and don’t have the energy to manage the shop. I want to sell it and enjoy the rest of my life.” The old man glanced at Fang Qi and took the crystals, finding that there were 28,000 crystals, no more no less.","Looking at the young man who took out about 30,000 crystals without a blink, the old man was a bit surprised, but he didn’t ask any questions. “I’ll get some people here to pick up a few things and leave the rest to you.”","“Ugh... I don’t need you to leave me anything.” Fang Qi glanced around the shop and found that it was a spiritual artifact shop.","“Okay! Okay!” The old man looked at the strange young man. “This shop is yours.”","Then, he walked out of the shop with light steps.","“Senior Mo, you are getting off work so early today? Don’t you need to keep an eye on the shop?” A melodious female voice sounded, and Fang Qi looked in the direction of the voice and saw a girl in her twenties; she was wearing a red dress.","“I sold the shop, so I don’t need to watch anything anymore.” Senior Mo walked forward with his hands clasped behind his back.","The woman looked surprised.","“Is this senior your friend?” Fang Qi asked curiously.","“Are you new here? Senior Mo looks cold but is actually very nice.”","Nice? Fang Qi looked confused, Nice? This place?","These two things didn’t seem compatible.","“You come from out of the city, so you must have heard of the name Mo Tianxing.”","Zou Mo was alarmed. “The big evil cultivator who killed and sacrificed more than 1,000 cultivators to summon a devil 200 years ago?”","“What do you mean by ‘big evil cultivator’?” The woman in red gave him a hard stare. “Since Senior’s history is no secret in Half City, I’ll tell you about it.”","“200 years ago, the Feng Family of the Morning Star Sea Realm collected more than 1,000 male and female cultivators and planned to summon a big devil with them. Senior Mo found out the secret and destroyed the secret place of the Feng Family, but the latter used their big influence to invert the truth with the help of the other forces, pushing Senior Mo into a corner! He had no choice but to hide in Half City.”","“From the looks of you, I don’t think you are forced into Half City after committing some hideous crimes outside.” She sized them up and added, “Don’t think that everyone outside of Half City is good!”","Fang Qi: “...”"]},{"number":233,"title":"Chapter 233 - The Internet Is Activated! Watching QQ!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Girl, the people outside are not all good, but do you mean that the people here are all good?” Fang Qi asked helplessly as he observed this valiant girl who was dressed neatly in red warrior clothes and black boots.","“This lady... must be a good person...” Zou Mo said shyly.","“What good person!” The girl in red glared at Zou Mo and snorted, “Listen up! I killed more people than I can count, and their bones could fill a room! Someone once offended me, and I cut off his head and kicked it like a ball! You guys, humph! You better be polite in front of me!”","“You... You...” Zou Mo almost cringed and his face turned pale.","“Nice to meet you.” Fang Qi cupped his hands. “I have a nickname ‘Bloody-Handed Human Butcher’ Ning...”","“Sorry, I misspoke.” Fang Qi rubbed his nose and was embarrassed that he almost said the name of a scholar, who’s family name was Ning.","[TL Note: This is referring to a famous Chinese novel Zhui Xu. It is not being translated fast...]","The girl in red’s face twitched a little.","The bold girl in red was named Ruan Ning, and she would be Fang Qi’s neighbor for a long time. She owned a shop that sold materials for making artifacts.","It was heard that most of the residents of Half City were born here, and Ruan Ning was one of them.","This shop that Fang Qi bought had two floors. Together with the warehouse that Senior Mo used to store spiritual artifacts, this place could accommodate 100 computers and had room for more.","When Zou Mo walked out of his bedroom the next morning, he almost couldn’t believe his eyes. “Boss... These...”","“Today is our first day in business, and I’ll write down the rules on the small black board on the counter.” Fang Qi looked at the short young man and patted him on the shoulder.","...","Meanwhile in the main shop, Su Tianji, Nalan Hongwu, Song Qingfeng, Jiang Xiaoyue, and the others all sat on the couches. Nalan Hongwu ate instant noodles and wondered, “What’s that kid doing lately? He’s been out for days and hasn’t sent back a message.”","“Xiaoyue, come and sit with Big Sis!” Happily, Lan Yan held the loli in her arms while they enjoyed the noodles together. “Has your boss disappeared? How come he didn’t send back any messages?”","Lately, Jiang Xiaoyue was very happy. Since Fang Qi left before the weekend, she enjoyed a bowl of instant noodle on the weekend, and she could eat it again today since it was the new week!","“How would I know?” Jiang Xiaoyue pouted and drank the noodle soup and said, “I couldn’t reach him with the communication jade; he is out of the range. I don’t know where he is now!”","“He said that he would find places for a branch, but now he doesn’t even play games!” Su Tianji complained, “I couldn’t even find him in Counter Strike; I checked all the rooms.”","“He doesn’t play Diablo either!” Nalan Hongwu said, “He said that I must pass Nightmare to enter Hell. I’m on the Nightmare difficulty level already!”","...","Meanwhile, in the shop in Half City.","Dumbfounded, Zou Mo read the rules that Fang Qi wrote on the small blackboard.","“Play if you want, but get out otherwise?” Fang Qi used different tones in different cities. In Jiuhua City where things were in good order, he used gentler and milder words and tones.","In this place, he was direct and blunt.","“Boss, aren’t your afraid that people will smash our shop if they read this?” Zou Mo was at a loss for words. Even though he knew that Mr. Fang, who had come to Half City with him, wasn’t an ordinary person...","“Yell if someone tries to smash the shop.”","“Yell what?”","“Just yell that someone is making trouble!” Fang Qi said while stretching and glancing around at the 100 or so bright computers. “I’ll get online now; I’ve been offline for a long time.”","Pointing at the small blackboard which had the following lines [The Legend of Mir 2: 38 crystals for monthly activation, and 10 crystals for weekly activation. 2 crystals per person per hour.] Fang Qi said, “Remember, they must pay in full to play. If they don’t want to pay, tell them to get out and don’t waste your breath on them.”","...","– Jiuhua City –","“Damn! The shop has a new item!” The moment that Lin Shao got online, he saw a logo of a penguin on the screen, and his eyes lit up. “QQ! It’s free!”","[TL Note: QQ is a messaging software made by Tencent, and its logo is a penguin. Its original name is OICQ, inspired by ICQ, a cross-platform instant messaging and VoIP client originally developed by the Israeli company Mirabilis in 1996. QQ is the short hand for OICQ.]","“Free?!” Many people had just finished eating instant noodles and were about to get on computers; they all went behind Lin Shao to watch.","Lin Shao opened QQ and saw that the screen seemed to be scanning something.","“Loading data...”","“Logging in...”","Then, a beginners’ manual appeared. After seeing the manual, people asked, “What is this penguin? We can search and add friends from other cities?”","“Other cities?” They looked at each other and took out their communication jade. “We can use our communication jade for that. What’s the use of this thing?”","“Let’s try it.” At this moment, Song Qingfeng, Su Tianji, and the others all stood behind him to see the new item of the shop.","Lin Shao clicked the options of cities, and two names appeared: Jiuhua City; Morning Star Sea Realm.","There were only two options.","“Morning Star... Sea Realm?!” Lin Shao turned to look at the others in confusion. “What’s this place?”","Su Tianji also looked baffled. “This name sounds weird.”","Ye Songtao said, “I’ve never heard of this place in the South Sea or beyond. Is it in the North Sea or the East Sea?”","Nalan Hongwu said, “I’ve never heard of it before either!”","Immediately, Lin Shao clicked open Morning Star Sea Realm, and there was only one person in there: Mr. Fang.","Lin Shao followed the instructions and added him as a friend.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi was still exploring this new QQ and trying to see if there were some differences from the version that he used before he traveled between worlds. Then, he heard a prompt of aa friend request.","Fang Qi looked and saw that it was Lin Shao.","He clicked [Add].","“Damn! It’s connected!” People were pleasantly surprised.","The new version of QQ had two ways for input, one with keyboard and the other with voice. The latter could only be used with a virtual reality headset","At this moment, Lin Shao said, “Where... are... you...”","Soon, the words ‘where are you?’ appeared in the chat box.","[Morning Star Sea Realm 😁] Fang Qi added an emoji.","“Morning Star Sea Realm?]","“Hey! What’s this round face?”","“It looks silly!” Jiang Xiaoyue pointed at the screen and giggled.","“Ask him where the Morning Star Sea Realm is!” Su Tianji yelled from behind.","“Where... is... Morning... Star... Sea... Realm...” Lin Shao said slowly while he watched the words appearing on the screen.","[You don’t know it?] Fang Qi replied, [Senior Nalan and the others should know it 😅.]","“Boss sent another round face expression!” Jiang Xiaoyue asked, “Can you do it?”","“Let me see...” Lin Shao searched around and soon found the emoji box.","“Hey! Here it is!” Seeing the grinning squinting face emoji, Jiang Xiaoyue clapped her hands and yelled, “Choose this one! This is the silliest one!”","Lin Shao felt cold sweat popping out on his forehead.","Then, he sent Fang Qi the message. [They don’t know that place either 😁😁]","“Master! Master! This round face is so funny!” Fenghua and Yuexin watched from behind with curiosity.","“We’ll get this thing later!” Dong Qingli said.","[Where on earth are you? Even Senior Nalan’s ultimate communication jade can’t reach you!]","[I don’t know.] Fang Qi replied, [I only know that this place is called Half City, and it is in the Morning Star Sea Realm. There are as many cultivators as dogs, and Nascent Souls are all over the place.]","[TL Note: Nascent Soul Realm which is common in cultivation novels doesn’t exist in this world, but this last phrase is common in China after the cultivation novels got popular.]","“Nascent Soul?” All the people froze.","“Oh, it’s a typo.”"]},{"number":234,"title":"Chapter 234 - Build an Online Games Guild","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“According to this kid...” Nalan Hongwu stroked his beard and summarized the information that they got, “He was sent to a place named Half City by the Senior to establish a branch, and there are countless high-level cultivators in that city?”","“But...” Su Tianji asked curiously, “How come we’ve never heard of this place?”","“Maybe...” Xue Daolv had a thought that even amazed himself, “Mr. Fang’s location is beyond the places that we are aware of?!”","“So far?!” Ye Xiaoye clicked her tongue and asked, “How did the shop owner contact us?”","“It must be a powerful method of the Senior!” Ye Songtao said, “It seems that the Senior’s communication method is more advanced than any of the current communication jades!”","“Sir! How is that place? Is it fun?!” Jiang Xiaoyue wanted to know more.","“It’s okay! This place is quite unusual.”","“Sir! Can you put the new shop on the livestream and let us have a look?” Dong Qingli asked.","“I saw from the manual that there’s a video chat option, and we can see each other!” Lin Shao looked around and soon found a camera button.","The System’s version of QQ had two options: real view video chat and virtual reality video chat. Soon, Fang Qi received a prompt. [Lin Shao wants to initiate a video chat. Do you accept?]","These guys... They understood how to use this software so quickly. Surprised, Fang Qi clicked accept and saw a large group of people including Jiang Xiaoyue, Song Qingfeng, Nalan Mingxue, and Su Tianji standing behind Lin Shao.","“It is Boss!” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed while covering her mouth with her hand.","“We can even do this!” Lan Yan pointed at Fang Qi who sat before the computer. “Look! Is that the new shop?”","“The shop seems empty!” Su Tianji pointed at the space behind Fang Qi and said.","“Damn!” Fang Qi looked at the group of people on the screen, and he blushed a little. “So many people are watching!?”","“We want to see if you got kidnapped and disappeared,” Nalan Mingxue said mildly.","“I almost got kidnapped and sold!” Fang Qi said in earnest, “You can’t imagine what kind of danger I was in when I first arrived. I boarded a shady boat and couldn’t get off; fortunately, I’m smart!”","They talked animatedly while Fang Qi told them the things that he had seen, including the incident in which the carriage driver was wrapped up by the twigs of the tree.","“Hahahaha...” Jiang Xiaoyue laughed so hard that she almost fell to the ground. She hammered the desk with her small fist and said, “How can anyone be so stupid!”","“Are the people in this city really so interesting?” Dong Qingli was also amused.","At this moment, Fang Qi heard Zou Mo yelling, “Boss! Someone is here to collect the monthly fee!”","“Monthly fee?” Fang Qi frowned. “What’s that?”","“You guys enjoy the games! I’ll talk to you guys later!” Fang Qi said as he sent over a waving emoji.","“Sir! Remember to livestream for us when you can!” Dong Qingli reminded him.","“Right! Right! I want to see the new city!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked eager.","...","Liu San was the ‘grand cultivator’ on this street, but he didn’t dare to enter some of the shops on the street to collect money, and the previous shop, which Fang Qi had bought, was one of them.","However, he heard that Mo Tianxing had sold the shop.","“Senior Liu! This shop’s name sounds grand!” Standing by Liu San’s side was a young cultivator who was wearing a short coat and had freckles on his face.","“The prices are not low. It seems that this shop sells good stuff.” Liu San snickered and walked into the shop. “Who’s the owner of the shop?”","“I am.” Fang Qi stood up from his seat and walked over.","Liu San glanced at the prices on the small blackboard and asked, “Kid, are you new here?”","“What is it?”","“Do you know Red Forest Pharmacy?” Liu San said proudly, “I’m Xu Biao’s subordinate. According to the income of your shop, we’ll ensure your safety in the city for 3,000 crystals per month!”","Fang Qi looked at Zou Mo and found that the latter was also confused.","These people were collecting money and running a protection racket!","Fang Qi chuckled, “Sorry, but we are safe and don’t need protection.”","Liu San smiled wickedly and said, “It’s... not safe in this city. Are you sure that you don’t need our protection?”","“Not safe?” Fang Qi frowned since it was the second time that he had heard these words; he heard them the first time from Mo Tianxing.","He shrugged and said, “I feel very safe.”","“Senior Liu, this kid wants to do it the hard way! Let me...” The young man with freckles was incensed, but he was stopped by Liu San who said, “Peace brings money, don’t you know?”","Liu San said with a fake smile, “If you come to us for protection later, the price will be higher!”","“Oh, really?”","“We’ll wait and see,” Liu San snickered and left.","Fang Qi watched the two of them leave, and he was at a loss for words.","At this moment, Ruan Ning came over from the neighboring artifact material shop and said curiously after glancing around Fang Qi’s shop. “Why did they leave in a hurry after coming in?”","“They came to collect the monthly fee, and Boss didn’t give it to them, so...” Zou Mo said uneasily.","“So, you drove them away?” Ruan Ning, the girl in red, looked gloomy. “Don’t you know that you’re new here, and you’ll be in trouble if you offend them?!”","“There will be no trouble; they just need a beating,” Fang Qi said casually. Besides, he didn’t have that much money. He had asked Wang Xian, the carriage diver, about the price of the shops in this area and found that they were similar. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have bought this shop.","“Why should I hand my hard-earned money to others?”","Ruan Ning: “You’re so dull and stubborn!”","“If you don’t want to give them money, you can join a force if you two have some unique skills.” Ruan Ning reminded them. “In this city, you can’t live long by yourself. After all, you’re not invincible masters.","“Since you mentioned it.” Fang Qi stroked his chin and nodded, saying, “I feel like I do need a force.”","Ruan Ning was pleased that he listened to her advice, and she said with a nod, “But don’t think that you can save money this way. Unless you can find the headquarters of these forces directly, you must register at the Coiled Dragon Office (Pan Jiao) in the inner city. All the forces including, newly-established forces, must register their names and logos at the Coiled Dragon Office.”","“Oh...” Fang Qi murmured to himself while he thought, Newly-established forces must register in the Coiled Dragon Office?","“Little Mo! Come with me to the Coiled Dragon Office!” Fang Qi yelled.","“Oh! Okay!” The baffled young man answered immediately.","“Finally, you understand the situation!” Ruan Ning watched them walk toward the inner city and heaved a sigh of relief.","When she looked back at Fang Qi’s shop, she was mad. “Hey! You didn’t close the shop’s door! Do you want me to keep an eye on your shop for you?!!!”","However, they were out of her sight.","While they were on the way, Zou Mo asked with a dull expression, “Sir, what force do you planning on joining?”","“Joining?” Fang Qi waved his hand. “Why would we join others? We can establish our own force.”","“Our own force?” Zou Mo was stupefied!","“Yeah...”","In the Coiled Dragon Office, a middle-aged man wearing a luxurious robe looked at the application form Fang Qi handed to him. “Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?!”","All the people looked as if they had seen a ghost.","Of course, they didn’t know that Fang Qi had already prepared the advertisement for recruitment.","[The Dragon-Slaying Treasure Saber will be gifted to anyone who clicks this...]","[TL Note: There are a lot of online browser games in China, and they all use this type of exaggerated advertisement. These advertisements usually appear as banner ads on websites and video ads before video content. The reason why this became a meme is that a lot of famous celebrities would pose for these games since it was easy to do and they get paid well, but the games themselves were quite bad.]"]},{"number":235,"title":"Chapter 235 - With This Name, You Will Get Beat the Moment You Walk Out","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Are you sure you want to use this name?” The middle-aged man who was in charge of registration looked at Fang Qi with twitching lips as if he was a moron. However, he had to make sure he didn’t hear it wrong for the sake of money.","‘Heaven-Defying’ wasn’t hard to understand. Despite its arrogance, it wasn’t very unusual since there were many crazily arrogant people in the city. Likewise, ‘Guild’ sounded like a clan and was also understandable.","However, what the heck was ‘Online Games’?!","More importantly, he was confused by the slogan underneath: Dragon-Slaying Treasure Saber will be gifted to anyone who clicks this?! Ultimate items will drop at every second?!”","What the heck is this?! How can such a weird force recruit people?!","“I’m sure,” Fang Qi said without hesitation.","The middle-aged man didn’t bother to tell Fang Qi anything more since he was only responsible for collecting money. However, looking at the two young guys whose pubic hair probably weren’t fully grown, he thought contemptuously, Heaven-Defying? You can have any name you want if you are not afraid of being beaten when you walk out of the door.","After taking crystals from Fang Qi, the middle-aged man soon took out a token in the shape of a big saber and handed it to Fang Qi, saying, “This is the temporary token, and you can come and get the official one in seven days. Congratulations! The Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild is established!”","His loud voice instantly attracted the attention of the people standing nearby.","“Heaven-Defying?”","“Online Games Guild?”","“What the heck is that?!”","More importantly, these two young men could even afford to enter the inner city and have the funds to establish their own force?!","“Boss! This guy must be rich!” A bald cultivator said to a black-cloaked cultivator who was about to walk out of the door.","“They are strangers here!” Another black-cloaked, gloomy-looking cultivator said, “Shall we...”","“Let’s go.”","...","“Everyone, please look around!” After coming out of the Coiled Dragon Office, Fang Qi was in a good mood, and he turned on the livestream.","On the big screens in the main shop at Jiuhua City, there was a grand building with coiling dragons behind Fang Qi. Before the building was a garden-like courtyard, and it was a magnificent sight.","“Wow! Is this the new city where the branch shop is?” Jiang Xiaoyue had stars in her eyes. “So beautiful! I want to go there too!”","[The weather is a bit gloomy there.] Nalan Mingxue asked in a bullet comment. [Does it rain often?]","“Not very often,” Fang Qi said, “At least it hasn’t rained in the past few days after I came.”","“Oh, I’ll introduce to you the new clerk of the branch shop!” Fang Qi beckoned at the baffled Zou Mo. “Little Mo, come here!”","He pulled Zou Mo over and said, “This is Little Mo, the employee of the branch shop.”","“Boss... Who are you talking to?” Zou Mo was nonplussed.","After Fang Qi explained to him about the livestream and the internet, he was amazed. “Boss, do you mean that our conversations here can be transmitted through spiritual spells to a place which is beyond tens of thousands of kilometers away?!”","Zou Mo asked in pleasant surprise, “Our shop is so awesome?!”","The people before the big screens saw the 15-year-old young man looking sleepy and confused. This young man who was in the growth stage of his life was about 1.6 meters tall and looked quite short standing beside Fang Qi who was a warrior.","“Sir! Your new employee is so short!” Song Qingfeng looked at the young man who was waving at them and said with a grin.","“He’s still growing.” Mr. Fang walked on with the young clerk. “Let’s go to another place! I’ve spent a fortune on the entrance, and it would be a waste if I don’t look around this place!”","“Sir... we didn’t close the shop...” Zou Mo reminded him in a quiet voice.","“Ahh?! F*ck?!” Fang Qi finally realized this, but he wasn’t worried that anyone would mess with his shop. Instead, he was afraid that he would see bodies on the floor when he went back.","“Then, let’s return to the shop.” Fang Qi waved at the friends who were watching the livestream in front of the big screens and said, “Today, I’ll show you the scenery of Half City!","“This is the inner city, and cultivators lower than the True Lake Realm are rarely seen here!” walking on the street paved with white stones, Fang Qi pointed at the rare passing cultivators and explained.","“There are so many cultivators above the True Lake Realm?” An Huwei and the others stared at the screen in astonishment.","“This probably looks more like a city of cultivators than Yujing!” Looking at the pedestrians on the street, Xue Daolv clicked his tongue and commented.","“Look at the demon beasts that are pulling the carriage... They look like...”","“They’re demon dragons!” Su Tianji said, “They are late-stage True Lake Realm demon dragons! And there are two of them!”","“What a waste! They use demon dragons to pull carriages!”","“I didn’t know that there is such a city!” Ye Songtao said thoughtfully, “But it seems very far from us...”","...","Zou Mo’s eyes were not small, but he had the bad habit of squinting his eyes which made him look sleepy even though he wasn’t.","He narrowed his eyes since his eyes felt uncomfortable as the light seemed piercing, and this sensation intensified after he obtained some spiritual essence in his body.","However, his eyesight was very good. “Boss, I feel like I saw something at the corner before us...”","He blinked his eyes and felt like he saw something turning into the ally.","“What is it?” Fang Qi glanced ahead. He remembered that he had been at this place before, and it was a bit remote. The corner ahead of them was even more remote, and few people came here.","[Sir! There are people behind you! At the crossing you just passed.] At this moment, the sharp-eyed audience had sensed that something was wrong through watching the livestream.","“What people?” Fang Qi looked around.","“It seems that we’re discovered?”","“We’ll do it here!”","In the rustlings, a bald cultivator walked out boldly with a cultivator with freckles.","Then, two more figures appeared from the alley in front of Fang Qi. One of them was a thin cultivator who looked like a monkey, and the other was a brawny middle-aged cultivator in a red robe.","“Little Guy, you seem very rich.”","“Heaven-Defying Guild? You guys are arrogant!”","“You just wasted thousands of crystals. You should have handed them to us!” The thin cultivator cussed with hatred as if Fang Qi had spent his money.","“You have more money than you can spend?!” The bald cultivator walked up and punched his fist onto the wall beside Fang Qi while saying with a cold smile, “Very good! Why don’t you loan us some money then?”","Meanwhile, the people watching the livestream gaped at the sight.","“F*ck! They want to beat the shop owner!”","“Not beating! This is a robbery!”","“They dare to rob people in the city?!”","“He is being robbed while livestreaming?!”","“Can he defeat them? Didn’t he say that the people there have great cultivation strengths?”","“F*ck! Little Mo will get beat!” Screams sounded in front of the big screens. “The shop owner will probably get beat as well!”","“Can you help him?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked weakly.","“How can we?” Su Tianji’s face turned livid. “We don’t even know how far away that place is from here!”","They mentioned something like the Heaven-Defying Guild... What is that? Is that why they are angry? They looked at each other in confusion."]},{"number":236,"title":"Chapter 236 - Establish Dominance Casually","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Boss... shall I go and get the city patrol team...” Zou Mo looked alarmed when these people came up and surrounded them. “I remember that a team of city guards who are all cultivator just passed this crossing!”","“Anyone! Help us!” Zou Mo yelled immediately.","Those four people who were surrounding Fang Qi and Zou Mo paused and looked at them while sneering. “Are you new in the city?”","The team of city guards came back and saw the situation here. They asked, “What’s happening?”","“Black Demon is doing business!” a cloaked man walked up from the side and said in a deep voice.","“Oh,” the city guards said, “Please continue.”","Then, they turned around and left.","“Hey!” Zou Mo was stupefied. “Don’t go! Hey!”","“What’s wrong with this city?!” The people watching the livestream almost spat out blood on the big screens.","The smile on the face of the bald cultivator turned colder. “Go on. Keep yelling if you can!”","Fang Qi glanced at the black-clothed cultivators who were leaving and asked, “Are you sure that they won’t come back?’","“What else do you think?”","“Do it,” The man wearing the black cloak said from behind them, “You don’t need to show mercy to them.”","On the other side, Zou Mo was surrounded by the other two cultivators!","Will I be killed? Zou Mo felt desperate. I shouldn’t have stayed in this city...","“Kid, did you hear that?” The bald cultivator lifted his fist and said with a sneer, “It’s no use begging for our forgiveness because I just want to beat you!”","Then, he punched out his fist full of spiritual essence!","Before he could finish his sentence, he heard a whooshing sound!","A sword pierced his hand and pinned him to the wall.","Then, two, three, four, and many more swords flew out. They were so fast that they caught the Spirit River Realm cultivators off guard and pinned them to the wall before they could react!","“The shop owner’s Innumerable Sword Scroll has reached this stage?!”","“He can control the sword energies at will, and he instantly handled four enemies!”","“This kid is awesome!”","The people watching the livestream exclaimed in surprise.","Then, the sword energies condensed and turned into a broad sword with four weird words engraved on it as it hovered in the air beside Fang Qi.","“Bo...Boss!” Seeing this scene, Zou Mo was astonished. Boss is so strong?!","“I’m Li Huangquan of Black Demon. I apologize to you.” The guy wearing the black cloak seemed to be apologizing to Fang Qi after he saw that Fang Qi wasn’t as weak as they had thought.","However, no one saw the murderous spirit in his eyes since he lowered his head.","At this moment, Zou Mo rubbed his eyes and saw a streak of sneaky black mists sinking into the ground from that man’s feet.","“Boss! Be careful of the ground!”","“Ugh!” A circle of lightning bolts rose from Fang Qi’s feet.","Holy Shock!","Meanwhile, a cloud of faint black mists rose from the ground as well.","The cloud of black mists seemed to shrink when it touched the lightning energy, and Fang Qi leaped up!","“Okay. That’s all for today’s livestream.” Fang Qi turned off the livestream while stepping on the sword.","“Hey! The shop owner turned off the livestream?!”","“The fight isn’t over yet!”","“Protest!”","The people complained in front of the big screen.","“Sneak attack?”","Fang Qi lit a cigarette for himself and raised one finger. “I’ll leave one of you alive to bring a message back to Black Demon. Just tell them that they are welcome to make trouble for our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","He glanced at them and asked, “Who wants to do it?”","“Arrogant!” The man wearing the black cloak sneered, “Do you think that you can stop me?!”","He was about to turn into a dash of light and flee when a curtain of sword energies blocked him.","Looking down from the sky, the many sword energies formed a Tai Chi pattern that was big enough to cover this area.","Fang Qi sucked on the cigarette and blew out the mist-like smoke from his mouth. “What did you say?”","“I... I’ll go back and bring the message!” Cold sweat slid down this man’s forehead. Although he didn’t understand what was in front of him, he knew that all his escape paths were sealed when the curtain of sword energies appeared!","There was no escape!","What the heck is that thing?!","Who is this guy?! He looks to be in his twenties; how can he be so powerful?!","It is horrible!","“You?” Fang Qi said, “Okay, you then.”","The sword array was activated, and many swords flew toward him in mysterious routes!","With a shrill scream, blood splashed out.","“I’ll leave the bald guy to bring the message.” Fang Qi glanced at the men who were pinned on the wall.","“Bo...Boss...” On their way back to the shop, Zou Mo was still panic-stricken. “Didn’t you say that you would let the black-cloaked guy go?”","Fang Qi threw the cigarette butt onto the ground and extinguished it with his shoe. “I wouldn’t have lit the cigarette if I wanted to spare him. We shouldn’t let that sneaky guy live.”","“By the way...” Fang Qi patted Zou Mo’s head and said, “You have good eyes.”","...","In front of the shop, Ruan Ning looked at Fang Qi and Zou Mo, who walked back briskly. “You’re back.”","Pointing at the shop, she said in displeasure, “You even forgot to close the door when you were out. Fortunately, you had me to keep an eye on it. Otherwise, you would have lost everything! Oh, what force did you guys join?”","Fang Qi took out the logo in the shape of the Dragon-slaying Saber and said, “Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild!”","“What guild?!” Ruan Ning’s eyes almost popped out!","Fang Qi hung the token at the door. “Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","“The name is so weird! I haven’t heard of it before!” Ruan Ning asked, “Are you sure that you were not tricked?! You joined a small force that I’ve never heard of before...”","On the side, Zou Mo said awkwardly, “Sister Ruan... it’s a force that Boss established himself...”","“He established it himself?!” Ruan Ning’s jaw almost dropped to the ground.","I told you to join a force to protect yourself, but you established a force yourself?!","Are you stupid?!","“Don’t act so surprised.” Fang Qi sat in his shop. “I also killed some people from the so-called Black Demon to establish my dominance. They dared to try to rob me and sneak-attacked me! They were tired of living!”","“WHAT?!” If her eyes could eat people, Ruan Ning would have swallowed Fang Qi whole. “How bold are you? You even dare to kill people of Black Demon?!”","Zou Mo reported the whole incident. “Boss even let one of them go to bring back the message that they are welcome to make trouble for our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.”","“Hey... Is Black Demon very powerful?”","“You’re finished!” Ruan Ning felt desperate. “From now on, I don’t know you! Goodbye!”","“Even if you know me, I won’t give you discounts when you come and play games in my shop,” Fang Qi yelled out the door.","Ruan Ning stumbled and almost fell. “Who dares to play games in your shop?! No one came before, and now...”","“Sir, what does your shop do?” Before she could finish, about four cultivators walked over and looked at the shop curiously while asking in a thick accent. “It looks weird.”","Ruan Ning closed her mouth immediately. Despite her frustration, she didn’t want to spoil Fang Qi’s business.","She guessed that only dumb outsiders dared to enter this shop!"]},{"number":237,"title":"Chapter 237 - You Dare to Take My Rake Cat! You Are Seeking Death!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! What does your shop do?” The cultivator who asked the question was a businessman named Huang Shan. As a man who could do business in this place, he had contacts in both the virtuous and the criminous worlds.","Of course, this world had no hard distinction between the virtuous and the criminous forces.","The grey-clothed old Daoist by his side was called Iron Rock Daoist, a guardian of the Huang Family. The middle-aged man who was wearing black clothes and had his hair tied in braids was also a guardian of Huang Shi’s Family; his name was Zha Gu, and his appearance was a little exotic.","As a shrewd businessman, Huang Shan had an eye for unique things. When he saw the unusual things in Fang Qi’s shop, he walked in curiously.","Besides, he wasn’t a local and thus wasn’t familiar with the complicated and constantly changing forces in Half City. Since he saw the token from the Coiled Dragon Office on the door, he was reassured, and he wanted to have a try with this shop; he didn’t think that much.","Fang Qi pointed at the Legend of Mir 2 on the blackboard and said, “If you want to play the game, you have to pay money first, and I’ll tell you what to do next.”","Zha Gu’s dark face turned even more black, and he said with a stiff accent, “How can there be such a thing? What if I don’t think this thing is worthy the money after I try?”","Fang Qi knocked on the six words on the small blackboard. [Play if you want, but get out otherwise.]","“You...” The foreign-looking middle-aged man’s face fell.","“Guardian Zha Gu!” For a businessman like Huang Shan, a dozen or so crystals were not a big amount, and he wouldn’t feel a thing if he lost them. Besides, there were many weird things in Half City, and he wouldn’t understand them if he didn’t try them personally.","Therefore, he handed Fang Qi the required crystals. “Then, I’ll try it!”","“Someone did pay to try it...” Ruan Ning walked over when she saw that people walked into Fang Qi’s shop, and she was surprised that someone was willing to try the game.","In fact, she was curious about the stuff in Fang Qi’s shop and wondered about the high prices and the bad attitude!","Could it be his stuff is so good that he isn’t worried about his business?","Subconsciously, she walked in and watched from behind.","...","Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s QQ was beeping.","Since the people in Jiuhua City couldn’t reach Fang Qi with their communication jades, they had to use this method.","Fortunately, Fang Qi’s QQ was on, and he glanced at it.","[Sir! What’s that new game? That one with the dragon character logo! How come we can’t play it?] It was from Lin Shao.","[Boss! They want to play the new game named the Legend of Mir 2! How do I activate it?] It was from Jiang Xiaoyue.","[Sir! How much is it to activate the Legend of Legend of Mir 2?]","[...]","Hurried, Fang Qi replied to Jiang Xiaoyue, [Xiaoyue, add the price of the Legend of Mir 2 on the small blackboard. I’ll send it to you.]","Jiang Xiaoyue was playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy when she heard the beep sounds.","“The beeping sound is coming from QQ?” Subconsciously, she pulled out QQ’s interface and found that she could use it while she was in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy!","“Wow! This is convenient!”","She immediately replied, [Got it], and ran to the counter, announcing happily, “Good news! The activation method of the new game is here!”","“New game?”","“Activation?”","Many of the customers were playing games. The people who weren’t playing games and the players who had turned on the external communication all heard her and looked over.","Soon, a small group of players in Jiuhua City entered the new game.","...","– Meanwhile in the shop in Half City –","Due to the black technology of the System, the games in Fang Qi’s shop didn’t need accounts, which made things very convenient for him.","Different from the original version of the Legend of Mir 2, there were three round stone platforms in the dark space, and on each platform was a character statue. If the players clicked one, the statue would melt, revealing a character on it.","The professions of Warriors, Wizards, and Taoists didn’t need Fang Qi’s explanation, and everyone including Huang Shan understood them at first glance.","[TL Note: Daoist and Taoist can be used interchangeably].","Quickly, Huang Shan chose his profession: Wizard.","It was a black-robed wizard with a cloud of flames dancing around his hands; he liked this profession at first glance.","Then, he entered the game.","The moment that he put on the virtual reality headset and entered the game, Huang Shan was astonished to find that he had changed into another person in the so-called Legend of Mir 2.","He became an ordinary person wearing crude, cotton-fabric clothes!","Alarmed, he instantly exited the game according to the instructions on the small blackboard. After putting down the virtual reality headset, he checked and found that he was still himself!","He had experienced illusions and arrays, but this thing was way better than all those illusions!","“Amazing!” Huang Shan quickly realized that this shop was extraordinary!","...","Meanwhile in Jiuhua City, a little over ten people began playing the new game.","Guo Xiong was in front of a small primitive village, and he changed into a young warrior who had a wooden sword in his hand. He was looking for monsters at the entrance of the village.","“Old Guo, what’s this game?” Xi Qi and the others had just gotten online. When they saw one of their friends was playing this game, they watched curiously.","“The new game, the Legend of Mir 2,” Guo Xiong said.","“Is it good?”","“I just began,” Guo Xiong said, “I feel it’s similar to Diablo, but the professions are easier to understand. Besides...”","He chased a scarecrow and hacked it to death. “It is easier to obtain growth in cultivation strength. One can increase strength by killing monsters, and you don’t have to wait until you level up.”","“It sounds alright.” Xi Qi and others weren’t interested. “You can try it first, and I’ll play it if you think it is worth it.”","...","– In the Half City Shop –","“I can increase my cultivation strength by killing monsters?! Even the animals such as chicken, ducks, and deer are counted as monsters?!” Huang Shan was even more astonished, and he chased creatures such as chicken, ducks, deer, and scarecrows and hacked them wildly!","The shop gave him lots of surprises, and he thought that there were more surprises for him!","What he had seen by now was already worth the dozens of crystals that he paid! As a shrewd businessman, he believed it was only the beginning; the amazement wouldn’t end here.","While his level increased slowly, he quickly learned the first technique – the Fire Ball Spell!","At this moment, more people began to show up outside of the village.","Huang Shan was fighting devil cats with rakes. These devil cats were obviously more powerful than other creatures in both their movement speed and fierceness of their attacks!","Standing from a distance, he threw fireballs toward the devil cats carefully with his newly learned spell. He felt as if he had returned when he had just learned spells and was facing an opponent for the first time!","He had gained some experience and killed the devil cat. “I gained a lot cultivation strength this time!”","After the death of the devil cat, he had a clear feeling that his cultivation strength increased by a lot!","“I need to kill more of these devil cats!” He was excited about this discovery. But just when he found another devil cat, a figure rushed toward it!","“Someone is trying to take them from me!?” His face fell, realizing the cat represented cultivation strength!","“Someone dares to take my rake cat?! You are seeking death!”","Immediately, he threw a fireball toward that person!"]},{"number":238,"title":"Chapter 238 - Get Weapons and Kill Them","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","This game had no peaceful mode since the players with good control could remove the spiritual spells or stop the attack the moment right before they hit their teammates.","As for the players with poor skills and control, they could only hope that they didn’t cause big troubles.","When Huang Shan began learning spiritual spells, the first one that he learned was the fireball spell.","“I missed it...” At this thought, he used the fireball spell again.","Boom! Boom!","Two fireballs exploded on the back of that warrior. In the virtual reality game, one could see that warrior stumbling, and the clothes on his back were caught on fire!","...","– Meanwhile in Jiuhua City –","Guo Xiong didn’t know if this game was more fun than others, but he had paid for it, so he must practice as hard as he could and gain cultivation strength. After all, he wasn’t a person who could throw money down the drain.","I hope there will be novel stuff later in the game. While he was thinking, he saw a rake cat, and he rushed over to attack it!","Before he could hack the cat, he felt a pain on his back; two fireballs had exploded on his back!","When he turned around, he saw a middle-aged man who was wearing crude cotton clothes. This man had a stick in one hand and a cloud of flames in the other. Right now, the third fireball had been shot out, and it was flying toward Guo Xiong.","“F*ck!” In pain, Guo Xiong cussed and tilted his body to dodge the fireball before rushing toward the attacker!","“Ugh?” Huang Shan was angry that a low-level warrior dared to fight with him, a cultivator!","Although he was still weak as a cultivator, he was fearless since his opponent was only a small warrior; he ran forward while throwing out fireballs.","...","– In the Half City Shop –","The people watching the game from behind Huang Shan also found the uniqueness of the game, but now they felt puzzled by what they saw.","Is this guy another player of the game? Confused, Ruan Ning looked around the shop but didn’t see another player. Where did this guy come from?","Fang Qi glanced at the screen and felt embarrassed when he saw the two newbies with trash items fighting each other with wooden swords.","“This is a player from the other shop,” Fang Qi explained.","“The other shop?” The old, grey-robed Daoist said in surprise, “It seems that you have a big business!”","– While the people were discussing where the other player came from in the Half City Shop –","Guo Xiong was at the disadvantage since he was in a passive situation, and now a rake cat was chasing after him. Both running and fighting seemed like bad options. Soon...","Bam! On the scene, things like the deer meat that he got from the hunt and his wooden sword dropped as he died.","“Hahahaha! You dare to fight with your granddaddy?!” Huang Shan killed the rake cat and then stepped on Guo Xiong’s corpse, saying mockingly, “A weak warrior like you dares to fight with me over a rake cat? You were seeking death!”","Then, he picked up the loot on the ground even though he didn’t know what the chicken meat and deer meat could do. However, he was a businessman and thought that they could be sold for money!","...","– Meanwhile in Jiuhua City –","“F*ck!” Guo Xiong cussed loudly while slamming the desk with his hands.","He was killing monsters and leveling up, minding his own business, but someone threw fireballs at him and even mocked him while standing on his body after he was killed.","It was too much to bear!","Sitting next to him, Xi Qi heard Guo Xiong’s cusses and asked, “Old Guo, what happened?”","“I died and dropped my items!” Guo Xiong cussed in a rage.","“Then, hurry up and go back to pick up your items!” After all, in Diablo, the players could go back and pick up items after being killed.","“No! I was killed by someone!” Guo Xiang said furiously, “That guy picked up my stuff and mocked me as he stood on my corpse!”","“No! I must return the favor! Damn it!”","“This...” Xi Qi and others looked at each other in bafflement, wondering how he could be killed by another player while he was playing the game alone.","They began watching the game from behind Guo Xiong.","In the game, Guo Xiong was about to go out of the city to find his killer, and he realized that he had no weapons. He sold the chicken meat and deer meat in his storage space and bought a wooden sword and two potion bottles before rushing out.","...","– In the Half City Shop –","“Daoist Huang, that weakling is here again!”","“Ugh? Isn’t he dead?!” Huang Shan was surprised, but after thinking for a while he understood that it must be a feature of these spiritual artifacts named computers. He said with a vicious look, “You dare to come again, and I’ll kill you again!”","This time, Guo Xiong was obviously calmer. With no monsters chasing after him, his movements were steady and swift. He stepped aside and dodged his opponent’s fireball and chased after Huang Shan!","Without paying too much attention, Huang Shan created another fireball and took aim!","Swoosh!","Boom!","Fire exploded on Guo Xiong’s shoulder, and he was forced to pause for a moment. Huang Shan continued running while launching fireballs. In the original game, players had to stop to cast spells, but in this remake version, using the fireball spell was a piece of cake for a cultivator like Huang Shan, who had a lot of experience. Since he almost didn’t pause while casting spells, and Guo Xiong had to dodge the attacks, the distance between them was still great!","When Guo Xiong finally rushed before Huang Shan, he drank a bottle of potion, but his HP still went to zero!","Boom!","He died again and dropped some items.","With a small part of HP left, Huang Shan said contemptuously, “Garbage! You can’t kill your granddaddy!”","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","Xi Qi and the others who had been watching from behind gaped at the sight. People can play like this?!","“F*ck!” Guo Xiong was infuriated instantly.","“Do you want help, Old Guo?”","“Come! All of you! Kill this guy!” Guo Xiong exploded with rage.","“Go! Let’s activate the game!” Xi Qi and his sister Xi Xiaoyun immediately activated the game.","– One hour later –","“F*ck!” Covered in blood, Huang Shan had wounds all over his body. He ran desperately with a small wooden sword while three warriors chased after him.","“Two guardians! Come and help me!” he yelled while running.","The two guys had been tempted when they heard that the game could increase their strengths. Hearing Huang Shan’s call for help, they were eager to enter the fray. “Coming! Coming! Sir! Activate the game for us!”","“Ahhh!” Before they entered the game, Huang Shan was killed, and his items dropped.","“Garbage! Do you dare to kill people again?!” Panting, Guo Xiong stepped onto Huang Shan’s body.","“Damn it!” Huang Shan was enraged instantly. “I was killed by those three damned people!”","He put down the virtual reality headset and almost smashed it on the desk!","He stood up and looked around. “Who killed me?! Do you dare to come out?!”","Then, he saw no one but the people who watched him play.","“You killed him first, and now you’re angry that he killed you back,” Ruan Ning mumbled by his side, “I heard the shop owner say that this shop is new, and the other players must be in the other shop which is very far from here.”","Huang Shan said with a dark expression, “Two guardians! I’ve never been insulted like this before! He dared to cuss me while stepping on my body! You must help me kill him today!”","The other two guys laughed. They were aggressive guys. Now that they were invited to kill, they couldn’t contain themselves anymore. They said with cold smiles, “Don’t worry, Brother Huang! Since you are in trouble, we’ll do our best to help!”","After entering the game, one of them was a level 1 Wizard and one of them was a level 1 Taoist. While wearing crude cotton short jackets, they looked around with fierce expressions and said, “Let’s go! Brother Huang! Where is the guy that you want us to kill?”","Huang Shan almost fainted due to anger. He rubbed his forehead and said, “You... level up first! Level up first!”"]},{"number":239,"title":"Chapter 239 - Suicidal Charge at a Big-Sabered Guard","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Fang Qi lost interest in watching the fight between the newbies. He returned to his own computer and turned on the Legend of Mir 2.","Ruan Ning followed him and asked, “Sir, is this game so powerful that it can increase one’s cultivation strength?”","She had watched the game and knew the value of the game wasn’t that one could kill people and get their items. Rather, it could increase people’s cultivation strengths as mentioned by Huang Shan.","For her, the fights were just additional benefits.","“Yeah,” Fang Qi answered casually, “Didn’t you hear them?”","“Of course, I heard them!” Ruan Ning said with her hands on her waist, “And I heard that the cultivation strength grows really fast in the game!”","“Although I don’t know what it is, I’m surprised that you took it out and let all the people use it in the shop!” Ruan Ning scolded him.","“Are you stupid?! Don’t you know that you can never show your wealth?! How dare you take it out casually?!”","“I understand your points and the principles!” Fang Qi said, “Ms. Ruan, do you want to activate the Legend of Mir 2 and play it?”","Ruan Ning felt like she was going to explode since she couldn’t talk any sense into this guy as if she were playing piano to a cow.","“No! I don’t want to play!” Ruan Ning snorted, “I won’t help you if someone tries to rob you!”","However... Another thought struck her. Since this kid could kill people from Black Demon, he must be quite strong...","“Forget it! It’s not my business, so it’s not my worry!” She went back to her own shop, and then she saw a sneaky figure in her shop. “Hey! You dare to steal things from my shop?! I’ll kill you! Stop!”","...","In the System’s version of the Legend of Mir 2, there were no communication channels such as world channels or map channels. Instead, QQ was the only communication platform, and it allowed people to talk anywhere in the world.","At this moment, Fang Qi opened QQ and saw that Jiang Xiaoyue was still online.","[Xiaoyue, how about playing a fun game with Boss?]","[😁😁...] Seeing a row of grinning squinting face emojis, Fang Qi felt weird.","“What the heck?!”","“Hahaha...” On the other side, Jiang Xiaoyue laughed so hard that she held her belly and couldn’t straighten her back.","[Boss, don’t you think that this emoji is funny? I feel like laughing whenever I see it!]","[Look at my grinning squinting ball! 😁] Fang Qi sent her a funny face and asked. [Are you coming?]","[Which game?] Jiang Xiaoyue asked. [You mean the new game named the Legend of Mir 2? I feel like it’s not very special compared with others.]","[Well, I’ll play it then!] After all, it was a request from her boss.","[Good Xiaoyue. I’ll give you a bonus at the end of the month.] Fang Qi was happy that he recruited a loli so casually.","“Really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue almost jumped up with joy. The Legend of Mir 2 was quite different from Diablo. In Diablo, an individual player could enter the Hell Mode, but many places in the Legend of Mir 2 in the later stages were not accessible unless players went in teams.","Therefore, it was necessary for Fang Qi to pick teammates and establish a guild.","After entering the game, Fang Qi considered for a long while and finally chose the profession of warrior. Although it was average earlier on, it was a good choice in later PVP (player vs, player) battles.","Of course, he didn’t know how many changes the System had done with the new version, and he could only make the choice according to his previous memory.","[Boss, what profession do I choose?] Fang Qi had just created his character when he received a message from Jiang Xiaoyue.","“Choose Taoist.”","“Okay! I also think Taoist is cute!” On Jiang Xiaoyue’s screen, there was a pretty little girl in a white Taoist dress, and she had a bowtie on her head.","[I’ll choose this one!]","Soon, Fang Qi saw a pretty Taoist girl wearing a pale-grey cotton dress in the spawn village.","Fang Qi: “...”","At this moment, more people entered the game, and Fang Qi saw Iron Rock Daoist and Zha Gu, the two guardians of the Huang Family, running out of the village.","“Brother Huang, where are you?”","“I don’t know!” After dying, he respawned into a strange small city. After leaving the city, all that he could see was the desert.","He didn’t know that the players who killed other players would respawn in the Red Name Village! This no-named small city was the Red Name Village in the upgraded version.","[TL Note: In the Legend of Mir 2, the name displayed by players who killed other players were red, so that is why this place is called Red Name Village.]","“Quickly come back! We are very close to level 7!” At this moment, Iron Rock Daoist and Zha Gu yelled in the newbie village as they wandered around.","“Got it! Well, I have to ask for directions first!” Huang Shan was now lost.","“Can you come or not?” Zha Gu was impatient from waiting.","“The guard at the gate has a good saber. Can you loan me your saber?” Zha Gu asked.","The guard ignored him completely.","[TL Note: In the game, the guards are NPCs, and their levels are very high.]","“Hey! You want to do it the hard way?!” Iron Rock Daoist also came up.","“How much is it? I’ll buy it.” He planned to use it to kill people later, but the guard had no interest in talking to two newbies even though he was no different from a real person in this game.","“You want to do it the hard way!” Zha Gu launched a fireball.","“Auch!”","Fang Qi had just reached the entrance of the village with Jiang Xiaoyue. Hearing the shrill scream, he looked forward and saw the guard putting away his saber after a series of fast, blurry movements.","A corpse lay on the ground in two halves.","“F**k! I was killed!” Zha Gu yelled.","“You’re seeking death!” Iron Stone Daoist stabbed at the guard with the wooden sword!","“AHHH!” The second scream came! With dark expressions, the two of them climbed up from the respawn spot and charged at the big-saber-wielding guard again.","“AHHH!”","“AHHH!”","“Boss, someone was killed over there... Shall we go and help them?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked as she pointed at the two guys charging at the big-sabered guard.","“Don’t mind them. They are morons.” Fang Qi looked helpless.","“We were both killed! The bastard is strong! We are not his match!” Iron Rock Daoist and Zha Gu yelled in the internet café.","“Call more people! More people!” Huang Shan yelled, “When I get out of here, I’ll slaughter that bastard who killed me!”","“Send a message and ask the members of the Huang Family in the hostel to come here!”","“Right! We’ll have more than ten people, and I don’t believe that they can defeat us all!”","“By the way, two guardians! Where are you now? Didn’t you come to my place?” Huang Shan was baffled that while he came to this strange place after dying, the others respawned in the starting village.","“The monsters here offer great cultivation strengths!” Huang Shan had just killed a monster with great effort.","“It’s much greater than that offered by killing a rake cat!” As if he had found a treasure mountain, Huang Shan was elated. “Come to my place! I found a mystical and great place!”","“How do we get to your place?!”","“I don’t know... I came here after dying.” A happy thought struck Huang Shan. Maybe it’s a gift to me from the heavens?!","“Take it easy! You two lead the members of our Huang Family to search for those stupid people who killed me, and I’ll cultivate in seclusion in this mystical place. I’ll see who dares to fight us when I come out of seclusion!”","“Okay!”"]},{"number":240,"title":"Chapter 240 - No Money to Buy Potions? Kill and Rob!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While a group of people fought with the big-sabered guard at the entrance of the village, Fang Qi walked by and picked up some wooden swords and clothes and sold them to a shop. After a lot of corpses piled on the ground, Zha Gu and Iron Rock Daoist finally howled in defeat, “How come we can’t beat this b*stard?!”","“Forget it! This guy is only a guard stationed at the entrance of the village. If we don’t mess with him, he won’t come and kill us.” Iron Rock Daoist said, “Don’t waste time on him. Let’s go and level up!”","As time went by, the players gradually found that the cultivation strength growth by killing monsters in the Legend of Mir 2 was greater than the single-player computer games.","They hadn’t felt this way after killing one or two monsters, but after they leveled up a few times, many of them found that the increase in their cultivation strength was much faster than in other games!","– In Jiuhua City’s Shop –","“I don’t have money to buy potions. Do you have money?” After killing some monsters, Guo Xiong realized that he ran out of potions and money!","Although the players could dodge attacks with their own skills and thus consumed less potions in the remake version game compared to the original version, the System had made adjustment in this regard. For example, the small bottles of the lowest-level of potions were much more expensive than those in the original version!","All the changes resulted in the same outcome – Guo Xiong found that he had no money to buy potions!","“Well... Let me see.” Xi Qi and the other warriors realized that they had also run out of potions and money!","“F*ck!” Guo Xiong cussed.","“Fighting with that b*stard wasted my potions! If it wasn’t for him, I would have had enough for a little while!”","“How about... hunting for some meat and selling it for money?” Their strengths increased fast since they didn’t need to worry about potions. They had killed chickens and deer to level up, and they had made some money by selling the meat. However, almost all of their money was spent!","If they went back to kill the small animals, their strengths wouldn’t grow that much; it would be primarily for making money. Even though the increase in their strengths slowed down, there was a solution for their current problem.","At this moment, Zha Gu and Iron Rock Daoist had also discovered the same problem after they summoned a little over ten people of the Huang Family.","They had no money to buy potions, and that meant that they couldn’t kill more powerful monsters to level up fast! Zha Gu was in bigger trouble since a wizard without mana would be in mortal danger! If he had to recover mana and HP by sitting down and meditating, it would take him a long time!","“What can we do now?” Zha Gu asked in bafflement, “Should we go back and get deer meat?”","“It’s too troublesome...” Iron Rock Daoist came to the edge of the village and saw many players killing wild beasts. His eyes lit up instantly.","“In for a penny, in for a pound!”","“Okay!” They knew that when they killed people, some items in the others’ storage space would fall out, and they could just pick them up. The two guys extended their evil paws to the players who were collecting deer meat right now!","After all, killing the wild beasts one by one was slow! If they could kill a player who had a storage full of deer meat and chicken meat, they would become rich instantly!","With this thought, they began killing players who were hunting in the forest one after another! Surprisingly, they gained abundant loot!","As the Deputy Commander of Jiuhua City, Gong He was now also playing the game. Since he started a bit later, his level was low as a beginner. He was hunting the wild deer in the forest and collecting deer meat.","Suddenly, a dash of fire shot out from behind a big tree and knocked down his chubby body!","Then, a Taoist ran over and stabbed at him with a wooden sword!","“Who?! Which b*stard sneak-attacked me?!” Gong Hao screamed. But before he could fight back, another fireball crashed onto his head!","He was dazed by the attack! With one in charge of hacking and the other in charge of launching fireballs, Gong He soon fell to the ground!","“So much meat!!” The two attackers were excited at the sight of the meat all over the ground after Gong He died.","“This guy must have collected for a long time!”","“Hahahaha! It all belongs to us now!”","“Although we can’t find and kill those scumbags, it feels great to kill these guys and obtain some loot!” They laughed arrogantly.","“Ahhh! My meat!” Gong He had planned to collect a lot of meat and sell it in one trip. However, before he could return, he was killed, and all of his meat was dropped!","He was so furious that he felt like killing someone! Some of his colleagues playing nearby heard his sad scream and asked immediately, “Brother Gong, what happened?”","“I was killed by two b*stards, and all the deer meat in my backpack dropped!” Gong He was livid.","“Where are they?” His colleagues who were level 7 wanted to avenge him.","“They dared to kill you! They deserve to die!”","Gong He said, “Come! Follow me! Let’s go out and kill them all to get their items!”","Half an hour later, Zha Gu and Iron Rock Daoist surrounded Gong He and his five colleagues with more than ten members of the Huang Family!","“Kill!” Zha Gu and the others were excited!","“F*ck!” After being killed and returning to the respawn spot, Gong He and his colleagues lost a lot of their items. They screamed in rage, “Where are our brothers in the Jiuhua Army?! Get the elite team here! All of them! We’ll kill those b*stards!”","...","On the other side, the killers walked toward the village and said, “Each of us has a pack of chicken meat and deer meat. Guess how much money we can get after selling them?”","“Haha! We don’t have to worry about money for a while!” When Zha Gu and Iron Rock Daoist walked to the entrance of the village, Fang Qi and Loli Jiang Xiaoyue also returned.","These guys look fierce with murderous spirits... Fang Qi displayed their names and realized that their names were all in red!","“Boss! The game is so troublesome! We have to kill beasts to earn money before we can buy potions!” Jiang Xiaoyue frowned. She realized that she had to earn money in the game just like in real life.","“Ugh... We don’t have to kill monsters to earn money,” Fang Qi explained.","“What else can we do?”","Fang Qi pointed at Zha Gu and Iron Rock Daoist who were walking toward the village and said, “Xiaoyue, they are sending money to us.”","When the two guys got close to the entrance of the village, they saw a saber shadow crashing toward them!","“Ahhh!”","“Ahhh!”","With two shrill screams, items were dropped all over the ground!","“Go! Go! Go! The money is here! Go get the money!” Fang Qi immediately pulled Jiang Xiaoyue over to pick up the stuff on the ground. Except for some small items that were picked up by others, they picked up the rest and almost filled their storage space!","Without money, Huang Shan was sitting in the Red Name City and trying to think of a way to get out. Suddenly, he saw two guys climbing up wearing only a little more than underwear; almost all of their items were dropped.","Fortunately, the System gave them some clothes to cover themselves. Otherwise, they would have had to walk around in underwear!","“How come you’re here as well?!”","“I don’t know!” They lamented.","“That damned guard hacked us with saber for some reason! We died immediately!”","“Do you have money? Loan me some to buy potions!” Huang Shan said.","“We have no money...” they howled.","“Hey... how did you guys come in? Tell them to send us some money!” Huang Shan looked bitter.","– In Jiuhua City –","“Deputy Commander Gong! Where are the morons who killed you?!” About 40 people blocked the entrance of the village with fierce expressions and wide-opened eyes."]},{"number":241,"title":"Chapter 241 - You Want to Do It the Hard Way","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Did you send the notice?” With his back to the main gate, Liu San waved a piece of paper in his hand. On the paper was a picture of a weird-looking sword with four strange symbols on the body; the original symbols were blurred in the witnesses’ minds, so someone substituted them with some runes.","“Yes!” A black-clothed cultivator said, “Xue Si’er needs money, and so do the guys including Ghost Hand Du Gan. I think that guy will pay after this incident.”","“Okay. Then, we’ll go there again tomorrow.” Liu San studied the picture in his hand.","“Boss Liu, this picture is...”","“It’s delivered from the upper people,” Liu San said, “They say that if we can find the sword on the picture or just provide a clue, we will receive bountiful rewards!”","“Is this sword a treasure?”","“What treasure?!” Liu San said with a snort, “You stay out of this; if you anger the big boss, he will toss you into the elixir furnace to make a blood elixir pill!”","...","Meanwhile, a middle-aged man who was wearing a big black cloak stroked his goatee and asked, “Where’s Li Huangquan?”","“He... died!” the bald cultivators said in a shaky voice.","“What?!” The black-cloaked middle-aged man stared at the bald cultivator with cold eyes like a horrifying demon beast that was sizing up its food. “What happened?”","Immediately, the bald cultivator reported the whole incident to him in detail.","“Hehe... Hahahaha!” The middle-aged man laughed hysterically. “How long has it been? It has been so long since anyone dared to act so overbearing in front of me, Iron Heart Demon! Now, I will give you a chance to redeem yourself! Go and find out for me where this kid’s force is!”","...","Fortunately, Huang Shan and the other two men found some animals such as wild wolves and goats, that they could kill easily, and sold the meat for money.","Although they couldn’t rob others, there were no people in the area robbing them. If they lived here peacefully, they would get high experience points. In this way, they could live on and accept their fates.","At the beginning of the game, their cultivation strengths increased very fast. However, after these incidents, the speed began to slow down. Still, the growth in their cultivation strengths was still fast for Huang Shan and his peers.","While they played the game in peace, the other people from the Huang Family were in trouble!","About 40 people surrounded six members of the Huang Family outside of the entrance of the village, and the remaining members of the family didn’t dare to show themselves!","“Brother Huang! Our people are being kept outside and can’t level up!” Iron Rock Daoist looked frustrated and bitter. “How come there are so many of them?”","“They said that they are the city guards of a place named Jiuhua City...”","“Where is Jiuhua City?” The three guys looked at each other in bafflement. “I’ve never heard of it before!”","“There’s no such place in the Morning Star Sea Realm!” Now, they remembered the shop owner once mentioning that he had another shop. “Where is the other shop located?”","– On the other side –","“Deputy Commander Gong, they said that they are from the Huang Family of a place called the Morning Star Sea Realm.” An officer leaned over and whispered, “It’s said that there are lots of grand cultivators in that place. Will this cause us trouble?”","“What trouble can this cause us?” Remembering that he lost his backpack full of chicken meat and deer meat when he was killed, Gong He’s body shivered in rage, and his gloomy face looked as cold as ice while he yelled, “I dare the people of the Huang Family to crawl out of the computers and kill me! Do they have that power? Kill them all for me!”","“Ahh!” Screams sounded!","“Can we get more people?!” Iron Rock Daoist who had been killing monsters and leveling up in this different map said with a dark expression, “What Jiuhua City?! What city guards?! It’s a remote place that we’ve never heard of before! How dare they mess with us? They are seeking their deaths by messing with us!”","“But all the people of my Huang Family who came with us are here...” Huang Shan said helplessly while opening his palms, “Unless we leave the city and return to the headquarters of my family to get more people... but it’s a long journey; it doesn’t solve the problem that we are having now!”","“What shall we do?”","“Brother Huang! Shall we go... and get Brother Tao?” Zha Gu asked, “Isn’t he your friend?”","“What friend? He’s just a business associate,” Huang Shan said, “It shouldn’t be a problem to ask him to find more people, but...”","He glanced around the shop and thought, How can I reveal this good place to others?","“Forget it. The shop is open, and I guess there will be more customers coming here anyways.” Huang Shan used the fireball spell on a wolf and said, “We must get as many benefits as we can while only a few people know about this place.”","“Ugh... The time is up?” Huang Shan heard the reminder in his ears, and he was confused.","He suddenly remembered the words on the small blackboard that said one could only play for six hours per day.","He had been wondering how this shop could continue since it dared to limit the play time with such a bad service attitude, but now...","Huang Shan asked, “Sir, can you let us play some more?”","Fang Qi replied, “No!”","Huang Shan stated, “We’ll pay double the price!”","Fang Qi replied, “No, even if you pay ten times the fees!”","Huang Shan added, “Sir, I’m a businessman as well. Do you know that you’ll lose customers if you do your business this way?”","Fang Qi replied, “Play or get out of here!”","Huang Shan was at a loss for words.","“What shall we do?” the three guys consulted with each other.","“Let’s go now! We can come back later with more people!” Huang Shan said, “Since each player can play for only six hours, those guys won’t gain any advantages over us!”","Since the members of the Huang Family were blocked at the entrance and couldn’t level up, they told them to exit the game a well.","At this moment, some cultivators walked into the shop.","Huang Shan paused, and the newcomers also stopped and looked at Huang Shan warily.","A few juniors at the early stage of Spiritual River Realm? Huang Shan frowned as he observed these people. One of them was wearing a blood-red robe with a pale face, but his red lips looked as if they were covered in blood.","Another guy at the foremost of the group shrugged in a big robe, and his hands were dry and black like dead tree branches. Several black-clothed cultivators followed them.","The black-robed cultivator looked Huang Shan up and down. “An outsider? I advise you to stay out of the trouble of this shop.”","“Oh?” Huang Shan crossed his arms before his chest and said, “Go ahead.”","Of course, he wouldn’t interfere. Instead, he had been hoping for a dumb person to test the strength of this shop!","“Who is the owner of the shop?” The man wearing the blood-colored robe yelled in a gloomy voice.","“Bo... Boss...” Sensing that something was wrong, Zou Mo hurried to inform Fang Qi.","Fang Qi had noticed the upheaval at the door, but he was busy killing poisonous spiders with Jiang Xiaoyue near Ginkgo Village.","“Little Mo, if they are here to play games, the instructions are on the small blackboard. If they came to make trouble...”","“Make trouble?” The man in the blood-colored robe snickered, “We just want to borrow some money from the shop owner.”","“Xue Si’er! I warn you not to make trouble here!” Ruan Ning walked out of her shop in a fury.","“Oh, it’s you, Ms. Ruan. You’d better stay out of the rules of this street!” The guy in the red robe looked unmoved.","“You...”","Fang Qi sighed slightly. “This city is perfect with its rich and dumb people, but there is one shortcoming. Little Mo, read them the rule on making trouble.”","Ruan Ning stared at Fang Qi fiercely, thinking, What do you mean by ‘rich and dumb people’?!","She felt insulted by his general comment!","“Okay...” Zou Mo read the words on the small blackboard, “Destroy their cultivation strengths and kick them out after breaking their legs.”","Fang Qi killed all the nearby monsters and put down the virtual reality headset helplessly. “After all, I don’t like killing people.”","Huang Shan’s face turned dark, thinking that this punishment was worse than killing them! After all, anyone living here had enemies. If they were kicked out with destroyed cultivation strengths, and their enemies came for them, the ending would be evident even if people were thinking with their butts.","By that time, direct death was a better fate!","However, people like Xue Si’er and Du Gan sneered. “So, you want to do it the hard way then?”"]},{"number":242,"title":"Chapter 242 - Why Are All the Guys in the City So Cranky?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“So, you want to do it the hard way?” Before this sentence was finished, the cultivator with the pair of black and dry hands attacked without making any noises!","A streak of black mist moved around Fang Qi silently and shot toward Zou Mo who was standing by the counter! Zou Mo was scared, but before he could react, that streak of black mist suddenly triggered a flash of lightning!","The power of the Holy Shock filled the space like a special energy field, and any objects entering it would be instantly struck by the lightning energy of the Holy Shock if Fang Qi didn’t restrain it!","Obviously, this was a highly effective technique to prevent sneak-attacks! Ever since he was sneak-attacked when he was being robbed, he would turn on the Holy Shock whenever he was in any conflict. The only thing that he needed to do was to manage it and restrain its force so that it wouldn’t attack people whom Fang Qi didn’t want it to attack.","Since Fang Qi had turned on the Holy Shock, that streak of unnoticeable black mist was instantly turned into sparks by the lightning energy, which ruined all the effects of this sneak-attack.","Then, a small pitch-black banner was revealed after the black mist was gone, and it was shot down and pinned to the wall by Fang Qi’s sword which was empowered by the Holy Shock!","The fabric of the banner was quite good since it wasn’t pierced by the sword! However, the lightning energy on the weapon was ten times more powerful than the flashes of lightning that could appear around Fang Qi.","Immediately, black smoke rose from the black banner, and countless fierce ghosts struggled out of it. However, they were pressed down by the holy, snow-white lightning energy at the moment!","Fang Qi pointed his index and middle finger, and the tip of his sword struck down under his spiritual essence!","Crack! A big crack appeared on the backbone of the banner!","Meanwhile, Du Gan who was standing at the entrance of the shop, spat out a mouthful of black blood, and he turned listless instantly! Then, Fang Qi turned his head and said to them, “Why are all the guys like you in the city so cranky? You attack whenever you don’t get what you want.”","“You damaged Old Ghost Du’s Fierce Soul Banner!” Xue Si’er’s expression turned grim.","“Anyway, the Old Ghost is getting weaker recently, what a loser!” He took out a bloody red bead and said gloomily, “Now, I’ll let you have a taste of my Bloodthirsty Bead!”","“Get out of here! What the heck is that?” With his face twitching, Fang Qi pointed his index and middle fingers, and a group of swords that were enveloped with white lightning energy shot out!","“Want to damage my Bloodthirsty Bead?!” Xue Si’er’s face fell, and he circulated his spiritual essence, making the red blood bead lit up instantly.","However, countless sword energies swarmed over like riptides, and each sword that crashed onto the red light would create a huge wave of white lightning energy!","Countless lightning sparks flew and formed a curtain of blinding lightning in front of the red light! By now, only a small part of the swords was consumed!","“Crack!” With a cracking noise, one sword broke the blood-colored spiritual light and pierced the blood bead!","The blood bead exploded and turned into a big cloud of blood mist! Looking at the red blood bead that was shattered by the Innumerable Sword Scroll, Fang Qi was at a loss for words. “This piece of garbage of yours is called the Bloodthirsty Bead?”","“You! You...” Xue Si’er was horrified, not understanding how his opponent had destroyed his spiritual treasure with such ease!","This blood bead was a treasure he had refined with his natal essence blood. With this spiritual treasure destroyed, Xue Si’er spat out a mouthful of blood, and his pale face turned even whiter, making him look like a ghost!","Ruan Ning gaped at the sight. This kid is young; how come he’s so strong?!","“Good strength,” Zha Gu whispered, “But I don’t know what spiritual spell he used to destroy his opponent’s spiritual treasure with ease.”","“It seems that he has concealed some of his strength,” Huang Shan whispered, “He has good strength, but it’s not enough to protect these treasures in the shop. He must have more tricks up his sleeve.”","“Come on! Let’s attack together! This kid is strong!” Du Gan yelled hoarsely. Now, only morons wouldn’t be able to tell that Fang Qi’s cultivation strength wasn’t low!","Waves of sword energies shot out while creating whistling sounds! All of Fang Qi’s opponents could do nothing but defend in front of the horrifying streaks of swords!","The Innumerable Sword Scroll was powerful when Fang Qi used it, and it looked like a surging river. Right now, people like Xue Si’er and Du Gan felt like they were mortals who were standing in front of a tsunami.","The people who wanted to attack were obliterated by the streaks of sword energies, and they were sent flying out of the shop and pinned to the wall across the street!","Ruan Ning was stupefied at the sight! Seeing Fang Qi controlling so many powerful swords energies with ease, Huang Shan looked alarmed. “This sword technique is indeed strong! Which faction is the shop owner from?”","“It seems like he hasn’t used his full strength yet!” Zha Gu said in a low voice.","Fang Qi brushed the dust off his hands and said, “Sometimes, it feels good to do it myself and get some exercise in the process.”","“Boss!” At this moment, Zou Mo pointed at the screen of Fang Qi’s computer. “Your character in the game was killed by spiders! That little girl was killed by the spiders as well! There are so many of them!”","“F*ck!” Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “Did we drop anything? No one got my black wood sword, right?” After all, he had obtained a black wood sword that added 4-9 to his damage!","He had just gotten it. If it were dropped, and someone picked it up... Besides the sword, he had a lot of materials and potions in his backpack!","Even Huang Shan’s old face twitched after hearing that.","“Damn it! You are seeking death!” With a dark expression, Fang Qi pointed his index and middle fingers, and screams sounded one by one with bone-breaking noises following.","Their cultivation strengths were destroyed, and their legs were broken!","“Get out of here!” Too lazy to spare a glance at them, Fang Qi hurried back to his computer and yelled, “Little Mo, clean up the blood by the door! I must go back and pick up my items!”","“Oh... Okay!”","Looking at this scene, Huang Shan and his peers were at a loss for words, and so was Ruan Ning.","“Let’s go!” Huang Shan cast a wary glance at Fang Qi and whispered, “Don’t mess with this shop if it’s not necessary.”","Ruan Ning walked into the shop with a dark expression and questioned, “Why didn’t you tell me that you were so strong?!”","“You didn’t ask.” Fang Qi answered distractedly while he played the game, and Zou Mo chuckled by his side.","Ruan Ning swallowed her words and glared at Zou Mo. “What are you smirking about? Aren’t you worried that your boss has powerful enemies? How can you smirk at this moment!”","Zou Mo scratched his head. “Those two guys were just at the Spiritual River Realm. In the previous incident, one of the guys of Black Demon was said to be at the early stage of True Lake Realm, but he couldn’t even block one strike from my boss. This... that’s why I’m not worried.”","“An early stage True Lake Realm cultivator couldn’t block one strike?!”","“True Lake Realm?!” Ruan Ning seemed to be exclaiming about Fang Qi’s high strength, but she shouted in the next moment, “Which subordinate of Black Demon on earth did you kill?”","“Your babbling is distracting me and making me anxious...” Fang Qi frantically dodged the attacks of the spiders and said, “I told you that I killed him in one strike; how can you expect me to remember the name of such a weak person...”","Ruan Ning was anxious, but then she realized that she was wasting her energy worrying about something that had nothing to do with her."]},{"number":243,"title":"Chapter 243 - Miss, Do You Want to Join the Guild?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ruan Ning was a little speechless; she had never seen anyone like this shop owner before. He had just dumped the guys outside and came back to kill spiders in the game!","“By the way, how come those guys left?” Ruan Ning pointed at Huang Shan and the others who were walking out of the shop and asked, “Is it because that they found your stuff isn’t that impressive?”","“Sister Ruan...” Zou Mo pointed at the small blackboard and said, “Each player can only play six hours a day, and Boss kicked them out since the time was up... He refused their offer of giving him more money!”","Zou Mo also felt like his boss’s method of doing business was puzzling. Even though they had great stuff, behaving like this was a bit too much. What if they angered the customers? They couldn’t kick them all out, right?","Zou Ning fell silent.","Humph! If you continue doing business this way, I think the customers won’t return tomorrow! Ruan Ning thought that even though the stuff in the shop could speed up the cultivation process, there was other stuff that had similar effects.","Leaving other things aside, just the spiritual meals and the spiritual herbs that she ate each day could speed up her cultivation. On top of that, there were special Spiritual Condensation Arrays and cultivation room built with spirit stones!","There were better methods in the inner city! They had unique and strange stuff like unorthodox blood elixir pills that were made with others’ essence blood and cultivation strength. One such pill could give a cultivator tremendous growths in strength, and the only drawback was that it had some side effects!","Now that she thought of it, there were many methods to increase people’s cultivation strengths. The method in Fang Qi’s shop was unique, but it wasn’t the only one since all kinds of methods existed.","Therefore, she felt like the customers would go to other places to cultivate now that Fang Qi refused to give them extra playtime. While she was brooding over this, Little Mo added without knowing her thoughts, “Sister Ruan, I heard those customers mentioning that they are going to borrow some people from a guy with the surname of Tao to continue playing the game!”","Ruan Ning almost fell to the ground!","They are going to borrow people to play the game?! A guy with the surname of Tao?! Ruan Ning’s heart lurched when she thought of a figure with some influence since there weren’t many people whose surname was Tao.","They can play the game themselves; why do they want to borrow people to play the game? To kill those guys in the game?! They are not morons; they wouldn’t spend a fortune on revenge in the game if there wasn’t anything unique and special.","She suddenly felt like the situation was quite weird, and she looked Fang Qi up and down suspiciously.","Ignoring her, Fang Qi was busy playing the game. “Xiaoyue! Use heal! Lure another spider here! Right! Just like that! Kill this one first!”","“I’ll try this ‘Legend of Mir 2’! How much is it?!” Once a girl got curious... Ruan Ning couldn’t contain her curiosity anymore!","She dug out the money and put it on the counter!","“Sister Ruan, don’t you need to keep an eye on your shop?”","“I closed it early today!” Ruan Ning yelled and then sat down before a computer. “I’ll sit here to see when your shop will be smashed!”","Having watched Huang Shan play the game, she knew how to play it.","She chose the profession of wizard. Since she had seen Huang Shan and the others using aliases, she also made up one as well.","After she gave herself the alias of ‘Condense Frost’, she saw Fang Qi staring at her screen.","“What?”","“I think the name ‘Fury Strike’ is more dominating, Miss,” Fang Qi said earnestly, “Or you can change it into ‘Ten-Thousand-Year Snow Frost’.”","“What ‘Fury Strike’? What ‘Ten-Thousand-Year Snow Frost’?” Ruan Ning rolled her eyes at him and entered the game. Then, she ran out of the village to kill chickens.","After killing some chickens, she discovered something. What is going on? My cultivation strength is growing so... it doesn’t need me to refine it?","How can it be so pure?! She felt incredulous. After all, each of the many methods in the city which could speed up the growth cultivation strength needed the cultivator to refine the new spiritual essence before it became their own!","However, the cultivation strength she obtained now was clean without any impurities! Also, it became her own almost without needing refining!","More importantly, the speed of the growth of her strength was very fast!","How could it be?! She was so amazed that she couldn’t even speak! There were many weird things in the city, but this was the best method of increasing one’s cultivation strength that she had ever seen!","Even the grandmasters living in the inner city probably didn’t have such an awesome cultivation method; that was shocking!","At the very least, they had to refine their newly acquired spiritual essence many times! In contrast, the spiritual essence that she gained here was without any impurities! It was probably even purer than the spiritual essence that had been refined many times!","This is incredible! With this thought, she continued killing monsters and hunted deer and chickens. Only monsters such as scarecrows and rake cats dropped money, but they were quite rare. Killing animals like deer and chicken didn’t bring players money directly, but the meat could be sold, and it was the only source of income in the early stage.","...","In Jiuhua City’s Shop, Wang Qiang, an elite member of the Jiuhua Army, was dragged here to play this game. However, his money was a bit tight now.","“Let’s go and hunt some deer?” Some of his colleagues also were short on money as well.","While they talked, they found a deer. But before they could move, a girl who wasn’t even level 7 rushed out of the nearby forest and killed the deer with clean movements.","“Ugh?” Remembering the incident in which some guys killed Deputy Commander Gong and getting the items in his backpack, an idea dawned on them.","“Shall we...”","“It’s not good... Qiang, we meet the players in the internet cafe each day...” Someone tried to dissuade him.","“Why not? She won’t know who I am!” Wang Qiang said, “Anyway, I’m using an alias in the game! How can she find me?”","“Besides, she might be someone from the Morning Star Sea Realm, and Deputy Commander Gong said that we must kill them whenever we see them!” They talked and made the decision before rushing over and hacking down their swords!","“Ahh!” A scream sounded!","While looking at the deer meat that almost covered the ground, Ruan Ning was furious. “What the heck! I hope your son will be born without... You bastards dare to sneak-attack me!” Although the sense of pain in the Legend of Mir 2 could be reduced to as low as 20%, it was still acute, and Ruan Ning grimaced at the sharp pain.","More importantly, the deer meat that she had collected for so long was dropped!","“Why are you yelling?” Ruan Ning sat beside Fang Qi, and the latter instantly heard the noise pollution.","“I was killed, and I lost so much deer meat!” After respawning, she went after them with hatred in her eyes.","“Qiang, that girl is here again.” Another brawl began.","“Ahh!” With another shrill, she was killed again, and more of her items dropped. Then, she found that Fang Qi was watching her the whole time from the side.","He just watched! Ruan Ning gritted her teeth at this ungentlemanly behavior; what infuriated her even more was that she saw that Fang Qi had reached level 14, much higher than those who killed her.","“Couldn’t you come and help me?!”","Fang Qi pointed at the token that looked like a Dragon-Slaying Saber on the door and gave her a bright smile while showing his white teeth. “Miss, do you want to join the guild?”"]},{"number":244,"title":"Chapter 244 - Ultimate Items Drop Every Second","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Go to hell!” Ruan Ning gritted her teeth. This damn shop owner watched me get killed and drop a lot of items, and he even took the opportunity to try and lure me into his guild!","She was just attacked and hacked at in the game. If I join this damn online games guild of yours, I will be attacked and hacked at in the real world too! she thought to herself. She wouldn’t be so stupid as to join it!","With a snort, she took out her communication jade. “Do you think that I have no help?! I’ll call my friends over!”","“I’ll go to another place to level up instead of dealing with these damn people! Humph!”","“Then, continue with your game.” Fang Qi wasn’t bothered by the rejection, and he resumed killing monsters with Jiang Xiaoyue. At this moment, Fang Qi had come to the Skeleton Cave, which could both save him money and offer him opportunities to earn money as long as no one tried to fight over monsters with them.","Since most of the players were about level 10, and Fang Qi’s level was a lot higher, no one would come and fight with him over monsters. Besides, due to the large size of the map in the System’s version, no one else had found this place yet. If Fang Qi didn’t know about the fact that the Skeleton Cave was nearby and didn’t search for it along the cliff, he wouldn’t have found this secret cave.","Although the System expanded the map and changed many things, the basic frame was the same!","After he killed one monster, Ruan Ning exclaimed next to him, “How come this monster dropped so much money?!”","Ruan Ning saw that Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue had killed a bat easily, and this monster dropped four big piles of gold coins!","There were thousands of coins in one pile!","Altogether, they found that it was about 10,000 gold coins!","Besides, there were many scrolls on the ground!","These things sold for thousands of gold coins in the shop!","In other words, Fang Qi had only killed one monster, but the return that he got was much more than the big pile of deer meat that she had collected with great efforts!","“How is this possible?!” Ruan Ning exclaimed, “Where are you?!”","“Miss, please explore by yourself!” Fang Qi said, “The fun in games lies in discovering everything by yourself!”","Ruan Ning felt frustrated, and she thought, It just comes down to the fact that I didn’t agree to join your guild!","She watched from the side and saw that there wasn’t much of anything else in this gloomy cave except for skeletons which looked quite strong as if they were experienced warriors who retained their battle instincts even after death!","Even Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue must fight with one of these monsters for a while before they could kill it.","If they were unlucky and drew several skeletons to them by accident, they would be severely injured.","The warriors had only one skill in the early stage of the game. In fact, it shouldn’t even be called a skill.","Basic Sword Technique – it was the most traditional and most basic sword skill that was the foundation of other techniques.","According to the legend on this continent, a warrior with great strength and various techniques summarized his knowledge and created this sword technique a long time ago. Then, people learned and used this sword technique to fight monsters.","After many years of use, it had become the most basic sword technique for warriors.","The Basic Sword Technique was easy to learn, and its movements were simple and not fancy. However, it would build a solid foundation for warriors.","Fang Qi used it and found this sword technique was quite special.","Fang Qi lacked a solid foundation in using swords, but he had learned a lot of powerful sword techniques. Now coming back and learning this basic stuff, it felt like he was building the foundation of a skyscraper, and it was bettering him from all aspects.","It was greatly beneficial for him to learn the basic stuff systematically.","Of course, he didn’t come to the Skeleton Cave only to practice his sword techniques.","“What’s that?” Ruan Ning saw Fang Qi’s happy expression when he picked up a bracelet.","On Fang Qi’s screen, Fang Qi’s character was checking the attributes of the bracelet.","[Big Bracelet","Defense: 1-3","Damage: 0-3]","“Huh!!??” Ruan Ning froze instantly. She had seen this bracelet in the shop before, and it only had the attribute of [Defense 1-1] without any other properties. Besides, it was extremely expensive!","@How come Fang Qi got a bracelet that has so many","Cheerfully, Fang Qi replaced a big bracelet with the attribute of [Defense: 1-1] with the new one.","“Huh!!??”","Ruan Ning froze again and thought, Doesn’t this big bracelet of yours provide [Defense: 1-1]? Why is this new one different?","Fang Qi laughed hysterically and said, “Xiaoyue! Let’s resume the battle!”","At this moment, she found that Fang Qi had more than 100,000 gold coins in his backpack!","“Ahh! There are treasures everywhere in this place! Let me go there too!” It was fine if she didn’t see this. Now that she knew there was such a place, she was filled with envy!","“You want to come here?’ After getting an ultimate item, Fang Qi was very smug. “A Dragon-Slaying Treasure Saber will be gifted to anyone who clicks this?! Ultimate items will drop every second! Join our Heaven-Defying Online Game Guild now!”","Ruan Ning’s face turned dark.","Damn it! Just this name alone sounds weird and not dependable!","Soon, some girls walked into the shop. Ruan Ning had forgotten her earlier doubt about the shop’s business and her comment about this shop not getting customers. Now, she had dragged a few people into the shop herself.","A tall black-clothed girl with a mature and plump figure walked into the shop first, and she was followed by twin sisters who were wearing green dresses and looked to be 18 or 19 years old.","“Here! This way!” The moment that they entered the shop, Ruan Ning beckoned at them.","“What happened today? What made our Ningning so impatient?”","“Ningning...” Fang Qi covered his smile, feeling like the pet-name was funny.","Ruan Ning’s face twitched, and she rolled her eyes and changed the subject immediately. “I found something good and wanted to share it with my good sisters!”","“Sir! Activate the Legend of Mir 2 for my sisters!”","“Ugh?! What’s ‘the Legend of Mir 2’?” The three girls looked baffled.","“Let’s go! You’ll know in a minute!” Then, she pulled them to the computers and entered the game.","Two hours later, Wang Qiang and his peers who had become robbers encountered Ruan Ning again.","Wang Qiang and his peers had moved their robbery business closer to the Viper Valley and encountered Ruan Ning and her friends who were searching for the Skeleton Cave, which was full of money and treasures!","Ruan Ning’s eyes turned red with hatred when she saw her enemies!","“Sisters! These b*stards are the ones who killed me! We outnumber them this time! Let’s kill them!”","Ruan Ning immediately charged at Wang Qiang with her girl friends!","“F*ck!” Wang Qiang was looking for their next victim, and four fireballs suddenly crashed onto him!","Before he could react, another round of fireballs shot toward him!","“Who hit me?!” Different from the original version, people could hide in the forests or behind trees and boulders. For a moment, Wang Qiang was baffled about the sudden attacks.","“He has very little HP left! Kill him!”","“F*ck!” Wang Qiang saw four fierce girls charging at him and attacking him viciously!","“Someone is killing Qiang!”","“Kill them!”","“Attack that person whose HP is almost empty!”","The scene was chaotic and messy.","Boom!","A lot of items were dropped.","“Brothers of Jiuhua City! F*ck! I was killed, and a lot of my items dropped!” Wang Qiang shouted in a channel in QQ that Gong He had opened for Jiuhua’s Army.","“Where?! Where?!”","“Near Viper Valley! Four girls attacked us fiercely! Auch! F*ck!” The remaining two yelled frantically, obviously outnumbered. They soon fell to the ground!","The four girls picked up the loot on the ground proudly and found not only deer meat but jewels and various items!","“We’re rich! We’re rich!” The girls had stars in their eyes.","“Let’s go! They are the so-called Jiuhua Army, and there are many of them!” Remembering the incident in which Huang Shan and his men were slaughtered, Ruan Ning ran immediately!","While the players fought each other in the game, Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue got a ring with [Taoist Spell: 4] and some great items besides the big bracelet with [Defense: 1-3] and [Damage: 1-3]."]},{"number":245,"title":"Chapter 245 - The Master of The Sword","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Before Ruan Ning and her friends got off the computers, a large group of people came into the shop; including the dozen or so members of the Huang Family, there were almost 60 people in the group.","Beside Huang Shan stood a middle-aged man in a deep brown robe, and he looked wealthy.","In fact, Huang Shan didn’t want to bring Tao Kun here, but he had to go to Tao Kun’s estate to borrow people. It was easy to fool commoners, but it wasn’t the case for smart people like Tao Kun.","As a result, Huang Shan had no choice but to bring them all here.","“Sir! Activate that Legend of Mir 2!” When the 50 plus people filed into the shop, they attracted attention from the other customers, including Ruan Ning and her friends, who had just fled after taking revenge and grabbing the items.","Standing behind the counter, Zou Mo stared at them wide-eyed, wondering how many crystals the shop would earn with so many people activating the Legend of Mir 2!","I’m working in such a shop! Dumbfounded, Zou Mo watched Huang Shan and Tao Kun tossing big bags of crystals onto the counter, and he counted them in a hurry, afraid to miscount even by one crystal!","It is indeed Second Master Tao... Ruan Ning was at a loss for words. She would have been astonished that this figure came to this place in the past, but now, she knew that only stupid people wouldn’t come to this place after knowing about it.","Tao Kun was the Second Master of Yuanheng Pavilion, which sold all kinds of precious and rare spiritual spells and spiritual treasures, and its business was so big that its customers included many forces in and outside of the city!","However, he was here with Huang Shan to check out this place today. He knew something was going on when Huang Shan asked to borrow so many people from him. Huang Shan knew that it was impossible to hide this secret from him and thus told him everything. Tao Kun was curious. How did such a shop appear in Half City?!","Despite his great experience in the world, he had never seen or heard of such a place before!","More importantly, it was a new force!","A newly established force which had just arrived in the city without a strong foothold dared to open such a shop.","In his mind, if Huang Shan told him the truth, it was a serious issue, and he would have to think carefully about this.","Since the people in Half City were mostly cultivators, many newbies chose the profession of wizards and Taoists. Soon, a bunch of people came out of the respawn spot in the small village!","Tao Kun widened his eyes after he experienced the increase in his cultivation strength!","Killing monsters can increase my strength by this much? All of this is pure spiritual essence? This is probably even better than the cultivation room which was designated for the First Master of the Pavilion!","However, with so many new players, including the players from Jiuhua City, in the game, the monsters and beasts outside of the village were not enough even though the System had expanded the map a lot.","Tao Kun was obviously bolder than Huang Shan, and he issued the order, “Search around for monsters to kill! If anyone dares to take the prey from us, kill them all!”","He was aggressive and overbearing!","At least, he gained a monopoly over the chickens and ducks nearby!","Outside the newbie village, a large group of new players chased after all kinds of small animals and hacked at them wildly! They even killed all the strangers they saw!","“You want to outnumber us?!” Tao Kun sneered and said arrogantly, “Brother Huang, where is the Jiuhua Army that you mentioned? I’ll see if they can defeat my Yuanheng Pavilion Guards!”","On the other side, Gong He, Wang Qiang, and the other members of Jiuhua’s Army were offline and were oblivious to the situation!","However, other passing players became their victims, and about a dozen were killed in a short while!","...","Poison Elixir King Qin Honglin had another identity; he was the head of the biggest gang in the 36th Block, but he handed the management of this business to his subordinates, Xue Nian and Xu Biao.","He stayed in his Red Forest Pharmacy to do illegal business in the disguise of selling elixirs and medicine.","Recently, he had encountered some small issues in his business. A while had passed, and the audacious killer who murdered two of his subordinates in his pharmacy in front of all the customers was still not found!","Some buyers even tried to test the water while doing business with him today!","Some of them thought that Qin Honglin was an old tiger who had lost its teeth!","It was a bad sign!","At this moment, Liu San looked livid with the scroll of paper in his hand. “No one has ever seen the guy who used this sword?”","At this moment, someone yelled, “No... Bad news!”","One of his black-clothed subordinates reported to him with a panicked expression, “Xue Si’er and Ghost Hand Du Gan had their cultivation strengths destroyed and their limbs broken! They are wastrels now!”","“What?!” Liu San’s face fell. “Where are they?!”","“Coincidentally, my men happened to be passing by and brought them back!” The black-clothed cultivator said, “Boss, what do we do now?”","“Lead the way!” Liu San came to the grand hall with a gloomy expression and saw the guys lying on the ground half dead. While suppressing his impatience, he transferred a bit of his cultivation strength to one of them and asked, “What happened?!”","“That guy’s flying sword technique is so powerful!” Xue Si’er said with his last bit of strength, “He broke my spiritual treasure with one sword strike!”","“Flying sword technique?!” Liu San’s expression changed!","“What flying sword technique?” Liu San immediately showed him the picture in his hand. “Does the sword look like this?!”","“Yes!” Xue Si’er quickly crawled back as if he had seen something scary, and he yelled, “Yeah, it looks like that!”","Liu San tightened his grip and instantly turned the scroll into dust, and the dust slowly settled on the ground. “Good! I didn’t expect that the master of this sword, whom our superiors are looking for, was actually right under our nose!”","...","In Red Forest Pharmacy, Qin Honglin looked at another picture in his hand with a gloomy expression. On the picture was a young man with a sword hovering beside him, and the details of this young man’s looks and the sword were very clear!","“I’m surprised that this man dared to mess with our Red Forest Pharmacy and also killed subordinates of Black Demon!”","“He did all this, and he deserves to die!” the coquettish woman beside him said.","At this moment, a brawny black-clothed cultivator walked in.","“Xu Biao? What’s it?”","Xu Biao walked in and whispered something to him.","“What?! We found him?!” Qin Honglin stood up immediately and said with a laugh, “It seems that our people are one step ahead of the others!”","“He dared to kill subordinates of Black Demon, which means that he is quite powerful!” The coquettish woman said, “How about letting me take some people to deal with him?”","“No!” A wicked smile appeared on Qin Honglin’s face, and it made his celestial-looking face seem very creepy. “I’ll handle the issue myself. Just watch how I refine him into a blood elixir pill to vent my fury!”"]},{"number":246,"title":"Chapter 246 - The Old Demon Pays a Visit","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Probably because these monsters had never been killed before, the drop rate was surprisingly high.","By now, Ruan Ning and her friends had used up their daily playtime and could only watch Fang Qi from behind as he killed monsters and got ultimate items!","The black-clothed mature young girl was named Xi Yue, and the older of the twin sisters was Su Zhi while the younger one was Su Yao. They were all locals of the city.","“How come the shop owner can play for so long?!”","“The monsters here are so rich!”","“Do you see the saber in the owner’s hand? Its damage is a bit higher than those sold in the shop!”","At this moment, Fang Qi was wearing a set of pale blue light armor with a saber named Bahuang in his hand, looking much more dashing than the newbies who only had small wooden swords and cotton clothes. His appearance drew a wave of exclamations from behind him.","“The shop owner’s damage is so high! He can break several bones on the skeleton monsters with one strike!”","“How come we couldn’t find this place after searching for it for so long?! He is taking all the good stuff for himself!”","“No! That little girl is enjoying these things as well!”","“Do you want these things?” Fang Qi said smugly, “You can enjoy all the benefits if you join my guild!”","“Humph! You want to lure us into your damn guild again.” Ruan Ning replied in disdain, “I advise you to watch out for yourself! I won’t interfere when the people of Black Demon come for you! I won’t even bury your corpse!”","“You are quite a figure. You dared to let one of Black Demon’s men go after killing the others.” Xi Yue obviously had heard about Fang Qi’s brave behavior, and she glanced around with a frown, seeming to contemplate if she should flee with one computer when the shop owner gets killed.","“Hey! Can’t you let us play longer?” The younger sister Su Yao was shy while older sister Su Zhi was bubbly. “Your shop is so big, so theres no way it’ll be filled! The computers stand idle anyway. Why don’t you let us play a while longer?!”","“Yeah!” Ruan Ning looked at Fang Qi’s screen and said resentfully, “I’ve never seen a shop owner like you! You are enjoying the game while making the customers watch from behind!”","“As for more playtime... You will get more of it soon,” Fang Qi said, “The shop will soon start selling memberships. Any member of the shop can have two extra hours of playtime compared to ordinary players.”","Soon, the trial memberships can be upgraded to VIP memberships, and these members would have two more hours of playtime than the ordinary members. It was the rule that Fang Qi had confirmed with the System.","“Soon... can’t you do it today?” Ruan Ning said in disdain, “I just robbed some passersby, and I want to play more!”","“You won’t find it enough even if I give you two more hours!” Fang Qi said in a huff, “Not even if I give you ten more hours! It’s useless to continue this topic...”","The passersby: “Damn it! Where are those people?”","The passersby who had been robbed were still looking for the robbers.","“How about giving us some more hours to play, and I’ll speak for you concerning the issue with Black Demon?” Xi Yue was quite confident in herself since her father was an executive of the Coiled Dragon Office and her mother managed several large shops in the city. Her family was a big force.","Despite the complicated relationships among all the forces in the city, some of them had the power to intervene in certain things.","She guessed that the shop owner had some strength and a powerful background, but he was a newcomer after all, and it was in his best interest not to mess with locals.","Confidently, she waited for Fang Qi’s reply.","“Ugh... this...” Fang Qi looked sulky. “I’ve told them that our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild will welcome them to make trouble, and I think it will look bad if I go back on my words.”","“Why not? How can you value your reputation more than your life?”","“Maybe I should take some people and rob the leader of the so-called Black Demon, and then I can take back the words,” Fang Qi said.","“You...”","“Forget it! Sister Xi Yue, just ignore him!” Ruan Ning said while glaring at Fang Qi who was busy hacking monsters and ignoring the girls. “He will ask for help when they come here and make trouble for him; he will be scared for sure.”","“I won’t help if you don’t offer unlimited play time!”","It was now 10 PM, and the sky was dark outside.","Suddenly, the whole street was engulfed in a gloomy red light!","The dark red blood light seemed to cover the whole street, and Fang Qi’s shop was the most impacted!","“Cackle...”","As a series of dark cackles sounded, blood mist floated outside the door, and the area around Fang Qi’s shop turned into a vicious ghost world!","Ruan Ning’s face turned pale. “What’s happening?! How come the Old Demon came personally?!”","A group of people suddenly appeared before Fang Qi’s shop, and the leader was a red-robed old man with a weirdly pink complexion.","Different from his attire in Red Forest Pharmacy, Qin Honglin wore a vermilion-colored robe, and he looked extremely creepy in it!","A fierce-looking, bald, middle-aged cultivator with ugly scars on his head and a coquettish woman in heavy make-up were following behind on either side of this old man.","Intense bloody and murderous auras floated into the shop, and all the people in the shop frowned at the intense smell of blood.","Ruan Ning and her friends looked grim as they asked Fang Qi, “How come you messed with this old demon! You’re in big trouble!”","“Sister Ruan...” Zou Mo asked, “Is this old demon very powerful?”","“People now address him as Poison Elixir King with respect, but dozens of years ago, the people here all called him Poison Demon!” Ruan Ning whispered, “The gossips that you heard outside of the city are not all fake; the stories about this old demon are all true!”","“It was heard that before this old demon entered Half City, he killed more than ten big families with poison. After coming to Half City, he got even more vicious. He creates elixirs with cultivators’ essence blood, and he even kidnapped cultivators from outside of Half City to make blood elixir pills. The members of the previous force which occupied the 36th block were all killed by this old demon and made into elixir pills!”","“It’s said that all the members of this old demon’s previous faction had been turned into blood elixir pills by him as well! There’s no evil deed that this devil wouldn’t do!”","Zou Mo shivered, and his heart turned cold. “Bo... Boss will be okay, right?”","“Where is the owner of the shop?! Come out and meet our big boss!” Liu San walked into the shop with a cold smile.","“Damn it! Who is it?” Fang Qi stood up impatiently.","At this moment, Tao Kun couldn’t sit there anymore as well. He exited from the game and said with a fake smile, “It’s Master Qin!”","“Tao Kun, do you want to get involved?” The bald, middle-aged man said, “He dared to kill our people in the Red Forest Pharmacy in front of Big Boss! No one can stop us from getting our revenge!”","His narrow eyes looked fierce. “I advise Brother Tao to keep out of this for the sake of our friendship!”","Not only Tao Kun but the other people’s faces also twitched as they thought, Shop Owner, what were you doing? How can you kill people in front of this old demon? Especially his subordinates!","It was impossible for them to speak for Fang Qi in this issue! If Qin Honglin couldn’t resolve this issue, he couldn’t even live in the city as his reputation would be ruined!"]},{"number":247,"title":"Chapter 247 - Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild Is Here to Smash Your Shop!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While they talked, Fang Qi was busy.","“How come I feel like I’m watching a movie.” Fang Qi took out a container of Haagen-Dazs and glanced at Ruan Ning and the others, asking, “Would you like a container of Haagen-Dazs? Five crystals for a container! The autumn is coming.”","Fang Qi opened the container and scooped a spoonful of ice cream into his mouth. While glancing at the calendar, he said, “They are only available for one more week! You won’t have a chance to try this in one week!”","After all, they were only available in the summer!","Ruan Ning and the other girls looked confused.","Tao Kun and the others looked at him questioningly as well.","What is the shop owner doing?! Enemies came to beat you at your shop, and you’re still selling snacks?!","Standing behind them, Zou Mo’s face twitched.","“Do you know about his cultivation strength!?” Ruan Ning said anxiously, “Divine Ocean Realm! Divine Ocean Realm!”","Outside the door, bloody murderous spirit surged up. Qin Honglin stood with his hands clasped behind his back, and he looked extremely calm despite the great fury in his heart. He forced a stiff smile on his old face as he said, “Kid, you’re the first one who can stay calm when my Red Forest Pharmacy pays a visit.”","He continued with a sneer, “I wonder if you can stay calm when I suck the marrow from your bones.”","“Wait a minute!” Fang Qi glanced at the computer screen and picked up the virtual reality headset. “Xiaoyue, you can’t pull the monsters this way! You’ll get both of us killed like that! I’ll teach you how to draw them out...”","One minute later, Fang Qi turned the chair and ate a mouthful of Haagen-Dazs before looking up. “Okay! What did you just say?!”","All the people gaped at Fang Qi in silence.","Qin Honglin’s face twitched rapidly as he said, “You are seeking death! Die!”","All the people immediately took out their spiritual artifacts, and overwhelming spiritual essence surged up in the shop. At the same time, a depressing murderous spirit permeated the air.","Countless distorted and gloomy ghosts crawled out from the spiritual artifacts!","Instantly, the whole shop seemed to have sunken into the demon realm with all kinds of demonic creatures crawling and flashing around!","Xi Yue pulled the other girls back in a hurry, and she said with a pale face. “Back off! Back off!”","He’s finished! Ruan Ning’s heart fell. How can this kid seek death this way?","Among the shrills of the countless horrifying ghosts and demons, a mild and impatient voice sounded, “Damn it. Someone is making trouble!”","Then, all the people saw a scene that they could never forget!","Instantly, many lightning bolts flashed in the crowd without warning! It was abrupt and sudden!","The moment that the lightning bolts flashed in the area, even Divine Ocean Realm cultivators such as Qin Honglin couldn’t defend against them!","With loud crackling sounds, the lightning bolts filled the space!","While the lightning flashed, all the people, didn’t matter their gender and age, jumped and spasmed as if they were dancing!","Then, they all dropped to the ground!","Fang Qi looked sulky. “It’s troublesome to break so many legs and destroy all their cultivation strengths... can anyone help me?”","The whole shop was silent!","Except for the heartbeats, there were no other sounds, not even the sounds of breathing!","A long while later, people heard a hard-gulping sound.","“They’re finished!” Tao Kun said, “From now on, the Red Forest Pharmacy is totally gone!”","Huang Shan’s inner shirt was soaked! What had he been thinking?! Fortunately, he had just thought about it and didn’t put it into action, otherwise...","Meanwhile, Ruan Ning, Xi Yue, and the other two girls couldn’t believe their eyes. “Did this really happen...”","“What do you think, Girls?”","“Do you think I would dare to open a shop in such a place without enough strength?” Fang Qi looked at the people of the Red Forest Pharmacy who were lying on the ground and complained, “Little Mo, I’ll teach you the Saint Spirit Sword Technique later, so you can do the chores such as breaking legs and destroying cultivation strength. Damn it... my previous life was more peaceful!”","Then, he waved his hand at the people in the shop. “It’s all over; don’t worry.”","A drop of cold sweat slid down Tao Kun’s forehead while he thought, I should never mess with this shop!","...","After he dumped out all the bodies, he said, “Little Mo, help clean up the place. They stained the ground.”","“Oh... Okay!” Zou Mo was still dazed and couldn’t adjust to what happened.","Then, Fang Qi asked, “Ms. Ruan, do you know where the Red Forest Pharmacy is?”","“What do you want to do?” Ruan Ning stared at Fang Qi warily as if he were as a stranger.","“I want to smash their shop.” Fang Qi said righteously, “These forces all like smashing other peoples’ shops, and I must follow the trend. Otherwise, I will look out-dated and lame. Then, what can do I if no one wants to join my guild!”","“I’ll join! I’ll join your guild, okay?” Ruan Ning almost had tears on her face.","“Join... the guild?” Huang Shan froze.","“Brother Huang, if you are interested, you can try it,” Tao Kun whispered.","Huang Shan said, “I have family and business out of the city. It... it’s not suitable for us.”","“We’ll join too!” Su Zhi said, “Does it mean that you will take us to the Skeleton Cave to get good items? And after joining your guild, can we can play two more hours today?”","In one instant, three girls joined Fang Qi’s guild!","“Do you have any conditions for joining the guild? Are there any punishments for leaving? What are the rules of your guild?” Xi Yue was more cautious.","“Ugh...” Fang Qi froze. “We’ll talk about it later.”","Then, he used a sword spell, and his sword flew to his feet before splitting into four. Fang Qi stepped onto one of the swords and said, “Now, as the Guild President, I declare that the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild is out for battle! Old Driver is leading the way! Get onboard fast!”","[TL Note: Old Driver is an internet slang in China describing someone who has experience with something, even though it refers to sexual activity in most cases.]","“Sir, we can fly like this?!” Ruan Ning stepped onto a sword carefully.","Feeling uneasy, Su Zhi and her sister also stepped onto the swords.","Xi Yue pointed her slim long finger at herself and then at the others in bafflement.","“I won’t take anyone on the flight who isn’t a member of my guild. You can fly yourselves or just stay here.”","Zou Mo said, “Boss, I...”","“You keep an eye on the shop!” Fang Qi said, “I will be back soon!”","He picked up Qin Honglin and asked, “Where’s the Red Forest Pharmacy?”","Ruan Ning immediately pointed the direction.","“Ahh!”","With a wave of gasps, the swords flew up swiftly!","Before the Red Forest Pharmacy, a figure dropped to the ground face down first!","“Who?!” Alarmed, quite a few customers in the shop moved away.","Some shop clerks walked out in surprise, and their faces turned ashen when they recognized the fallen figure. “Big... Big Boss?!”","At this moment, all their hearts dropped to their stomachs!","Fang Qi took out the rocket launcher with unlimited rockets from his storage spiritual artifact.","Fang Qi pointed his index and middle finger forward and injected a trace of spiritual essence into the rocket launcher, saying, “Go!”","“Swoosh!”","Like a blurry sharp sword, a rocket instantly shot out and broke the spiritual light protective sphere around the shop!","Boom!","A loud explosion sounded!","Fang Qi yelled, “The Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild is here to smash the shop! All the people not involved in this should back off!”","All the customers were stupefied!","They wanted to laugh, but none of them could when they saw Qin Honglin lying on the ground in front of the shop.","Fang Qi shrugged and said to his companions, “Misses, please help me, or it will take me, the Guild President, a long time to completely smash it!”","The three girls didn’t know how to respond.","“Smash!”","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","Rocket missiles shot out one after another!"]},{"number":248,"title":"Chapter 248 - Who Else?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s happening?!”","Exclamations sounded from the shop while beams of fiery light shot into it, creating earth-shaking explosions. Without the spiritual light protective sphere, the bricks used to build the shop were fragile before Fang Qi’s sword control technique and unlimited rockets. Soon, the shop collapsed, and the clerks who were still in the shop at this moment scrambled out of it with screams!","The customers who had run out of the shop watched the upheaval and talked among themselves animatedly.","“Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild? How come I’ve never heard of it before?”","“This is outrageous! They just came here to smash the shop?!”","“Outrageous?” Some people pointed at the half-dead Qin Honglin and said, “Look! That’s the Big Boss of the Red Forest Pharmacy!”","“Isn’t he a grand cultivator of the Divine Ocean Realm?! How come he’s in such a state?!” Many people gasped in shock!","Half City was indeed not peaceful sometimes, but if a Divine Ocean Realm cultivator died here so easily, no one would dare to enter this city again!","In the past, when conflicts broke up in this city, only the small figures died, and the high-level cultivators never worried about their safety.","Even if Divine Ocean Realm cultivators fought each other and caused an upheaval, the people in the inner city would come out and intervene, which was why no Divine Ocean Realm cultivator had died in the past dozens of years!","But now, this Divine Ocean Realm old demon before them was turned into a wastrel even if he could live!","“What’s the background of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?!”","“A Divine Ocean Realm cultivator was crushed!”","“He was more than crushed!” A passerby said, “Don’t you see the dominating expressions on the faces of that Guild President and his companions? They seem to be at ease. Obviously, it was a piece of cake for them to beat this old demon!”","It must be noted that when two Divine Ocean Realm cultivators fought with each other, even the winner would lose a lot of qi and wouldn’t have the energy to smash the opponent’s home base!","Under Fang Qi’s bombing, the whole shop collapsed completely. In addition, as his rockets exploded and dug into the soil, a basement deep into the ground was revealed!","At this moment, the luxuriously decorated shop was turned into a huge crater!","However, the protection of the basement was obviously more solid than the shop’s. Fang Qi shot out two rockets, and the outer wall of the basement emitted a wave of blood light. The sticky blood on the wall swallowed the explosions completely! The basement was still intact!","“Ugh...” The girls looked at each other and asked, “Sir, what shall we do?”","The people watching the scene chattered among themselves as well. “This must be that old devil’s core secret!”","“It is probably the blood elixir room in the rumors!”","“I wonder how many human elixir pills this old demon has created. But he always did it in secret and never revealed the location of the blood elixir room to anyone.”","“Could it be that this is the place?!”","Boom!","At this moment, a huge noise came underground!","The ground shook as if a huge hammer was smashing it!","“What’s happening?!”","Then, another huge noise came from the underground!","“There’s something under the ground?”","With huge hammering noises, something seemed to be struggling out of the ground, trying to break free!","Suddenly horrified, the people watching the scene wondered what was the thing that could cause such a huge upheaval and create such shaking of the ground when it was inside the spiritual light protective sphere.","Underground, something seemed to have shatter!","All the people saw that blood oozed out from the ground and appeared at the location of the shop in silence.","They retreated quickly in horror. “What the heck is this?!”","“Did the old devil keep some monster underground?!”","The ground seemed to crack, and blood continued to ooze out. Suddenly, the outer wall that Fang Qi had attacked using rockets broke down!","Sticky blood oozed out like snakes and gradually filled the crater beneath the Red Forest Pharmacy. It was blood but made people feel like it was alive! Although it had no eyes, the people who looked at it felt like they were stared at by tens of thousands of evil eyes, and a creepy sensation rose in their minds!","At this moment, Qin Honglin, who lay on the ground half-dead, sneered, “You destroyed my cultivation, but you will all die since you released the Hell Blood Demon that I imprisoned underground!”","Meanwhile, blood surged up like a huge flood!","Countless cultivators who had been watching the scene fled with screams!","“What is this thing?!” Fang Qi took out a cigarette from the cigarette box and lit it with a lighter before sucking on it deeply. “Hey, I feel like counterfeits are running loose here. You dare to call this thing the Hell Blood Demon? Are none of you afraid of death?”","A sword light shot into the sky with a crisp sword cry, and this crisp sound resonated in the area!","Instantly, huge winds blew, and clouds tumbled in the sky!","The gloomy sky turned even darker at this moment.","Fang Qi jumped off his sword and stood in mid-air as he casted the sword spell with his hands. At the same time, he moved seven steps in the sky following the pattern of the seven stars forming the Big Dipper.","He chanted, “Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword!”","In the sky, the dark clouds surged, and thunder rumbled. Lightning bolts flashed around the edge of the dark clouds, turning the area into a chilling world!","Seeing this scene, all the people gaped in horror as if they sensed the ancient fear hidden in their bloodline and instinct!","It was a boundless fear that tiny humans had toward the vast heaven and earth!","In the thick dark clouds gradually appeared a huge vortex!","It looked like a portal connecting to the Hell, hanging upside-down in the sky.","Like a heavenly demon who opened its mouth and wanted to swallow the world, it seemed terrifying.","Under the unrivaled heavenly power, the surging blood in the Red Forest Pharmacy now looked as tiny as a grain of sand in the ocean!","In the sky, countless lightning bolts condensed in the center of the vortex!","Finally, the ultimate sword energy that was brewed in the vortex was born, and it struck down while being engulfed by a thick lightning bolt!","Under the dark clouds, a lightning tree connecting the heaven and the earth seemed to grow in the Half City!","In the next moment, it seemed like the whole world turned into a permanent white!","Countless shrills sounded in the blood!","Many resentful souls imprisoned inside this blood demon howled and struggled out before turning into nothingness in the lightning bolt.","Thick and stinky black smoke rose, and the surging blood river shrunk into nothing but white bones!","Fang Qi sucked on the cigarette and glanced around. “I just asked who else?!”","Looking at the ruined Red Forest Pharmacy and the Hell Blood Demon who had turned into dust, all the people backed off hundreds of meters in silence."]},{"number":249,"title":"Chapter 249 - The Reputation Is Established","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I haven’t finished my cigarette yet...” Fang Qi sucked on the cigarette in pity. “It’s such a short battle!”","While blowing out smoke, he glanced around, and the girls who were still stunned by the scene backed away from him in a group.","“Stay away! I must make sure that you are not an old demon who used some evil method to regain your youth!” Ruan Ning was getting anxious.","Are you kidding me? You can’t reach this realm even if you began cultivating before you were in your mom’s belly!","Even though that Hell Blood Demon had just gotten out of imprisonment and was weak since it couldn’t use its full force, it wasn’t something that everyone could handle!","The only explanation was that this Guild President who looked to be in his twenties was actually an old demon who was hundreds of years old!","Some people in this city are like this! They are old, and they are perverts! With this thought, Ruan Ning was even more at unease!","Fang Qi reminded her of some old pervert in the inner city who was infamous all over the place, and she automatically categorized Fang Qi into this group!","“Ugh...” Fang Qi said, “I won’t go near you then.”","“Ahh! Why are we getting close to this guy?!” The three girls almost hugged each other and screamed. Looking down, they found themselves still standing on the swords in the sky.","The swords flew over to Fang Qi themselves!","“What do you want!?” The three girls were afraid that he was a man-eating monster!","Fang Qi flicked his finger on their foreheads. “Don’t you recognize your Guild President?! What old demon?! If you keep calling me this name, I’ll throw all three of you down! How can I create a guild if I’m weak?”","The three girls fell silent.","“You really are not?!” Su Zhi’s bright eyes blinked as she studied him closely. “Then, are you a super genius from a powerful hermit faction?!”","“Cough! This...” The talentless and shameless shop owner looked embarrassed. “Miss, have you read too many novels.”","Ruan Ning said in a low voice, “He must be an old demon who regained youth. Think about it; who would admit this to others?”","Su Zhi and Su Yao nodded in agreement, and the admiration that they had just felt disappeared. They moved away subconsciously; they were at the tips of the swords, and they moved to the handles of the swords.","Hearing their whispers, Fang Qi was puzzled. How come it turned out this way?","I’m still young! My physical age is less than 20 and my mental age is less than 30! How can you call me an old demon?! Why are you staring at me as if I am a pervert?!","“Okay! Let’s go back and talk about the guild rules!” exasperated, Mr. Fang said with a dark face.","...","Anyway, the Red Forest Pharmacy’s destruction was a major incident in the outer city!","During the night, almost all the forces were asking about which force had destroyed the Red Forest Pharmacy.","Overnight, the name of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild spread all over the city! All the people knew that this newly established force with the weird name had emerged and was on the rise!","Even though it was new, it wasn’t a force that anyone could afford to mess with!","– In a branch of Black Demon –","Iron Heart Demon sat on a wide chair covered by animal fur and stared at the bald cultivator in front of him. “Are you telling me that you found the force that killed Li Huangquan?”","“Yes...” The bald cultivator wanted to continue but was interrupted by Iron Heart Demon. “Lead the way!”","He grabbed the black cloak by his seat and draped it around his shoulders, ready to go out!","“But... But...” The bald cultivator looked very nervous.","“Why are you stalling?!” Iron Heart Demon snorted and kicked the bald cultivator to the ground. “Lead the way immediately!”","“Yes...”","Before they walked out of the door, a cultivator in a grey cotton robe walked in.","“Wang Jin?” Iron Heart Demon said in a cold voice, “I didn’t give you permission to come in!”","“I came with a message from Black Demon Big Boss.” The grey-robed cultivator said, “Iron Heart Demon, stay in seclusion cultivation for one month, and you can’t come out of seclusion without the approval of Black Demon Big Boss!”","Then, he turned and left.","“What is the meaning of this?!” Iron Heart Demon was furious. “You damn better explain yourself!”","“If you have questions, bring your questions to Black Demon Big Boss.” The grey-robbed cultivator said, “I’m only a messenger.”","“Damn it!” Iron Heart Demon smashed his fist onto the doorframe!","This incident even drew the attention of the people living in the inner city.","“The Red Forest Pharmacy was completely taken out in one night? Qin Honglin had his cultivation strength destroyed, and no one knows if he’s dead or alive? He seemed to have been cut into pieces by angry enemies?” A middle-aged man read the intelligence report in his hand with a serious expression. “If my memory is right, this Qin Honglin was a Divine Ocean Realm cultivator, right?”","“Yes, Father.” Xi Yue wore a green blouse and a white silk long skirt and had her pretty black hair pulled up in a bun which was decorated with an exquisite hairpin. This hairpin was in the shape of a flying phoenix, and it accentuated her aristocratic presence.","“I was invited by a friend and happened to witness the incident on site.”","The problem was that even though it was easy to find out how Qin Honglin was destroyed, few were willing to believe it.","“You mean...” The middle-aged man asked with a serious expression, “That shop has a grand master behind it, and this grand master instantly destroyed Qin Honglin while the latter showed no ability to defend?”","“Is it possible that he used some mechanism or a powerful spiritual treasure?” The middle-aged man asked suspiciously.","“It is possible.” Xi Yue said, “However, it still shows that a powerful force is behind this shop owner, and this shop seems to be only a branch.”","“A branch?” Xi Chenzhou looked baffled.","“It’s a branch.” Xi Yue nodded and said, “It seems that the main shop is in a place called Jiuhua City in Dajin...”","“In fact, I’ve never heard of this city before, but it doesn’t seem to be a small country since this shop has more than one customer in the Divine Ocean Realm.”","“What’s the business of the shop?” As an executive of the Coiled Dragon Office, Xi Chenzhou must know everything about the major forces.","“Ugh...” Soon, Xi Yue told Xi Chenzhou about the game in the shop.","“Hack chickens? Rob people? One can gain cultivation strength?” Xi Chenzhou looked confused.","Xi Yue could only continue explaining.","“Treasure hunting? Adventure? Dropping items?!”","What the heck are those?","Xi Chenzhou could understand nothing but the growth of cultivation strength. “When I finish the business at hand, take me to the shop!”","“Okay! By the way,” Xi Yue thought of another thing and asked, “Can I join that Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?”","“Join what?” Xi Chenzhou thought his ears were playing tricks on him.","You don’t want to stay in the grand Coiled Dragon Office and want to join the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?!","“Yeah...” Xi Yue felt uncomfortable with this topic. Despite the embarrassing name, her friends had all joined it, and she would feel humiliated if she wore rags while her friends were all high levels and wore ultimate items!"]},{"number":250,"title":"Chapter 250 - The battle in the Newbie Village","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the next day, the membership came out. Since it was only an improvement on the shop’s business after Fang Qi opened the new shop instead of a task, he didn’t have to spend much energy on it. According to the rules, any customers who spent more than 800 crystals in the shop could get a membership for free.","Of course, the new customers could deposit 800 crystals in the shop and became a member as well.","In the early morning, Mr. Fang prepared a bowl of instant noodles and watched Zou Mo practice the Saint Spirit Sword Technique.","“800 Crystals?!” Ruan Ning desperately wanted to play the game, but she only came over to have a look to satisfy her eyes since she had her shop to manage during the day.","Right now, the same token of the Dragon-Slaying Saber hung at the door of her shop as well, and it was a dashing sight.","The moment that she saw the condition for the membership, her eyes almost jumped out of their sockets. “So expensive! President, do we have discounts as guild members?”","Fang Qi said in pity, “Sorry, no discount!”","Ruan Ning was furious that the membership needed 800 crystals, and she enjoyed no discount as a guild member!","How is this reasonable? she thought to herself.","– Meanwhile in the Jiuhua City Shop –","Song Qingfeng and others walked into the shop and saw a line of words in pretty handwriting on the small blackboard.","“Anyone who spent more than 800 crystals can have a free membership?!”","The members could have two extra hours of playtime, and the players with trial membership could upgrade it and enjoy two more hours of playtime a day!","They would have ten hours of playtime, which was almost twice of the previous six hours limit!","The application process was quite simple; they only needed to sign their names on the card made with special materials, and they would have extra hours of playtime.","Song Qingfeng’s spending had far surpassed 800 crystals. Now with this black card in his hand after the application process, he could play for ten hours each day! He was elated!","Meanwhile, Tao Kun and Huang Shan came into the shop with a large group of people and saw the announcement on the small blackboard as well.","To have two more hours of playtime, they had to deposit 800 crystals. It was fine for themselves, but they had a large group of people with them. If each of them paid 800 crystals, they would have to deposit tens of thousands of crystals in the shop! For now, they didn’t dare to do it!","Even though they had witnessed the power of the shop yesterday, it was still a new force after all, and they felt like its foundation wasn’t solid enough.","“Ugh... Brother Tao, what do you think?” Huang Shan asked immediately.","Tao Kun looked toward a middle-aged cultivator. This man was wearing a deep-blue robe, and he had a wide and full forehead.","“I’ll try it first. If it is indeed as great as what the Second Master said, I think each of the elite members of our Yuanheng Pavilion deserves to have this membership!” Tang Yuan was the First Master of Yuanheng Pavilion. After hearing about the destruction of the Red Forest Pharmacy and Tao Kun’s account about this shop, he decided to come with them to see how powerful this shop was in person.","Huang Shan’s face twitched as he thought, They sure are rich! They can afford to deposit tens of thousands of crystals in this shop!","Seeing the people behind them just standing there, Tao Kun scolded them, “Why are you still standing there?! Go and help First Master with leveling up!”","“Oh... yeah!” The people who came with them finally snapped out of the daze.","Then, Tao Kun walked to the counter and paid while cupping hands at Fang Qi. “Mr. Fang, with so many of us buying memberships, can we have a discount?”","“Sorry, but there’s no discount.” Fang Qi told them that there was no discount, even if they came in groups.","Tao Kun looked sulky. “Mr. Fang, that’s not a decent way of doing business!”","Fang Qi pointed at the words on the blackboard.","[Play if you want, but get out otherwise.]","“...”","“How long will it take before I spend 800 crystals?!” Ruan Ning complained, “It’s better to keep the money to myself than to deposit it in your stop. What if you run with the money? My cultivation strength is lower, and I’m no match for you! If that happens, all my savings will be gone!”","At this moment, the instant noodles were ready, and Fang Qi opened the lid.","“What is that?! It smells so good!” Ruan Ning sniffed and exclaimed, “What are you eating?!”","“Instant noodles.” Fang Qi opened a box of spicy sticks. The two different aromas of instant noodles and spicy sticks drifted to Ruan Ning nose, and she couldn’t bear it anymore. “I’m a guild member; can you share some food with me?”","“Only one stick,” Fang Qi said, “If you want more, you must buy them!”","“Stingy!” Despite her complaint, Ruan Ning quickly picked up one strip.","Fang Qi beckoned at Little Mo and told him to have a couple of spicy sticks.","“How can it be so delicious?!” While chewing the spicy stick that had a special spicy flavor, Ruan Ning almost screamed in appreciation!","“How much is one box?!”","“15 crystals!” Fang Qi mumbled with the instant noodles in his mouth.","“I’ll take one box!” Ruan Ning gritted her teeth. “And a bowl of instant noodles!”","“Do you want a sausage?” Fang Qi picked up the sausage in his bowl and bit into it.","“How much altogether?!”","“21 crystals.”","Ruan Ning suddenly felt like 800 crystals wouldn’t last long here.","“What’s this delicious aroma?!” At this moment, Tao Kun, Huang Shan, and the people who came with them were also tempted. “Sir! We’ll each take a box and a bowl as well!”","Soon, the aromas of instant noodles and spicy sticks permeated the entire internet cafe!","“Ahh! It smells so good!”","“So delicious!”","“Tsk! Tsk! The food can even purify the spiritual essence in the bodies! How can such good stuff exist?!”","...","After eating instant noodles, Fang Qi went online and resumed playing the Legend of Mir 2.","At this moment, about 70 people stood neatly in front of the newbie village. Except for a few who had iron swords or black wood swords, most of them had wooden swords, and all of them had cotton clothes.","“Brother Huang!” Tao Kun looked serious with a small smudge of instant noodle grease on the corner of his mouth. “Where is that Jiuhua Army that killed you yesterday? They claimed that they will kill anyone from our Morning Star Sea Realm! I want to see how they will do that!”","In the middle of the group was a middle-aged man who was wearing cotton clothes with a small wooden sword in his hand; his ID was Yuanheng. He said, “As you said, I can increase cultivation strength by killing monsters here! I tried it and found that the effects are very good! No one knows if there are hidden treasures in this world and where they are at. It means that we must establish our force in this world as soon as possible!”","“This way, we can increase our strengths faster!”","“Since those people claimed that they will kill all the people from our Morning Star Sea Realm, we must give them a taste of our strength!” He raised his small wooden sword and yelled, “Kill! Kill all the people who are a part of that Jiuhua Army! Don’t let any of them go!”","“Ugh... First Master, then what shall we do now?” Tao Kun asked.","“Send a few elites and take me to kill the rake cats!” Tang Yuan said in his resonant voice."]},{"number":251,"title":"Chapter 251 - Tipping Point","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Shop expansion was almost the default task in Fang Qi’s System Interface.","The target for this task: A full house.","Fang Qi glanced at the data and found that the average computer utilization rate was 70% and barely reached a full house at peak hours in Jiuhua City’s Shop. In Half City’s Shop that had a little more than 100 computers, there were only about 60 to 70 customers, which meant that the utilization rate was only a little bit better than 50%","It seems that I don’t have to worry about the issue of shop expansion in the short term, Fang Qi thought. Of course, he didn’t know how naïve his thoughts were.","...","The number of the players of the Legend of Mir 2 grew gradually. For example, the disciples of Shengjing Academy and Xiyi Academy were suppressed in the old games by the disciples of Lingyun Academy, and they thought that the new game might give them a chance to turn the tides around.","In the new game, everyone was on the same starting line, and they didn’t have to worry about being at a disadvantage!","They showed more interest in the new game than the old players and had begun playing it on the first day. Moreover, they had more luck than Gong He, who was killed by others viciously and dropped his items while he was at a low level.","Also, they had discovered the pattern and uniqueness of this game while they played. Despite the greater speed of cultivation strength growth in this game compared with the single-player games, they had to fight with others over monsters and make money, which slowed down their speed of growth to the same level as the single-player games.","“Royal Sister...” The Second Prince was now a little warrior who was wearing sky blue light armor. The members of Royal Team were among the earliest players, and they were all above level 10 by now since they didn’t encounter other malicious players.","Ji Wu also chose the profession of warrior, and they were now fighting monsters and leveling up in the Viper Valley. Led by the royal masters, Ji Wu’s level got close to average and reached level 10.","In the early stage of the game when everyone was an ordinary person, the warriors had an advantage of knowing some combat techniques, and some players also knew close-range combat skills and could use it in the game. It was why the warriors had the least worry about money among all three professions in the early stage of the game.","Despite all this, they still found that they were short in funds.","The only reason that they had money to buy potions and fight more powerful monsters was that a few of them went hunting yesterday and got a lot of animal meat. Obviously, they desperately needed money.","What could they do now? Go hunting? Since their levels were much higher than the animals, they didn’t get that many experience points from killing them.","To rob others? As the majestic Royal Family of Dajin, they couldn’t lower themselves to become bandits.","“Maybe... we can go and buy some coins with crystals?” Royal Princess Ji Yu lifted her exquisite chin while pondering, and this idea dawned on her.","“The problem is that everyone needs money to buy potions and kill more powerful monsters to level up. Who will sell coins to us?!” The Second Prince didn’t think this method was plausible since none of the players in the new game were poor.","The ones who were short on money would play the old games and see if the new game was worth the money.","Ji Wu said thoughtfully, “I’ll summon a few teams of guards from the Royal Palace.”","Ji Wu had discovered the difference between the new game and the old ones. In other games, only the old players could help the new ones gain levels quickly, but in this game, the new players could help the old players!","Since everyone is trying their best to level up and increase their strength and thus have no gold coins to sell to us, we can bring new people into the game and get them to earn money for us!","After having a group of people earning money for us to buy stuff to kill monsters, we don’t need to worry about having no money in the game!","Right now, Ji Wu’s idea was different from people like Huang Shan but was just as effective!","As long as they had money in the game, their speed of strength growth would be greater than everyone else.","Increasing their strength in this world quickly wasn’t just for the short-term gains and profit.","For example, he had had no interest in the TV series, Wind and Cloud, since the characters in it were only on the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm. If he had stopped watching, he wouldn’t know that there would be the sword technique, Sword 23, in the later episodes!","He could catch up with the TV series later on, but all the players were in the same world in this game. The strong ones would get stronger while the weak ones would be suppressed!","To ensure their future advantage over others, he must be prepared.","“But... Father, isn’t it overkill to summon your guard teams to earn gold coins in the game?” the Second Prince said, “They are the most elite warriors of our Dajin...”","“Let our guards do it then,” Royal Princess Ji Yu said, “Father’s guards are elites; wouldn’t it be better to use them to explore high-level maps?”","“Good point!” Ji Wu’s warrior character stroked his non-existent beard in the game and nodded after a short pause.","...","The Royal Gold Hunting Team wouldn’t come until dozens of minutes later.","Meanwhile, the united army of the Yuanheng Pavilion and the Huang Family, which had about 60 to 70 players, began a detailed, wide-range search outside the newbie village while killing monsters and leveling up.","For better communication, people like Tang Yuan, Tao Kun, and Huang Shan established a chatroom for the Yuan Huang United Army in QQ.","In the chatroom was a channel named ‘Exterminate the Jiuhua Army’. In the channel, there were ten players with the prefix of ‘Huang’ in their names, and the rest of the 50 plus players’ names began with the prefix of ‘Yuanheng’. Their names were neatly placed in order.","– In Jiuhua City –","Gong He was very proud over the big victory against the people from the Morning Star Sea Realm yesterday.","However, Wang Qiang was in a different situation. He was sneak-attacked by four girls, and a lot of his items dropped. Although he went to Red Name Village, he had a few good friends left in the newbie village.","In the chatroom of the Jiuhua Army, Wang Qiang was talking with his buddies in the channel called ‘Jiuhua Elites’, “Keep an eye on them for me, especially the girl named ‘Condense Frost’ among those four girls! They dared to sneak-attack me!”","“Got it! We have about eight people here! We’ll get them if they dare to come!”","Meanwhile, a disciple from the Huang Family glanced at the guys who were killing spiders. Those guys look familiar...","“Are they the guys who blocked us yesterday?”","In the ‘Exterminate the Jiuhua Army’ channel, someone yelled, “I found the Jiuhua Army! They are here!”","“Where?!”","“How many?!”","“Seven to eight!”","“Don’t alert them!” Tao Kun said, “I’ll bring people and surround them!”","About ten minutes later, about eight members of Jiuhua Army lay on the ground, surrounded by about 30 players of the Yuanheng Pavilion.","Two members of the Huang Family walked over and spat while they said, “Yuck! You’re so weak! You dare to claim that you’d kill us whenever you see us?!”","“F*ck! Don’t run if you dare!”","“Run?” Tao Kun sneered. “Your granddaddy will wait for you here! You can summon all your people here if you dare!”","Someone yelled in the ‘Jiuhua Elites’ channel, “How many of us are here? Come and gather at Viper Valley! We were killed by people from the Morning Star Sea Realm!”","“How many do they have?”","“About 20 to 30! They claimed that they will wait for us here and told us to summon people!”","“Outrageous! Really outrageous!” Gong He heard the conversation and roared in fury, “Gather everyone at the entrance of the village! Send messages to the brothers who aren’t online and summon them!","“They only have about 30 people and dare to taunt us?! If we don’t kill them and bury them today, I, Gong He, will quit my job and go back to my hometown to become a farmer!”"]},{"number":252,"title":"Chapter 252 - The War Escalate","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Yesterday, Tao Kun and the elites of Yuanheng Pavilion had practiced for a long time to level up in preparation for this moment!","The best way to obtain a solid footing in a new place was killing the powerful people to gain respect!","It would be hard to do if no one targeted them. Now that someone messed with them and swore to kill all the people from the Morning Star Sea Realm, he could take this opportunity to establish his dominance.","Besides, the so-called Jiuhua Army looked to be a joint force of warriors and cultivators, which made it a weak force in his eyes.","In contrast, the elite soldiers in Half City were all cultivators!","That was why he was confident in choosing the Jiuhua Army as his stepping stone to establish his reputation!","After all, in the eyes of many cultivators, they were always superior to warriors!","“Cultivators of Yuanheng Pavilion and the Huang Family, come to the empty ground near Viper Valley!” Yuanheng yelled in the chatroom for the Yuan Huang United Army, “Today, we must beat them senseless and show them the power of our Morning Star Sea Realm!”","At this moment, except for those who were in Red Name Village, there were about 50 to 60 Jiuhua guards gathering at the entrance of the village.","Gong He yelled, “Guys! Those bumpkins of the Morning Star Sea Realm are stepping over the line! They robbed our resources and killed eight brothers who were leveling up outside! Can we stand by and watch them do this?!”","“Never!”","“Kill!”","“What’s the slogan of our army?!” Gong He yelled.","“Powerful Jiuhua Army! Unite as One!”","“Kill!” Gong He pointed his iron sword toward the direction of Viper Valley. “Today, we must slaughter them all and offer them as sacrifice to the flag of our Jiuhua Army!”","Under Gong He’s command, they charged at the direction of Viper Valley in neat lines with warriors in the front, Taoists in the middle, and the wizards taking the end.","...","Near the Viper Valley, the Yuan Huang United Army had cleaned up the nearby monsters.","Yuanheng said solemnly, “Brother Huang, we must unite and centralize command; I hope people from the Huang Family can coordinate with us.”","[TL Note: Yuanheng is the ID for Tang Yuan, the First Master of the Yuanheng Pavilion.]","“Of course!” Huang Shan immediately yelled in the channel in the QQ chatroom, “All the members of the Huang Family who are near the Viper Valley, take orders from Yuanheng Pavilion!”","Tao Kun nodded in satisfaction. “People from the Huang Family, go to the left side and form up!”","“Here they come!” The people from the Yuanheng Pavilion had discovered the benefits of the channels inside the QQ chatrooms. If they yelled in the game, they probably couldn’t be heard even if their throats got sore. But in the channel in the QQ chatroom, everyone could clearly hear the orders from Tang Yuan and Tao Kun under the Command Mode!","“They are 100 steps away from the range of our fireball spell!”","“50 steps!” Tao Kun yelled, “All wizards get the fireball spell ready! Taoists, retreat!”","...","On the other side, Gong He, the commander of Jiuhua Army, yelled, “We’ll soon enter the casting range of the fireball spell! Taoists, get the healing techniques ready! Warriors, charge from the two sides! Wizards, cover them with the fireball spell!”","About 20 warriors split to the sides while the two parties threw fireballs at each other one after another as if the fireballs were free. Many magic light dots scattered in the area, and the flying fireballs looked like shooting stars!","“Taoists! Heal!” the commanders of both parties yelled.","Different from the original game, drinking potions during a battle in the System’s version of the game would distract the players. It was much easier for fireballs to hit them in the chest, and it would be troublesome if the potion bottle got knocked into their mouths and stuck in their throats.","Therefore, the Taoists’ healing techniques were the best choice!","Many wounded warriors and wizards emitted bright lights while their wounds healed slowly.","...","“Warriors, charge into the group and kill those two guys in the middle who are issuing orders! Kill them for me!” This was from the commander of the Jiuhua Army.","...","“Wizards, get closer to them. Concentrate your attack on the fat guy in the middle of the group!” This was from the commander of the Yuan Huang United Army.","...","Instantly, the two parties began fighting at close range!","“Taoists, move ahead and help the wizards!”","“Warriors! Kill the wizard! Kill the wizard now!”","“Charge! Everyone!”","“Damn it! Want to fight us?! Let’s see who has more people!”","In the chaos, Yuanheng was stabbed. “Damn it! Who stabbed me?!”","Gong He fumed. “F*ck! Who threw the fireball at me?!”","It was turmoil!","-Three minutes later-","“Brothers who respawned at the village, hurry up and come to help us! Help!”","– Five minutes later –","“Where are the people from the respawn spot?!”","The elites reported, “We are fighting on the way there.”","The commanders of both armies scratched their heads since no such case would happen in real life. After some consideration, they yelled, “Pull the battle toward the respawn spot! Pull the frontline over!”","“The people who got killed, quickly respawn now! Don’t take the main gate! Be careful of the Big-Sabered Guard!”","...","On the way to the Viper Valley, disciples of Cloud Ocean Faction, including Ye Xiaoye, had just come out of the newbie village.","“Aren’t they cultivators from the Morning Star Sea Realm? They seem to be weak wizards!” Some Jiuhua guards pointed at the disciples of Cloud Ocean Faction who had just come out of the village and rushed up, hacking at them with vicious force!","“What are you doing? Why are you killing us?!” The disciples of Cloud Ocean Faction fell to the ground instantly.","They were sulky and cussed in their heads when they came out from the respawn spot.","“Are the three of them a part of Jiuhua Army? I’ve never seen them before!” Some cultivators from the Morning Star Sea Realm saw them and threw fireballs at them.","The three of them died again!","“F*ck you! Are you mad?!” Yun Lian exploded in fury instantly. “Kill those b*stards!”","At this moment, the royal guards who had come here to earn gold coins also walked out of the newbie village.","“More people?!”","Both armies were too into the war, and their eyes were all red with murderous spirit. “Whoever they are, just kill them!”","...","At this moment, Ji Wu and the others were killing vipers in the Viper Valley.","“They should be here now, right?” Ji Yu checked the time.","“Let me see.” Ji Wu put down the virtual reality headset and looked at his communication jade. “They are here. They are getting ready to level up.”","However, if only he knew what was happening around the newbie village...","– Outside of the newbie village –","“Who are you?! You dare to kill royal guards?!”","“Royal your mom!” Dizzy with fighting, the wizards of the Yuan Huang United Army each threw a fireball at the royal guards.","“You’re seeking death!” The royal guards who had just come out of the newbie village were furious. “Kill!”","...","– The Red Name Village –","The most vicious and ferocious figures of the Jiuhua Army and Yuan Huang United Army were all sent here.","“What’s the situation in the newbie village?! Report to me! I’m in the Red Name Village!” Yuanheng yelled in the QQ chatroom channel.","Likewise, Jiuhua Army Commander Gong He yelled, “I’m killing these b*stards in the Red Name Village. Brothers in newbie village, command and coordinate well! Try to send the rest of the b*stards here!”","– Meanwhile in the newbie village –","A player from Xiyi Academy yelled, “F*ck! Who killed me?! Was it you?!”","Another wave of wild hackings occurred.","The royal guard shouted, “Who killed us? Are you seeking your deaths?! Damn it! You won’t stop?! Ahh!”","They were killed and dropped their items.","After respawning, they hacked at each other wildly!","“Sob... All my items were taken by them!” Ye Xiaoye had just gotten some items, but now she only had the cotton clothes on her; she didn’t even have her wooden sword anymore. Right now, she couldn’t do anything but weep.","“Damn it!” Yun Lian and the others from the Ocean Cloud Faction were angry. “Brothers of Cloud Ocean Faction! Come and avenge our Junior Sister!”","“Brothers of Liuyun Taoist Palace! Come and help us!” someone yelled in the crowd.","...","In the Red Name Village, the people from Yuanheng Pavilion wondered, How come there are so many people here?!","“So many!”","Tang Yuan’s face turned dark. “Send a message and get more people here!”","“Ahh!”","With another scream, someone was killed.","“Damn it! Go and get my guard team of 100 people!” Tang Yuan yelled hoarsely with a red face!","Damn it! He had never been hacked at like this before in his life!"]},{"number":253,"title":"Chapter 253 - A Cussing War of The Corpses","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Get more people?!” Ruan Ning was still watching them play in the shop, and she clicked her tongue at the shouts, wondering if these people had gone crazy from the battle!","At second thought, she understood how they felt. After all, they were all lofty figures, and now they were hacked into a bloody mess by some minions from nowhere. It was indeed unbearable!","If the situation continues, will there be seats left? Ruan Ning thought, Maybe I need to call the sisters to come...","She immediately sent messages to Xi Yue, Su Zhi, and Su Yao. “Come over now! The Big Boss of Yuanheng Pavilion is about to bring 100 guys to play the Legend of Mir 2. You’ll have no seats if you are late!”","In the Coiled Dragon Office, Xi Yue said awkwardly, “Dad, I must go to the Origins Internet Club...”","“Now?” Xi Chenzhou looked baffled.","“Ningning said that Master Tang of the Yuanheng Pavilion is about to get more than 100 people to the shop, and there won’t be any spots available if I’m late...” Xi Yue’s pretty face looked embarrassed as she wondered, Why is Tang Yuan dragging so many people to this expensive shop with a bad attitude even if he is playing there himself?","...","The battle soon moved from the newbie village to the Red Name Village. Including the innocent passersby, royal guards, and disciples from academies and factions, there were over 200 people in the war at the Red Name Village!","Most of the players of the game, including the new players who had just entered the game, gathered in this place!","The chaotic war in the newbie village got smaller in scale while the players were sent to the Red Name Village one by one!","The Red Name Village was a village in name, but it was now expanded into a city by the System. At this moment, the area near the respawn spot in one corner of the city was crowded with people!","In the Red Name Village, there were no safety and protective measures, and there was no Big-Saber Guard!","This added the chaos of the situation!","“Kill! Kill them for me! The ones who are killed must respawn immediately and battle!” In the channel for the Yuan Huang United Army, Tang Yuan yelled wildly, “Hold on! I’ll get 100 elites to come here in a moment!”","In the channel for the Jiuhua Army, Gong He yelled crazily, “Hold on! I’ve sent an urgent order to get more people from the military! How come there are so many of them?!”","The independent players who didn’t activate QQ Voice Chat yelled in the game, “Damn it! Go to hell!”","“You dare to kill me? Come on!”","“I’m back! Come and fight!”","“...”","It was chaotic.","...","Ji Wu was frustrated. “Where’s Captain Yu? How come we lost contact with him?”","Royal Princess Ji Yu was also frustrated. “I lost contact with my people as well...”","“What’s happening?! Where’s my people?!” The Second Prince’s face turned dark. “I’m waiting for money!”","...","– The Red Name Village –","“Royal guards, come and gather here! Come and gather here!”","“Ahh!” The person who was shouting was instantly killed!","“You want to gather?!” A few members of the Huang Family shouted with red eyes, “So you can kill us?! Damn you!”","After putting down the virtual reality headset, Captain Yu looked at the communication jade, and his face turned pale instantly. There are so many messages!","He replied with cold sweat popping out on his face. “Your Majesty, we are buried in the respawn spot of the Red Name Village... There are too many people here!”","“What?!” Ji Wu’s face fell at the news. “How many people?!”","“About 200... And there are about 100 people who claim that they are from a place called the Morning Star Sea Realm. They attack us whenever they see us!”","“...”","“Father... What shall we do?” The Second Prince was frustrated. They were waiting for the money to level up faster, but the team responsible for earning gold coins were now buried in the respawn spot in the Red Name Village?!","“Should we... get more people here?!” Fifth Prince Ji Yang suggested.","Ji Yu shook her head. “They are too far away and can’t solve this urgent issue.”","“Tell An Huwei to get 200 Jiuhua guards into the game!” Ji Wu snorted and said, “I’ll see how strong the people from the Morning Star Sea Realm are!”","...","“Ningning!” Xi Yue, Su Zhi, and Su Yao walked into the shop briskly.","“Come and get online!” Ruan Ning beckoned at them. Then, she asked Fang Qi while clicking open the game, “Sir, you will tell us how to get to that treasure place today, right?”","“Ningning, you don’t have to keep an eye on the shop today?” Xi Yue asked in bafflement.","“I closed the shop! Tomorrow, I’ll hire someone to watch the shop for me!” Ruan Ning yelled.","“...”","– Half City –","A middle-aged man wearing a sapphire-blue robe and a square hat came into the shop with about 100 people. “Master!”","Tao Kun put down the virtual reality headset and said, “Master is commanding the battle. Go to the shop owner and get online! Let all the guys kill people and get their names red so they can come to Red Name Village!”","Then, he explained to them how to play the Legend of Mir 2.","Ten minutes later, a team of a little more than 100 disciplined Yuanheng guards entered the Red Name Village!","Their levels were low, but the other players in Red Name Village didn’t have high levels either!","About 200 people began battling and cleaning the remaining 200 people!","Among the 200 people in the other group, only dozens were Jiuhua guards who could be organized through the QQ chatroom. As to the others, they couldn’t order the royal guards or the independent players who were red-eyed due to intense murderous spirit. The result was obvious!","Gradually, there were more members of the Yuanheng Pavilion standing, and the independent players were the first to get numb from fighting and killing, so they just laid on the ground!","The few remaining Jiuhua guards couldn’t hold up in this situation.","“Hold on! Hold on!” In the Jiuhua Army channel, Gong He yelled hoarsely since it was a war concerning Jiuhua Army’s honor!","“Reinforcements are coming! Castellan An is coming with 200 soldiers!”","....","– In the Half City Shop –","“They are still resisting.” Tao Kun said with a dark face. “Our playtime is almost up!”","“Get 150 ordinary Yuanheng guards to come here and replace us!” Seeing that the victory was near, Tang Yuan said loudly with a sneer, “I’ll see how long they can resist us!”","...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","An Huwei walked in with 200 people. “Xiaoyue! Get us computers!”","“Ugh... Castellan An.” Jiang Xiaoyue froze. “There are only a few seats available!”","“Oh?!” An Huwei froze, wondering how come more than 600 computers were almost all taken!","“How many are available?”","“About a dozen...”","In Jiuhua’s Main Shop, there were more games, and there were more players ever since the Diablo and Counter Strike competitions finished. Right now, the players who were playing the Legend of Mir 2 pulled in lots of people. How could there be a lot of seats available!","...","In the Jiuhua Army channel, Gong He yelled hoarsely, “Reinforcements?! Where are the reinforcements?! We can’t hold on for long!”","“About a dozen arrived!” an officer replied.","“About a dozen?! What’s wrong?!”","“No more available computers!”","“Damn it! F*ck!” Gong He cussed. “There are more than 600 computers! How come they are all taken?! Tell the players of other games to exit and leave the computers to us!”","“Deputy Commander Gong! We’re finished! Our brothers can’t hold on anymore! We all fell!”","Furious, Gong He looked at the corpses on the ground. “Who are they?! So many people are just lying here?”","“They are people of the Liuyun Daoist Palace, the Cloud Ocean Faction, and the major academies!” an officer reported in a low voice, “And some seem to be royal guards...”","“...”","“Join hands! We can still fight them!” Gong He shouted with red eyes, “We can still fight! Get them up, and I’ll open a channel for the joint force! We will have one central command!”","“Hold them!”","...","“Master Tang!” Huang Shan exclaimed as he had discovered something, “They are cussing us in the Current Channel on QQ! There are several pages of their cusses!”","Tang Yuan who had been happy with the victory froze and saw the people lying on the ground muttering in the Current Channel.","“B*stards of the Morning Star Sea Realm!”","“&%¥#!”","Damn it! How can they talk while lying on the ground as corpses?!","All of them were dumbfounded, feeling as if the world had been turned upside-down!","“Scum! Get up if you can!”","“Don’t let your granddaddy talk while stepping on your corpses!”","“...”","The people of the Yuanheng Pavilion couldn’t hold back and cussed as well."]},{"number":254,"title":"Chapter 254 - Big Guilds in Their Infancies","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the Coiled Dragon Office, Xi Chenzhou was listening to the report from his spy. “The Yuanheng Pavilion brought about 300 people altogether?! Just to play the so-called ‘The Legend of Mir 2’? What’s so special about this Legend of Mir 2?”","The movement of a big force like the Yuanheng Pavilion had obviously drawn the attention of other forces besides the Coiled Dragon Office.","Black Demon was one of them.","“Mr. Wang, what do you...” A black-robed, middle-aged man with long hair falling on his shoulders sat in the great hall and asked, “Why do you think the Yuanheng Pavilion brought about 300 people to that shop?”","“Big Boss Black Demon,” the grey-robed cultivator said with a smile, “We’ve investigated the issue. It’s said that one can enter another world that is comparable to real life through that shop, and people can find treasures and increase cultivation strengths. The effects are excellent!”","“You mean that they have found something that is worthy of using so much manpower?” Black Demon asked in his deep voice.","“Very possible!” The grey-robed cultivator nodded and said.","“This small shop named Origins is quite weird!” Black Demon chuckled, “Shall we bring some people there and have a look?”","Besides the Coiled Dragon Office and Black Demon, some other forces in Half City had also noticed the unusual moves of the Yuanheng Pavilion!","They all sent spies and scouts to the places near Fang Qi’s shop to get information.","Meanwhile, the corpses who had laid on the ground or even got offline all went back online and respawned!","If someone opened the Jiuhua Army channel, they would find that there were over 200 people in it!","Except for the players of other games who came to this channel in QQ to spectate and listen in on the battle, there were altogether more than 200 people fighting in the war!","About 200 people of all three professions charged at the people of Yuanheng Pavilion in an organized way, catching the latter off guard! In only ten minutes, the latter all fell to the ground!","At this moment, a large group of people came in the internet cafe including spies from other forces, Xi Chenzhou with some guards of the Coiled Dragon Office, and Black Demon with about a dozen of Black Demon Guards.","The moment that they entered the internet cafe, they heard loud shouts, “Respawn at the count of three!”","“Three! Two! One!”","“Respawn!”","“Wizards, don’t be afraid of death! All charge!”","“All of you, charge!”","“Their number is almost the same as ours! Charge and kill!”","“Charge forward! Respawn immediately if you die!”","“...”","The yells were hoarse, and the shouts sounded exhausted.","The people watching from behind were dumbfounded!","Xi Chenzhou looked at the black-robed, middle-aged man with long hair. “Black Demon?”","“Mr. Xi? Nice to meet you!” Black Demon cupped his hands and then pointed at the people yelling hoarsely. “What are they doing?”","Feeling awkward, Xi Chenzhou said with a bitter smile, “I guess they are fighting over some treasures.”","They watched the groups of people charging at each other wildly on the screens; it was a chaotic scene.","Their faces twitched as they watched.","“Shall we try the game?” Black Demon asked, “Where’s the shop owner?”","Zou Mo was feeling uneasy. He looked at these people who were standing in front of him and felt like they were all magnificent and influential, but he didn’t know who they were.","He forced himself to speak to them, “Sorry, but the computers are all taken. If you want to play, please wait in line.”","“...”","“Do you know who you’re talking to?!” a subordinate came out from behind Black Demon and questioned.","“Ugh... Who?” Little Mo had cold sweat on his forehead.","“Little Mo!” As the shop owner, Fang Qi had to keep an eye on the things happening in the shop. “Next time you encounter such people, tell them these eight words: Play if you want, but get out otherwise!”","“You!” That man was infuriated instantly, but he backed off at Black Demon’s stare.","“Are you the President of the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild?” Black Demon stared at Fang Qi who was playing the game as he asked. Knowing that Qin Honglin was destroyed by this shop mysteriously, he naturally wouldn’t make a rash move before he understood the situation.","“You want to join?”","At a loss for words, Black Demon decided to ignore him. Instead, he stood behind the people of Yuanheng Pavilion and watched.","This war between the people of Yuanheng Pavilion and the Jiuhua Joint Army was insane. They alternated in groups and used the computers in turns until midnight. In the beginning, the people of the Yuanheng Pavilion were in the disadvantage, but they held on since they could respawn an unlimited number of times.","As time went on, the number of the Jiuhua Joint Army began to increase, and they were replaced by elite soldiers with greater combat skills, which made the scale tip toward the Jiuhua Army gradually.","In the end, at 12 in midnight when the shop closed, the Jiuhua Army buried the Yuan Huang United Army at the respawn point in a landslide!","Going from victory to being buried in the respawn point, Tang Yuan was reluctant to admit defeat. Seeing that Black Demon and the others were in the shop, he pulled these people into his group.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi’s new shop had reached the target of shop expansion on the second day of business; there was a full house and long lines!","On the second day, the war broke out again with the Yuanheng Pavilion starting it with the intention of gaining back the victory. Making use of the extra 500 computers that the shop had added overnight, they joined forces with people like Black Demon and fought back!","With both shops at full capacity, the players of other games in the old shop couldn’t even find available computers! They had all been taken by the players of the Legend of Mir 2 who were waiting at the door in the early morning!","After fighting for two whole days, both parties found that neither of them could gain the upper hand because this wasn’t the real world in which one couldn’t respawn after being killed!","In the game, the players could respawn countless times, and they could never kill their enemies for good.","They hadn’t been able to think straight when they were first killed by their opponents, but after battling for two days and considering the situation during the nights while the war was paused, they began to understand the situation.","Only people with equal strengths could have an equal right to talk to each other.","In the war, both parties had seen each other’s strength and knew that at the current level, they were all strong, and neither could gain the upper hand.","Soon, the conference channel between the Morning Star Sea Realm and Dajin Country was established!","No one knew about their negotiations, but they finally reached a temporary peace agreement and began exploring in the world without much conflict.","After all, neither party could gain any benefits in the war. Instead, they consumed a lot of manpower and resources, which was not their intention of playing the game in the beginning.","As a result, the two-day war involving over 1,000 elite warriors and cultivators across countless kilometers that was caused by some deer meat came to an end for the time being!","Meanwhile, some big forces began to establish their forces in the Legend of Mir 2, including the Liuyun Daoist Palace and the Cloud Ocean Faction which paid little attention to the game before.","Forces such as the Royal Family, the Yuanheng Pavilion, Black Demon, and the Coiled Dragon Office didn’t need to be specifically mentioned. Although they didn’t have the ability to establish guilds officially, they were building guilds that were in their infancies."]},{"number":255,"title":"Chapter 255 - The first step of Wuwei Daoist Alliance","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Due to the cross-regional war in the last couple of days, the Legend of Mir 2 got very popular. During the chaotic war on the second day, the two shops were packed, seriously impacting the experience of other players, and those players protested.","– On the next morning after the war –","“Ugh?!” After opening her own shop in the early morning, Ruan Ning ran to the Origins Internet Club which was next door and got surprised.","The two-story shop which could contain less than 200 computers had suddenly become bigger yesterday, but that was still acceptable. Today, when Ruan Ning entered the shop, she was stupefied!","The space inside the shop had doubled! She wondered if the amazing spatial arrays were free in this shop!","It was expanded in one night?!","More importantly, the number of computers in the shop increased to about 1,000!","“Guild President... What happened?” Ruan Ning asked in horror as if she had seen a ghost.","“Did I enter the wrong shop?”","“It wasn’t like this yesterday, right?”","“Yeah! Yeah!” Little Mo nodded his head repeatedly.","“Sir, is this the same shop as yesterday?!”","“Little Mo,” Fang Qi patted Little Mo’s curly and messy hair and said calmly, “As an employee of the shop, you must get used to these kinds of changes.”","Meanwhile, the shop in Jiuhua City had expanded to accommodate 1,400 computers, and the space was divided into two zones – the Legend Guild Zone and the Normal Player Zone.","The first zone had 1,000 computers, and the other had 400, so situations such as players of other games not even getting into packed lines yesterday wouldn’t occur again.","Of course, after the expansions, the shops were no longer as crowded as before.","After the war in the last two days, a part of the high-level players stayed in the Mengchong Province where the Red Name Village was located so that they didn’t need to go through all the trouble of leveling up again. On the other hand, a lot of level 1 players who joined the game recently deleted their accounts and restarted.","With a large influx level 1 players at the newbie village, the resources became scarce despite the expansion of the map in this remake version of the game. The players tried to hold back, but there was still friction.","Of course, the Royal Gold Hunting Team finally began their work and started getting money for the royalty.","“Sir, these teleportation scrolls are awesome!” The girls clicked their tongues as they followed Fang Qi. Fang Qi had also come to the Mengchong Province with two Taoists and three wizards, but they came here using the Random Teleportation Scrolls instead of being sent here since they had red names.","“But it’s so expensive!” The flight took them only about ten minutes to get here from Biqi Province, but it cost them lots of gold coins! These teleportation scrolls were indeed pricy!","“Guild President!” With a teleportation scroll in hand, Xi Yue asked, “Can we create such Random or Town Teleportation Scrolls in the real world?”","“And Dungeon Escape Scrolls!” The girls obviously coveted these things. After all, if they had these scrolls, they could escape whenever they were in danger.","They weren’t the only people who had this question. Meanwhile, Tang Yuan was also holding a Random Teleportation Scroll in his hands.","“Master,” Tao Kun pointed at the scroll and said, “There seems to be a seal on it.”","“Using these kinds of seals, one can store spiritual spells inside the scroll. By tearing open the seal, one can use the spiritual spells inside...” Tang Yuan nodded. “Interesting.”","In Diablo, there were town portal scrolls which used the power of runes. However, it was too foreign for the cultivators in this world who had no idea about magic.","However, the scroll-making method in the Legend of Mir 2 was closer to the methods in their cultivation system which they had studied for many years. It was why this scroll attracted their attention so soon.","...","On the other side in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, they finally achieved some results after spending lots of resources, manpower, and energy of top-tier artifact masters from all factions.","Li Haoran glanced around at the rows of elite cultivators and members of the suicide squads who participated in the research and the masters of factions and families. “We have finished the study of the affixes of basic magic properties, the magic-instilling method, required materials, and things to watch out for. Now, I’ll teach this magic-instilling technique to everyone here. I can tell you that the magic of suffix of the basic properties such as strength, spirit, and dexterity can be instilled in any spiritual artifacts in theory.","“Due to our traditional artifact-making methods, this area was blank!” Li Haoran said, “It means that our artifact-making method will enter a new era!”","“Now, I’ll teach you two categories of magic instillation. One of them is the basic magic instillation that we can sell,” Li Haoran said in his loud voice, “We’ll use this unprecedented technique to break the sanction imposed on us by the Yundian Upper Realm!”","“Does basic magic instillation have special requirement for materials?” Ye Songtao asked the question, and it was a concern that many forces shared. After all, the Yundian Upper Realm had sealed not only the sales channels of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance but the import channels as well!","Comparatively, they were a truly powerful cultivation force, and one word from them could easily seal the channels of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance!","“You don’t have to worry about that,” Li Haoran said, “I’ll tell you some good news: our Dajin has lots of materials needed for basic magic instillation.” Then, he asked someone to fetch a few spiritual herbs, some beast blood, and ores.","“Moon Glare (Yue Hua) Herb? Fragrant (Xiang Shi) Ore?” They all looked surprised. “This beast blood is...”","“Black Ring (Hei Huang) Snake Blood. It’s a low-level demon beast,” Li Haoran said with a smile, “Using these materials, the power of the magic instillation might be more ordinary, but these materials can be all found in our region, and they are all local specialties!”","“Hahahaha! Great!”","“Excellent! Even if the outside forces could understand these techniques, they would find that the main materials needed are all in our Dajin! Excellent!” The people were elated!","Meanwhile, the top-tier artifact masters in Dajin began a new project after the basic magic instillation became a success.","The elite artifact masters from big factions in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, including Jun Yangzi and Duan Buyi, gathered together and looked at the golden bullets in front of them.","“Everyone now is clear on how the bullets are shot out.” Jun Yangzi picked up a bullet. “Now, we must study how to increase the power of the bullets.”","“First of all, we must increase the pressure inside the bullets when the powder is combusted without changing the formula of the powder. Higher pressure will produce a greater thrust force and increase the base power,” Jun Yangzi said.","“Second of all, we must choose a more suitable material to make bullets, so we can engrave artifact arrays on the surface.”","“Third of all, magic instillations on the bullets and the guns.”","“Lastly and most importantly, we must make more powerful powder with spiritual herbs and elixirs.”"]},{"number":256,"title":"Chapter 256 - The Legend of Mir 2 Gets More Popular","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The war caused such an upheaval, and there was no way that Mo Tianxing, the former owner of the shop, didn’t notice it.","In fact, he had watched the game for half a day yesterday but couldn’t find a computer to play himself.","Today, he came into the shop a little over 8 AM and found that the shop had experienced a transformation.","Upon entering the shop, he exclaimed in wonder, “Destroying Qin Honglin and creating such a spatial array in the shop, the kid is indeed extraordinary!”","It seems that I underestimated him. He stroked his beard and thought, Should I try the Legend of Mir 2?","“Old Mo, is the Legend of Mir 2 really as good as you said? Even Black Demon and the Coiled Dragon Office sent people here?” Coming with Mo Tianxing were a short and chubby old man with a white beard and an old Daoist wearing a dark-blue Daoist robe.","“You can look and decide for yourself!” Mo Tianxing said in disdain, “You two old guys want to come with me but don’t believe me! What do you want anyways?!”","The moment that they entered the shop, they heard someone yell from a seat near the counter, “Ultimate item! A great ring! Magic: 0-3!”","Immediately, a group of people swarmed up!","They watched the people swarming over as their faces twitched.","“Isn’t that Master Tang?”","“And Second Master Tao? How come they swarmed up as well?”","“Do you see that black-clothed, middle-aged man? Isn’t he... Black Demon?”","“And the grey-clothed cultivator is Wang Jin?!”","All of them stood behind a black-clothed cultivator.","“He looks to be a member of the Black Demon Guard?”","“Hahahaha!” While they were wondering about the situation, Black Demon laughed. “A hexagonal ring with the property of magic: 0-3! Good! Come and trade with me in Biqi City! I will reward you when we go back!”","“Thank you! Boss!” That Black Demon Guard was elated.","“This...” The people of Yuanheng Pavilion looked dejected. “How come our guys aren’t as lucky?!”","“Listen up, elites of Yuanheng Pavilion!” Tang Yan yelled in envy, “Anyone who gets ultimate items will be rewarded!”","“Yes!” The cultivators of Yuanheng Pavilion looked fiercer while they searched for monsters with intense eyes.","At this moment, someone yelled, “I seemed to have found a new place!”","“A new place?”","“Where is it?”","“Let’s go and have a look!”","“There is a cave here?!”","“So many skeletons!”","As they gasped and shouted, the people all ran over.","Mo Tianxing and his two companions gaped at the sight with dull eyes.","“Let’s go! Old Mo, don’t block our way! We must enter this world called the Legend of Mir 2 now!” The short and chubby old man with a white beard yelled impatiently, “We can’t miss the treasures!”","They went onto computers in a hurry.","Besides Mo Tianxing, other cultivators nearby also came to see what was so special about the shop that attracted these big forces!","Meanwhile, the players in Jiuhua City who had waited in line for computers for a whole day due to the great war yesterday began to wonder as well. What is so unique about this game? How come so many big forces couldn’t quit it?","With this thought, some independent players began to enter the game as well.","At this moment, Fang Qi led the few guild members into a grand city inside a desert.","The city was so grand that Fang Qi couldn’t be sure if it were Earth City or Sarbark City at first glance when he came here yesterday for the first time.","The city walls were so high that they greatly suppressed people even from the distance. When the people looked up close to it, it felt as if dark clouds were pressing down on them. All kinds of war machines sat on the defense walls, giving people the feeling that it was impossible to break this city.","People could buy maps from the local people, but the maps that money could buy in the beginning were vague, and some of the locations were a bit off.","Fang Qi had been here yesterday, so he had prepared maps already.","“Guild President! Are we leveling up today?” After leveling up quickly in the past two days, the girls were eager about this prospect.","At this moment, the four girls from Half City had reached level 16 and 17. Three of them were wizards, and Su Yao was a Taoist.","As for Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue, they were level 24 and level 21 respectively.","They had spent some time on helping their teammates level up, Otherwise, their levels would be higher.","Now that all six members of the team were around level 20, Fang Qi thought that they were able to fight some small bosses of the early stage.","However, he wanted to kill small bosses not for items but for skill books!","Yes, skill books!","Although in the world where Fang Qi came from, such scrolls were everywhere in the game; no one would pick them up even if they were thrown on the street. However, the skill books in this world were very expensive! A new skill could help them increase their combat power by many levels.","More importantly, they could learn these skills in real life!","Of course, Fang Qi didn’t want to learn these skills in real life. As the shop owner, he was only using this game to increase his cultivation strength. As for techniques and skills, his plate was full. He had the Innumerable Sword Scroll, the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, and the 36 Tiangang Sword Array and didn’t need to learn more.","Mr. Fang might not need these skills, but it didn’t mean that the others didn’t need them either.","According to the experience he had gained before he traveled to this world, Fang Qi had chosen this place.","Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue had been here yesterday and thus were quite familiar with the terrain. Fang Qi walked to a corner outside of the city wall and pulled out a brick. Suddenly, the ground underneath the wall suddenly sank and revealed a tunnel wide enough for one person to pass!","According to the metaphysics that Mr. Fang had learned before he traveled to this world, one would have a higher chance of getting items and skill books in these hidden places since it was also the first time that any players entered. Therefore, Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue spent the whole night killing zombies and got the Slaying Sword Technique, the Soul Fire Rune Note, and some useless skill books such as the basic sword technique and fireball spell.","Obviously, Mr. Fang wanted to continue the search today as he didn’t believe that he was this unlucky. He waved the zhanmadao and said, “Let’s go! I’ll take you to find the Dog Book!”","[TL Note: The zhanmadao was a single-bladed anti-cavalry Chinese sword.]","“Dog book? What dog book?” The four girls were baffled.","[TL Note: Dog Book is the nickname that Chinese players gave to [Summon Godly Beasts] which is a skill book for Taoists.]","“Boss meant the book named [Summon Godly Beasts]!” Jiang Xiaoyue pouted, looking doubtful. “Boss told me this last night, but after fighting monsters for one night, we didn’t even see a [Summon Skeleton]!”","At level 21, Jiang Xiaoyue could only throw out fire rune notes from behind Mr. Fang and didn’t even have a skeleton with her. This was an embarrassment for a Taoist.","Mr. Fang also felt embarrassed. Although he was a level 24 warrior, his Slaying Sword Technique was only at level 1 since he had just learned it.","Fang Qi scratched his head. “Just trust me this time, okay? I have a scientific way of killing monsters!”","“Trust me! Let’s go!” Then, he led the way and dashed into the secret tunnel."]},{"number":257,"title":"Chapter 257 - Mr. Fang from Africa.","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: I also have no idea why the chapter name is this, LOL.]","In fact, Jiang Xiaoyue didn’t want to go into the underground tunnel which was damp, gloomy, and full of zombies. Seeing Fang Qi running into it, she stomped her foot and followed reluctantly.","Ruan Ning, Xi Yue, and the other two girls looked at each other. They had had some trust in Fang Qi, but after looking around, they wondered if it was wise for them to believe him...","However, they had used so many Random Teleportation Scrolls to come here, and they couldn’t just give up.","It was an underground tunnel built with bricks, and it was full of zombies. Fang Qi swung his zhanmadao and led the way.","At this moment, the female wizards had only learned the Fire Resistance Ring and Fireball Spell.","Su Yao, a little Daoist, hadn’t learned the Soul Fire Rune Notes yet and could do nothing but heal and poison monsters before hacking with a saber.","Meanwhile, Ji Wu and the other players who were not involved in yesterday’s war were getting close to level 20.","They began exploring the Biqi Mine Pit with a big group of royal guards. Meanwhile, the players from Dajin were killing monsters in the Zombie Cave while people from the Morning Star Sea Realm fought in the Skeleton Cave; there were no conflicts between them at this moment.","“Father...” Royal Princess Ji Yu waved her weapon and killed a zombie that was rushing toward her before saying, “In this world, there seems to be no other special benefits besides the fast growth of cultivation strength...”","“The only other benefit is that the basic sword technique gave us a more solid sword technique foundation,” the Second Prince said, “But it has been many days now.”","An Huwei and the others were also playing the game, and even Song Qingfeng had reached level 17.","However, without the support of the Royal Gold Hunting Team or buying gold coins from other players to level up, the speed of strength growth wasn’t faster than playing the single-player computer games.","The great war pulled many players into the game, but when they found that the effects of the Legend of Mir 2 were not as good as they had expected, they became doubtful.","Despite their doubt, the small conflicts and sneak attacks that were common in the game taught the players from the academies the survival skills which were quite useful to people with low cultivation strength like Song Qingfeng and Xi Qi. So, the current players continued playing the game.","As for the players who didn’t play the game like Nalan Hongwu and Lan Mo, they continued playing the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Diablo and watching the TV Series.","...","– Meanwhile in the secret underground tunnel –","The problem with being in the underground was that there was no light. Fortunately, they could use torches even though the illumination range was very limited.","It was a convenient place for them to level up. After their potions ran out, they just went up to the Sarbark City to replenish the stock in the pharmacies on the ground. After several trips, they killed so many monsters that only a couple of small cat monsters were left.","Several hours had passed, and they had obtained two Lightning Spell Skill Books, a Summon Skeleton Skill Book, and a Soul Fire Rune Spell Skill Book for Su Yao. Then, Mr. Fang led his team to venture into the next level.","After walking down a flight of trapezoidal steps, they entered the Fragrant Rock Tomb.","Since no one had been here before, this place was full of monsters, which was why Fang Qi didn’t dare to take Jiang Xiaoyue down here yesterday. Fang Qi remembered that there was a zombie wizard in here that could use Swift Lightning Flash, which was a powerful offensive technique that wizards could only learn at level 26. If they were attacked by the zombie wizard while they were surrounded by monsters, even Fang Qi’s items would be no match for it. If they died here and dropped items, they didn’t have to think about coming back to pick them up.","However, with three wizards, two Taoists and a summoned skeleton by his side today, Fang Qi ventured into the Fragrant Rock Tomb and decided to give it a try.","After three days, all the team member got their basic techniques, such as Soul Fire Rune Note, Summon Skeleton, and Lightning Spell. Fang Qi and his team ventured into the third level of Fragrant Rock Tomb.","By this time, they hadn’t seen a dog hair, not to mention the Dog Book!","Their leveling up speed had become slower. Fortunately, the growth of cultivation strength relied on killing monsters instead of leveling up. Otherwise, they would have given the whole thing up!","Three days later, the lowest leveled team member was at level 23, and Fang Qi had the highest level, which was only level 27.","When they were almost done killing the monsters in the Fragrant Rock Tomb, they seemed to hear iron chains dragging on the ground in the darkness behind the monsters.","The sounds were so crisp that they could be heard clearly among the roars of the monsters in the underground!","Hearing these sounds deep into the dark underground, the girls felt their hair standing on end. “What is it?!”","Fang Qi remembered that there were corpse kings living in the Fragrant Rock Tomb. At his current level, he didn’t dare to enter Corpse King Palace even if the knew the way. He only dared to try his luck in the Fragrant Rock Tomb!","As the torchlight lit up the space deeper into the tunnel, they saw a giant monster with ashen skin and iron chains attached on its body!","The torchlight seemed to have attracted the monster’s attention as it moved over, and this monster turned around and moved swiftly toward them!","Its huge and brawny arms, distorted rotten face, and the overwhelming suppression emitting from its body were enough to make people shiver in fear.","“Xiaoyue! Use poison! Get the skeletons to tank it first!”","“Lightning Spell! Fire Notes!”","The corpse king was obviously faster than other monsters. In a few seconds, it ran before them, and the skeletons that tried to block it were sent flying by a swing of the iron chain!","“Ahh! It is coming at us!” The female wizards were panicking. Usually, the Lightning Spell and Fire Notes would stun the monsters or knock them down, giving the long-distance professions the time to pull away. However, this corpse king showed no reaction after being hit by the spells and techniques!","Fang Qi could only rush up and concentrate his energy!","“Ahh!”","With a thunderous yell, a bright sword light appeared in the darkness as Fang Qi attacked with the Slaying Sword Technique, slashing toward the neck of the corpse king!","However, Fang Qi’s heavy zhanmadao seemed to have hacked onto metal, and the wound in the skin he inflicted was less than one centimeter deep!","On the other hand, a huge repulsive force pushed back, numbing Fang Qi’s hands!","The corpse king swung its chain, and Fang Qi scrambled to block it with his saber before he was sent flying!","“F*ck!” After falling onto the ground, Fang Qi was frustrated when he saw that a large portion of his HP was lost. “Even the corpse kings are so strong; how can we fight the Zuma Clan Master later?!”","However, Fang Qi had successfully attracted the attention of the corpse king. When the latter charged at him, he yelled, “Attack!”","Lightning Spells and Fire Notes were thrown onto it wildly!","The corpse king paused and was about to turn from Fang Qi. Fang Qi immediately stood up and hacked toward it. At this moment, the corpse king already ran toward Jiang Xiaoyue with a furious roar!","Soon, Xiaoyue was also struck by corpse king’s chain and lost lots of HP even though she had dodged it in time!","“Xiaoyue! Stop attacking!” Fang Qi yelled. He had found that the corpse king didn’t possess any high intelligence. After he hacked at it from behind, the corpse king turned its attention back to him!","Fortunately, they had cleared out a big area and thus had room to run while the corpse king chased after them.","“Split up! Scatter! If it turns to you, just stop attacking!” Fang Qi obviously was experienced with such creatures that had low intelligence. After several rounds of chasing, the corpse king finally fell to the ground with a scream while running!","At this moment, almost all of them were wounded. If not for their quick reflexes and excellent eyesight as cultivators, some of them probably would have died!","Right now, they saw that the corpse king dropped a lot of things, such as potions and gold coins, after dying.","After clearing the monster that they had drawn out by accident, Fang Qi picked up the Skill Books from the ground. Holy Armor Spell, Group Healing Spell, and Enchanting Light.","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words."]},{"number":258,"title":"Chapter 258 - Losing Interest","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Fang Qi picked up the other items scattered on the ground and handed the Skill Books to Xiaoyue and Su Yao. “Each of you can take one.”","“I want the Holy Armor Spell!” Jiang Xiaoyue took one book happily. Even the name of this sounds grand!","Su Yao was shy. After taking the Group Healing Spell that Fang Qi handed to her, she said with a blush after a long pause, “Thank you.”","“Who wants the Enchanting Light?”","“Give it to Sister Xi Yu,” Ruan Ning said. Since she and Su Zhi had Fire Wall and Exploding Flame respectively, Xi Yue could take this rare spell.","After learning the Holy Armor Spell, Jiang Xiaoyue shot out a rune note, and the flames jumped out from the burning note and drew a huge ancient character in the air like a dancing snake!","Everyone knew that the ancient rune notes contained mystical power. When that ancient character appeared in the air, all of them seemed to be engulfed in a layer of faint orange flame, and they felt a special force attached to their bodies!","With this force, they felt like they were invincible to monsters’ attacks!","“So powerful!” they exclaimed as they sensed this special power","“Ugh?” Fang Qi looked at the lofty ancient character, nonplussed. “Isn’t it supposed to be a big simplified Chinese character of ‘Defense’?”","[TL Note: This is the character if you are interested – 防.]","Of course, Mr. Fang was just saying it; it couldn’t be a simplified Chinese character in this world.","Obviously, it was a rune character which represented a spiritual spell when it was drawn!","Soon, Su Yao tried her Group Healing Spell, and her spiritual essence transformed into a wave of clear spiritual light which spread around, slowly healing everyone’s wounds that they had gotten when killing monsters!","“This is also awesome!” The girls exclaimed again. After all, they had never seen a spiritual spell which could heal a large group of people!","“But... what is Enchanting Light?” After finishing reading the Spell Book, Xi Yue shot out an Enchanting Light toward a distant monster.","A wave of strange lightning energy landed on the monster, but it had no effects on it.","That monster ignored them and didn’t even look this way.","Xi Yue felt discouraged, wondering how her spell was useless while the others’ spells were all powerful.","She shot out another Enchanting Light.","The monster still showed no response.","While stomping her foot, she shot out a dozen Enchanting Light, but the result was the same.","She finally gave up while gritting her teeth. Seeing the other girls smirking, she threw her weapon named Crescent Moon (Yan Yue) onto the ground in a huff. “This is a garbage skill!”","“Does this spell have an explanation?” Jiang Xiaoyue asked curiously, “It can’t be this lame even if it is weak.”","“It says that it can summon powerful monsters as servants,” Xi Yue complained, “It sounds powerful, but I can’t even summon a weak monster!”","...","While Fang Qi was killing the corpse king, the Royal Exploration Team had been working hard in the deserted Biqi Mine Pit.","After three days of killing monsters, they were all above level 20 with the highest one reaching level 25.","Even the members of the Royal Gold Hunting Team were close to level 20.","“Captain Yu, do you have news from the people of the Morning Star Sea Realm?” Ji Wu asked a thin, middle-aged warrior in front of him.","“Your Majesty,” the middle-aged officer said, “Those people are busy killing monsters in the Skeleton Cave and Wilma Forest, and it’s heard that this game is the only game that they have!”","“A group of bumpkins!” Ji Wu snorted, “Did they find anything?”","“Not yet.”","Ji Wu fell into deep thoughts while frowning.","During the past few days, they had killed many zombies and gotten the Skill Books for the Lightning Spell, Fire Note, and Slaying Sword Technique. However, skills such as Fire Wall and Explosion Flame which were above level 20 were rare.","For now, he hadn’t seen anything that made his time spent in this world worthwhile.","Of course, for Royal Princess Ji Yu and the others, it was a good experience since their cultivation strengths were not high, and they had obtained noticeable growth of strength.","However, for Ji Wu, no matter how fast he increased his cultivation strength, he couldn’t advance one realm in one month or in one year. Besides, even if his cultivation strength grew, he still needed a breakthrough to reach a higher realm.","For example, Elder Fu’s cultivation strength was high enough, but due to his low understanding of nature, he only had one foot in the Emperor Warrior Realm.","“No.” Ji Wu shook his head. “This game isn’t good.”","Meanwhile, An Huwei had reached level 20 in the Orc Tomb with a large group of Jiuhua guards. Now, he was taking them to the Centipede Cave in the Death Valley at Mengchong Province.","The Death Valley was very big, and higher-level disciples of the big forces such as Cloud Ocean Faction, Liuyun Daoist Palace, and Blue Flame Faction were all here.","While ordering the Jiuhua Army to clear the monsters, An Huwei bought a box of spicy sticks and sat down with the heads of the other forces.","Lounging on the computer chair, An Huwei yelled, “Come and have a spicy stick! It’s tiresome to play this game!”","With that said, he picked up a spicy stick and stuffed it into his mouth.","“Spicy sticks?!” An elder of the Cloud Ocean Faction leaned over and picked up one. “Castellan An, have you gotten any ultimate items?”","“Forget it.” While eating spicy sticks, An Huwei watched the Jiuhua guards hacking at monsters wildly on the screen. “This game is good for training the soldiers, but I find it quite boring.”","“I have the same feeling!” An elder from the Liuyun Daoist Palace came over and picked up a spicy stick as well, taking a break from the fight. Although they couldn’t gain cultivation strength while taking breaks, they found that when they re-entered the virtual reality mode, the accumulated strength would enter their bodies as if it were being stored in their characters right now.","Lounging in his chair, An Huwei watched his men killing monsters in satisfaction. While biting into another spicy stick, he commented, “This game isn’t as dashing as the games such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy. What’s the use of the Fireball Spell? The Fire Resistance Ring can only push away low-strength opponents. Do we need to push away low-realm warriors in the real world?”","“Right. I have my protective spiritual treasure with me and can ignore attacks from less powerful people!” This elder sounded quite experienced and he continued, “I haven’t learned any new spiritual spells in this game. Does the game want me to fight using only the Fireball Spell in this game?”","“Even the higher-leveled spiritual spells are useless to us!” An Huwei shook his head and said, “Do we need more spiritual spells? Why do we need them?”","They lounged on the computer chairs and chatted while eating spicy sticks."]},{"number":259,"title":"Chapter 259 - Practice Enchanting Light in Seclusion","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","There was a legend in the Wilma Continent.","“In the legend, Enchanting Light isn’t a skill of the three big professions. A wizard was once enchanted by the Wilma Devil, and he learned the Enchanting Light spell in the chaos. Like the demon leaders, he created tens of thousands of loyal followers who were enchanted by the demonic light and would fight to their deaths if they were summoned by the demonic light as they were followers of the devils and demons,” Fang Qi told the girls the history of Enchanting Light in the game.","“So powerful?!”","“It doesn’t sound real!”","“If it’s true, how come my Enchanting Light has no effects on monsters?!” Xi Yue voiced her doubt, “This is a garbage skill!”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “As a beginner, you can only enchant small animals, and it’s impossible to enchant monsters! You’re weak and can’t blame the spell!” He immediately sent her to enchant chickens. After she was successful with chickens, she could use it to enchant archers.","Meanwhile, he told Jiang Xiaoyue and Su Yao to practice the Summon Skeleton spell. Summon Skeleton had an unique feature – if the skeletons didn’t die, the Taoists couldn’t re-summon them. Therefore, the Taoists’ proficiency with this spell wouldn’t increase if their skeletons didn’t die.","Since no monsters were allowed to enter the cities, the Big Sabered Guards would kill skeletons whenever they saw them.","If one kept bringing skeletons into the city, the Big Sabered Guards would take it as an insult and kill the player as well!","Therefore, Fang Qi took them to Tiger Guard Hall to practice the summoning skill. At this moment, the other players hadn’t finished exploring the Wilma Forest yet. Due to the large number of monsters in the forest, they didn’t have the time to discover this new map yet.","Fang Qi had found this place when he was killing monsters and walked down a secret tunnel without turning back.","The Tiger Guard’s ancestor had once helped the three big heroes fight the Red Moon Demon, and he was cursed by the Red Moon Demon. His descendant, the Tiger Guard, was like a walking dead. When he was killing skeletons, he wouldn’t have the mind to make trouble for the skeleton’s human masters.","When the girls took off their items, the skeletons that they summoned usually had little HP, and they would be killed by the Tiger Guard in one or two saber slashes.","...","Meanwhile in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, the basic magic-instilled artifacts were produced at large scale. After selling them to the internal forces, they were sold to the big forces in Country of Dajin.","In turn, the big forces sold them to people out of the country! Magic instillation! These new artifacts soon attracted the attention of a lot of big forces in Dajin and the surrounding small countries.","Today, many cultivators wearing green robes with jade mountains embroidered on their chests came into Jiuhua City. They were disciples of Jade Hill (Yu Qiu) Mountain, which was beyond the East Ocean.","There were also some Daoists wearing black-white robes and holding Daoist whisks in their hands; they were cultivators from Dragon Sea Daoist Palace. As for the cultivators wearing fancy clothes and jaded belts, they were members of the three big families on Linglang Mountain.","In the past, independent and small cultivators were most common in the big cities in Dajin, but now, various elites from big forces were here in the cities of Dajin.","The basic magic instillations were not useful to the grand cultivators, but the major forces had tens of thousands of disciples.","In terms of resources and worldly experiences, these forces were not without conflicts. If they lost to their rivals due to the inferiority of their spiritual artifacts instead of lower cultivation strengths...","Just imagine the scenario in which cultivators had the same spiritual artifacts, but some of them had extra attributes such as [+10 Energy] and [+10 Dexterity] on their spiritual artifacts, what would happen?","In one incident, a disciple of Liuyun Daoist Palace with low cultivation strength and few spiritual spells used his spiritual artifact and casted a middle-level spiritual spell!","It was said that the artifact stored more than one spiritual spells!","In another incident, some cultivators encountered a team of disciples of Lingyun Academy who were ordinary warriors lower than the Ancestral Warrior Realm. The cultivators usually could easily defeat warriors, not to mention the ordinary warriors! However, the cultivators were knocked down by something called guns!","It was fortunate that those warriors didn’t want to kill them. Otherwise, they would have died! And no one would believe that these cultivators were killed by warriors!","Since the decision makers in the clans and factions were afraid of offending the Yundian Upper Realm and didn’t dare to send people over to buy these new artifacts, the disciples came and bought the artifacts for themselves!","After all, they couldn’t survive in the real world if they didn’t buy these items, and that was why the big cities such as Jiuhua and Yanhai were thronged with disciples from foreign forces!","The Wuwei Daoist Alliance had been promoting and selling resources and spiritual artifacts to the surrounding forces, but now the situation had changed. The disciples from the big factions came into Dajin Country to buy items from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance!","They came in groups and bought artifacts in large quantities!","A luxuriously dressed young cultivator looking to be in his twenties walked into the Blue Flame Pavilion of Jiuhua City and saw a big sign. [Qixi Shopping Festival; 30% off all items in the shop.]","[TL Note: Qixi Festival is the Chinese Valentine’s Day.]","The young man looked baffled.","On the other side, a shop clerk looked at Li Haoran in confusion. “Junior Uncle-Master Li, will this work?”","“I don’t know...” Li Haoran’s face looked stiff. “It’s Mr. Fang’s suggestion.”","“We don’t have a Qixi Festival, right?”","Li Haoran said as his face twitched, “It’s now a new addition in our shop, okay? The people from other countries don’t know it anyway.”","The young cultivator asked a shop clerk eagerly, “What’s the Qixi Shopping Festival?”","“Hello, Gongzi! This is a new promotion of our shop, and the discount is effective for only seven days,” a girl explained with a sweet smile.","“In the next three days, all the items you see are 50% off! These are the best spiritual artifacts of our shop, and they have super effective magic instillations!”","“All items are on 50% discount?”","The girl nodded. “Yes, but only for three days.”","“Okay!” The young man who had planned to buy about 100 artifacts said immediately, “I’ll take 500 items with the magic affix that increases energy and 300 with the magic affix that increases dexterity!”","...","In Half City on the next day, Xi Yue yawned and said, “Guild President, is this practice useful?”","“Of course! Which level are you on now?”","“I’m on level 3...” Xi Yue said drowsily in boredom.","“Come to the White Sun Gate!”","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue and Su Yao were busy practicing Summon Skeleton. Xi Yue looked at Fang Qi with a bored expression, “Guild President, what do I do here? I don’t summon skeletons.”","Fang Qi pointed at the Tiger Guard who had just killed the skeleton that Jiang Xiaoyue summoned and said, “Enchanting Light.”","“Ugh?” All the girls looked at Fang Qi in astonishment.","“Guild President, can I enchant it?!” They had seen the horrifying power of the Tiger Guard. He moved swiftly and had high damage; this was why they came here to practice Summon Skeleton.","Xi Yue tossed out an Enchanting Light tentatively.","Then, she looked exhilarated as if she had picked up a crystal on the street. “I enchanted it!”","“Now, I will take you to enchant the Eagle Guard!” Fang Qi said, “Today, I saw one Eagle Guard while we flew using the Random Teleportation Scroll.”","The Eagle Guard was a loyal archer but had gotten lost after being enchanted by a new-born devil. He usually wandered in the jungles and mazes and had powerful long-range attacks that brought fear to his enemies."]},{"number":260,"title":"Chapter 260 - The Horrifying Army of Six!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Half an hour later, Xi Yue was flanked by a Tiger Guard, an Eagle Guard, and five black evil worms. This combination could strike fear into anyone’s mind.","“How come I can only summon one skeleton while she, a wizard, can summon so many monsters?!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at the team following Xi Yue with envy.","Fang Qi took them to the Fragrant Rock Tomb again and killed all the monsters except for a group of horn flies.","The uniqueness of Enchanting Light was that the monsters enslaved by the wizard could get stronger through killing other monsters.","Killing horn flies was the best method, which was swift and riskless.","During this process, the six of them killed another corpse king which dropped the Assassination Sword Technique and Ghost Shield Spell, but there was no trace of skills over level 30.","About two hours later, the girls asked, “Guild President, where are we going?”","“We are going to kill corpse kings!”","– Meanwhile in the Biqi Mine Pit –","“Your Majesty,” Captain Yu said in embarrassment, “The zombies’ levels are too low for us. Should we go to another place to level up?”","“Level up? For what?” The Second Prince said in disapproval, “This game is obviously no match for the games such as the Legend of the Sword and Fairy. I think we’ve wasted our time on this game these days!”","“It wasn’t a waste,” Royal Princess Ji Yu said, “At least our cultivation strengths increased quickly.”","“Should we... change to another game?” Fifth Prince Ji Yang said, “This game is good for occasional practice, but it’s not worth this much manpower and resources.”","...","“Guild President, what are we doing in this place? Sister Xi Yue’s Tiger Guard can kill these low-level monsters easily, and we don’t even need to fight at all!”","“Someone is here!” At this moment, Ji Yang and the others deep inside Biqi Mine Pit heard the distant voices.","Ji Wu waved his hand. “Go and take a look!”","Several warriors took Ji Wu’s order and walked forward with torches in their hands. Before they walked far, several huge black worms moved toward them swiftly!","“Monsters!” One warrior screamed and hacked at them subconsciously! As if his attack disturbed a nest of worms, the five huge black worms leaped up in the darkness fiercely!","Meanwhile, an arrow whistled in the air!","“Ahh!” With a scream, the warrior fell to the ground and died instantly!","“What was that?” The remaining warriors rushed over and saw the huge worms. Then, they drew out sabers and hacked at them!","In the next instant, screams sounded. Then, they all fell in less than a minute.","“What’s happening?!” Ji Wu’s face fell when he heard the shrills. “Are the people from the Morning Star Sea Realm here to attack us?”","“Line up!” Captain Yu yelled, “The warriors stand in the front, wizards take the back! Skeletons charge forward! Push Fire Walls outward!”","Fire Walls rose and illuminated the surrounding area.","At this moment, a red flame and a blue fire flame lit up in the sky and turned into two strange rune characters!","Suddenly, the five black worms charged forward as one with hissing sounds!","“So fast!”","“Lightning Spell! Using Fire Walls! Make the skeletons charge!” Yu Chi command. But the moment that he issued the orders, he heard an arrow whistling toward him from the darkness!","Instinctively, he moved his body, and the arrow missed his heart but shot into his shoulder with a swooshing sound!","The huge force almost knocked him down! Level 7 Eagle Guard!","Then, he saw a warrior wearing yellow military helmet and armor charged up with a big saber!","“Block him! Block him!” Lying on the ground, Yu Chi yelled hoarsely and found that half of his HP was gone! He gasped immediately!","“We can’t block him!” A royal guard yelled in horror after being hacked by the Tiger Guard. “What’s this thing?! He almost killed me with one attack!”","The Tiger Guard had great speed. Now with someone controlling him, he no longer had that crazy and orderless moving pattern, and he was moving strategically. Together with the five black worms, they instantly broke the defensive line made up of about 10 warriors!","They rushed into the wizards!","“The spells seem useless on them!” A wizard yelled in horror. Several lightning bolts only paused these monsters a bit, and they moved forward at greater speed!","“Hold them back!” Yu Chi roared.","“I don’t believe that we can’t kill one monster together!” The moment that he said those words, several healing spells landed on the heads of the wounded worms!","Since healing spells were only effective on the entities who didn’t resist them, they couldn’t heal monsters!","Many royal guards had tested this, but now the healing spells were landing on the heads of the monsters?","More importantly, the monsters seemed to be engulfed in a strange force, which weakened the damage of spells and physical attacks on them!","The royal guards could still deal with it if only one worm had such protection. However, each of the worms had the same protection! With their tough bodies and swift dodging speed, all the attacks had little effects on them!","Meanwhile, they saw that their skeletons were hacked into bone fragments by two skeletons that were emitting blue light!","Then, they saw these two skeletons charging into the battle, and anyone who was hacked by them would lose half of the HP while the wizards just died!","The skeletons that they summoned were at level 0 or level 1; the highest one was only at level 3. But these two skeletons were obviously not at level 3; they probably were at level 7!","“What are these creatures?!” All of them watched the scene in horror. Then, a warrior wearing green armor and a black cape rushed up and created a huge wave of sword energies, which knocked down a wizard who hadn’t had the chance to run five steps!","Then, this wizard died at the second strike!","At this moment, Fang Qi was not yet fully equipped with ultimate items, but most of his items were unique to his profession, including a set of heavy armor and a helmet, the zhanmadao, and a skeleton ring. After getting buffs from the Holy Armor Spell and the Ghost Shield Spell, he was like a tiger in a herd of sheep!","Of course, the most terrifying one was the yellow-armored warrior who had a big saber; he killed one wizard with only one strike!","The royal guards felt like he was even scarier than the Big Sabered Guards! By now, half of the royal guards were lost!","As for the other half, they were severely injured and disabled. Ji Wu watched in horror while the monsters swept by like swarming locusts. Out of his 40 royal guards, only ten were left standing!","Fang Qi checked the time and found that Xi Yue only had two hours of playtime today.","“Hurry up! Rush straight in!” After all, they would lose these level 7 monsters that they summoned after getting offline!","“These people... are also players?” Looking at the players following the monsters, Ji Wu’s jaw dropped in horror!"]},{"number":261,"title":"Chapter 261 - A System for the Military! Wars Between Countries Are About to Start!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Yundian Upper Realm –","The Yundian Upper Realm was called an ‘Upper Realm’ because its position was higher than most of the other cultivation forces!","If the words of the Three Saint Gates were edicts among the cultivation forces, the Yundian Upper Realm thought that their words had almost the same weight.","For example, when they recently ordered the severance of the sales and resources channels of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, all the forces obeyed without hesitation.","However, they were not happy because of this. The Wuwei Daoist Alliance was just an insect in their eyes, but this force didn’t submit to them; instead, they rebelled!","They used a special method to break the sanction against them!","Gongshu Kuo smelled the fragrance of tea that was floating up from the teacup in his hand and said mildly, “It seems that the Wuwei Daoist Alliance doesn’t plan to submit.”","Gongyang Jun looked angry. “What are those guys thinking?! They are working against us for such a small interest!”","Gongshu Kuo sipped the tea and said, “I’m afraid that the interest isn’t small.”","“What then?” Gongyang Jun snickered. “Magic instillation? They are just trivial novelties. Look at the things they sell! Only low-level cultivators would use these things!”","“Not only that!” Gongshu Kuo said calmly, “It’s said that they got some other good stuff. Since they can’t get the real benefits from the Cultivation Realm, it’s understandable that they resort to something inferior.”","Then, he slammed his hand on the table and said with a cold expression, “However, they keep ignoring our Yundian Upper Realm and even work against us in the public. If we can’t solve this issue, other people will copy them and take the words of Yundian Upper Realm as bullsh*t!”","“Brother Gongshu, what shall we do?”","“Since they don’t listen to our gentle persuasion,” Gongshu Kuo said in a chilling voice, “then, we must do it the hard way.”","...","– Biqi Mine Pit –","All the people were chilled by the scene they had glimpsed.","If they are players, then why are the monsters working with them?! Is it possible that those players have the skill to enslave monsters?! What are the two guards wearing yellow armor?!","The two rune spells rose in the darkness had toughened the monsters who had been tough to deal with in the first place! The rune spells weakened all the magic and physical attacks on them!","These terrifying monsters were buffed up with spells!","The royal guards might be able to deal with one of these horrifying powerful monsters, but when several creatures charged together, they had obliterated the team of about dozens of people! A few players destroyed more than a dozen!","What things do those players have that enable them to have such extraordinary power? What is going on?","At this moment, with players charging into the Corpse King Hall, an immense amount of death energy flowed into the mine pit, and new corpse kings began to take shape in the deserted mine!","– In the gloomy darkness –","“Warriors, charge forward!”","“Wizards, use the Lightning Spell! Taoists, release Fire Notes! Heal!”","Ji Wu roared in a fury while a big, pale-skinned corpse king chased after a group of royal guards who were about level 20.","Then, a scream sounded as someone died!","“Don’t panic! The dead ones respawn right away and come back!” Ji Wu had dozens of people, and one to two deaths had no big consequences. With more than ten warriors charging forward and the wizards and Taoists casting spells wildly from behind, even this corpse king was not their match. With a scream, it died and dropped items all over the ground.","[Holy Armor Spell], [Group Healing Spell], [Assassination Sword Technique], and [Magic Shield].","Ji Wu picked up the ancient books and flipped through them.","“Your Majesty... These are...” Yu Chi looked at him in confusion.","Ji Wu tossed some of the skill books to Yu Chi. “Try them!”","The Soul Fire Rune Note turned into a huge rune character in the air, and all the people sensed that they were engulfed by a strange force.","“What do you think?” Ji Wu asked.","“You can test it!” Ji Wu yelled and hacked with his sword, and Yu Chi blocked his attack with his weapon!","Dang!","Yu Chi retreated half a step and said, “The force was reduced, but not much.”","The effect is average? Ji Wu was baffled. In the shop which had produced the powerful sword techniques as shown in the Legend of the Sword and Fairy and Wind and Cloud, the spiritual spells should be more powerful than this.","“However, this spiritual spell has a large area of effect,” Yu Chi said, “If we stand together tighter, all of us will be covered.”","It had a large area of effect but only moderate power. Was it only a minor spiritual spell? It could be used in the game, but what effect could it have in the real world?","In the battle between masters, what effect could this thing have? It was no match for ordinary sword control technique, let alone the Heavenly Sword!","Ji Wu shook his head in disappointment.","Then, he heard Yu Chi say, “This rune note looks simple and effective, and it requires zero skill level. If we promote it in the military, it has good prospects.”","After all, Yu Chi had never played the games before and thus was not as picky as the other players.","Hearing his words, Ji Wu’s body shook suddenly!","Yeah! Why should I use the techniques myself?!","As the Emperor of Dajin, what was his most powerful force?","Was it his individual cultivation strength? No!","As an emperor of a country, his most powerful force was the military!","A large military consisted of ordinary warriors and cultivators, and an elite army made of tens of thousands of grand warriors and cultivators, and a team of royal guards comprised of thousands of high-level warriors and cultivators!","However, his military wasn’t so great. Half of the hundreds of thousands of ordinary warriors would die to the spiritual spells before they could get close to their enemies if they fought with the Yundian Upper Realm’s army, which consisted of at least 100,000 cultivators!","His elite army of tens of thousands of grand warriors and cultivators was no match for the elite team of thousands of cultivators from big cultivation forces! Even with the assistance of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, he couldn’t defeat huge forces such as the Yundian Upper Realm, and that was why Dajin had stopped their western expansion!","However, equipped with these spiritual spells, the military of Dajin would become an iron army in the future!","An Iron Army!","Looking at the Group Healing Spell in his hand, a thought dawned on him.","Maybe the things in the game were not for the super masters but for training soldiers and lower-level members of different forces?","In fact, Ji Wu was right. In the history of this continent in the game, the most powerful Godly Dragon Empire had once sent three commanders and many soldiers to travel across snowy mountains to fight the one-million-strong orc army for the local humans.","On their way back after the victory, they were blocked by an avalanche of the northern snow mountain. The army couldn’t return to their homeland and had to settle in this land.","They left the three professions, which were the core systems of the army of the Godly Dragon Empire!","As time went on, the most powerful masters of the three teams were called the Almighty Daoist, Wizard God, and Holy Warrior, and people addressed them as the Three Heroes in the war against the Red Moon Devil.","Their descendants began exploring this continent and searching for the way home.","This was the historic background of the game.","The spiritual spells and techniques in the Legend of Mir 2 were not the most powerful ones, but they were the easiest to master and fastest to learn! This feature was perfect for training soldiers!","Just imagine, who would let their soldiers learn techniques such as the Heavenly Sword, Sword God, or Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell?","In contrast, the Lightning Spell was the advanced and simplified version of the ordinary Thunder Spell!","The Fire Wall Spell was the advanced and simplified version of the ordinary Fire Spell!","As for the Slaying Sword Technique and Assassination Sword Techniques, they were the advanced and simplified version of the ordinary sword techniques and sword energies!","You can imagine hundreds of thousands of soldiers commanding godly beasts, using magic shields, and unleashing fireballs.","However, you can’t imagine each of the hundreds of thousands of soldiers using the Heavenly Sword or Sword God techniques! It was impossible.","This was the advantage of these spiritual spells and combat techniques in the Legend of Mir 2!","At this thought, Ji Wu waved his zhanmadao and said, “Let’s test the Assassination Sword Technique.”","From the description of the skill book, the Assassination Sword Technique seemed to be a penetrative essence, and the blade energies that it formed was different from the warrior qi that Ji Wu had learned.","These blade energies could create a special force after leaving the sword and could pierce any monster’s body without a noise; it could also pierce wizard’ shields and damage their bodies!","It was the key to assassination!","Ji Wu hacked his saber and saw a bolt of white blade energy that was condensed by essence from his Dantian slashing out and solidifying after it left his body.","Yu Chi tried to block it with his saber, but the blade energy pierced Yu Chi’s saber in silence, and Yu Chi’s expression changed drastically!","Ji Wu’s eyes lit up. “Go and get more people! I’ll be claiming this area and will get all the skill books!”"]},{"number":262,"title":"Chapter 262 - You Don’t Like The Legend of Mir 2? How about stealing vegetables?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Where did those guys go?” When Yu Chi sent people after Fang Qi and his team, the latter had been gone a long time ago.","They didn’t know that the secret tunnel leading to the Corpse King Hall had to be dug out by a zombie wizard.","“Search this place!” Ji Wu thought that those players must be searching for something valuable since they had taken so many powerful monsters with them.","He immediately ordered his men to search the place.","...","“One of them is trying to rebel!” In the Corpse King Hall, Xi Yue yelled in alarm.","“Summon it back and continue to enchant it,” Fang Qi shouted back calmly.","After the Enchanting Light was used successfully, the master and the servants would form a spiritual bond. Therefore, Xi Yue could command the monster using her mind, and she could sense the emotions of the monsters and tell if they were about to rebel.","In the Corpse King Hall, the torches lit up the pitch-black space, and they found that it was filled with corpse kings.","A few seemed to have noticed them and ran toward them swiftly!","Fang Qi’s items right now were totally different from the time when they first battled a corpse king. With the buff from the Holy Armor Spell, he could handle one corpse king himself. The Tiger Guard could deal with two to three alone, and the Eagle Guard could handle two with no issues. Then, the skeletons and evil worms could deal with a few, so they had the situation under control.","“What was dropped?! What dropped?!” About one hour later, the ground of the Corpse King Hall was covered with dead bodies.","The bodies here didn’t drop items as frequently as before, and only the last few dropped some things!","[Hell Lightning], [Magic Shield], [Crescent Moon Saber], [Savage Charge], [Group Invisibility Spell], [Teleportation]...","Fang Qi looked at the skill books and found that none of them were above level 35.","“F*ck!” Fang Qi touched his forehead and handed the skill books to the girls. “Take them! Nothing too good!”","[Heavy Armor","Armor: 4-7.","Magic Armor: 2-3","Damage: 0-5]","“F*ck! Five extra damage points!”","“So high.” The girls immediately went over and saw that it indeed offered up to five damage points.","Except for the armor, there were an ultimate prayer necklace with [Taoist Spell: 0-5], two magic robes, one set of soul battle armor, and some small good items.","After allocating the loot, Fang Qi and the others killed monsters for a while, and then their playtime was up.","“I don’t want to go home yet...” Seeing that Fang Qi and Jiang Xiaoyue were still killing monsters, Ruan Ning and the other girls were reluctant to leave.","“My Enchanting Light lured so many monsters, and I still want to play it, but the playtime is up!” Xi Yue’s face was cold with dissatisfaction.","“Sister Xi Yue,” Su Zhi asked, “Your Enchanting Light is so powerful; can you learn it in the real world? If you can, there is no logging off in the real world, and the monsters you enchant will...”","“Right!” Xi Yue’s beautiful eyes brightened. “I can try it. It isn’t difficult!”","“Who should I enchant then... There are no monsters here.” Xi Yu glanced around.","Feeling like something wasn’t right, Zou Mo instantly hid behind the counter. When Xi Yue’s gaze came, he was nowhere to be seen.","Her beautiful eyes returned to Fang Qi.","“Don’t even think about it.” Fang Qi’s face turned dark.","“Don’ mess with Old Demon Fang!” Ruan Ning immediately dissuade her, “Let’s find a demon beast!”","The other three girls shook when they heard the three words ‘Old Demon Fang’. Remembering the abilities of this ‘Old Demon’, they fled while saying, “Guild President, we’re off now if you don’t have anything for us to do!”","“Damn it! Who is Old Demon Fang?!” Fang Qi immediately took of the virtual reality headset.","“Run!”","“See you tomorrow! Guild President!” The girls’ expressions changed as they fled.","“This is...” Fang Qi was frustrated.","...","The Legend of Mir 2 had its fans, but there were some players who didn’t like the kind of fights in the game.","For example, Su Tianji quitted the game after playing it with some elders and disciples of Liuyun Daoist Palace.","For one, she didn’t like battling and fighting with other players every day. Also, everyone had their own favorites since there were many choices in Fang Qi’s shop.","At this moment, she exited the game in boredom. Since some players had reached the Nightmare Difficulty in Diablo, she didn’t want to be too behind and thus didn’t want to play it. She had played Counter Strike for a while in the morning. Since the new TV Series episodes wouldn’t come until tomorrow which was Monday, she was bored.","As for QQ, she heard that the people of the Morning Star Sea Realm were aggressive and fierce, so she didn’t add them as her friends. The only friend from the other city was Mr. Fang, and the rest of her friends on QQ were all from her faction.","She bought a box of spicy sticks and then sat there idly.","“Master! Master! Aren’t you going to level up?” Sitting beside her, Fenghua was energetically chasing after a centipede while shooting fireballs.","Su Tianji said, “Your master is old and has no energy for that!”","Idly, she rested her head on the desk and then clicked randomly on QQ.","Then, she found a strange icon.","“Qzone?” Su Tianji looked at it curiously. “What’s this thing?”","She glanced inside of Qzone and found that she could choose a birthplace, house, and vegetable field, etc.","“So strange...” Su Tianji was baffled at the options of a vegetable garden, wondering why a grand cultivator like her would want to grow vegetables like an ordinary person.","Of course, she didn’t know that she would not only grow vegetables but steal others’ vegetables as well in the future.","She opened QQ to ask Mr. Fang since she was confused.","[Sir, what does Qzone do 😕?] In the whole shop, only Fang Qi knew how to type words with the keyboard, and the others all used voice input.","Fang Qi was busy playing the Legend of Mir 2 when he saw the prompt from QQ. “Who is it?”","He opened QQ and glanced at it. Su Tianji? What does she want?","“Qzone?” Fang Qi froze at the message.","“We do have this thing...” Fang Qi scratched his head. The System had indeed given him this reward, but he had been busy playing the Legend of Mir 2 and didn’t pay much attention to it.","Engrossed in playing the Legend of Mir 2, Fang Qi was impatient. [How would I know 🙄?]","Su Tianji, [Aren’t you the shop owner 😠🔪?!]","[You have a point 😄] Fang Qi scratched his head, wondering if he, the shop owner, should try this thing first.","[TL Note: In QQ, there are mini games, and this was one of them. It is based on Happy Farm. Happy Farm was a social network game and massively multiplayer online game based on farm management simulation. It was played predominantly by users in Mainland China and Taiwan, and was the most popular MMOG in terms of players. At the height of its popularity, there were 23 million daily active users, logging on to the game at least every 24 hours.]"]},{"number":263,"title":"Chapter 263 - Mr. Fang’s Paradise","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Yundian Upper Realm –","“How are things going in the Cultivation Realm?” Gongyang Jun asked, “The extra spots that Messenger Feng promised us...”","“Our candidates have all gained access to Cultivation Realm, and the Three Saint Gate gave us the spots that should be for the Wuwei Daoist Alliance,” Gongshu Kuo said, “It’s heard that Messenger Feng spoke for us and did a lot of work.”","“Then, we must do our part as well,” Gongyang Jun smiled smugly. “Otherwise, we’ll look bad. If they refuse to submit, we’ll take down some of their cities, conquer the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and even besiege Jingshi.”","Gongshu Kuo nodded, thinking that it was a good deal for them to deal with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance in exchange for three spots. “You can make the arrangements.”","...","While Ji Wu and his men were searching for the entrance to the Corpse King Hall, Mr. Fang decided to check the so-called Qzone.","Jiang Xiaoyue felt bored killing monster alone in the Legend of Mir 2. Now that she was at a high level and was in no hurry, she decided to watch the TV Series episodes that she had missed.","Fang Qi clicked open Qzone and looked around. It was a vast world, and the place he stood at had green mountains, clear rivers, and vibrant forests. It looked like a perfect living place for a hermit.","He looked around and found that there seemed to be many other options for spawn places, such as a peach forest, a bamboo forest, a pine forest, and even a cliff, an island, a wasteland, and a riverside...","It seems that the players are supposed to grow vegetables here... Grow vegetables...","With so many places to choose from, Mr. Fang scratched his head and couldn’t make up his mind.","“I’ll take this spot!” Mr. Fang chose a place that was beside a mountain and a river with a peach orchard. “I can read the Peach Blossom Spring here! If I put an Eight Trigram Array around here, I can call it the Peach Flower Island!”","[TL Note: The Peach Blossom Spring, or Peach Blossom Spring Story or The Peach Blossom Land, was a fable written by Tao Yuanming in 421 CE about a chance discovery of an ethereal utopia where the people led an ideal existence in harmony with nature, unaware of the outside world for centuries.","The Peach Flower Island is mentioned many times in Jin Yong’s Condor Trilogy, therefore gaining its popularity.]","He had forgotten that he was just a vegetable farmer.","After he made his choice, a farmhouse appeared before him with a field in front of it.","At this moment, five vegetables were growing in the field, and one of them had matured.","In this space, there was a beginner’s manual, teaching the new players how to harvest the matured vegetables.","Fang Qi took a digging spade from the house and dug out the vegetable. He looked at its description and saw its name, White-Golden Spiritual Daikon.","“... What daikon?” Fang Qi froze.","He could sell it to the shop for 272 gold coins, or he could eat it himself and gained some cultivation strength.","Fang Qi carried the big daikon in his arms and thought, So, that’s how things work here?!","This is a big daikon; do you want me to bite into it like this? Fang Qi was puzzled.","He sold it and saw that the price of daikon seed was 125 gold coins. He bought two seeds and planted them, and he entered the house after watering them.","It was a clean wooden house with one big living room, wooden chairs, and a wooden desk.","He opened the windows, and the bright sunshine shone into the room, making the room look warm and cozy. While living here, one would feel like a hermit with no intention of getting involved in worldly conflicts.","Fang Qi took a look and found that the shop had seeds for tea trees. On top of that, Fang Qi saw that he could keep dogs, cats, and fish!","There were even elixir furnaces and elixir recipes!","Players can even make elixirs here?!","Fang Qi continued to browse in the shop and looked at the items as he exclaimed, “I can even buy computers here?!”","Fang Qi was confused. I can enjoy the Legend of Mir 2 on the computers in the real world; what’s the use of computers for me in this place?","He almost dropped onto the ground on his butt when he saw poker cards in the shop!","Hey! We’re here to grow vegetables, no?","Dizzy, Fang Qi walked out of the house and found that the daikon he just planted had matured!","He blinked, thinking that he had seen wrong. Have the White-Golden Spiritual Daikon matured in a few minutes?!","At a closer look, he heaved a sigh of relief when he found that the matured ones had been planted before he came; they were not the ones that he had just planted.","However, it seemed like the White-Golden Spiritual Daikon had a short growing cycle, and he estimated that they would mature in a few hours.","He was alarmed. After all, the White-Golden Spiritual Daikon, which could increase people’s cultivation strength was a spiritual plant, but it could mature in a few hours.","Amazed, Fang Qi harvested the daikon. Then, while looking around the scenic farmland, he nodded in satisfaction.","He studied the other functions of Qzone as well.","On the interface were icons of [Invite Friends into Qzone], [Enter Friends’ Qzone], and [Invite Friends to Watch TV Series], etc.","“Hey! Are you done with the testing?!” Impatient, Su Tianji sent him a message in QQ.","“Done!” Fang Qi stretched and tossed the spade to the side.","[Your friend Mr. Fang invites you to enter his Qzone. Do you accept?] Su Tianji saw the prompt on QQ.","She immediately clicked [Yes].","On the screen appeared a flourishing peach tree forest, and there was a farmhouse in the depth, behind which was a clear winding river. In the fenced field in front of the house, some vegetables were growing.","Looking at Mr. Fang who wore simple cotton clothes, Su Tianji widened her eyes. “You’re really farming?”","Then, she looked down at herself and found that she was also wearing simple cotton clothes like those in the early stages of the Legend of Mir 2!","She thought they were ugly!","Su Tianji who put great importance on her self-image felt sulky.","Mr. Fang took out two big daikon and said, “Do you want to eat them? It’s heard that eating one can extend one year of your life; if you eat them all, you will live as long as the earth and heaven! Super White-Golden Spiritual Daikon!”","“Pooh!” Who would believe his nonsense!","“Forget it!” Fang Qi was indifferent. Each of the daikons is more than 200 gold coins; do you think I want to give one to you?","He immediately sold them in the shop and bought several more seeds.","Seeing Fang Qi loosening the soil and planting the seeds, Su Tianji was at a loss for words. “What’s the use of growing these things?”","“It’s useless. You can leave!” Fang Qi said.","“... Tell me!”","“You can look around the things in the shop,” Fang Qi said in displeasure, “You can try it yourself! Don’t just ask me!”","“You’re the shop owner and have lots of playtime!” Su Tianji said with a cold face, “We can only play eight hours each day.”","While she said that, she opened the shop. “There aren’t many things here. These spiritual plant seeds can only grow in this virtual space...”","“Keep looking.”","Su Tianji rolled up the list and exclaimed in a louder voice, “Dragon Drool Tea Recipe?! Nine-Cycle Heaven Heart Elixir Recipe?! Almighty Elixir Recipe?! Street Fighter 97 Gaming Disk?!”","“Ugh?” Su Tianji froze. “What’s the last item? Why is that here?”"]},{"number":264,"title":"Chapter 264 - A Group of Idle People Began Their New Life","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Su Tianji scrolled down the list and found that the shop had not only elixir recipes but also sheet music, such as the Worldly Affair Mind-Cleansing Tune, Green Ocean Wave-Creating Tune, etc. There were also a lot of weird things that she had never seen before.","Besides, she found that the shop even sold clothes!","Looking at her crude cotton clothes and then the extremely beautiful dresses in the shop with sky-high prices, Su Tianji said, So expensive, but this place is using gold coins.","With the dignity of a grand cultivator, she said with faked coolness, “Sir, this Star Elixir Recipe costs 50,000 gold coins. Does it mean that I can buy it with only 50 crystals? It’s quite cheap!”","She was ready to pay, thinking that it was a great deal to buy such an awesome recipe for only 50 crystals!","“You got it wrong.” Fang Qi rolled his eyes. “You can only buy it with the money you earn in this space.”","“Ahh?” Su Tianji looked at her empty pocket and said embarrassedly, “I have no money!”","“Grow vegetables! Eventually, you’ll earn money.” Fang Qi plowed the field and found something like a peach core. The space sent him a prompt, “You found a spiritual peach seed. Do you want to plant it?]","“Ugh?” Fang Qi froze.","“Of course, I’ll plant it!”","“...”","Ten minutes later, Fenghua asked while killing monsters in The Legend of Mir 2, “Master, where are you?”","Su Tianji answered with gritted teeth, “I’m farming!”","“Farming?!” Dumbfounded, Fenghua and Yuexin looked over and saw Su Tianji wearing crude cotton clothes and indeed plowing the field with a spade on the screen!","Since the people in Qzone had no cultivation strength, sweat began to pop out on her forehead after a while.","“Hu...” In a green pine forest, Su Tianji wiped the sweat off her forehead and exhaled while she looked at the big daikon in her field. She began to calculate in her mind, One White Golden Spiritual Daikon sells for 275 coins, and the good ones can get more than 300 coins. If I sell one, I can buy two seeds... When I grow a field of daikon, I will be able to buy the Star Elixir Recipe... and the Worldly Affair Mind-Cleansing Tune which can elevate mental strength! Then I’ll buy some pretty clothes. The Celestial Feather Gown is good but too pricey... I’ll take the Simple Heart Dress first...","This field is dilapidated, and it doesn’t fit my style. I must decorate it... She calculated in her mind.","“Master, what are you thinking?” Fenghua and Yuexin were stupefied as they watched Su Tianji murmuring with a greedy face on the screen.","...","In the fenced field in front of Fang Qi’s house, there were only five daikons and a spiritual peach tree. Fang Qi looked at them and estimated that they wouldn’t mature until two to three hours later.","During this period, he could kill pests and pull out weeds, which could ensure the prosperity of the plants. If he did none of those things, the plants would also grow but with less value.","As for the many peach trees around the house, they were the ordinary kind and couldn’t be sold for money. As in real life, growing vegetables only needed a small amount of time and energy each day as long as there weren’t too many plants.","After doing all the chores, Fang Qi only needed to wait for the plants to mature. During the time, he could do something else; he just needed to come back occasionally to kill pests or remove weeds before the final harvest.","If he didn’t come back to kill pests or remove weeds, it didn’t matter much except that the harvest wouldn’t be as good.","Su Tianji also found this environment quite relaxing. She had chosen a forest of pine trees and bamboos, and there were creeks and flying birds. Compared to the grand view of Liuyun Daoist Palace, this place was quiet and private, giving her a feeling of elegance and freshness.","Staying in this place, she found her mood and mind both refreshed. Su Tianji suddenly realized that she didn’t want to leave this place at all; she could grow vegetables, sip fragrant tea, and practice the guzheng, playing her favorite tunes. In fact, just casually playing it was refreshing.","[TL Note: The zheng or guzheng, also known as a Chinese zither, is a Chinese plucked string instrument with a more than 2,500-year history.]","Then, she would harvest her big daikon and buy stuff! This was a life of relaxation and leisure.","Needing some company, she pulled in her two disciples. “Fenghua! Yuexin! Come and grow vegetables with me!”","“Master! What’s the fun of farming?!” Fenghua and Yuexin were confused since they didn’t play yet.","“Yeah. It’s more fun to get items and increase cultivation strength in the Legend of Mir 2! What can farming do for us?”","“It doesn’t cost you a lot of time!” Su Tianji said while she demonstrated, “You just need to spend about 20 minutes each day on planting the seeds and watering them! It’s an easy task!”","If they did the same thing to the precious spiritual herbs in their faction, the spiritual herbs would have died long ago. Su Tianji was amazed at how easy it was to grow the White Golden Spiritual Daikon in this space!","Then, she added, “After growing them, you can go and play; just remember to come back and harvest them.”","“So easy?” Seeing the simple process, the two girls decided to try it. Soon, two more vegetable farmers appeared in Qzone.","“Senior Sister Fenghua! Senior Sister Yuexin! What are you playing?” Some passing disciples of Liuyun Daoist Palace came over when they saw the two girls busy plowing the field.","“Growing vegetables!” Soon, these disciples all opened their vegetable gardens after knowing that it would cost them little time but would bring them great benefits.","Hearing that they could grow vegetables, Song Qingfeng who had been playing the Legend of Mir 2 immediately sent a message to Fang Qi, [Sir, what can the vegetables do? Are you growing them?]","[I am 😄!] Fang Qi who was browsing the shop replied immediately.","“Ugh? The shop owner is also growing vegetables?” Song Qingfeng immediately called out to his friends, “Young Master Lin! Young Master Xu! Let’s try ‘Qzone’ as well! I heard that the shop owner is also growing vegetables in there!”","“Will that affect our game time?” Lin Shao had finally reached level 25 with great efforts, and he was afraid that the others would overtake him.","“No! It won’t!” Song Qingfeng said, “I heard that you just need to plant them in the field and just remember to harvest them!”","“Let’s go! We’ll grow vegetables too!” Soon, Fang Qi saw the friends in his QQ all opening their Qzone and beginning to grow vegetables.","At this moment, Su Tianji had collected the first batch of daikons and planted the second batch. Since she didn’t have the chance to open new fields yet, she used the remaining gold coins to buy the cheapest guzheng and the sheet music of Wind in Pines. While boiling a pot of Longjing Tea on the stove in front of the house, she enjoyed herself.","“Fenghua! Yuexin! Come and listen to my Wind in Pines! What do you think of my skills? It’s said that it will increase mental strength!” She dragged the two girls out of the Legend of Mir 2 into her Qzone.","“Ding ding dong dong...” With tears on their faces, they listened to Su Tianji’s rusty playing... Increase mental strength? They felt like their minds were about to collapse!","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang bought the song, The Boundless Sea and Sky by Beyond, with ten gold coins.","“Today, I watch the snowflakes flying by...” While humming along, he plowed the field following the rhythm of the music, enjoying himself very much."]},{"number":265,"title":"Chapter 265 - I Stole the Vegetable with My Abilities","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Did you hear that we can grow vegetables in Qzone in QQ! The spiritual plants there can increase our cultivation strengths! It needs nothing but planting and harvesting!” The players who were playing The Legend of Mir 2 chatted with each other.","“So magical?”","“Shall we try it? It’s free! We can hurry back after planting.”","“Okay! Let’s go and have a look!”","...","Even though the System took the majority of the profits, Mr. Fang made quite a lot of crystals. However, after spending most of his income on the shop in Half City, he was almost kicked into poverty.","Fortunately, the shops were full of customers these days and earned lots of money, which gradually replenished Mr. Fang’s pocket.","After dinner, Fang Qi was flossing his teeth with his legs crossed. With money coming in, he was feeling a bit smug. Should I find some time to go shopping? Buy some luxurious stuff? It’s late today... Tomorrow, I’ll watch TV drama... and the day after...","Damn! Mr. Fang gave up on his idea. Maybe I’ll wait a few days...","At this thought, Fang Qi opened the game and clicked open QQ to invite all the people who had opened Qzone to be his friends.","“Someone sent me a friend invitation?” At Su Tianji’s recommendation, Xue Daolv was also playing Qzone since she told him that it would cost him little time but would bring him great benefits. He was now busy growing vegetables.","Seeing someone sending him a friend invitation, he was reluctant at first until he found that it was from Mr. Fang.","He immediately clicked [Yes]!","Elder Fu had just finished growing a batch of vegetables and was playing Diablo with Nalan Hongwu. At the prompt of QQ, he found that someone wanted to add him as a friend.","Mr. Fang?","Fang Qi had had Nalan Hongwu as his friend and didn’t have Elder Fu, and Elder Fu was surprised at his invitation. Why does he want to add me?","“What’s it?” Nalan Hongwu saw his surprise.","“Nothing. That kid Fang Qi suddenly wants to add me as a friend.” Elder Fu said, “I’ll just click [Yes] and ignore him.”","In Qzone, Dong Qingli and Zhang Wanyu were browsing the shop together.","“I want to buy this!” Dong Qingli pointed at a huge stuffed Pikachu and said, “This yellow mouse is cute! And it’s not expensive!”","“This house is too crude,” Zhang Wanyu said, “I plan to save some money and decorate it, and it will look nice when I invite friends over!”","“Good idea!”","“Ugh?” Zhang Wanyu sounded surprised.","“What’s it?”","“Mr. Fang wants to add me as a friend!” Zhang Wanyu said, “He has you as his friend; why does he want to add me?”","“He might want to get to know you in secret!” Dong Qingli speculated naïvely as if she had discovered a new continent.","“Nonsense!”","Bai Lang was playing the Legend of Mir 2 when a message popped out from QQ.","“Mr. Fang? Add me as a friend?”","“I received the message too!” Zhou Hongying gasped beside him.","“Me too!” The middle-aged cultivator, Zhan Yan, was also surprised.","...","By now, Fang Qi’s friend list grew from about 20 to almost 100, and the number was still growing as time went by.","[Tell the truth! Why do you want to add my disciples as your friends?] Su Tianji was wary and sent a message to question him, afraid that this despicable guy wanted to lure her good disciples away from her!","He is trying to lure both at the same time! One is alright, but this is outrageous!","At this moment, Su Tianji was tuning her guzheng. The Wind in Pines composed by Ji Kang wasn’t expensive, and Su Tianji liked it very much. After practicing for a while, she could now manage to play the whole piece.","She had just called her two disciples over and heard from them that Mr. Fang had added both as friends!","What is he up to?","Su Tianji built a guzheng platform on the field beside her house. After placing the guzheng on it, she plucked the strings while she waited for Fang Qi’s reply.","She was familiar with guzheng, and now she was proficient with this piece of music.","While she played it, the crisp notes floated into the forest with the breeze.","Her two disciples hummed along while following the rhythm of the music, and they looked like immortals who lived in seclusion.","Of course, only if they didn’t see the following scene.","They saw a figure sneaking into the fenced field in the courtyard with a spade and digging at the biggest White Gold Spiritual Daikon.","“Master... That’s...” Fenghua and Yuexin’s minds went blank.","Su Tianji who was engrossed in the playing turned her head and saw the figure digging out the big daikon and running with it in his arms!","“Stop!” Su Tianji immediately roared in anger.","She put the guzheng on one side and ignored it while she chased after that figure at top speed!","However, when she chased into her courtyard, the thief was gone.","“Fang Qi!!” Su Tianji gritted her teeth, and her eyes had flames in them.","You dared to steal my daikon?! The daikon that I’ve planted for hours with great efforts got stolen like this?","“Master! Master!” Fenghua and Yuexin checked their gardens and said, “Our vegetables were stolen too!”","“What?!” Su Tianji exploded in fury instantly!","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had returned to his place and was counting his loot.","“Su Tianji, one big daikon. Fenghua, one big daikon; Yuexin, ten spiritual oranges... Zhang Wanyu, ten spiritual oranges...”","By now, Mr. Fang had stolen vegetables from dozens of people, and the loot made him thousands of gold coins! He was rich!","“What should I buy?” Mr. Fang, who had gotten rich overnight, browsed the shop and the many items in it.","“Seeds. I’ll buy some seeds of spiritual grains. Two sets of clothes... Armani suits are nice! I’ll take one! Sapphire-blue mage robe? Looks interesting. I’ll take one.”","“I’ll buy a dog too...” Fang Qi believed that a dog was a necessary addition to his house. Soon, he came to the section for pets.","There were two kinds of dogs in Qzone; one was ordinary pet dogs, and the other was dogs that could guard the house after training. The latter was more expensive.","Fang Qi browsed the list. “Golden Retriever... Husky... Native dogs...”","Fang Qi bought an Akita Inu. The moment that he bought it, he saw a figure rushing in. After all, friends could enter each other’s places as long as the doors weren’t closed.","“Fang Qi!” Su Tianji walked over with a dark expression and reached out her hand. “Return my daikon to me!”","“Why?” Mr. Fang said righteously, “I stole it with my abilities! Why should I return it?!”","Su Tianji instantly lost it, and she used her ultimate techniques.","Lion Roar!","Turtle Fist!","Invincible Wheel Punches!","[TL Note: These are the names for the roars and random punches in China.]","Mr. Fang fled while covering his head with his hands"]},{"number":266,"title":"Chapter 266 - Bitten by A Dog","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Stop! You must return it!” In Fang Qi’s Qzone, Su Tianji showed her chilling and ferocious face, disregarding her usual image!","“I only took a daikon! It’s no big deal!”","“I nurtured it for three hours!” Su Tianji was furious. “And you stole stuff from my disciples too! Return them now!”","“They are all gone!” Mr. Fang looked shameless, and then he pointed at the dog, saying, “I spent the money on the dog. You can come and steal my plants and vegetable when they mature.”","Do you think that I’m that kind of a person? I... She cussed silently, I can’t do anything to this shameless guy right now. I’ll mislead him with some gentle words and then steal all of his vegetables tomorrow! I’ll see what he can do at that time!","No! It’s not stealing! I will just be taking back what’s mine! Su Tianji corrected herself in her mind with a cold expression. That’s the plan!","I will come tomorrow! She thought in resentment","Then, she asked with a benign expression, “Why did you buy the dog?”","“Why I bought the dog? The dog...” Fang Qi thought for a long while and said, “It’s good for the country!”","“What does growing vegetables have to do with the country?!” Su Tianji’s face turned dark.","...","At this moment, Dong Qingli and Zhang Wanyu returned to Qzone to collect vegetables after finishing playing the games.","“I lost many oranges!” Zhang Wanyu yelled in alarm.","“Ugh? How come my big daikon is gone?!” Dong Qingli was baffled at the sight of a big hole in the field. “This big daikon was here only a moment ago!”","Elder Fu also discovered something. “It seems that one of the vegetables in my garden is missing?”","“I lost some vegetables too!” Nalan Hongwu looked at his vegetable garden in confusion.","“Where are my spiritual oranges?! Who took them?!” Xue Daolv froze.","Song Qingfeng, Xu Zixin, and the others were stupefied when they returned to their own fields.","Dozens of players who had grown vegetables were confused by the situation.","The players in the Jiuhua City Shop had created a group chat, but it was rarely used. But today, things were different.","Lan Yan, [One of my vegetables went missing! It’s very strange! How about you guys?]","[I lost one as well!]","[I lost a big daikon!]","[I lost some spiritual grains!]","[My oranges went missing!]","Someone even sent [@Mr. Fang] in the group.","[Mr. Fang, what is going on?]","[I’ll go and get some information!] Nalan Mingxue popped up.","She ran into Fang Qi’s Qzone.","Three minutes later, Nalan Mingxue reported, [Don’t ask Mr. Fang; he stole the vegetables, and he said that he wouldn’t return the stolen goods, even challenging us to steal his vegetables!]","The crowd became indignant!","Su Tianji expressed her mind in the group. [This kid is outrageous. Tomorrow, let’s go and empty his garden!]","Lan Yan: [I agree!]","Song Qingfeng: [Me too!]","Xu Zixin: [Count me in!]","Jiang Xiaoyue: [I lost my vegetable too! I’ll steal from Boss!]","“...”","Mr. Fang emerged and voice his opinion in the group, [😅 Can you talk about this in private...]","Su Tianji: [ Who pulled Mr. Fang into the group?]","Nalan Mingxue, Lan Yan, and all the others were at a loss for words.","After all, few people had glanced at the names in the group chat...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was playing with the Akita Inu in his place.","“Come! Smile! Little Akita!”","Snap!","Fang Qi took pictures with a camera.","Thousands of gold coins were enough to buy these small items. More importantly, he found that he could use these pictures to make memes!","Fang Qi took the pictures and then began making memes of the Akita Inu.","It was soon 12 at midnight; Fang Qi closed the shop and went to bed.","...","On the next morning, Su Tianji came into the shop very early with her disciples. Without watching the TV series or eating breakfast, she went online impatiently.","At this moment, Mr. Fang sat down before the computer leisurely with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands.","There was no one in Fang Qi’s Qzone. After one night, the vegetables in Fang Qi’s fields looked quite tempting. The White-Golden Spiritual Daikon had big leaves, showing that they had matured long ago.","The spiritual peach tree was heavy with fruits, and these fruits were about to drop.","A small yellow dog was napping in the dog house by the side, and its face was on the ground, making it looked dull and silly.","Su Tianji copied Fang Qi and walked into the field with a spade. She muttered with a cold expression, “I’ll take back all of your illegally acquired goods!”","After walking into the courtyard, she first dug out a daikon.","Good! She got a daikon.","Then, she began picking peaches.","[Beep!]","The alarm sounded, and she got a warning, [Don’t be greedy.]","Su Tianji froze and then thought, No wonder that kid only stole one. I thought he wasn’t too greedy, but the truth is that he can’t steal more than one!","Forget it. More people will come and steal from him. Since she had reached the limit, and there would be more people coming to steal from the garden, Su Tianji was ready to leave.","Your garden will be empty sooner or later! She glared at the field and was about to leave when a yellow dog blocked her way.","“Bark! Bark! Bark!”","“How come this dog is so ferocious?”","“Ahh!”","...","One minute later, a message appeared in Fang Qi’s QQ. [Fang Qi! Come out!]","The message had Su Tianji’s beautiful photo as the avatar on the side.","[What?] Fang Qi just finished his instant noodles.","On the other side, Su Tianji was looking at her list of costs in fury!","[Rabies Vaccine: 800!","Medication: 100!]","That was what she got for stealing a daikon that was worth only 300!","What was more infuriating was that she dropped the big daikon in the garden and forgot to pick it up!","[Explain what is going on with your dog 😠🔪🔪🔪...” A row of kitchen knives showed Su Tianji’s murderous spirit.","[What dog?] After just finishing his breakfast, Fang Qi was baffled.","[Don’t play dumb!]","[When are you returning to Jiuhua? I’ll invite you to a meal!] Su Tianji’s words oozed chills.","“I won’t return for the time being, Sis!” Fang Qi added the meme of the Akita Inu smiling that he took yesterday. [So you can’t fight me in real life!]","[So, you know that I will fight you! 😠🔪🔪🔪]","Suddenly, she paused and asked, [Where did you get that picture?!]","[Do you want it?] Fang Qi typed. [I’ll sent you a set of such memes, okay?]","At this moment, bedlam broke loose in the group chat.","Lan Yan, [Who went and stole the shop owner’s vegetables? This damn guy has a dog 😠!”","Song Qingfeng, [I knew that the shop owner would be on guard. He heard our conversation yesterday; why would you go!]","Lan Yan: [You didn’t go?]","Lin Shao: [Bullsh*t! He went! We were bitten first, and he fled 🔪!]","[Trashy shop owner!]","[I agree! Trashy shop owner!]","[Beep.]","At this moment, the system prompt sounded, and all of them received the message, [Your friend ‘Mr. Fang’ is inviting you to watch Jade Dynasty. Do you accept?]"]},{"number":267,"title":"Chapter 267 - The Tourist Group of Jade Dynasty","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Inviting me to watch Jade Dynasty? Everyone froze. What is he up to?","[Guys! Don’t accept!] Su Tianji called out in the group chat. [This kid is too despicable! He not only stole our vegetables but sent a dog to bite us! He wants to gain our forgiveness by showing two episodes of Jade Dynasty? No way!]","[Right!]","[I think so too!]","[Guys! Don’t accept!]","[Keep the consensus going!]","[I wasn’t bitten by the dog. I’ve clicked ‘Accept’ already😳...] Song Qingfeng sent an embarrassed emoji.","People didn’t know what to say to him for a moment.","Su Tianji said, “You don’t have to go even if you accepted (Akita Inu fierce face)!”","Lan Yan suggested, [When the shop owner is watching the TV Series, we’ll go and steal his vegetables together! I don’t think that dog can bite all of us!]","[Ugh? How come you have this picture?] Jiang Xiaoyue sent the 😲 Emoji.","Fang Qi soon sent a meme of his Akita Inu being silly while wearing a scarf.","“Oh! So silly!” Jiang Xiaoyue sent the 😄 Emoji.","Dong Qingli was also interested, [Where do you get these?]","Su Tianji, [Don’t change the topic (Akita Inu baring teeth)!]","Fang Qi sent the meme of Akita Inu playing cute with head leaning to one side.","Su Tianji, [(Akita Inu disdainful face)!]","[(Akita Inu leaning his head to one side)]","[(Akita Inu ferocious face)]","“...”","Lan Yan: [Ugh? Isn’t it the silly dog in the shop owner’s field?]","Dong Qingli: [Why does it look so silly?!]","Lin Shao: [The more you look at it, the sillier it looks!]","Xu Luo: [Can we cook it 😠?]","[TL Note: LOL, the dog-eating stereotype.]","Obviously, he had been bitten several times by this dog.","“If you right-click on the image, you can save it and send it!” Someone discovered this function.","Soon, the group chat turned into a flood of memes! The original topic was completely forgotten!","Meanwhile, the indignant chatters and the angry members were silently pulled into a newly-established group chat.","Nalan Mingxue: [That kid obviously wants to change the topic! Don’t be fooled by him! Who knows his ID in the Legend of Mir 2?]","Su Tianji: [What do you want to do?]","Lin Shao: [You want to sneak-attack him? Count me in!]","Ye Xiaoye: [I like it!]","Su Tianji: [Good idea! Count me in!]","Nalan Hongwu: [I’m out. You guys go ahead.] Anyway, he wasn’t bitten by the dog and had no intention of joining in on the revenge.","Standing behind Su Tianji, Xiao Yulv saw the conversation, and he immediately raised his hand, yelling, “I know his ID! I can find his whereabouts for you!”","After all, he had often watched Jiang Xiaoyue play the games.","Su Tianji was pleased. “You finally can do something useful!”","“...”","Soon, a battle of wits and courage against Mr. Fang began.","...","[It seems that you succeeded in changing the topic.] Nalan Mingxue sent him a meme of Akita Inu’s disdainful face in a private message.","[Not at all. They are touched by my warmth and sincerity (Akita Inu silly smile)!] Fang Qi replied, [Come and watch the TV Series.]","Nalan Mingxue: [How come your face is thicker than the city wall?]","[TL Note: This is a common saying in China to describe a shameless person.]","[Coming or not?]","[Of course 😤!] Of course, she would come! She must get the interest on her revenge first!","Soon, Fang Qi saw that most of them had accepted his invitations.","...","“Sir, what are you doing?” Ruan Ning stood behind Fang Qi with a bowl of instant noodles. “Aren’t you going to play the Legend of Mir 2 today?”","“I’ll watch the TV Series first!” Fang Qi said, “I’ll play the game after that.”","“What Series?” Ruan Ning said with a frown, “What’s that?”","Fang Qi pointed at a line of words in the middle of the small blackboard. “Jade Dynasty.”","Although the players in the new shop couldn’t play other games, they could watch the TV Series.","With the Legend of Mir 2 written on the top of the blackboard, many customers were playing this game. Besides, the people in Half City hid good stuff from others, except in the case of the Legend of Mir 2 in which they had been forced to pull teammates into their group to survive.","Many people were addicted to playing the Legend of Mir 2 and couldn’t spare a thought for other stuff. Even though they noticed the TV Series, they didn’t have time to try them.","That was why only a few people watched Jade Dynasty in the new shop.","Ruan Ning and the others didn’t even have enough time to level up with Fang Qi and thus didn’t have time to try the new stuff.","“I recommend you girls to watch it when you have time,” Fang Qi said. Whatever the customers did in the shop, they would spend money. Therefore, he only talked and gave tips to the girls in his guild.","What’s that? You’re being vague about it, yet you are also asking us to watch it... Ruan Ning was frustrated.","Qzone had the function of inviting friends over to watch the TV Series together.","Even the people from the distant Morning Star Sea Realm could join the people from Jiuhua City to watch the TV Series together. For a small gathering of a few friends, they could sit in the living room, sharing a pot of good tea. As for a large group like that one that Fang Qi was having today, the situation was...","Fang Qi said, “Welcome to the Death Souls Abyss Tour!”","Mr. Fang took a large group of people to the Death Souls Abyss in the Ancient Ten-Thousand Bat Cave.","In the depths of the dark abyss floated faint whitish light.","When the faint light shone on the floating souls from the underground, some faint-hearted people hid behind others.","In the Death Souls Abyss, they witnessed the deep love between Zhang Xiaofan and Lu Xueqi who were ready to die for each other and the horrifying ancient beasts in the Merciless Ocean.","They also saw the nimble and playful girl in green, Bi Yao.","The audience experienced dangerous adventures and narrow escapes with the characters in the TV Series and were moved by the good sides of human nature and the true feelings revealed in the adventures.","In Blood-Dripping Cave, the audience had their hearts in their throats when they watched Zhang Xiaofan and Bi Yao being trapped inside.","“Where is this place?” While they walked deeper into the cave behind Fang Qi, Dong Qingli and the others clicked their tongues in wonder.","“This place seems to be the headquarters of the so-called Blood Refinery Hall which, is an evil faction.” Nalan Hongwu, Xue Daolv, and the others looked around and saw a big stone room. On the left of the room was a statue with a benign face while the statue on the right looked ferocious with a black face and ghost horns.","“Do you think that they will find some treasures here?”","“They found a bell!”","“Look here!” Someone yelled in astonishment.","Meanwhile, Bi Yao also exclaimed in the scene, “Heavenly Book?”","All the people in the audience didn’t expect this, and they were pleasantly surprised. They gasped in excitement as they read the words on the wall – First Chapter of the Heavenly Book!","[At the beginning of the world, chaos filled the space with the sun and the moon concealing their light and the heaven and the earth blurring their boundaries. Then, they began to take shape, and the pure and turbid began to separate...]","According to the ancient myths, all the spiritual spells and techniques of the Saint Faction (Demon Faction) came from the Heavenly Book!","In this world, the cultivators used heavenly power while the warriors tried their best to strengthen their bodies. However, the Heavenly Book seemed to cover everything they could imagine!","Mr. Fang: “The Dead Souls Abyss Touring Group has arrived the Heavenly Book Stop. Please read the book at your leisure!”","“...”"]},{"number":268,"title":"Chapter 268 - Fled offline and new recruits","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","All the people were elated. While they watched the TV Series, they couldn’t get the main character’s treasures, but they could learn from his adventures and obtain his techniques!","They had learned the Tai Chi Mystic Pure Dao Technique, and now they had the opportunity to obtain the Heavenly Book!","However, to their regret, the first chapter of Heavenly Book was extremely profound and mysterious since it was the most important chapter of the Heavenly Book!","Special talent and lots of time were needed to understand it!","“This is so deep!” Nalan Hongwu lamented in frustration, feeling dizzy in front of the words which explained the ultimate truth of the world. “We still have many questions about the cultivation methods and spiritual spells in this world. It’s difficult for us to understand the words on the stone tablet...”","People like Xue Daolv, Ye Songtao, and Lan Mo sat down cross-legged and began to study the words in concentration and tried to understand in their own ways.","“I think the words aren’t describing high-level techniques or cultivation methods.” Nalan Mingxue studied each word on the stone tablet. “They explain the special rules and truth.”","“This girl got it right.” Lan Mo nodded and said, “In short, they are the ultimate truths about the world!”","Hearing Lan Mo’s words, everyone looked surprised. “Why would they show this stuff to us?”","They were stunned!","“Are you guys finished?” Fang Qi said, “The touring group is about to leave!”","“Give me another half hour!” Nalan Hongwu said.","“Half an hour is not enough!” Lan Mo said, “One hour! At least one hour!”","“One hour is not enough!” Su Tianji said.","“Let’s go now!” Fang Qi looked down on them. “We’re watching an episode! Who would pause an episode for one hour?”","He clicked [Start] immediately.","“Don’t!”","“Sir! That’s not kind! Everyone wants to read the Heavenly Book!” Ye Songtao said, “Give me one moment!”","“I will need a moment too!” Nalan Hongwu yelled immediately, “Pause! It will pass if you don’t pause it!”","“Right! We can watch the episode later!” Lan Mo said, “But we must study the Heavenly Book carefully!”","“Take your time. I’ll go and read the second chapter of the Heavenly Book,” Fang Qi said casually.","“There’s a second chapter?” Like a bomb, Fang Qi’s words attracted everyone’s attention.","“Did that senior give you some tips and important spoilers?” Lan Yan asked suspiciously, “How do you know that there’s a second chapter?”","Fang Qi pointed at the first line on the stone tablet, asking, “Do you know these three words?”","“The First Chapter?”","Fang Qi spread his hands and shrugged. “See? Since the first chapter is here, there must be a second chapter, and there might be a third or a fourth chapter! Do you want to read them?”","“Of course!” All of them looked interested. “Go on and let me see what the second chapter of the Heavenly Book looks like!”","“Oh! Can Zhang Xiaofan and Bi Yao escape from this cave?!” After all, the return route is now blocked!","Everyone began to watch the episode in concentration.","“Come and look at this!” After Bi Yao had walked out of the stone room, the audience read a small line of words under the white bones.","[The bell weeps, and all flowers wither; lovers turn haggard with white hair. Love is bitter and torturous, and the sentimental will always be hurt by the heartless.]","...","The audience watched the story of Lady Golden Bell (Jin Ling), Xiaofan and Bi Yao’ starvation without food or water, and their search for the way out.","“Zhang Xiaofan and Bi Yao are so pitiable...” Holding a middle-sized stuffed Pikachu which she had bought with one day’s income of growing vegetables, Dong Qingli felt like crying while she watched this episode. “They had just read the Heavenly Book, and now they might die here?”","“Nonsense!” A passing Cloud Ocean Faction elder said, “I think they will find a way out!”","In the moment of desperation, the two people found that there was something wrong with the word ‘hurt’ in the line of ‘the sentimental will always be hurt by the heartless.’","The dent in the word fit perfectly with the bell that they had found!","“They found it!” The girls were excited.","The others were also elated.","However, when they walked, they didn’t find an exit, but some words looking like those that they had seen in the Heavenly Book in the previous stone room!","“Is it the second chapter of Heavenly Book?” Excited, everyone read the words out loud subconsciously.","[Gloomy souls in the Hell and demons and gods in the heaven, I’ll sacrifice my body to you and fall into the Hell forever for my love without regret.]","“Turning a woman’s essence blood into a ferocious curse?” They read the words of the curse passage, and they felt terrified.","If this curse was used, the woman would stay in Hell forever. It was so evil!","“Love Curse?” Hearing Bi Yao’s explanation, all the viewers were surprised. “This curse is so evil; what does it to do with love?”","“Will anyone use it?” All of them looked doubtful.","At this moment, the area dimmed.","“It ended! Ahh!”","“The two episodes already?! Will Zhang Xiaofan and Bi Yao come out in the end?”","All of the viewers were frustrated.","“Sir! Where’s the second chapter of the Heavenly Book?!”","“It might be in the next episode.”","The others yelled, “Don’t run if you dare!”","“I’ll forgive you if you let me beat you!”","“Can’t you release 100 episodes altogether?!”","“Can’t you put the chapters of the Heavenly Book in one episode?!”","“Em? No! How come some of my vegetables went missing again?!”","“Where’s Mr. Fang?”","All of them froze. “He’s offline!”","At this moment, Mr. Fang had gotten offline without hesitation. Anyway, no one could come through the internet cable to beat him! Getting offline ended all the trouble for him!","In Half City, with the popularity of Fang Qi’s shop and the Legend of Mir 2, no one dared to mess with him.","Besides, the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild had destroyed Qin Honglin and thus became the biggest force of the 36th block.","Occasionally, some cultivators asked to join the guild. Although Fang Qi hadn’t established his guide in the game yet, the guild in the real world now had about 30 members.","Since the guild didn’t have a lot of members, sometimes Fang Qi would ask Ruan Ning and other girls or even Zou Mo to manage the guild, which made him look like the leader of the big guilds in his previous world. In short, he didn’t have to do any work and almost delegated all of his duties.","Today, Fang Qi was a bit surprised while he looked at the people who wanted to join the guild.","“Guild President, what do you think?” Ruan Ning whispered to him smugly, “I personally recruited three grand cultivators!”","Fang Qi looked at the embarrassed Mo Tianxing, a short and chubby old man who was rubbing his hand bashfully, and an old Daoist in dark Daoist robe.","“Well! Little... Guild President Fang,” the short and chubby old man said while rubbing his hands, “Do you still need people in your guild?”","Beside him, Mo Tianxing and the old Daoist looked embarrassed for him and didn’t want to be around him.","“Can you take us with you to get good items?”","“Can you give us some of the items that you replaced?”","“Can you tell us some good places to level up? We’ve been hacked at while we tried to level up...”","Guild President Fang’s face twitched at the series of questions and thought, Your last question is what you really want the answer to, right?"]},{"number":269,"title":"Chapter 269 - The System Is Facing a Shortage of Materials?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[New Task: Personal Teleportation Array","Task Description: This is a teleportation array for personal use activated by essence blood; it will connect the Morning Star Sea Realm and Jiuhua.","Materials Needed (rare materials which can be found locally): Blood Soul Crystal, Spatial Spiritual Rock, and Spiritual Marrow.","Common Materials: Not needed at the moment.","Task Reward: Personal teleportation array (Morning Star Sea Realm—Jiuhua)","Task Instruction: Blood Soul Crystal and Spatial Spiritual Rock are unique in this area, and their locations will be pointed out. You must find Spiritual Marrow yourself.]","Fang Qi looked at the task in surprise. “I never imagined that you face a shortage of materials. You can even reproduce the runewords in Diablo!”","System, [Items in virtual reality are not real; the material shortage and consumption are severe.]","Fang Qi replied, “I can’t refute that.”","After all, the items that the System recreated were not high-level ones.","[New task: Be Prepared","Task Description: Prepare the materials for the prizes of the first Sand City Master Event.","Sand City Master Prizes: Wilma Cornett, Bone Jade Scepter, Judgement Staff, and Dragon Mark Sword.","Task Description: The weapons are enhanced mimics; the Cornett is a one-to-one exact reproduction.","Materials Needed: Wilma Cornett doesn’t need materials; Bone Jade Scepter needs Bones of a Master; Judgement Staff needs Deep Ocean Black Iron; Dragon Mark Sword needs dragon bones.]","Fang Qi stumbled and almost dropped to the ground. “F*ck! Do you think I can get these things?! They sound lofty and grand already!”","System, [Host, please work harder.]","Maybe I should take Sarbark City? And I don’t care if I get the prizes or not. Fang Qi thought.","System, [Host, please read the rewards carefully.]","“What?” Fang Qi looked down.","[Task Rewards: Godly Weapon Fragment *1; one day access to Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room; Sword God (Proficiency)","Task Levels: This task is divided into three levels. The Host completes one level whenever one material is obtained. All three rewards could only be claimed when all three requirements are completed. Otherwise, only partial rewards will be distributed.]","Fang Qi replied powerlessly, “You win! I will do the task, okay? But... what is the Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room?”","System, [You can choose characters from a movie or a TV series and practice with them as you did in the Game Cultivation Room.]","Fang Qi said, “It means that I will be killed by the characters countless times, right?”","Anyway, the Movie and TV Series Cultivation Room was not bad. Maybe he would master Sword 23 after dying hundreds of times...","Of course, Mr. Fang was probably overthinking.","After reading the Heavenly Book, Fang Qi had some understandings.","Since he almost mastered the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, he had a deeper understanding of the Heavenly Book than the others.","Maybe I should take some time and go out to practice the sword techniques...","However, he must get the work done first; there was a lot on his plate.","Crossing his arms, Fang Qi replied after thinking for a while, “You can join the guild, and I’ll help you level up and even give you items.”","“Really?” The short and chubby old man’s eyes lit up.","His two friends looked embarrassed.","Fang Qi nodded. “I want to ask you about some items.”","“Items?” The others looked at each other and were surprised.","The short and chubby old man said, “Please go ahead.”","“Blood Soul Crystal, Spatial Spiritual Rock, and Spiritual Marrow,” Fang Qi asked, “Have you heard of them?”","The three of them were silent.","Fang Qi frowned. “Are these things so rare that even you haven’t heard of them?”","Mo Tianxing said, “We’ve heard of Spiritual Marrow which only appears in the core of some extremely huge spiritual crystal mines. They are sold occasionally in the inner city, but it’s very precious!”","“How about the others?” They all shook their heads.","Fang Qi continued, “Are Deep Ocean Black Iron and Dragon Bones hard to get?”","The three old men’s eyes brightened. “We heard of them; they are treasures but not as precious as the Spiritual Marrow.”","“Oh...” Fang Qi stroked his chin. “Can I buy them in the city?”","“Ugh...” The short and chubby old man shook his head. “It’s hard to say. Although people say that you can buy anything in Half City if you have money, you must be lucky to get the rare stuff. However, you’ll have better luck at obtaining dragon bones in Black Dragon City than in Half City. Besides, if you want, you can hunt a dragon yourself.”","“Really...” Fang Qi touched his pocket, reluctant to spend his hard-earned money on prizes for others!","It was better to hunt one!","“Ms. Ruan.” Fang Qi looked at Ruan Ning, who was standing by his side, and asked, “Can you help these new members level up on my behalf?”","“...”","“I had an epiphany from the TV series just now, and I must go out and test some of my theories!” With a wave, he already walked out of the shop and said, “As for the privileges of the members, you can explain them to the new people for me!”","“Hey!” Before Ruan Ning could continue, Fang Qi had flown away on the sword.","“Are you the Guild President or not?!” Ruan Ning waved her hands in fury!","However, she had no choice but to smile awkwardly and say, “Should we go... and level up?”","...","After reading the Heavenly Book, Fang Qi had indeed got some inspirations, and he took the opportunity to go out of the city and practice sword techniques. Then, he would try to find the Blood Soul Crystal and Spatial Spiritual Rock that the System mentioned.","Since the System said that these things were in this area, they shouldn’t be far away.","This System is not helpful. Fang Qi complained silently, It didn’t give me a cultivation room, and I must travel far to practice sword techniques. Besides, I have to find stuff for...","Since Fang Qi was going to practice the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell instead of an ordinary sword technique, he couldn’t do it in the nearby area. Otherwise, he would ruin the nearby houses.","I will just think of it as a day trip in this world... Mr. Fang thought. After all, he rarely went out after he came into this world, and it felt good to be out once in a while.","He could also practice his flight technique on the sword while he was out, and he might be able to fly to Jiuhua after he reached a really high level with this technique.","Having been in Half City for a while, he was familiar with the rules of this city.","The outer range of Half City was guarded by an array which was like a huge and natural Soul-Confusing Array.","However, Fei didn’t spend so much money to establish a force in Half City for nothing. He had received the official token which was not only a symbol but something that he could use to protect himself against the array outside of Half City.","Flying on the sword, Fang Qi found that this area was gloomy even during the daytime, looking as if it would rain at any moment.","However, the moment that he left this sea area, he saw the clear, blue sky with white clouds as if he had come into another world!"]},{"number":270,"title":"Chapter 270 - Laotie of Jiuhua City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I heard that the grand masters of Dajin are all playing a game of stealing vegetables... They are enjoying it a lot!”","“They aren’t playing anything else!” someone said in surprise, “I saw those guys today, and they have very high levels! How could they have time to play other stuff?”","Another person answered, “The other game doesn’t affect the playing of the Legend of Mir 2. You just need to check on it when you have time. It’s very easy!”","“So easy?!”","In the Half City Shop, a few players had just finished playing the game and were talking among themselves. Obviously, the news of the new form of entertainment had spread from Jiuhua City to Half City.","“Stealing vegetables?” Huang Shan had just entered the shop and he heard this conversation. “What is that anyway?”","“Yesterday, someone mentioned it in the world channel,” Iron Rock Daoist said, “It seems to be talking about this thing called Qzone. Shall we go and have a look of it?”","With the nearby forces and some independent players entering the game, the 1,000 computers were usually fully occupied.","Fortunately, the lines were not long.","After getting online, they didn’t enter the Legend of Mir 2. Instead, they opened Qzone.","“Choose your birth place?” They looked around and found that it was easier to understand than the Legend of Mir 2. The process of collecting vegetables, buying seeds, loosening soil, and growing vegetables was super simple.","Looking around at the green fields and plants, Huang Shan exclaimed in appreciation while digging into the soil, “This is really a good place!”","After collecting the vegetables that had matured when they entered their spaces, they bought seeds and planted them.","“That’s it?” They found that this was all they needed to do.","“What can these vegetables do for us?” They remembered someone mention that they could sell the vegetables for money to buy other stuff in the shop, or they could eat the vegetables to gain a little cultivation strength.","Immediately, Huang Shan opened the shop and browsed the contents. He was shocked and thought to himself, Thousand-Year-Old Ice Silk Worm Raising Manual?! It’s the method of raising Thousand-Year-Old Ice Silk Worm that had disappeared for many years?","“I’ll have a look too!” Iron Rock Daoist opened the shop and browsed two pages hurriedly. “Iron Net Flower Growing Manual?! Aren’t those flowers almost extinct since the growing method was lost about 3,000 years ago?”","“Blood-Swallowing Worm Raising Manual?!” Zha Gu browsed the contents in astonishment and said in a heavy accent, “With this manual, my venom techniques will enter a higher level!”","“Hahahaha!” After growing their daikon, the three people looked at each other and laughed, “With these things, our Huang Family’s strength will gain a tremendous growth!”","Huang Shan stroked his beard. Now that I’ve planted the White Golden Spiritual Daikon, I’ll just wait for them to mature! One daikon can get a little more than two seeds. If this continues, hahaha!","It gave him great pleasure just thinking about it.","“Beep!” At this moment, a message came from the QQ.","“Hongyin from Jiuhua City wants to add you as a friend. Do you accept?”","“Langhua from Jiuhua City wants to add you as a friend. Do you accept?”","“Little Ye from Jiuhua City wants to add you as a friend. Do you accept?”","“...”","How come so many people want to add me as their friends?! Huang Shan froze for a moment and then thought, Maybe they know my Huang Family will prosper and want to gain my friendship?","No... How can they know that? Huang Shan shook his head and drove this thought out of his mind, but he couldn’t think of another explanation.","Forget it! I will just click [Agree]!","After clicking many [Agree]s, he turned his head and saw the weird expressions on Iron Rock Daoist and Zha Gu’s faces.","“What’s wrong with you two?”","Zha Gu said, “Hahahaha! So many people want to add me as their friends! Maybe they know that I’ll become a great figure?”","Iron Rock Daoist froze. “Strange! I got these messages too!”","“Guys! What are you so happy about?” At this moment, a guy wearing a black robe stood before them, and he was accompanied by a grey-clothed cultivator.","“Black Demon?!” Huang Shan was a little surprised, knowing that Black Demon had great strength and a powerful force!","He cupped his hands and said, “It’s not a secret. Since Brother Black Demon asked, I don’t see any reason to hide it from you.”","He pointed at the computer screen and said, “We’re growing vegetables in Qzone, and it can bring us lots of benefits. The spiritual vegetables can not only increase our strengths but get us money to buy items. There are many precious treasures in the shop, and they are rarely seen in other places!”","“Really?” The two guys glanced at the farmhouse and the fenced field on the screen and said, “Thank you for telling us.”","Then, they went online to grow vegetables.","After planting, they received many messages.","“Qingli Moonlight from Jiuhua City wants to add you as a friend. Do you accept?”","“Young Master Song from Jiuhua City wants to add you as a friend. Do you accept?”","“...”","How come so many people want to add me as their friends? Black Demon was confused.","He added them all and even sent them messages.","[What are you doing?] After putting in these words, he felt like they couldn’t reflect his style, so he searched for a while in the column of emojis and added 😎s.","“That’s it.”","No one replied except the guy named Young Master Song, [Hello! Laotie from Morning Star Sea Realm (Akita Inu silly face).]","[TL Note: Laotie means friend, and it is commonly used in Northern China.]","“Hahahaha!” Black Demon laughed at the silly meme and thought, This guy looks honest from this picture. Good! I like him!","Still, he didn’t understand what ‘laotie’ meant.","“Boss!” At this moment, the grey-clothed cultivator Wang Jin yelled, “Get into the game! A brother found a secret place in Mengchong Province! The zombies there drop many new skill books!”","“New skills?!” After hearing the news, Black Demon immediately entered the game. “What skills?”","After all, he was still killing monsters with nothing but the Lightning Spell!","“A lot!” Wang Jin glanced at the techniques. “Explosion Flame! Fire Wall! They are all good stuff! I told them to leave some for us!”","“Go! Show me the place!”","– On the other side in Huang Shan’s group –","“Brother Huang, someone in Earth City seems to be selling the skill book for Lightning Spell!”","“Skill Book?!” After all, he was still killing monsters with the Fireball Spell!","“How much is it?!” Huang Shan asked immediately.","“50 crystals!” Iron Rock Daoist looked at the screen and said, “And there’s also skill books for Soul Fire Rune Note!”","“Let’s go and have a look!”","A while later, they exclaimed, “Wow! This Lightning Spell is so cool!”","“This Soul Fire Rune Note is awesome, too!”","Meanwhile, a slim figure sneaked into Huang Shan’s vegetable garden in the courtyard. “These damn guys killed me and made me drop items! I’ll steal one of your big daikons today first!”","Ye Xiaoye dug into the soil with a spade in a huff.","Soon, a big mature daikon was dug out. Seeing that no one was around, she ran with the daikon in her arms.","– A while later –","“You robbed half a pack of chicken meat from me before, and now I’ll take a daikon as a small act of revenge!” Bai Lang walked into the courtyard with a spade and dug out one daikon!","Soon after, another black figure sneaked in..."]},{"number":271,"title":"Chapter 271 - All Strategies","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the sea area outside of Half City, the clear sky soon darkened.","In the sky, a person walked, following the pattern of the Seven-Stars with a bright sword in his hand.","The clouds surged in the sky while lightning bolts flashed like dragons and snakes!","Fang Qi usually couldn’t use the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell without the help of Owner-Brand cigarettes. After all, his cultivation strength wasn’t very high, and he didn’t have complete control of the Heavenly Power and this sword spell. This sword spell was so powerful that it might summon a heavenly lightning bolt and kill him if he made a mistake while using it.","Fang Qi didn’t dare to use it unless it was an emergency. However, inspired by the Heavenly Book, he had reached a new understanding of the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, which was why he dared to use it now.","“It seems like it’s going to rain?” In the distant sky came a huge spiritual boat, and its magnificent body flew steadily in the howling winds under the dark clouds. It showed that the owner of the boat was extraordinary.","“Raining?” On the boat stood a young man in white looking to be in his twenties. He had slightly arched sword-shaped eyebrows and a chiseled face, and his cold and arrogant expression appeared deep while he looked into the distance.","Standing behind him were a few female cultivators looking to be in their twenties, and they dressed in a similar style as the young man in white. They obviously came from the same force.","The girls were whispering among themselves, “It’s fortunate that we are traveling on Senior Brother Duan’s Dragon Travel Boat! I think this spiritual boat isn’t afraid of storms and lightning bolts, right?”","“It’s heard that the Dragon Travel Boat is a gift to Senior Brother Duan from Elder Duan. It’s a super spiritual boat that Elder Duan got from some ruins, and many spiritual arrays on the boat can’t be copied!”","“So powerful?! We made the right decision of coming out of faction with Senior Brother Duan!”","“Brother Duan, you are the best cultivator in this generation and an example that we all look up to!” A fat cultivator walked forward. “These junior brothers and sisters admire you very much! I heard from some senior sisters as well a few days ago; even Senior Sister Lin Xin praised the Dragon Travel Boat and said that it is an ultimate spiritual boat!”","“Of course!” The young man in white smiled arrogantly. “It’s a treasure that my Uncle-Master got from the Lightning Wilderness Ruins! It’s not an ordinary item! I will tell you more about it. It has three features; the first is that it’s so fast no one can catch up to it!”","Knock! Knock! Knock! While they were talking, they heard knocking sounds on the boat.","The knocking attracted everyone’s attention.","They looked up and saw a young man less than 20 years old standing outside of the boat. “Guys, can you tell me how to get to Black Dragon City?”","Subconsciously, the fat cultivator pointed in the direction.","“Wait a minute; how did you get up here?” The young man in white suddenly realized that they were on a high-speed spiritual boat instead of on an ordinary street!","“I flew up.” Fang Qi glanced at the sword beneath his feet.","“Thank you!” Then, he flew forward stepping on the sword.","The girls who had been talking among themselves gaped at the sight.","“What was that?!”","“That guy is so powerful...”","“And he looks younger than Senior Brother Duan!”","An extremely beautiful girl who had an oval-shaped face and was wearing a water-green-colored dress walked out of the cabin and looked at them curiously. “Junior sisters, what are you talking about?”","They immediately pointed at the sky before them. “Senior Sister Lin, someone flew past us on a sword!”","They watched that figure disappear in the sky ahead of them on a sword. The girl covered her opened mouth with her hand while she exclaimed, “I wouldn’t have believed it if I didn’t see it with my own eyes!”","The fat cultivator said, “Senior Brother Duan, where were we?”","Suddenly, he seemed to realize something and shut up immediately.","Duan Lan gritted his teeth. “Where did this kid come from?!”","...","Black Dragon City was the cultivation city closest to the sea area of Half City.","Different from Jiuhua, the Morning Star Sea Realm had no countries. Instead, it consisted of cultivation forces with complicated relationships.","Anyone who could build a city in this region was a great figure.","The city got the name of Black Dragon City because Castellan Huangpu Tao had once hunted and killed a ferocious black dragon with thousands of years of cultivation strength at this location, and the incident stunned the Morning Star Sea Realm!","Like other cities, Black Dragon City was guarded heavily, and people must enter the city before 7 PM except for those with special identities or invitations who could enter through the side door later into the night. As for the others, they must wait until the next day when the city gate was opened again.","Now, it was 7 PM, and two guards were closing the city gate slowly.","At this moment, a figure flew swiftly toward them.","The city gate was almost closed, and there was only a narrow slit wide enough for one person to pass through.","Swoosh!","A figure flew in, and the door closed.","Dumbfounded, the two guards looked back.","“Kid! Who are you? Don’t you know that it’s closing time?”","“I know.”","“But you still entered the city?” The two guard’s faces turned dark.","“I shouldn’t have entered?” Fang Qi said politely, “Then, can you open the door so that I can go out?”","The guards were at a loss for words.","The System Interface showed that the Spatial Spiritual Rock was in Black Dragon City.","At this moment, Huang Shan, Black Demon, and the others had finished playing the Legend of Mir 2 and were about to get offline when they remembered that they hadn’t collected their vegetables yet.","They immediately opened Qzone.","Huang Shan walked into his courtyard and was ready to collect his six White Golden Spiritual Daikon. “How come there are three holes in here?”","“My daikon? How come only half of them are left?!”","At this moment, Black Demon and the others had also entered their Qzones.","They all saw three holes in the ground, and half of the daikons went missing!","Black Demon wondered, What happened?! Where’s my daikon?","Wang Jin also wondered, I lost three daikons!","“Who did it?!” They glared around.","Who else can enter my place except me?","Soon, they found that friends could enter their spaces.","Then, they saw the row of friends that they added after planting vegetables.","“...”","“F*ck!”","“The b*stards from Jiuhua stole my vegetables!” Black Demon’s face turned dark, and then he remembered that Young Master Song who had sent him the meme of the dog.","When he looked at the meme again, he found it was despiteful!","“F*ck!” He immediately sent over the emoji of the kitchen knife.","[You are blacklisted by this user.]","He sent another kitchen knife.","[You are blacklisted by this user.]","Dumbfounded, he sent another one.","“...”","“F*ck!” Furious, he opened QQ. [Black Demon Guards, gather here! I want to kill them!]","[Your daily computer time is up. Please return tomorrow!]","“...”"]},{"number":272,"title":"Chapter 272 - Mr. Fang Might Be in Trouble","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You mean... the owner of that shop is out of the city right now?!” There was no light here, and even the life presence was very weak.","In fact, the life presence was so weak that one could smell death.","Death-like silence and coldness filled this place as if it were a mansion in Hell!","As that deep voice, which sounded like it was coming from a corpse that was crawling out of a tomb, resonated in the stone hall, pale firelights suddenly lit up one by one.","When the pale firelights lit up, instead of giving some warmth to the stone hall, they instead added to the gloomy chill.","In the stone hall stood two rows of black-cloaked cultivators on the sides, and these two rows of people stretched all the way to the gate of the hall!","Judging from the presence emitting off of these cultivators, one could tell that they all had extremely high strength, and the weakest person’s cultivation stage was no lower than the True Lake Realm!","The black-robed man sitting in the center of the stone hall had a more horrifying presence, and he seemed to be engulfed in an ominous darkness which no one would want to touch, not even a little bit!","Under the dim firelight, people could see that a middle-aged man stood in the hall, and he said, “It’s true!”","A chilly wind blew into the hall, dimming the pale firelights, and the deathly sensation intensified.","In Half City, the Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild seemed to have gained its footing on the surface after it took out a Divine Ocean Realm cultivator. After nearly 100 people witnessed the incident, people had to believe that it was true after investigating the facts even though a lot of them didn’t believe it at first.","However, the words about the wonders in the shop circulated in the city, and many forces began to create schemes.","Driven by greed, great strength couldn’t stop people from coveting what they wanted. After all, many powerful figures in Half City were killed by schemes and conspiracies.","Even the most powerful figures had their weaknesses. If the weaknesses were exploited, they would die no matter how strong they were.","For the forces who had deep roots in the city, it wasn’t difficult to gain information.","After these days of investigation, they found that the main shop seemed to be in an extremely distant place, which meant that the great force behind the shop wouldn’t be able to reach Half City in a short time.","Therefore, they could rule out this threat.","Secondly, even though this shop could instantly destroy Qin Honglin, who was at the Divine Ocean Realm, it was done inside the shop.","Even outside the shop, despite his great strength, the shop owner had taken a long time to kill a Blood Devil which had just come out of its prison and was thus quite weak.","When Fang Qi killed Li Huangquan, he didn’t show a strength great enough to kill someone at the Divine Ocean Realm.","In other words, the shop owner was strong but not impossible to deal with.","Then, they could capture Fang Qi in secret and get the information about the shop from him! It was a well-thought plan!","“Where is he?”","“Black Dragon City! I heard that the Netherworld Underground Palace excels in soul-searching techniques. If you have information, my master hopes...”","“My Netherworld Underground Palace will take all those spiritual artifacts!” The gloomy wind howled in the stone hall, and all the light went out instantly! It sounded as if hundreds of ghosts were walking in the darkness and crying out in fear.","...","– In Black Dragon City –","This city was less populated than Jiuhua since there were no ordinary people living here.","There were only cultivators residing in this city.","“Forgive me, I love freedom and can’t bear restraint...” Mr. Fang sang the song with his hands in his pockets while he searched for the Spatial Spiritual Rock in Black Dragon City in a great mood.","The passing cultivators all looked back and stared at him at a loss for words.","This city looked better managed than Half City; at least there were no spiritual boats parking in the air above the city.","Maybe I should get a ride with a demon beast. Since every big city forbad flying in the city, and the rules in this place were stricter than in Half City, Fang Qi hired a beast carriage. “Go all the way to the west! Straight to the center of the city.”","The driver was an ordinary cultivator wearing grey clothes. Therefore, Fang Qi asked him about the general information of Black Dragon City.","About half an hour later, the driver said, “Daoist Brother, the Castellan Estate is before us!”","Fang Qi looked up and saw a huge mansion with several luxurious carriages parked in front of the gate. The most eye-catching thing was a pure white lion that looked quite magnificent. Fang Qi wondered who its master was.","Castellan Estate? Fang Qi looked at the big mansion with high walls sulkily. You make things difficult for me even for the first item! That’s not nice!","I’m an educated and cultured man, and you want me to steal a treasure from the Castellan Estate?! Fang Qi looked at the walls of the estate and calculated silently. Which wall should I scale? Are there any defensive arrays? Are there dogs in the house?”","“Daoist Brother!” the cultivators said, “If you don’t need me anymore, I’ll go now!”","“Please!” Fang Qi waved his hand.","When the carriage was gone, Fang Qi walked closer to the Castellan Estate. The gate was closed for the night, and he didn’t see any guards, which helped Mr. Fang a lot.","However, when he walked forward, the snow-white lion suddenly roared and bared teeth at him; it looked so ferocious, as if it would pounce on him at any moment!","There are no dogs inside, but there’s a lion outside?! Fang Qi frowned and found the situation quite troublesome.","Roar! Roar! While he was thinking, the snow-white lion’s roars became even louder.","Fang Qi picked up a brick from the ground and walked toward the lion in frustration.","“I will knock you out, you hear me!”","Bang! Bang! Bang!","“You dare to dodge?!”","The snow-white lion fell to the ground, and Fang Qi entered the estate by scaling the wall.","At this moment, a group of people walked toward the gate from the inside. The gate opened, and a dignified-looking, middle-aged man with white hair and a beard cupped his hands. “I’m honored by the visit from the Heavenly Fairy of the Nanhua Faction. But... why are you leaving so soon?”","The middle-aged man asked, “Do you have any complaints about my hospitality?”","A woman in white walked out of the gate followed by several people wearing celestial-like white clothes. “Castellan Huangpu, I have an important bit of business to tend to, so I can’t trouble you any longer. Little White!”","She beckoned.","Since it was a short visit, they had left their carriages and mounts outside the gate. She looked around and called, “Little...”","“!!??”","The snow-white lion lay on the ground, and beside it was a brick.","“What’s going on?! I just climbed in, and then it shows that the target is out of the gate?”","All the people watched while a figure jumped down from the wall; they gaped at this sight, and their minds went blank!"]},{"number":273,"title":"Chapter 273 - Long-distance runner Mr. Fang","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mr. Fang brushed the dust off his hands and looked to the side, and he saw a group of stupefied people.","Someone dared to climb into the Castellan’s estate in the night?!","It seems like this guy had also knocked this rare white lion unconscious!","All of them felt like there was something wrong with their eyes.","Fang Qi thought, I was too engrossed in looking at the System Interface...","Staring at cell phones while walking was deadly and staring at the System Interface while walking was more so.","That was how Mr. Fang ended up in this situation!","Mr. Fang wished that he could go back in time and do this again, and he blamed the wall for being so short that he just couldn’t stop his jump!","All the people standing in front of him looked angry. “Who are you?!”","The woman in white, who was the leader of the group, quickly went to the snow-white lion and injected some spiritual energy into it. The lion woke up slowly, and everyone could see that it had been knocked unconscious by Fang Qi.","“Did you do it?” Her tone was as cold as the frost in January.","“Don’t misunderstand.” Fang Qi tried to explain. “I just went in to find a washroom.”","It was worse than remaining silent!","“You are seeking death!” Hearing his words, the middle-aged man with white hair and a beard yelled with a dark expression, “Capture him!”","The cultivators behind him waved their hands, and several pitch-black chains turned into black light beams and shot toward Fang Qi to bind him.","“What’s this?” Fang Qi instantly retreated dozens of meters, but the black chains followed him like swarming snakes. It was a strange situation!","“Don’t let him go!” A disciple in white yelled, “This kid dared to hurt the rare beast of our Nanhua Faction! We can’t let him get away from this!”","“Don’t worry!” The middle-aged man said with a dark expression, “This is the Dragon-Binding Chains of my Black Dragon Office. Even the dragons from oceans can’t escape from me. This kid will be caught even if he fled to the end of the world!”","While he spoke, the black chains began to tighten, and a man in white praised, “Mr. Castellan, your Dragon-Binding Chains are indeed powerful...”","Before he could finish his sentence, they were dumbfounded by what they saw!","A sword hanging by Fang Qi’s waist shot out like a silver snake, and it split into two then into four before turning into more. The swords hacked onto the black chains like lightning bolts, and sparks appeared on the chains!","Engulfed in white, blinding lightning energy, the swords spun and hacked out like tornados!","The black chains were cut and sent flying backward by the swords! The Dragon-Binding Chains were instantly broken!","With several swords hovering in the air beside him and one sword beneath his feet, Fang Qi descended slowly from the sky while standing on the handle. In the strong wind created by the swords, he looked like a descending sword immortal.","All the people were stunned and were at a loss for words while they watched the scene!","“There is such a sword technique in the world!?” A disciple of the Nanhua Faction exclaimed.","Huangpu Tao’s face got darker.","Fang Qi looked around and glanced at the System Interface. No! The Spatial Spiritual Rock seems to be on them!","“I’m finished... I offended them to the max...” Fang Qi’s face turned dark, and he immediately withdrew the swords and cupped his hands. “Your Black Dragon Chains deserve its great reputation! I barely blocked it after I used the World-Ending Sword 23! A great attack indeed! It was my pleasure!”","Huangpu Tao was silent.","“Roar! Roar!” On the side, the white lion bared its teeth as if it wanted to pounce at Fang Qi.","Fang Qi was at a loss for words. “Miss, I think your big dog needs some teaching and a leash.”","“Build the Qian-Kun Dragon-Locking Array!” Huangpu Tao exploded in fury. “My Black Dragon Office will be disgraced if we can’t capture this kid!”","Ten minutes later, the sword beneath Fang Qi’s feet pierced the nightly sky like a sharp blade!","“Thief! Don’t run!”","“Don’t chase after me then!”","Looking at the large group of people chasing after him, Fang Qi took out the communication jade. “Little Mo, if I don’t return tonight, you can close the door at 12 PM sharp!”","“What? You are asking if some people don’t want to leave? Don’t worry. Just yell ‘someone is making trouble’ and toss them out.”","“Don’t worry! It will be okay!”","A team of cultivators from the Black Dragon Office panted, “Castellan! How come that kid... has the time... to chat using a communication jade?!”","“Little White! Can you go faster?” As if it were challenged, the white lion accelerated with a furious roar!","Fang Qi put away the communication jade and looked back. Ugh? They’re gaining on me?","After casting a sword spell with his hands, he suddenly sped up!","– One hour later –","“Ki... Kid... Stop! Hu...”","“Roar... Pant...”","Sitting on the sword, Fang Qi said, “Can we sit down and talk? We can talk it out!”","“F*ck!”","“Little White! Can you go faster?” The woman in white patted her mount, the white lion, and asked.","“Roar!” It was a wild chase!","One night passed.","After lighting a cigarette, Mr. Fang sat on the sword and sucked on it.","The cultivators of the Black Dragon Office panted, “Kid... Don’t... Don’t run!”","The cultivators of the Nanhua Faction panted, “I... I can’t... run... anymore...”","Huangpu Tao panted, “How... How can... this kid... fly so fast?”","“Little White, can you...” The white lion collapsed with white foam flowing out of its mouth.","“Little White! Little White!” The woman in white yelled in alarm and injected some spiritual energy into the animal in a hurry. With a cold expression, she pointed at Fang Qi who was flying before her. “Don’t run if you dare!”","Huangpu Tao: “If you... don’t... run, we... can talk!”","After all, Fang Qi had just entered his mansion and didn’t cause any damage; it wasn’t something that they couldn’t solve through talking.","He was exhausted!","“Hu...” He put his hands on his thighs and panted.","“You look powerful and must be an influential figure, but you know nothing but running?!” The woman in white gritted her teeth, and murderous light flashed in her eyes.","“If you are really a hero, do you dare to fight with me?” The woman in white said in a chilly voice.","While panting, Huangpu Tao sneered, “I think... you are not... someone from... a small faction. Did your master teach you nothing but running from your enemies?”","“Hu...” He was almost out of breath after saying so many words.","“Miss, do you want to fight me one-on-one?” Fang Qi looked at Huangpu Tao who seemed eager to fight him. “Or will this gentleman fight me?”","“Castellan Huangpu!” the woman in white said in a cold voice, “He insulted and hurt Little White. As its master, I must avenge it!”","The woman in white spat out her words through her clenched teeth. “If I can’t defeat you in half an hour, I’ll let you go. Okay?”","Seeing hesitation on Fang Qi’s face, she asked, “Are you afraid?”","“Only half an hour?” The disciples of the Black Dragon Office clicked their tongues.","“The Nanhua Heavenly Light that Senior Sister Liu cultivates is unrivaled among her peers in the same realm... She might even defeat masters of a higher realm if they are not careful... It seems like this guy is afraid...” The people around them began to talk among themselves.","“She doesn’t need to use Nanhua Heavenly Light! For this trip, the Faction Master gave her several spiritual treasures that are powerful! She can use any of them to suppress masters of the same realm with ease!”","“I mean...” Fang Qi organized his words and said, “I mean if I do well in the battle, can I get some prize? For example, can I pick a treasure from you? If you agree, I don’t mind increasing the difficulty. For example, you don’t have to set the time limit for yourself.”","TL Note: Read the Translator’s Thoughts!!"]},{"number":274,"title":"Chapter 274 - One Puff Refreshes Your Mind, and Two Puffs Energize Your Body","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It was dawn, and there were almost no people in the square in the center of the city.","“This kid...” The disciples of the Nanhua Faction who had been talking about Nanhua Heavenly Light and spiritual treasures were enraged. “You want to increase the difficulty?!”","He is audacious!","You would be lucky if you don’t get killed! How dare you ask for treasures?!","“Senior Sister Liu!” One female disciple stood up and said, “If you don’t teach this guy a lesson, he will think that he is the most powerful guy in the world!”","“This kid is despicable! We must teach him a hard lesson!”","“He is greedy and dares to ask for treasures! He’s shameless!”","While the cultivators of the Black Dragon Office and the Nanhua Faction yelled and cussed, Huangpu Tao also became indignant. “You’re too greedy!”","“How can you call me greedy?” Fang Qi said, “It’s an insult to me. This is a fair bet. If I lose, I’ll give you the sword control technique that I just used, okay?”","“What?!” Now, even Huangpu Tao was stupefied. After all, when Fang Qi used the sword control technique, even he, a grand cultivator with high cultivation strength, couldn’t catch up. He would love to have this flying sword technique if he could!","He was surprised that Fang Qi dared to place this technique on the bet!","The white-clothed woman’s shoulders shook with fury. In the Nanhua Faction, one of the biggest factions in the Morning Star Sea Realm, she had studied all kinds of secret spiritual spells of the faction since she was very young, and her cultivation strength and spiritual spell knowledge far surpassed her peers. She well deserved the name of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy!","The young man in front of her looked to be a beginner in cultivation, but he was so arrogant that he was insulting her with his bet.","“Okay!” Her voice shook with fury. “As long as you are able to get it!”","Her slim fingers opened, and several snow-white, ice-crystal-like silk threads shot out of her sleeves. These slim ice threads moved in the sky like flying dragons and coiled around each other gradually, and they turned into a translucent cage made of ice and snow, imprisoning Fang Qi in the center!","I’m being kind and giving you a fair duel. Why are you so angry? Fang Qi thought resentfully.","“What’s this treasure? It’s powerful!” Seeing this, the cultivators of the Black Dragon Office exclaimed, “If we don’t build Qian-Kun Dragon-Locking Array, the Black Dragon Chains are no match for this spiritual treasure!”","“This is the first spiritual treasure given by the Faction Master, and it’s called Snow Treasure Ice Silk Threads! This treasure is refined with the precious 3,000-year-old Ice Silk Threads and essence of Snow Treasure. It took our Faction Master three years to create this treasure,” a male cultivator of the Nanhua Faction explained proudly, “The silk threads not only are tough, fireproof, and waterproof, but they can freeze people’s spiritual essence with their powerful chilling presence. If anyone is trapped by them, surrendering is the only option!”","“Where’s your spiritual treasure?!” While handling the ice silk threads, the woman in white asked with a cold expression.","Fang Qi pointed at his sword beside him and said, “One sword is enough for me.”","“Arrogant!” With a cold expression, she unleashed tremendous spiritual energy, and the ground around Fang Qi was covered by a thick layer of ice and frost!","Even the air began to freeze!","“Back off! Back off!” Several gasps sounded, and the surrounding people retreated immediately!","The ground that they stood on was frozen. If they were one second late, they would have been frozen into ice sculptures!","Immense chilly energy condensed around those few slim threads, turning the moisture in the air into ice frost. It looked as if several dragons made of ice were flying in the sky!","The cage began to shrink!","“The kid is finished!” The disciples of the Nanhua Faction were elated. After all, when the Snow Treasure Ice Silk Threads was used to this degree, no miracle could save him!","“Admit defeat! Do you want to freeze to death in Senior Sister Liu’s spiritual treasure?!” A disciple of the Nanhua Faction yelled.","“I thought you were strong, but I was wrong! You are very weak in reality!”","“Are you going to admit defeat?” The woman in white walked closer to the ice cage that had almost solidified and looked at the person imprisoned inside with displeasure.","At this moment, her pupils suddenly contracted","From the ice cage which was completely separated from the outside world, she heard a shout, “Sword! Come!”","She didn’t know if she heard it right.","Then, she heard gasps from the surrounding people who all pointed at the sky, and she was a little surprised.","She looked up and saw that the sky was covered by dense swords which blocked the sunshine, and they crashed down with tremendous force!","Boom! Boom...","Many swords fell like shooting stars, and the huge ice cage was instantly shattered into ice dust. Even the ice-crystal-like silk threads were pinned onto the ground!","All of them gaped at the scene. In the center of the tens of thousand swords, that young man had half a cigarette between his fingers.","Feeling chills inside, the surrounding people retreated dozens of steps!","If the horrifying swords stabbed them, they would have died many times!","The woman tried to pull up the Snow Treasure Ice Silk Threads that were pinned onto the ground and failed; she immediately gave up.","Seeing her expression getting colder, Fang Qi was afraid that she would get angry and go back on her words.","Hurried, he flattered her, “You forced me to block your attack with my trump card! Your...”","Suddenly, he realized that he didn’t know the name of her spiritual treasure. He stammered for a few seconds in embarrassment and finally said, “Those... threads are really powerful!”","“Snow Treasure Ice Silk Threads!” She gritted her teeth so hard that her teeth almost shattered.","With a dark expression, she took out the second spiritual treasure, which was a small green jade fan.","The small fan flew out of her storage spiritual artifact and instantly grew to the height of about one meter. On each side of the jade fan was a picture of a unique beast.","The jade fan waved twice, and violent wind instantly roared like thunder!","“What’s special about this fan?”","“Wind... Wind-Roaring Fan!” The disciples of the Nanhua Faction had cold sweat on their bodies. “The wind blades kill the physical body! Wind roars suppress the soul. This kid is finished! Senior Sister Liu is unleashing her full force!”","In the next moment, a wave of swords swarmed through the square.","To everyone’s horror, the Wind-Roaring Fan was sent flying!","“How come the wind roars had no effect on you?!” The woman in white was terrified. After all, the Wind-Roaring Fan could blow people’s souls out of their bodies!","“You mean that?” Fang Qi shook off the burned ashes from the end of the cigarette and said, “I felt a bit dizzy but recovered immediately after taking a puff of the cigarette.”","He presented the remaining cigarette to her and asked, “Do you want to try it? One puff refreshes your mind, and two puffs energizes your body.”","“!!??”","Damn you!!","The Nanhua Heavenly Fairy formed a spiritual spell with both hands and chanted a long incantation. Then, her whole body was lifted by a mysterious force while heavenly wind surrounded her; the space between the heaven and the earth turned dark while the thunders bolts and lightning flashes swirled around her like lightning snakes, forming a lightning curtain!","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction were excited. “Nanhua Heavenly Light! Senior Sister Liu is using the Nanhua Heavenly Light!”","“I’m surprised that I can see the current Heavenly Fairy use the Heavenly Light Technique!” Even Huangpu Tao looked up at the sky and exclaimed in appreciation and astonishment."]},{"number":275,"title":"Chapter 275 - I, Fang Qi, am willing to acknowledge you as the most powerful!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Although it was only dawn, and few people were walking on the streets, the great upheaval caused by earth-shaking thunders attracted the attention of many cultivators!","They looked up at the surging dark clouds in the sky in shock!","They were wondering who was bold enough to use such a powerful spiritual spell in Black Dragon City!","The cultivators nearby rushed toward the square, wanting to see what was happening.","They wondered which grandmaster got angry and was battling in the city.","“Disperse the surrounding crowds!” Castellan Huangpu Tao did his duty and ordered his subordinates.","He had thought that this battle would be finished easily, but now, even Nanhua Heavenly Light was used!","Now, he couldn’t interrupt the use of this spiritual spell.","...","The truly powerful spiritual spell could activate spiritual essence in the body and trigger the energy from the earth and the heaven to protect the person who was using the spell! This was what Nanhua Heavenly Light was doing, and the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell had the same effect.","In the sky of Black Dragon City, clouds were surging up on one side while dark clouds gathered on the other side!","“What is that?!” The people of the Black Dragon Office and the Nanhua Faction were surprised at the sight.","Isn’t Nanhua Heavenly Light being used on this side? Then what is going on on the other side?! Is it another Nanhua Heavenly Light? That’s impossible!","All the people looked toward the other side in bafflement!","In the sky, a figure stepped, following the pattern of the Seven-Stars in the sky. With his hand casting a sword spell, he chanted, “Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword!”","His voice was as resonant as a big bell and a rumble of thunder from the sky followed his words, shaking the people’s minds!","More and more people gathered around this place and looked up at the sky, which got darker and heavier as if a huge heavenly curtain was crashing down!","On the other side, the ominous clouds gathered and turned into a horrifying vortex. In the center of the vortex, the concentrated lightning bolts looked like a heavenly eye which had just opened!","“What’s this spiritual spell?!”","“Nanhua Heavenly Light!” The cultivators in Black Dragon City looked up at the sky, and someone pointed at it and shouted as he had recognized it, “That’s the prelude of the Nanhua Heavenly Light!”","“Nanhua Heavenly Light?!”","“Who on earth is forcing the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy to use Heavenly Light here?!”","Many cultivators gathered and looked up in shock!","“What’s it on the other side?”","“Turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword! What’s that spell?! I’ve never heard of it before!”","“Look that way!”","One cultivator pointed at the sky; he was so stunned that he was at a loss for words!","A golden light beam shot out from the dark clouds in the pitch-black sky!","As more light beams shot out, the gloomy sky looked as if two huge heavenly gates opened!","“Look at the other side!”","All the people screamed in alarm when violent winds roared in the other side of the sky while the vortex fell like an upside-down volcano; all the lightning snakes condensed into the tip!","The lightning bolts in the center turned from blue to white, blinding all the people below!","In the sky, that figure hovering in the air looked like a god and a demon!","“I never expected that someone so young would have mastered such a horrifying spiritual spell!” The Nanhua Heavenly Fairy looked at the figure under the lightning bolts in astonishment. “He can also activate the heavenly power!”","An ultimate lightning beam crashed down!","Meanwhile on the other side of the sky, more and more golden light beams shot down, and a few of them broke the protective spiritual light around some houses and instantly turned them into huge craters!","Even a small trace of the energy of this spiritual spell had such great power! If it unleashed its full power on someone, the target would have been turned into ashes instantly!","On the other side, a sword energy directed the tremendously thick lightning beam forward!","The horrifying presence flowing around the lightning beam looked like an ancient dragon of lightning!","On the other side, the dark clouds that looked like the heavenly gates opened, shooting down many golden light beams!","The two forces collided with each other in the dark sky!","The horrifying power that they unleashed even shook the sky and the earth!","Under everyone’s gaze, the golden celestial light beams shooting from the sky engulfed the destructive lightning beam, completely swallowing it!","Standing proudly in the golden light beams which had turned her figure golden, the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy looked down with her cold golden eyes while her hair and clothes fluttered wildly in the wind!","At this moment, the world turned silent!","“She won?!”","All the people looked at each other.","When the golden light beams swallowed the lightning beam, was that cultivator turned into ashes ?","“He should... have died!” A disciple of the Nanhua Faction said hesitantly.","“It’s a pity that Senior Sister Liu can use Nanhua Heavenly Light but can’t control the damage that it inflicts. Even if this guy survived, he would be in a bad shape!”","“That’s a pity!” Another Nanhua Faction cultivator lamented, “He was quite a figure; he fought back under Nanhua Heavenly Light and didn’t surrender!”","“No!” At this moment, Huangpu Tao held his breath and looked closely, and then his expression changed drastically!","A lightning beam broke out from the golden light beams! At this moment, the lightning beam was so weak that it was flickering.","However, it flew out with the sword!","Crack!","Nanhua Heavenly Fairy’s protective spiritual light around her body was instantly broken. Looking at the sword blade that was slashing toward her, she felt hopeless!","Am I going to die?!","Since she couldn’t hold back the Nanhua Heavenly Light once she used it, she guessed that her opponent had the same issue!","However, that cold sensation of the sword piercing through her body didn’t come at the next second.","She opened her eyes and saw a strong hand gripping the sword handle.","Also, a cigarette burnt to its butt fell from his fingers into the dust.","All the people including Nanhua Heavenly Fairy felt like their minds went blank while they watched this scene. They were at a loss for words.","Fang Qi exhaled a heated breath.","He said loudly, “Among all the young cultivators who have battled with me, you have the most powerful spiritual spell! I, Fang Qi, am willing to acknowledge you as the most powerful!”","Everyone went silent!","All the people gaped at the sky while Fang Qi’s words resonated in their mind, “I, Fang Qi, am willing to acknowledge you as the most powerful!”","It went on and on, replaying itself again and again!","...","It seemed like a long time had passed!","The dark clouds dispersed, and dazzling golden sunlight came; it was the light of the morning sun.","Two figures stood in the high sky under the golden sunshine, looking like two immortals who lived forever in the world.","Suddenly, the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy turned pale, and she shivered before falling from the sky!","In her fluttering white clothes, she looked like a fairy falling to the mortal world!","At this moment, every man present wished that they could catch her in their arms like they were carrying a princess and fly down from the sky!","However, one man was one step ahead of them!","He caught her by her collar and flew down from the sky as if he was grabbing a small chicken!","“Let! Me! Go!” the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy struggled violently and shouted.","Everyone was at a loss for words."]},{"number":276,"title":"Chapter 276 - Hurrying home to collect vegetables","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What do you want?!” The people of the Black Dragon Office and Nanhua Faction glared at Fang Qi, obviously displeased that he helped the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy descend from the sky in such a manner.","“Think before you make demands, and don’t be too greedy!” A cultivator of Black Dragon City said angrily, “You wouldn’t be so smug if our Castellan showed his hand!”","“Ugh...” Fang Qi thought for a moment and said, “Have you seen a pale grey rock? The force in it might be... strange!” He told them what he wanted without revealing too much information.","“Pale grey rock? Strange force?” Disciples of the Nanhua Faction and the Black Dragon Office looked at each other; they had thought that he would ask for some powerful spiritual treasure and were surprised that he only wanted a useless rock.","However, Huangpu Tao and the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, Liu Ningyun, became wary. Huangpu Tao looked Fang Qi up and down and said in a deep voice, “I indeed have such a rock, but I wonder how you know about it! I think you came here to obtain this rock, right?!”","Huangpu Tao had indeed acquired this rock by accident, but he didn’t know what it could be used for.","The force it contained was very strange and mysterious, and he had kept it, thinking that it had some great uses that he didn’t know about.","Some time ago, one of his friends, an elder of the Nanhua Faction, borrowed the rock from him to study it, and Liu Ningyun had come today to return this special rock.","Obviously, even the Nanhua Faction couldn’t understand the mystery in the rock! Fang Qi was prepared for their questions and said, “If I say that I can sense the presence emitting from the rock, would you believe it?”","Huangpu Tao and Liu Ningyun looked at each other","This was the most reasonable explanation since neither of them could have possibly leaked the information about the rock.","Therefore, Huangpu Tao believed him.","“Since I have no use for the rock, I can give it to you,” Huangpu Tao said.","“No!” Still weak, Liu Ningyun glared at Fang Qi and said, “I lost the battle, so I must provide the treasure!”","“It seems like this guy came for this rock on purpose. I’m afraid that he won’t take other stuff.” Huangpu Tao shook his head and said.","“This...” Liu Ningyun glared at Fang Qi in hatred, angry that he would choose something that she didn’t have!","“For years, I’ve been wondering about this rock’s use. Since you’ve been searching for it, you must know about it. Can you tell me its use to satisfy my curiosity?” Seeing the hesitation on Fang Qi’s face, he offered, “If you agree, I can also give you another treasure. If you refuse, I’ll just let it be.”","“Another treasure?!” Fang Qi’s eyes lit up. “Can you give me a dragon bone?!”","“Slave of greed!”","“Money lover!” The people cursed him silently.","Fang Qi said, “I can tell you its use since this rock is useless to other people anyway. I have the method to make a personal teleportation array, and I need this rock to make it.”","“Teleportation array?!” Huangpu Tao and Liu Ningyun looked at each other again; they were surprised since the method of making teleportation arrays had been long lost! They wondered what force was behind Fang Qi.","“Can you tell us which faction you come from?”","“I’m Fang Qi, the shop owner of Origins Internet Club!” Mr. Fang took the opportunity to advertise his shop, and he pointed at Liu Ningyun, saying, “This girl is very powerful. If she can be like me and learn the sword control technique and Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell by reading the Heavenly Book and practicing the sword techniques, she will double her strength in no time!”","“...”","“Mr. Fang, do you have a spiritual spell shop?!” Huangpu Tao was displeased and said, “Are you telling me that those spells you used just now are for sale?” He didn’t believe that one would sell their ultimate techniques.","Mr. Fang said, “I ensure you that all of you can master these spells!”","The people were stupefied, especially Liu Ningyun.","She thought, You said that everyone can master this spiritual spell that is on the same level as my Nanhua Heavenly Light? You mean that the most precious spell of our Nanhua Faction is only a common spell for sale in your shop?!","Unable to bear the anger, she sneered and said, “Mr. Fang, do you mean that every customer of your shop knows these techniques?!”","“Not really.”","She was displeased. “Then, how can you say that you could ensure us that everyone can master these techniques!”","However, she was tempted to have a look at this shop.","“Where’s your shop, Mr. Fang?” Huangpu Tao was quite eager to learn Fang Qi’s sword control technique. “I want to go and visit!”","“It’s in the 36th block of Half City!”","“Half City?!” The disciples of the Nanhua Faction retreated several steps as if they had seen a ghost!","“Don’t be alarmed.” As a neighbor of Half City, Huangpu Tao knew the real situation of this city. “However, isn’t the 36th block Qin Honglin’s territory?” He asked tentatively, “Is Mr. Qin good and well?”","“That Old Demon Qin Honglin?!” Nanhua Heavenly Fairy had disdain in her eyes.","Fang Qi said, “That guy? I destroyed him when he came to make trouble in my shop.”","Huangpu Tao went silent, and he began to believe that Fang Qi’s shop was quite extraordinary since not a lot of people would say such a thing for fun.","“Nanhua Fairy, do you have the interest to visit this shop?” Huangpu Tao asked since he had nothing urgent to tend to.","“Senior Sister Liu!” One of the disciples said, “We still have something to do...”","“We’re delayed anyway!” Liu Ningyun said in a cold voice, “It doesn’t matter if we’re delayed further!” She wanted to see what tricks Fang Qi was playing.","This way, Fang Qi lured two groups of people to go back with him.","Directed by Mr. Fang’s sword spell, the Innumerable Sword Scroll that he mastered immediately split the runeword broadsword into dozens!","“Get onboard!” Fang Qi said, “I must hurry back to collect vegetables. Hurry up!”","Huangpu Tao: “...”","Liu Ningyun: “...”","All the other people: “...”","Swoosh!","They instantly flew up into the clouds.","Meanwhile, in a place in the Morning Star Sea Realm close to Black Dragon City, the dark clouds covered the sky and turned the whole sea area into a ghost realm!","In the death-like silence, a voice sounded as if it floated up from the netherworld, “Will he come?”","“Don’t worry. This is the only route back to Half City!”","In the distant sky, several sword beams flew toward them swiftly!","“Here he comes!” Cold sneers sounded from the gloomy clouds. “Let’s report back to Palace Master with that kid’s head!”","Suddenly, Fang Qi and the others plunged into a big dark cloud; they could see nothing in the darkness!","A few figures appeared from the darkness, as if they had come from the netherworld.","“So stupid!”","“He delivered himself to us!”","“Then, we’d better take this gift... Cackle...”","“It’s not possible to get out of the Serene Cloud Soul-Refining Array!”","Huangpu Tao stretched his arms. “This route isn’t peaceful...”","Mr. Fang said, “The robbers in the city are stupid.”","Liu Ningyun said weakly, “It seems that we have another hard battle before us.”","A figure rose before them and stared at them for a while. “He has a few weak people as company? They can die with him!”","Huangpu Tao’s face turned dark. He had planned to reserve his strength, but he was furious when he heard that they planned to kill him! He condensed tremendous spiritual energy into his palm, and a huge black palm fell from the sky, blocking the sunshine!","Boom! With some squishing sounds, the huge gloomy cloud in the sky was smashed by the huge palm like a dough!","With horrified screams, the big array collapsed as if it were crushed by a huge mountain!","Many ghosts and souls fled with shrills!","Boom! They were exploded, and the bodies fell like dumplings!","“Damn it! How dare you try to rob me, Huangpu Tao? This is what you get!”"]},{"number":277,"title":"Chapter 277 - Old Demon Fang Could Make Friends?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Now, even robbers build arrays!” Fang Qi exclaimed while flying. “They are really high-end robbers.”","“They were here to rob you!” Liu Ningyun stared at Fang Qi coldly since she had seen through the robbers’ motives. “You took Castellan Huangpu along to scare them! Your scheme worked!”","Having a low opinion of Fang Qi, she was even more embarrassed when she found that his strength was higher than hers.","She was reluctant to talk to him! Even when she talked, she sounded combative.","Fang Qi shrugged and said with a straight face, “In fact, I could have dumped you here and escaped alone.”","“Shameless!","“Despicable!”","Some disciples of the Nanhua Faction instantly cussed him.","“I can’t believe that he could talk about escaping with such dignity and righteousness!”","Fang Qi was at a loss for words. “How come the people in your faction are like dull ducks?”","“What did you say?!”","“Do you want to provoke us?!”","“...”","They arrived at the shop while bickering.","Indifferent of this atmosphere, Fang Qi yawned and took them to the shop.","The clean street paved with white stones and the neat shopfronts made a good impression on the disciples of Nanhua Faction who had never been here before.","“People are not allowed to fly in the sky above the city, right?” One disciple asked curiously.","“I don’t know.” Fang Qi explained, “I was prepared to fight with anyone who tried to stop me, but I found that no one cared!”","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction were silent.","Behind them, Huangpu Tao’s face twitched, thinking, It’s probably that no one dares to stop you. After you destroyed Qin Honglin, who would dare to mind your business in the outer city?","“Hello! Sir!”","“Hello! Guild President!”","Upon entering the shop, the warm greetings sounded, making the atmosphere very friendly.","The disciples of Nanhua Faction were amazed at the scene as they had never seen anything like. “Senior Brother Li! It’s so big inside!”","“The arrangement in here is very strange!”","“It’s a spatial array!” someone gasped behind them.","Surprised, Zou Mo looked at the people behind Fang Qi. “Boss, these are...”","“Oh.” Fang Qi touched his head. “I forgot to introduce them. They are some new friends I made when I was out of the city.”","Su Zhi said, “Unbelievable...”","Ruan Ning said, “Even Old Demon Fang has friends...”","“Such beautiful friends... Incredible!”","They came up instantly, especially Ruan Ning. She walked over with a bowl of instant noodles and said, “The girl walking in the front is so beautiful...”","Eating a spicy stick, Su Yao said in envy, “She has such a good temperament...”","Xi Yue snorted. “Did he lure her from somewhere... I feel like I had seen her before somewhere...”","A pair of beautiful eyes glanced at Fang Qi with chilling coldness. “Who’s your friend? Don’t flatter yourself!”","Fang Qi stared at her eyes and froze. Then, he started anew, “Sorry, let me introduce again. This girl is not my friend; she came with me for some unknown reason after being defeated by me.”","Liu Ningyun’s vision dimmed, and she almost fainted from fury!","“...”","Other people thought, Let’s be friends...","At this moment, Huangpu Tao, a considerate and experienced person, walked up and smoothed things over. “You wouldn’t have known each other without that fight! Mr. Fang, you have so many people in your shop!”","He hurriedly changed the topic.","Ruan Ning was resentful that she had to manage this shop for Fang Qi and thus had no time to manage her own shop. She walked over with a bowl of instant noodles and bumped Liu Ningyun’s arm, whispering, “Don’t be mad. Old Demon Fang is just an old pervert...”","She tried her best to defame Mr. Fang!","“Uh-hem!” Before she could finish, she saw murderous eyes glancing toward her.","“I misspoke! He is handsome and rich!” she immediately changed her words.","Liu Ningyun sniffed and smelled a special fragrance. After spending a whole day chasing after Fang Qi and battling hard with him, she was fatigued with great consumption of her spiritual energy. The fragrance of food made her even more aware of her hunger.","She looked at the red-clothed girl standing beside her and asked, “What’s in your bowl? It smells so good!”","All the other disciples of the Nanhua Faction also stared at the instant noodles.","“It’s my shop’s special—Laotan Chinese Sauerkraut Instant Noodles,” Fang Qi said, “Do you want a bowl, Nanhua Fairy?”","“Nanhua Fairy?!” All the people nearby looked toward her in surprise.","“Is she the super genius of Nanhua Faction?”","“It’s heard that she has understood Nanhua Heavenly Light at a young age, and no one is her match!”","“She’s really beautiful and elegant! I can’t believe that she is in our Half City!”","All of them swarmed up and looked at her as if she was a rare animal.","Sitting on the couch, Liu Ningyun snorted in disdain. “Just from the name, I know that it’s not something good...”","Before she could finish, Huangpu Tao came over with a bowl of noodles. “Slurp... I’ve never tasted something as delicious as this! It’s indeed a delicacy! Hahahaha!”","Surprise suddenly appeared on Huangpu Tao’s face. “The instant noodles...”","“What? Castellan Huangpu?” Liu Ningyun’s face turned cold when she saw Huangpu Tao’s expression changing drastically. “Did this guy poison you?!”","“No!” Huangpu Tao exclaimed, “The noodles can even purify the spiritual energy in my body and solidify my foundation! Unbelievable! Really unbelievable!”","“What?!” All the disciples of the Nanhua Faction stood up from their seats.","Liu Ningyun said, “I’ll take a bowl of instant noodles!”","“Slurp! Slurp! The noodles are so delicious!”","Ten minutes later, she drank the last spoon of soup in the bowl and said, “Sir, one more bowl for me!”","Fang Qi looked at her round belly and then at her face.","Liu Ningyun blushed immediately.","“Each customer can only have one each day,” Mr. Fang said honestly.","At this moment, a white-haired old man sat down on the couch with a bowl of instant noodles in his hands.","Huangpu Tao looked him up and down. “You’re... Brother Mo?!”","Mo Tianxing looked up. “Castellan Huangpu!”","“So good to see you here!”","“Brother Mo, you’re also a customer of this shop?” Huangpu Tao said curiously.","Mo Tianxing looked embarrassed. “Old Yu Cangshan dragged me here to play the Legend of Mir 2! He did poorly in the game, so he joined the guild! Castellan Huangpu, are you here to play the Legend of Mir 2 too?”"]},{"number":278,"title":"Chapter 278 - A new storm is coming","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Play the Legend of Mir 2?” The new-comers looked at each other in bafflement. “No.”","Still not satisfied, Huangpu Tao bought a box of Spicy Sticks and a bottle of Coke when he heard of these snacks. He said while eating and sitting on the couch, “I came here because I heard that Mr. Fang’s shop has the sword control technique!”","“Sword control technique?” Mo Tianxing said while eating instant noodles, “That girl Little Ruan told me about it yesterday, but I was busy leveling up and didn’t have time to look at it. Why? Is it very powerful?”","“Of course!” Huangpu Tao was still embarrassed when he recalled last night’s incident. He was a grandmaster who had cultivated for hundreds of years, but he chased after a junior for one night and fell in exhaustion. No one would believe the story if he told it to others!","He must learn the sword control technique, which would be highly useful no matter if he was chasing or fleeing! Who could stop him then?","As for the powerful Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, he heard that it could be learned here, and he certainly wanted to obtain this powerful technique.","“Play the Legend of Mir 2?” Huangpu Tao asked, “Is the stuff in the Legend of Mir 2 better than the sword control technique?”","“I’m not sure. You have to ask that girl Little Ruan.” Mo Tianxing shook his head and tossed the question to Ruan Ning.","Huangpu Tao and others immediately looked at Ruan Ning curiously.","“Not at all!” Ruan Ning said, “I watched a few episodes of Jade Dynasty and found that the spiritual spells in it are very powerful. But the problem is...”","She continued with a frown, “I can’t learn them in a short time! The sword control technique isn’t easy to learn as well! I thought about it for one night and still can’t understand it. It’s about controlling things, but the method is different from controlling spiritual artifacts. The structure of their spiritual artifacts is different from ours, and I think I still need time to study it.”","Mo Tianxing nodded and said, “That’s true. I can learn the spiritual spells in the Legend of Mir 2 quickly. Each of the spiritual spells in the game is simple, quick, and powerful, and they are good for battles of spells.”","“So, that’s the difference...” The others got a general idea of the stuff in the shop.","“I have to go now!” Mo Tianxing had finished his noodles. “I must go and level up!”","“...”","Soon, Huangpu Tao with the cultivators of Black Dragon Office and Liu Ningyun with the cultivators of the Nanhua Faction began their first computer experience under Mr. Fang’s instructions.","“Well! Don’t say that I didn’t take care of you. Take my advice and grow vegetables first after getting online. Then watch a TV Series or play the game. Remember to collect vegetables later...”","Under Mr. Fang’s guidance, they soon turned from newbies to experienced players. They first grew vegetables and then watched the TV Series...","Then, they found Mr. Fang and talked about the plot with him.","Of course, Mr. Fang stole their vegetables as he did with others.","...","Meanwhile, in the Death Valley at Mengchong Province in the Legend of Mir 2.","The Death Valley had a more famous nickname – Centipede Cave.","According to the legends, this was the underground tunnel leading to the Viper Valley in Mengchong Province, and the cave was filled with large groups of centipedes, evil worms, and pincher worms that preyed on people who entered the cave by mistake.","Wang Jin came with a large group of people. “Big Boss Black Demon, I’ve seen this guy several times, and his name is Young Master Song. He must be the thief who stole your vegetables!”","They saw some warriors killing centipedes in front of them. When they clicked on the option of displaying names above players’ heads, they found that one of them was a warrior named ‘Young Master Song’.","...","In the Lingyun Academy group chat in QQ.","A group of people gathered in a small channel named ‘Shop Owner Punitive Expedition’.","Song Qingfeng killed the centipedes in boredom and asked, “Sister Su, do you see him?”","He was supposed to call her Auntie, but all the people who called her that received beatings.","Su Tianji replied, “I’ll send a message to ask Little Xiao.”","Nanlan Mingxue said, “It’s said the shop owner went out to play yesterday. Today, he should be online.”","Bai Lang added, “I searched the city and didn’t see him.”","At this moment, Song Qingfeng saw a blue lightning bolt crashing onto his head!","Before he could react, another lightning bolt crashed down!","Hit by two lightning bolts, Song Qingfeng instantly lost half of his HP. Meanwhile, he was knocked down by a centipede!","“F*ck! I’m being attacked!” Song Qingfeng yelled in QQ while he gulped down a bottle of red potion.","“Where?! Where?!” The players who gathered in QQ to beat the shop owner were eager to engage in a fight.","“With so many of us here, someone dares to mess with us?!”","“We’re in the narrow Death Valley!” Lin Shao yelled.","Su Tianji asked, “We’re not far from you. How many are there?”","Nalan Mingxue added, “We’ll fly over immediately.”","Xi Qi said, “Old Song, can you hold on for a while?”","“F*ck! I took the chance and escaped using a Random Teleportation Scroll! They have more than ten people! We are not their match,” Song Qingfeng yelled.","“Let’s go!” They were bored from simply leveling up each day!","Nalan Mingxue yelled, “There are many of them. You guys gather at the entrance of the Death Valley! People of Lingyun Academy, come and gather at the entrance of Death Valley!”","...","– On the other side, in Black Demon’s channel in QQ –","Wang Jin yelled, “Big Boss! The guy named Song fled!”","“Interrupt it! I told you to interrupt his chanting!” Black Demon said with a dark expression, “One slash could have done it!”","In the virtual reality remake of the game, the Lightning Technique and weapons could hit the enemies’ hands and sent the Random Teleportation Scrolls or the Town Teleportation Scrolls flying. But obviously, they were one step too late.","“The others are his friends!” Wang Jin yelled, “We can’t let them flee too!”","Lin Shao had just taken out a Random Teleportation Scroll when a lightning bolt struck his hand.","The swift lightning bolt instantly knocked the scroll from his hand.","Then, about ten lightning bolts crashed down!","“F*ck! I died, and my items dropped!” After respawning, he howled, “My ultimate Grim Reaper Glove dropped!”","“Come and gather at the entrance of Death Valley after respawning!” Nalan Mingxue yelled, “We can charge in when we have 20 people!”","Soon, a group of people gathered together. “Let’s go to the narrow valley!”","A while later, about ten warriors and ten wizards and Taoists swarmed in and charged toward the dozen-or-so wizards and Taoists of Black Demon.","“They are over there! Those few!” Song Qingfeng rushed in as well when he saw the back-up.","“Kill that guy called ‘Grandpa Jin’!” Lin Shao yelled, “He killed me!”","“Fire Wall! Use the Fire Wall and shoot Explosion Flames!” Su Tianji commanded and took control.","“Warriors! Charge with me!” Nalan Mingxue lifted her zhanmadao, and the two women commanded in turns.","Instantly, the dim valley was lit up by flames and lightning bolts!","The sword light fell like a curtain!","The wizards launched attacks first, and then the warriors charged!","...","On the other side in the Black Devil QQ channel came a yell in alarm, “Black Demon Guards! Come to the Death Valley to kill them! Hurry up! We’re outnumbered!”"]},{"number":279,"title":"Chapter 279 - Training Soldiers","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","With only about ten people with him, Black Demon had a bad feeling when he saw about 30 people. He immediately took out the Random Teleportation Scroll from his belt and was about to tear it open.","“Ahh!”","With an explosive shout, a dazzling saber light hacked onto his wrist viciously, and the scroll instantly dropped to the ground.","“F*ck!” Black Demon’s face fell when he saw a female warrior standing before him with a smile. “You want to run?”","Resistance Fire Ring!","Subconsciously, Black Demon used the Resistance Fire Ring, but he found that he couldn’t push his enemy away.","Nalan Mingxue hacked at him again.","Then, a lightning bolt crashed down!","Nalan Mingxue stopped her charge. “Sister Su! Watch out! You almost hit me!”","“I’m watching!” Su Tianji launched another Explosion Flame and Black Demon who had, little HP left, died with a scream!","“Did he drop any items?” Su Tianji asked.","Nalan Mingxue took out a curved wooden staff from the backpack. “Devil Staff with Magic 2-5 and Luck+1.”","“Magic Staff?! I’ve never seen such a weapon before!”","“It has high-level properties, and it even gives extra luck!”","On the other side, Song Qingfeng quickly cleared the battlefield. “What do you think? Shall we stay here and wait for them to deliver more items to us?”","“Let’s return to the city first! Don’t leave any people here!” Nalan Mingxu’s bright eyes flashed. “The wizard that Sister Su killed is Big Boss Black Demon from the Morning Star Sea Realm, and I guess that hundreds of them will come!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was rushing toward the lowest level of Wilma Temple with his teammates.","Since they obtained the Enchanting Light Skill Book, Mr. Fang never saw such a skill book again.","Therefore, the only wizard with the Enchanting Light had enchanted two huge multi-horn insects and five evil worms.","As for the Tiger Guard...","“Guild President... Can the Enchanting Light kill the Tiger Guard by accident?” Xi Yue was sulky. She had made a special trip to the Tiger Guard Hall but killed the Tiger Guard by accident when she used the Enchanting Light!","“Yeah, sort of.” In fact, the Tiger Guard was more vulnerable to the Enchanting Light than the ordinary monsters.","It was why the monsters in their small team were all low-leveled.","“Guild President, are we here to level up?” By now, they had reached the second level.","“We’re here to get the cornett.” Fang Qi was planning to establish a guild in the game, and the Wilma Cornett was a necessity.","The Wilma Clan Master was a powerful demon who was regarded as a god by its followers. These followers had tried to resurrect the Wilma Clan Master by sacrificing the lives of 10,000 followers.","Although the Wilma Clan Master couldn’t walk out of the temple, it could destroy the human world if it had the chance to regain its strength.","The lightning bolts that it released could kill people easily.","There circulated many myths about the Wilma Clan Master on this continent, and it would be the first boss that the players could encounter. Compared to the Wilma Clan Master, the corpse kings were nothing.","Sitting together in the internet café with the girls in his guild, Fang Qi said, “Come here! This is the entrance of the third layer!”","“Ugh? How come someone else are here to kill monsters?” Mr. Fang was surprised that some other people came here before he did!","In the center of the hall on the third level, a huge demon with two wings, bull’s hooves, a human body, and two horns was charging swiftly toward a little wizard who had a Crescent Moon (Wizard Weapon) in his hand!","Its huge body stepped on the ground, and the entire palace shook continuously.","Several other wizards and Taoists were attacking the demon, and they were obviously from the same team.","“Sir! What should we do? There are people who are already hitting it.” Xi Yue frowned.","“F*ck...” Fang Qi was sulky, and he wondered if he should come back tomorrow.","Before he could finish his words, that wizard glanced at them and said, “This place now belongs to the White Dragon Office. Get out of here now!”","Ruan Ning: “...”","Xi Yue: “...”","Then, Mr. Fang stepped in the escape route of the wizard, who was being chased by the Wilma Clan Master.","With a savage collision, he pushed the wizard back toward the Clan Master!","The Wilma Clan Master caught up and struck out its palm.","“Ahh!”","A scream sounded.","Mr. Fang brushed the dust off his hands and picked up the item that was dropped on the ground; he found that it belonged to a wizard named Zhuge Bai.","– In a corner of the internet café –","“F*ck!” A cultivator wearing a white robe exploded in fury. “I was ambushed by a scummy warrior named ‘If You Aren’t Vicious, You Can’t Stand Still’! Kill him for me!”","Immediately, about ten people who had been battling with Wilma Clan Master all charged forward.","Soon, the area above the ‘scummy warrior’ Mr. Fang’s head was lit up by several lightning flashes!","“Come on! Concentrate all attacks with me and kill the Taoist named ‘Xue Shuilong’ on the left!”","“Lightning Spell! Concentrate! Concentrate the damage! Heal me, Xiaoyue!”","“Sis Xi! Stall his skeletons with Enchanting Light! Get the worms to bite them!”","“Good job! We killed one!”","“...”","Beside them, the people of the Black Dragon Palace and the Nanhua Faction who were watching the TV Series couldn’t hold back anymore. “What’s this upheaval?”","They looked over and saw that the screens were filled with flames and lightning bolts!","“What’s this thing?”","...","– Meanwhile in Black Demon’s channel in QQ –","“F*ck! They are gone!” Black Demon brought about 100 people to the narrow valley, but his enemies were long gone.","Black Demon roared, “My magic staff dropped!”","“It took us a long time to find him, and now he’s gone again!” Wang Jin said in a dark expression, “Where can we find him now?”","“How about...” One Black Demon Guard had an idea. “We can put a price on their heads on the World Channel!”","“Good idea!” Black Demon yelled, “Announce for me on the World Channel, and put prices on the three scumbags, Young Master Song, New Snow, and Yuji Immortal! Anyone who gives us their locations will be rewarded with 400,000 gold coins!”","Soon, the World Channel in QQ was flooded with the notice.","[Wanted: Anyone who reports the locations of Young Master Song, New Snow, and Yuji Immortal will be rewarded with 400,000 gold coins! Anyone who kills them can get one million gold coins with a screenshot of the scene!","The notice flooded the screen and attracted the attention of all the players.","Song Qingfeng was now leveling up in another place. After being attacked by strangers, he looked at the World Channel and cussed, “F*ck!”","In a channel in QQ, Song Qingfeng yelled, “I have a price on my head!”","Nalan Mingxue said, “Me too.”","Su Tianji: “...”","Soon, they received congratulation messages, and the most infuriating one came from Mr. Fang, “Friend! I need money lately. Can you help me out? (Akita Inu’s dirty smile)”","The three of them replied together, “Get out! Scummy shop owner!”","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue saw a stranger’s name jumping on her friend list.","The Royal Princess asked, “Do you need help?”","“Ugh?”","In the Corpse King Hall, the ground was covered by the bodies of corpse kings, and most of the royal guards had obtained all the skills below level 30!","Yu Chi asked them, “Do you want to kill the scumbags from the Morning Star Sea Realm?”","“Yes!”","“I have been planning to kill those bastards of the Morning Star Sea Realm!”","“I’m bored of leveling up each day!”","After receiving Ji Yu’s message, Nalan Mingxue sent her a question mark before asking, “How many people do you have?”","“300.” Ji Yu sent her a cool emoji. “If you want, I can summon about 2,000 😎”","Nalan Mingxue’s frown deepened, feeling like it was like training soldiers instead of dealing with grudges in the game.","“Okay!” she put in one word immediately.","At this moment, Ji Wu had a solemn expression on his face while he held a secret intelligence report in his hand. He inhaled deeply and said, “I’ll go and see Alliance Master Lan.”","On the top of the secret intelligence report was a message: [Yundian Upper Realm sent a troop of 20 warships and 100 spiritual transportation boats!]"]},{"number":280,"title":"Chapter 280 - The No.1 Guild and the Imminent War","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“You can battle with others in the game?” Listening to the explanations, Liu Ningyun looked at Su Zhi’s screen in surprise.","The TV Series named Jade Dynasty was indeed excellent, but they couldn’t participate in it.","However, it seems that the players can practice what they learn in the game.","Besides, she saw that the spiritual spells the players used were quite powerful. More importantly, as Mo Tianxing mentioned, they were simple and easy to learn.","After all, when they battled with people, they couldn’t always use super powerful spiritual spells or treasures. Overkill was one thing, and the consumption of energy was another big issue.","That was why these simple and highly efficient small spiritual spells became the top choice of the cultivators!","“You can try it yourself.” Even though their team had seven monsters enchanted by Xi Yue’s Enchanting Light, it was a hard battle against Wilma Clan Master without Tiger Guard and Eagle Guard.","Su Zhi answered their questions with short sentences while she put most of her energy in the battle.","“Tomorrow.” Liu Ningyun thought for a moment. “We’ll try this game tomorrow after finish watching the TV Series.”","“Are you using these small spiritual spells to deal with this demon?” A female disciple of the Nanhua Faction looked at the huge demon who was launching lightning bolts with its palms, and each dodge of its attacks seemed like a narrow escape. “Isn’t it dangerous?”","“We can sharpen our combat skills this way.” Liu Ningyun knew that cultivators mostly used these spiritual spells in ordinary battles. If she hadn’t encountered Fang Qi, who was a weird exception, she probably wouldn’t have had a chance to use Nanhua Heavenly Light in years.","Then, she saw two huge insects with big horns and five black worms helping the team fight. “What are these?”","“They are Sister Xi’s pets.” Su Zhi explained, “Enchanting Light can enchant seven monsters that are as powerful as her. These monsters can also be strengthened by four levels, reaching level 7. They are super powerful after all the transformations! Much stronger than before!”","“Unfortunately, we haven’t gotten this skill book again!” Su Zhi looked sulky. “It seems that this technique is hard to get..”","“Seven monsters?! The same level as their master?!” Liu Ningyun froze.","What did it mean? If she could learn this spiritual spell, would it mean that she could control seven demon beasts of the True Lake Realm?!","Besides, these seven monsters could even get stronger later on?!","She shivered while she imagined the scenario in which seven strengthened True Lake Realm monsters surrounded her enemies.","Each technique in this shop is horrifyingly powerful!","“Xiaoyue, the Clan Master is going after you! Be careful!”","The Wilma Clan Master wasn’t as stupid as the corpse kings. Even though Mr. Fang blocked its advance, it would try its best to attack the wizards who were casting highly damaging spells at it from behind Fang Qi.","None of the girls would survive after getting attacked by it!","Under the Wilma Clan Master’s powerful lightning spell, the worms suffered great casualties while the two level 7 multi-horn insects looked fatigued and almost exploded.","Several times, even Mr. Fang was almost killed by the super-powerful lightning attacks.","At this moment, the Wilma Clan Master’s HP hit the bottom!","Whoosh! Suddenly, it flashed.","As if it used the teleportation spell of the wizards, it instantly appeared before the wizards!","Crack!","One lightning bolt shot from its claws, and Su Zhi died.","The others behind Fang Qi were in a panic!","“F*ck! Run to me! Let the skeletons charge forward! Don’t panic! Its HP is almost empty!”","“Move according to plan! Get to a safe position before attacking!”","The resurrected Wilma Clan Master was only a weakened demon, and it finally dropped to the ground with a scream under their concentrated attacks!","After it fell, a surge of tremendous force entered their bodies!","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction were watching and were surprised. “What’s happening?!”","“This presence? How come I feel like a group of people achieved breakthroughs together?!’","“I broke through!” Xi Yue exclaimed in pleasure, “So many experience points!”","“I broke through too!” Ruan Ning yelled.","“I died...” Su Zhi had tears on her face.","The people of the Nanhua Faction and the Black Dragon Office were surprised. “Can people break through in this way?!”","“Dragon’s Ring!”","“Wilma Cornett!”","There were other items such as Asura (Weapon) and Demon Conquer (Weapon), and Fang Qi picked them up one by one.","Then, he saw a small yellow book lying on the ground.","“Summon Godly Beast?!”","All of them came over. “Summon Godly Beast?!”","Fang Qi was surprised that [Summon Godly Beast] Skill Book was dropped by the Wilma Clan Master.","“It’s a pity that it isn’t the Flame Sword Technique!” Sulkily, Mr. Fang tossed the book toward Jiang Xiaoyue, hoping that they could soon find the [Flame Sword Technique] Skill Book. Then, he could use it to light his cigarettes. It would be cool!","“We’ll try to get Sis Su Yao a [Summon Godly Beast] Skill Book next time. Now, let’s go and establish the guild!”","...","The Wilma Cornett was a demon’s horn that looked like a bull horn.","According to the legend, if people dripped blood on it and swore, they would unite as one. When one devoted member used spiritual spells or attacks, they wouldn’t hurt the other members.","In short, the special force in this demon’s horn could protect the members of the guild from being accidentally injured by other members by, making it easier for the guild to fight big battles.","An announcement appeared in the Legend of Mir 2 World Channel in QQ, [The first guild in the Legend of Mir 2, Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild, is born! A new chapter of the Legend of Mir 2 begins! The battle of the Royal City of Sarbark will trigger the war on the entire Wilma Continent!]","Messages flooded the World Channel.","“Awesome!”","“What on earth is a guild? Where can we build one?”","In Earth City of the Mengchong Province, the guild members had a guild badge of the Dragon-Slaying Saber pinned on their chest. Behind their names in the game, there was a line of words, spelling out ‘Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild’.","“Wow! So awesome!”","“The first guild?”","“So quick?”","“We can play the game this way?” Many players obviously hadn’t heard of such things before.","“Do you need more people? Can I join you?”","Xi Yue, Su Zhi, and the other members felt quite proud and honored when people, including the grand cultivators from big forces in Half City, looked at them with envy.","Even Ruan Ning, who always complained about Mr. Fang, looked smug.","Jiang Xiaoyue stood very straight as if she were worried that the others couldn’t see the eye-catching badge.","At this moment, about 100 Black Demon Guards gathered outside Sarbark City.","The people yelled in the Black Demon Channel in QQ, “Where?! Where is that kid?”","In the Lingyun Academy Channel in QQ, Nalan Mingxue, and the others couldn’t stop their smiles.","Song Qingfeng said, “Come, and let’s get the loot!”","Obviously, they leaked their own locations to Black Demon.","In one corner of Sarbark City, hundreds of royal guards stood in a neat square formation.","Yu Chi roared, “Defend!”","Rows of fireballs were shot into the sky, forming orange characters!","The hundreds of guards seemed to be engulfed by the firelight!","“Demon!”","Waves of rune notes flew into the sky while pale blue flames burned and formed huge blue ancient characters!","The light shone on the people’s faces and turned them blue!","A square formation of royal guards charged out as one and soon crashed into the hundreds of Black Demon Guards!","“Attack!”"]},{"number":281,"title":"Chapter 281 - Lake and Fish","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s happening?!”","“How come they have so many people?!”","Shouts sounded in the Black Demon Channel on QQ.","“Where are the skeletons? Push them forward!”","They had been searching for people and didn’t form a proper array. When they cast the spiritual spells, the attacks were random and ineffective, and part of their spells, such as Fireballs and Fire Rune Notes, could be blocked by weapons. Soon, the royal guards who had armor and magic resistance buffs charged toward them!","In the Royal Team Channel, Yu Chi yelled, “Warriors surround them! Wizards launch techniques toward the center of the crowd!”","Many of the royal guards were equipped with complete skills. When they launched the AoE skills (Area of Effect) such as Fire Wall and Explosion Flames into the dense crowd of Black Demon Guards, the latter was instantly knocked down!","Black Demon’s face turned gloomy.","By his side, Wang Jin yelled, “They seem to be people of the Royal Clan! That warrior named ‘Royal Guard Captain Yu’ is from the Royal Clan!”","“They are the royal guards of Dajin!”","“Remaining Black Demon Guards, use Random Teleportation Scrolls and get out!” Black Demon roared.","“Retreat! Retreat!”","“Damn it! Those scumbaags from the tiny forces even dragged the Royal Clan into the battle!” Black Demon cussed indignantly in frustration, “They tricked me!”","“Boss, what should we do?” From the looks of it, they were no match even if they called all the Black Demon Guards here.","“Get more people! Get more people!” Black Demon roared in fury, “Call all the people of Yuanheng Pavilion, Coiled Dragon Office, and other forces! Get them to come and join the United Troops Channel!”","“You want to fight? Let’s make it a war!”","In the Dajin Command Channel, Gong He and the elders of the Liuyun Daoist Palace and Cloud Ocean Faction were called in.","Even Su Tianji was called into the Dajin Command Channel.","In about half an hour, about 1,000 people gathered outside of Sarbark City including royal guards, the Jiuhua Army, and people from big forces such as the Liuyun Daoist Palace and Cloud Ocean Faction!","On the other side, the Morning Star Sea Realm soon formed a troop of 1,000 people. Although they didn’t attack, a storm was brewing before Sarbark City.","...","– In the Taixi Faction –","It was now autumn, and most of the plants in the world had withered from the chilling winds, but cold temperatures couldn’t affect the green and vibrant plants here.","The green spiritual plants and blooming flowers in all kinds of colors grew cheerfully around the clear lake at the foot of the green mountain.","An old man wearing a white robe with golden patterns on it was fishing by the lake.","A little boy and a little girl stood behind him at attendance.","The old man stared at the different kinds of fish that were swimming in the water and tossed out a handful of fish bait. Soon, herds of fish and shrimp swam toward him.","He pulled up the fishing rod, but there was no hook attached.","Sitting by the lake, he watched the fish and shrimps fight for food in the water, and his face which looked distant with thousands of years of worldly experience and filled with vicissitude revealed a trace of interest.","“Master, we’ve finished the investigation of Junior Brother Feng Xi...” A disciple came from outside.","“He practiced jobbery and even lost the Demon-Suppressing Cauldron, right?” The old man looked at the lake with a smile as if he knew everything.","“You knew it?” The disciple was surprised. “I don’t understand why you still allow Junior Brother Feng Xi to do what he has done...”","At this moment, a golden carp leaped out of the water.","He pointed at the golden carp and said, “Look! This fish jumped out of the water and saw the world outside, but it still has to return to the lake.”","While he spoke, he tossed out the bamboo basket by his side and caught the golden carp before it fell back into the lake. Then, the basket continued to fly forward toward the center of the lake.","“What do you see now?”","“This...” The disciple said, “Master, the fish was caught by the bamboo basket and can’t return to the lake.”","“Yeah... It was caught by the basket and doesn’t need to return to the lake.” He casually tossed out some bait into the center of the lake.","At this moment, the bamboo basket was flying past this spot.","The water in the center of the lake surged up while a huge weird fish with horns leaped up and swallowed the bait and the bamboo basket together!","He slowly put away the fishing gear and said, “It’s not easy to raise the fish in this lake.”","...","Meanwhile, Ji Wu sat together with the leaders of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and even An Huwei, the Castellan of Jiuhua City, appeared here.","“I think all of you know about the situation,” Ji Wu said in his deep voice, “According to an urgent report, Yundian Upper Realm’s troops will soon come to the border of our country! I think you all know their purpose.”","“Your Majesty, you mean...” Lan Mo looked grim.","“It’s a joke! Yundian Upper Realm gained so many benefits from Cultivation Realm, and we get their left-overs!” Ji Wu sneered, “Now that we have found a new way to strengthen our country, they have no right to make us give it up!”","“In my opinion, these guys are just jealous!” Jun Yangzi sneered, “If they want to fight, we will fight!”","...","Ruan Ning was recruiting members in Earth City of the Mengchong Province. “Guild President, Dajin Country seems to have engaged in another war with this side!”","“Didn’t they fight not long ago? They are doing it again so soon?” Xi Yue frowned. “Guild President, should we go there?”","“Yeah! Why not?” Fang Qi sipped on the Coke and said, “Wait a moment for me. We’ll go and watch the battle after I steal some vegetables!”","Soon, he entered Su Tianji’s small yard which was empty since she was in the battle.","He dug out a big daikon.","Then, Mr. Fang entered Song Qingfeng’s small yard which was also empty with its owner in the battle.","He dug out a big sweet potato.","Then, he walked into Nalan Mingxue’s fenced field.","“Bark! Bark!”","A black-and-white puppy came up with a wagging tail; It was a cute Husky.","“She got a dog as well?” Mr. Fang was surprised.","Then, he walked into the vegetable garden. “I’ll get you a peach to eat.”","“Wu... Wu...” The dog bit into the peach while wagging its tail.","Unsatisfied, it bit into the vegetables in the garden and pulled out a daikon.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang also pulled out a big daikon.","Then, he ran with two daikon in his arms.","“Good dog. I’ll bring you food next time.”","The little Husky looked very excited.","He looked back and saw that all the vegetables in the garden were ravaged.","“Who’s the next one?” Mr. Fang thought for a second and entered a yard,","A girl in red stared at Fang Qi with disdain on her face. “Guild President, what do you want to do?! Do you want to steal my vegetables from under my nose?”","“Sorry. I walked into the wrong place...” Mr. Fang mumbled to himself, “I should have told them to go watch the battle, and I would go later... I wasn’t thinking clearly...”","Then, he glanced at the people of the Nanhua Faction and Black Dragon Office who were watching the TV Series.","He entered their yards and found that their vegetables were still in the field. The big holes that he had dug while stealing the daikon from them before were still there.","“They still haven’t collected their vegetables?” Mr. Fang immediately put down the virtual reality headset and walked over to them. “Guys, you can collect the vegetables now.”","“Oh, can we?”","“So soon?”","“I forgot about it while watching the TV Series!”","They exclaimed and immediately went to collect vegetables.","“Remember to grow new vegetables after collecting!” Mr. Fang reminded them.","Disciples from Nanhua Faction said, “Thank you for your reminder, Sir!”","Liu Ningyun was suspicious. “How come he’s so warm and helpful?”","Huangpu Tao said, “Thank you!”","Good; Fang Qi would have new vegetables to steal next time."]},{"number":282,"title":"Chapter 282 - Fighting the Landlord","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Dou Dizhu literally means fighting the landlord, and it is a card game in the genre of shedding and gambling. It is one of the most popular card games played in China.]","“Hey! It’s not fun!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Song Qingfeng exited virtual reality mode and sighed, “The people from the Morning Star Sea Realm stopped fighting after only two charges. I thought they would last longer!”","“They had to retreat since they were defeated,” Lin Shao said, “Their items were dropped everywhere; many of them don’t have complete skills, so they couldn’t continue the battle.”","“By the way, should we go back and collect vegetables?”","Beside them sat Nalan Mingxue and Lan Yan, and they both yelled, “Let’s go and collect vegetables!”","Shen Qingqing looked worried. “Did the shop owner steal from us again?”","Nalan Mingxue said mildly, “I’m afraid that he won’t dare to come anymore.”","“Ugh?” Shen Qingqing and the others looked at her in surprise.","“I bought a dog yesterday,” Nalan Mingxue’s lips curved with smugness while she explained.","“You had enough money to buy a dog?” Shen Qingqing asked in surprise.","“She bought a small one,” Lan Yan explained for her, “I checked the information, and it said that this dog will be as ferocious as a wolf when it grows up. It is enough to guard the courtyard.”","“Really?” Shen Qingqing said in resentment, “I wish it would bite him! Then, I’ll see if he dares to steal vegetables from us in the future!”","“Did you buy a dog too?” Dong Qingli heard their conversation and asked, “Is it cute? Is it as silly as the shop owner’s dog?”","“Ugh...” Nalan Mingxue said, “It’s okay.”","“It’s very cute!” Lan Yan added, “It’s young and loves to play. Do you want to come and have a look?”","“Good!”","The girls accepted the invitations and came to Nalan Mingxue’s Qzone.","“Ms. Nalan’s dog is very obedient except that it likes to nibble on things...” Lan Yan told them in excitement, “It’s chubby and very cute.”","While she spoke, they walked into the courtyard. “Yuanyuan! Yuan...?”","Then, she was stupefied.","The whole vegetable field was ravaged, and it looked as if a tornado had swept through it!","What happened?!","“Where’s the dog?! Did that villain Fang Qi hit it?!” Lan Yan was worried about the dog.","A black-and-white silly dog was sitting on the ground. Seeing its master, it wagged its tail wildly and trotted up as if it wanted to show off its ‘achievement’.","When it saw Nalan Mingxue, it rubbed itself on her snow-white boots.","“Wu... Wu...” With half a piece of a vegetable leaf hanging from its mouth, it looked up at her with big, watery eyes.","Nalan Mingxue had the urge to stomp this silly dog with her foot!","Looking at its face that seemed like it was asking for a compliment, she was torn between laughing and giving it a lesson. She stood facing the wind in stupefaction.","At this moment, a beep sounded in QQ.","It came from Mr. Fang. [When did you buy the Husky? It’s super cute.]","Then, he sent a picture in which he and the little Husky each held a daikon, saying, [It can even help its master pull out daikons.]","Nalan Mingxue who was always calm and collected couldn’t remain cool any more!","“Hahahaha!” Mr. Fang sent a meme of the Akita Inu’s laughing face, very happy at her ‘misfortune and misery’.","[I will tell you one thing; the Husky will work with me.]","How dare she use a Husky to guard her home?","[Don’t be smug! (Akita Inu’s disdainful face) (Akita Inu’s ferocious face)]","– In Nalan Mingxue’s Qzone –","“The dog is so cute!” With stars in her eyes, Dong Qingli picked it up and put it in her arms, not caring that it was dirty.","“So warm! Look at its face!”","“It’s more fun than Mr. Fang’s memes!”","“What are Mr. Fang’s memes?” Lan Yan was baffled.","“The pictures that Mr. Fang uses every day!”","Lan Yan was at a loss for words.","In her mind, the funny face of the Akita Inu that Mr. Fang used every day and the sneaky smile on Mr. Fang’s face after stealing vegetables came together, and the two pictures had an equal sign connecting them.","“Hahahaha!”","She laughed so hard she that bent her back.","Then, all the people in the field understood the joke and laughed as hard as they could.","It seemed to be the only way that could alleviate their misery of being robbed by Mr. Fang.","...","Oblivious to the fact that the girls were making fun of him, Mr. Fang was now browsing the items in the shop.","He remembered that one could buy computers and even games such as Street Fighter in the shop. After glancing at the prices, he found that the computers were expensive. He could barely buy one with the big fortune that he made by growing and stealing vegetables everyday. After buying the computer, he had no money left to buy games.","The objects for pure entertainment were rather cheap, but other games such as Street Fighter were expensive since they could unlock new features after certain conditions were met.","Therefore, Mr. Fang reached out his evil hands toward a very cheap little game which looked like a set of poker cards – Happy Fight the Landlord!","Since he was chatting with Nalan Mingxue in QQ, he sent her a message, [Want to come and play Fight the Landlord?]","“What’s that?”","[A small game to test players’ IQs,] Mr. Fang tempted her with a straight face.","[Testing IQ? This is obviously a way to provoke me. It must be a trick (Akita Inu’s disdainful face)]","[Damn!]","...","On the other side, seeing that she had only about ten minutes of computer time left, Su Tianji sat down on the bed in her Qzone and sulked.","She sprawled on the bed.","“What’s wrong with me? I don’t want to cultivate or battle...”","She rolled over and got up.","On the verge of going offline, she suddenly felt bored with life.","She cursed when she remembered that she had to go to battle in a few days, “Damn it!”","Instead of being worried about the crisis, she just wanted to sleep.","In QQ, Mr. Fang suddenly sent her a message. [Want to come and play Fight the Landlord 😄?]","Su Tianji asked, [What’s that?]","[It’s a little game to test players’ IQs.] Mr. Fang replied with a straight face. [Come on! I called Young Master Song and others too!]","[I’ll get offline in ten minutes; what game can I play?] Su Tianji lost interest.","[Don’t worry! We can play several rounds in 10 minutes!]","[Ugh? Really?]","[Coming! Coming!]","After Fang Qi explained the rules to them, they learned the game fast. Soon, voices sounded in Mr. Fang’s room.","“I call Landlord!”","“I will rob it!”","“Plane!”","“Trio with a single card!”","“Pass!”","“Little Joker!”","“Big Joker!”","“...”","...","“What’s fun about this game?” Xiao Yulv mumbled to himself while he watched them play, “It’s just a bit more complicated than Pai Gow...”","[TL Note: Pai gow is a Chinese gambling game, played with a set of 32 Chinese dominoes. It is played in major casinos in China, the United States, Canada, Australia, and, New Zealand.]","On the next day, Xiao Yulv sat down on the couch with a set of cards identical to the ones that Fang Qi played with yesterday.","“Come on! Let’s play Fight the Landlord! Anyone who has finished their computer time or can’t get online, come and play Fight the Landlord with me!”","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was counting his winnings. “Playing two more days of cards and I will be able to buy Street Fighter...”","His QQ was flooded with the messages. [Scummy shop owner! Return our hard-earned money!]","“...”"]},{"number":283,"title":"Chapter 283 - Conquering the City","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After gaining a big victory, the united troops of Dajin didn’t chase after the people of the Morning Star Sea Realm as if they didn’t want to crush them.","This gave the alliance of the Morning Star Sea Realm some time to regain their footing. Different from the players of Dajin, they would lose the chance to obtain fast growth in cultivation strength after they lost the battle completely. With incomplete skills and their items dropped, they would certainly lose no matter how many people they had!","While they trained their people diligently, they contacted and invited more forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm into the alliance. Therefore, the computers in Half City Shop grew from 1,000 to 2,000 almost overnight!","Fortunately, the shop was well managed under the System’s surveillance. Otherwise, Zou Mo would have been overwhelmed.","Meanwhile, in the Jiuhua City Shop, the big forces including the royal guards, Jiuhua Army, and Cloud Ocean Faction were also expanding, leveling up, and trying to obtain more skill books.","They busied themselves with the practice of spiritual spells and combat techniques.","Half City and Jiuhua City were at peace, which was quite unusual.","It felt like the calm before a storm.","...","In this world, peace couldn’t exist on its own; it could only be achieved through wars.","100 spiritual transportation boats and 20 warships?","If people could see the large group of spiritual boats crossing the border of Yundian Upper Realm, they would know how wrong the intelligence report was!","With their ability, Yundian Upper Realm certainly could hide information from Dajin.","On the bow of a huge warship in the lead stood a white-faced Daoist who was about 50 years old. He was Gongyang Jun, and he said, “That little guy Ji Wu is probably pleased that he has obtained the information about our movement.”","Standing beside him, the middle-aged cultivator with a wide face, a wide forehead, and a black-and-white robe was Gongshu Kuo. “When Ji Xuantong was alive, he was respectful to us, but this kid is so audacious that he even dares to join hands with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and challenge us?”","“He thinks that we will charge at the Crescent Moon Fortress in the west with 100,000 soldiers? What a joke!” Gongyang Jun snickered and looked at the spiritual transportation boats that were moving swiftly behind them, saying, “For us, is there a difference between barging in from the west and from the east?”","Gongshu Kuo said in a harsh tone, “We’ll take ten of his cities and see how he reacts to that!”","In front of the South Gate Fortress in the south of Dajin, the patrolling soldiers suddenly looked up.","“What... are those?!”","Many spiritual boats suddenly appeared in the sky, and many cultivators flew down from the boats like dense locusts while spiritual spells crashed down from the sky like a storm!","They appeared out of the blue in the sky as if they had been invisible!","At this moment, the people in the South Gate Fortress of Dajin felt as if the end of the world had suddenly come!","“Cultivator troops! They are cultivator troops!”","“They are cultivator troops of Yundian Upper Realm. How come they are here?”","“Hurry up and report it!”","“Ahh!”","Faced with enemies that they had no ability to fight back against, the well-trained armies that were responsible for guarding the border fell into chaos and screams soon filled the South Gate Fortress.","...","– Dajin Country –","“Report! Cultivator troops of Yundian attacked the South Gate Fortress, and the 50,000 border soldiers can’t hold them back! They are asking for back-up!”","“Report! The South Gate Fortress is lost! The 50,000 back-up soldiers from Crescent Moon Fortress retreated to Blade-Hiding (Cang Feng) City!”","“Report! Blade-Hidden City was lost!”","“Report! Cultivator troops of Yundian conquered ten cities consecutively, and they are attacking the Sky Wolf (Tian Lang) Fortress!”","“...”","Hearing the urgent reports, Ji Wu became livid with fury. “Damn it! The previous emperor signed a peace pact with the Yundian Upper Realm, but they disregarded it and conquered my cities?”","Although he had made some preparations and increased his guard, he didn’t expect that the gap between them would be so great until the Yundian Upper Realm attacked Dajin!","“Your Majesty, haven’t you been developing spiritual transportation boats,” One general said, “In my opinion, we can pull the spiritual transportation boats. Together with our military spiritual boats, we can move 30,000 elite soldiers to defend Sky Wolf Fortress!”","“30,000 soldiers are not enough!” Ji Wu said with gritted teeth, “According to the war reports, Yundian Upper Realm has sent a cultivator army of at least 30,000 soldiers!”","Even if Dajin had 30,000 elite cultivators formed into a troop, they would be no match for Yundian Upper Realm’s 30,000 cultivator troop since the latter had excellent items and high cultivation strengths. Right now, Dajin’s army was a mix of cultivators and warriors! How could they win?","After all, a cultivator’s power on a battlefield was several times greater than a warrior’s!","“That’s the only option we have! Your Majesty!” The old general said in a trembling voice, “They have no intention to battle with our main military force. After entering the center of our territory, they can easily attack the Royal Palace to the west or the headquarters of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance to the east!”","The powerful mobility of Yundian Upper Realm’s cultivator army was evident, and Dajin’s army was no match for it.","Perhaps a big army of 200,000 to 300,000 soldiers could stop Yundian Upper Realm, but the latter obviously had anticipated this and showed no intention of fighting with Dajin’s main force.","With many transportation spiritual boats, the tens of thousands of cultivators of Yundian Upper Realm could lead the hundreds of thousands of warriors and cultivators of Dajin in a merry chase.","The only option right now was to chase after them with lots of transportation spiritual boats, but the transportation boats in Dajin could only carry tens of thousands of people.","This eliminated the only advantage of an army that was mainly comprised of warriors – the numbers advantage.","“I’m willing to block the enemies with a 30,000-soldier-strong suicide army!”","“I’m willing to be the vanguard!” A middle-aged general with a beard yelled.","They were generals who had once talked about Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell with Premier Zhang in the Royal Palace. The white-haired general was Wang Tong, and the middle-aged general was Li Kaishan; they were both experienced generals of Dajin. With two of them here, the majority of the military force of Dajin was here.","“Everyone, please look forward at the Yundian Upper Realm,” Wang Tong pointed at the green mountains in the distance. “It’s beautiful and rich with resources, but our land is comparatively poor and rural.”","“They regard themselves as lofty cultivators from an upper realm, and we should respect them for it. However, they take us as lowly ants that they can crush whenever they want! Today, they took ten cities from us due to a small grudge. If they think of something tomorrow, will they come and take the whole country! Do you want to take this humiliation willingly?","“Today, I will lead you to battle them to death! Who is willing to come with me?!”","“We are willing!” Instantly, the roars resonated in the area as if huge ocean waves crashed onto the land!","With a grim expression, Ji Wu finally came to a decision at this moment. “With you all willing to go to war for our Dajin at the risk of your lives, how can I, the emperor of Dajin, stand by and watch?”‘","“Where are my royal guards!”","“Where is the Jiuhua Army!”","“Where is the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Army!”","“We are here!” More than 2,000 people shouted from behind him, and the flags fluttered in the wind.","“Today, I’ll lead 30,000 elite soldiers of the Iron Armor Army and cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and 2,000 of the joint army of Dajin (Internet Cafe Army) to battle them to the death!”","“No! Your Majesty!”","“You represent the country and can’t go to the battle with 30,000 soldiers in the suicide army at the risk of your life...”","“Stall them? What can we do even if we stall them?” Ji Wu said with a cold smile, “They will slowly kill the soldiers of our Dajin one by one!”","“At least... we can stall them until our main force comes!”","“What then? They can go anywhere they want; how can our army keep up and beat them?!” Ji Wu slammed his fist on the wall beside him. “I have a clear understanding of the situation now. Despite the big number of soldiers and generals of my Dajin, the only force that has the potential to block them is the tens of thousands of soldiers that the transportation boats can accommodate!”","Without these tens of thousands of soldiers and the spiritual boats, Dajin could do nothing but guard the Capital City!","Ji Wu wasn’t an emperor who would do nothing but guard what he had. As the second emperor of Dajin, he didn’t experience the era when the soldiers of Dajin battled around to expand their territory, but he had a stronger wish for a more powerful Dajin compared to the previous emperor, Ji Xuantong. Now, an opportunity presented itself before him!","“I’ve made a decision!” Ji Wu said firmly with his golden cloak fluttering in the wind."]},{"number":284,"title":"Chapter 284 - The first battle between Yundian Upper Realm and Dajin Country!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the chaotic world, Dajin was probably strong enough.","The country was established by a group of warrior families. Warriors had been regarded as mortals by the cultivators, but they had built a big country in this world full of masters, forcing the cultivators to acknowledge its existence. In fact, it even formed a partnership with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, a cultivator alliance. It was something unimaginable for warriors in ancient times!","The pioneers who had achieved this feat were great enough to be recorded in the history books!","However, for Yundian Upper Realm, this country was still young and weak.","After all, the weak ones and the ones who fell behind were always preyed on by the powerful.","Natural blockages and terrain advantages were nothing for cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm. Sky Wolf Fortress had the defensive advantage since it was surrounded by cliffs, but it was child’s play for cultivators.","The lofty cultivators of Yundian Upper Realm looked down on the Fortress from the spiritual boats in the sky and the sharp arrows shot by the soldiers who were defending the fortress were blocked by the spiritual light barriers around the spiritual boats and posed no threat to the cultivators.","Only the City-Destroying Arrows could have some effects on the spiritual boats in the sky. But soon, the arrows were destroyed by spiritual spells and disappeared in a flash like shooting stars in the night.","Standing on the tall black cliff, the generals wearing black armor raised their arms and roared, leading the remaining soldiers to jump onto the spiritual boats from both sides of the cliff. Then, they fell hopelessly in the destructive spiritual light.","The blood and fire flowed out of this war between unequal parties!","Gongshu Kuo sat on the bow of his boat in an armchair with a cup of tea in his hand, and he watched the battle as if he was enjoying dazzling fireworks of a bustling festival.","Behind him stood a row of elders from the Gongshu Family, and their auras showed that they were all above the Divine Ocean Realm!","“B*stards of Yundian! You’ll die pathetically!” A middle-aged general wearing black armor cussed while he was dragged up to the bow.","“Family Master, we’ve captured the head general of Sky Wolf Fortress.” The person who spoke was a middle-aged cultivator whose cultivation strength was obviously at the early stage of the Divine Ocean Realm!","“Have you forgotten the pact that you reached with our previous emperor?” The black-armored general cussed in fury, “How can you call yourselves heroes or upper realm cultivators when you sneak-attack us?”","Gongshu Kuo waved his left hand, and the middle-aged cultivator immediately slapped this general’s face twice ferociously.","“Take him down.” Gongshu Kuo lifted the cup in his hand and enjoyed the fragrance of the tea. “They are so weak. I think we don’t have to keep the captives; just kill them all...”","Suddenly, he had a bad feeling in his guts. The spiritual light barrier protecting this spiritual boat was broken, and his body tilted subconsciously.","Bang!","The teacup in his hand exploded!","The hot tea spilled over and spayed on his head and face.","A few tea leaves stuck on his face, and he looked extremely disheveled and embarrassed!","Looking at him, the surrounding people wanted to laugh, but they had to hold back; their faces all turned red since they were trying to push it down.","“Who?! Who did it?!” Shamed and enraged, Gongshu Kuo stood up from his chair and looked around, wanting to pull out the person who sneak-attacked him and kill them. However, he couldn’t find the attacker.","The surrounding masters also looked around but couldn’t see a trace of the attacker.","Then, they looked into the distance. Right now, the huge fleet of warships of Dajin only looked like a small black dot in the sky.","Then, someone yelled in alarm, “It’s Dajin’s Army!”","In a snow-white long dress, Su Tianji’s dense black hair fluttered in the wind while she stood at the bow of the ship in the lead. With one of her white boots stepping on the edge of the ship, she was holding a silver-whitish heavy sniper rifle which had a long and thick body.","While exhaling slightly, she squinted her eyes and looked at Gongshu Kuo, who had tea splashed all over his head through the scope. “Alas! I’m old! My hand shook slightly!”","“With your old-age and clumsiness, you can only hit him by the edge!” Xue Daolv said contemptuously while standing by her side.","...","“Kill! Kill them for me!” Gongshu Kuo wiped his face, feeling like it was the most humiliating moment in his life!","At his order, many spiritual boats flew toward Dajin’s spiritual boat group at top speed!","“Block them!” Gongshu Kuo looked livid while he stared at the distant spiritual boats. “I don’t know what tricks you are playing, but you can only defeat my Gongshu Family in your dreams!”","Each of the spiritual boats of Gongshu Family was a super spiritual artifact for war with ultimate power!","Gongshu Kuo said with a chilly expression, “I’ll give these ignorant ants a taste of the great power of the spiritual artifacts that my Gongshu Family got from the Cultivation Realm!”","The Gongshu Family had once gained a scroll which showed the creation process of ancient warships in the Cultivation Realm. It was because of this scroll that the Gongshu Family was elevated to the No. 3 Position in the Yundian Upper Realm.","When the world wasn’t this peaceful before, the Gongshu Family had used their fleet of warships to destroy a middle-sized cultivator force which had offended Yundian Upper Realm. During that battle, the Gongshu Family had almost zero casualties!","The creation process of the Gongshu Family’s warships was very profound and complicated; the battleships were perfect spiritual treasures with powerful defense abilities, and they could even unleash several grand spiritual spells that had horrifying power!","Even the Gongshu Family possessed only a couple of dozens of such perfect warships, and they had brought 20 of them, more than half of the combat force of the family, into this battle.","Countless spiritual light beams gathered in the first row of the warships, and the cultivators’ spiritual energies merged with that of the spiritual stone. They instantly unleashed a horrifying powerful presence!","Meanwhile, violent winds howled around the spiritual boats of Dajin, and the spiritual energies around them were disturbed as if a violent storm was brewing!","While the warships of Yundian Upper Realm were condensing several powerful area of effect spiritual spells with horrifying power, the soldiers of Dajin set up ordinary-looking City-Destroying Crossbows at the bow of each spiritual boat.","“What a joke!” Gongshu Kuo laughed when he saw that Dajin’s army was still using the outdated City-Destroying Crossbows. “Look at the uncivilized countryside people! They are still using these low-level weapons!”","Meanwhile, more than a dozen heavy and thick black arrows flew toward the warships of the Yundian Upper Realm like cannons while creating loud rumbling noises!","One of these flew directly toward the warship that Gongshu Kuo was standing on.","However, Gongshu Kuo didn’t mind. “Strengthen the defense of the spiritual light barrier at the bow of the ship to the highest level!”","At his order, the pale blue spiritual light before him almost turned solid!","He sneered, “These uncivilized people want to deal with the warships of the Gongshu Family with these City-Destroying Crossbows? Can these arrows break the spiritual light barriers?...”","Boom!","To his astonishment, a huge arrow shot into the floor before his feet, and a large area of the deck got blown into debris!","On the huge black arrow was engraved several weird characters that were bright and eye-catching; it was the light of runewords: decrease the target’s armor by 50%.","Then, the entire arrow exploded, creating immense flames as the sky and the earth shook.","Jun Yangzi stood on the bow of the boat while his robe flapped in the wind. He said with a vicious expression on his face, “Sorry, but our spiritual artifacts don’t need to be charged up to use.”"]},{"number":285,"title":"Chapter 285 - Charge!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What happened?!” Gongshu Kuo’s black-and-white robe puffed up and emitted a layer of weird black-and-white spell runes. Under the mystic power of the runes, the debris from the explosion were all blocked. Obviously, his white-and-black robe was a very powerful spiritual artifact.","He was saved, but the spiritual boat that he was standing on obviously wasn’t so lucky. Meanwhile, dozens of huge black arrows shot over!","Boom! Boom! Boom! Boom...","Two rounds of attacks severely damaged Gongshu Kuo’s 20 warships; several of them were hit on vulnerable parts, and they fell toward Sky Wolf Fortress!","“How could this happen?!” Beside him, Gongyang Jun complained, “Brother Gongshu, didn’t you say that your Gongshu Family’s warships are unrivaled? How come they can’t even block the City-Destroying Crossbows?”","“Impossible! Absolutely impossible!” Gongshu Kuo’s headpiece was hanging off his head sideways, and his organized and tidy clothes were messed up. He said in a deep voice with a vicious expression, “Impossible! We spent lots of manpower and resources on each of the warships. Although I don’t know what unorthodox tricks they are using, the battleships can’t be destroyed so easily!”","He pointed toward Dajin’s spiritual boats before him and said, “They ran out of those huge black arrows!”","Indeed, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance spent lots of energy and resources on the huge black arrows, and they couldn’t make many of them.","After two rounds of attacks, the arrows were depleted.","“It seems that the force behind them isn’t completely useless!” Gongshu Kuo said with a gloomy expression, “No wonder they dared to lure the Wuwei Daoist Alliance away from the Three Saint Gates; no wonder the Wuwei Daoist Alliance dares to work against us!”","“We underestimated them. But now, we won’t repeat the same mistake!” Gongyang Jun narrowed his eyes, and a chilly light flashed in them.","“Here come their transportation boats with warriors!” an elder from the Gongyang Family yelled.","“Their warriors dare to fight with cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm?!” Gongyang Jun said, “Tell the cultivators of the Gongyang Family to form the Lightning Vital Array and cast the Qianyang Lightning Spell. Beat down the warriors for me!”","Soon, many spiritual boats with the Gongyang Family’s flags flew out, and the cultivators on the boats all formed a strange lightning array while chanting long passages of incantations. Immediately, dark clouds gathered in the sky with rolling thunder and flashing lightning bolts!","“Its the Qianyang Lightning Spell!”","The soldiers in Dajin’s army exclaimed at the sight of the thunderclouds. Different from the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, this spiritual spell was cast by many rows of cultivators and covered a large area. Although its damaging ability was no match for the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, it covered a large area, engulfing the entire front area of the army of Dajin.","It had no effects on grandmasters such as An Huwei and Ji Wu, but it would inflict great damage on the warrior troop.","After all, it was a spiritual spell created for war and could deal a lot of damage to troops. In fact, Ji Xuantong had once battled with the force of the Yundian Upper Realm, but he was defeated by this horrifying lightning power. He was intact under these thunderclouds, but he lost more than half of his soldiers in one instant, and the battlefield looked like hell!","Besides, the warships of Gongshu Family were still very useful. The other spells that they shot out broke the spiritual light barriers of some transportation spiritual boats of Dajin. Standing on the spiritual boats without the barriers, the soldiers of Dajin were defenseless!","Meanwhile, the spiritual boats of Dajin’s army emitted light which blinked red and blue alternatively. The light was so hot and strong that it dyed the color of the sky.","“What’s that?”","After injecting spiritual energy into his eyes, he looked toward the distance and saw countless phalanxes standing neatly on Dajin’s spiritual boats, and fire lights flew up into the sky, turning into rune characters made of flames and engulfing each soldier in a vague holy aura.","Holy Armor Spell!","Then, a wave of fire runes flew out. The rune characters used in these fire runes were the most common spells among cultivators and could be combined with any ordinary Taoist spells.","Lastly, blue flames shot up one by one above the phalanxes.","They were Ghost Spiritual Shields!","“All warriors, raise shields!” Ji Wu roared with a grim expression.","“Raise shields!” The order was passed down, and the warriors of Dajin lifted huge black shields.","Then, many lightning bolts fell, turning the whole Dajin spiritual boat group into a hell of lightning energy!","Gongyang Jun’s eyes showed his absolute confidence in this attack. After all, even the unrivaled warrior army led by Ji Xuantong had lost more than half of its soldiers before they could get close to the cultivator army of the Yundian Upper Realm!","“You haven’t learned your lesson! Stupid!” Looking at the sky which had turned into a hell of lightning, Gongyang Jun sneered, thinking that Dajin was extremely stupid to send warrior troops to lead the charge!","At this moment, Ji Wu looked dead serious, and sweat began to pop out on his forehead. Obviously, he, the emperor of Dajin, also remembered the disastrous fate of Dajin’s army in the western expansion a long time ago; it was a nightmare of the army of Dajin.","Right now, he was leading troops and charging at this nightmare, and there was no retreat for him!","“Hold on! We must hold on!” Ji Wu clenched his teeth so hard that they almost bleed.","Boom!","Violent lightning bolts fell onto the spiritual boats that were charging forward and destroyed the spiritual light barriers. Wood debris flew after the lightning bolts shattered the edges of the boats!","The lightning bolts also landed on the huge shield array formed by the soldiers!","Like giant ice pallets, they crashed onto the shields viciously with booming noises!","Many elite soldiers of Dajin felt desperate. Despite their higher cultivation strength as elites compared to the ordinary warriors, they didn’t know how to block such an attack, and they had to hide under the shields.","The Ghost Spiritual Shields emitted pale blue light which looked extremely weak, as if it would shatter easily.","However, when the lightning bolts crashed onto the shields, all the soldiers of Dajin were amazed to find that the seemingly powerful attack didn’t inflict lethal damage as they had imagined!","When wave after wave of lightning bolts landed on the shields of almost 20,000 elite warriors, they felt like they could hold on for a long time and block more attacks with the additional benefit of the magic instillation which increased their vitalities.","Maybe, they could really walk out of this nightmare alive!","Gradually, the sky began to clear while groups of spiritual boats rushed out from the dark clouds. They were a bit shaken, but the warriors of Dajin protected the core parts of the boats and brought them out of the attack safely and successfully!","“Father! Do you see this?” With slightly red eyes, Ji Wu gazed at the distant sky. “The army of our Dajin finally walked out of this nightmare!”","He roared hoarsely, “Taoists, use Group-Healing! Warriors of Dajin, charge!”","A wave of clear spiritual light rose in the crowd, and the fatigued Dajin warriors regained their strengths with noticeable speed!","“My Dajin Iron Army will never fall!” With hoarse roars and cheers, they celebrated their narrow escape!","“For Dajin! Charge!” This roar resonated in the sky!"]},{"number":286,"title":"Chapter 286 - Iron Army!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How did they come out?” Gongyang Jun’s face turned wicked. He couldn’t believe that Dajin’s army had walked out of the Qianyang Lightning Spell intact, but it happened right before his eyes!","The toddlers who had been learning how to walk suddenly changed into a truly powerful elite army!","“Spiritual spells – Gloomy Ghost Flames!” Gongyang Jun issued the order, and the cultivators in the troop formed phalanxes. Then, many flames lit up on the spiritual boats before they rushed toward Dajin’s army like cannonballs!","“Form the Shield Array!” Dajin’s warriors formed layers of black walls of shields, and the flames disappeared when they smashed onto the shields.","The warriors behind the shield walls already loaded arrows onto the bows!","“Shoot!” Countless arrows engulfed in warrior qi shot toward Yundian Upper Realm’s spiritual boats. The arrows might have a shorter attack range than spiritual spells, but the power was almost the same.","Lots of arrows crashed onto the spiritual light barriers around the spiritual boats, and the spiritual light began to dim and blink as if the barriers would break anytime!","Meanwhile, the spiritual boats of Dajin’s army got even closer!","“Retreat! Retreat!”","“Attack the spiritual boats! Stop them!”","Gongyang Jun’s cultivator army was obviously in a difficult situation. After all, he didn’t want the warriors of Dajin to get onboard his spiritual boats.","Even though he believed that the elite cultivators of the Gongyang Family wouldn’t be defeated, the family’s honor as the No. 4 Family in the Yundian Upper Realm would be lost!","“Retreat! Retreat!”","“You can’t retreat anymore!” Gongshu Kuo roared.","If they retreated further, the array would be disrupted.","“Then, tell me what we should do!” Gongyang Jun looked gloomy, and it was obvious that tensions were rising between the two families.","“Gather our elite forces!” Gongshu Kuo shouted, “Attack!”","Before he could finish the sentence, he saw the following scene.","“Fire Wall! Launch Fire Walls! Crush them with Explosion Flames!”","“Taoists! Use Group-Healing and send the skeletons over!”","“Anyone who can cast AoE spells, use the spells and attack!”","Flames burned on the spiritual boats, and they turned into surging fires! The flames created by spiritual spells didn’t need fuel, and they kept burning under the support of spiritual spells.","These spiritual spells didn’t need chants, hand gestures, or spell incantations.","It wasn’t powerful when it was cast by one person, but when a group of people used the same spell, it turned the spiritual boats of the elite cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm into an ocean of blazing fire!","The flames connected and blocked the sky, turning the spiritual boats under its influence into a huge fiery cloud!","In the world of combat, speed trumped everything else!","“Lightning Spell! Concentrate the Lightning Spell onto the guy who is issuing orders! Concentrate fire on him now!”","An elder of the Yundian Upper Realm was directing the cultivators to block the attacks, but about 100 blue lightning bolts suddenly landed on him without warning!","Crack!","His protective spiritual artifact was shattered instantly, and his face turned pale!","“He’s still alive! Still alive! Continue concentrating fire on him!”","Boom!","The deck of the spiritual boat exploded, and the elder fled to the spiritual boat behind him in a panic!","“He fled! Don’t chase him! Aim for the next one!”","“Use Fire Wall and Explosion Flames! Drive the spiritual boats forward! Warriors, charge!”","The white-robed elder who had had a narrow escape still looked pale with fear!","Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun gaped at the sight.","What are these spiritual spells? They don’t need to be chanted, and they have such great power?!","In contrast, their spiritual spells were powerful but took a lot of time and energy to cast. However, the spiritual spells of Dajin’s army were extremely simple and efficient.","“Shoot the spells onto the warships! Wipe them all! Wipe them clean!” Yu Chi issued orders from a spiritual boat of Dajin.","Under the ferocious attacks, many cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm were swallowed by lightning bolts and flames before they had time to cast spells!","“We can’t go on like this!” Gongshu Kuo couldn’t hide the frustration on his face. In his life, he had never encountered such a situation or imagined that his cultivator army would be beaten into this pathetic state by a mixed army of warriors and cultivators.","I can’t let this army live!","This was his thought right now.","He took out a black awl made of an unknown material, which was neither copper nor iron, and tossed it into the sky. It turned into a huge sky-piercing awl and crashed viciously toward the center of the crowd of cultivators of Dajin who were casting Fire Wall and Lightning Spells!","The black awl was named Sky Falling Awl, and he obtained it in the Cultivation Realm with great efforts. Even cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm couldn’t block the full force of this treasure, let alone these cultivators who were lower than the pinnacle stage of the True Lake Realm!","Since this weapon moved very fast, even cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm rarely escaped from its attack.","Gongshu Kuo sneered silently, knowing that the crisis would be over after he killed these cultivators, who were the core of his enemies.","In his mind, it would take Dajin lots of manpower and resources to raise more cultivators of this level, and he didn’t believe that Dajin would be able to raise another group of such talented cultivators in a short time!","The attack came so swiftly that it caught everyone off guard.","It was too late to stop it.","While alarmed screams and cusses sounded, the huge black awl shot toward the center of Dajin’s joint army where the elite and experienced internet café soldiers gathered.","“No!” Ji Wu’s expression changed drastically.","“Watch out!”","“Despicable!”","While the yells sounded, almost all of them looked hopeless since no cultivators of the True Lake Realm could block this attack.","However, before the black awl crashed down, someone yelled, “Open shields! Open shields!”","Swoosh! Swoosh!","From the center of the joint army of Dajin, a golden light flashed while magic shields were activated one after another, turning the center of the joint army dazzling golden.","Then, the black awl crashed into the crowd!","All of their protective spiritual artifacts were shattered instantly, and they had to activate their spiritual essence to block the attack.","Boom! Boom...","Many people were sent flying like cannonballs, and the array formed by the core members of the joint army was scattered. As a result, the attacks ended.","All the cultivators and warriors of the Dajin Joint Army watched their peers fall from the sky like dumplings, and their minds turned blank, wondering if the people who had trained, fought, and got skills books with them were all dead.","Gongshu Kuo’s face was cold. Even cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm probably couldn’t survive such an attack, let alone these cultivators of the True Lake Realm.","“No!” Ji Wu let out a furious roar, feeling like his heart was bleeding.","However, the falling cultivators shook and flew back up into the sky!","After all, the wizard’s shield was a very powerful spell; the wizards whose shields were not broken were harder than iron and couldn’t be hurt by sword techniques such as the Flame Sword Technique.","They looked listless, but they were obviously not dead!","They had withstood this attack collectively with magic shields and with the strengthened defense that came from Taoists’ spells.","“Group-Healing! Group-Healing!” Ji Wu roared in elation.","The troops of the Yundian Upper Realm were silent.","Dead silent!","This was truly an Iron Army that was as hard as metal!"]},{"number":287,"title":"Chapter 287 - Dajin’s Rise!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“They are not dead?” Gongshu Kuo watched as the cultivators of Dajin were engulfed in golden light barriers again. These light barriers were shattered before, but he saw that golden light barriers appeared around these people again!","He didn’t know that the extremely vulnerable wizards in the Godly Dragon Empire in the Legend of Mir 2 had survived many dangerous battles with this magic shield spell.","“Hahahahahaha!” Ji Wu laughed at the sight and pointed at the livid-faced Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun who were standing on the warship, saying, “I was sleepless with worry for years. When I did sleep, I worried in my dreams, afraid that the cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm would invade my territory and kill my citizens!”","“But today, I will tell you this!” Ji Wu roared, “Dajin is no longer the lamb that lies beside ferocious beasts and shivers in fear! My Dajin is rising!”","He ordered, “Everyone, charge!”","“Warriors of the Dajin Joint Army, charge with me!” Royal Guard Captain Yu Chi shouted, and many warriors leaped onto the Yundian Upper Realm’s spiritual boats!","The few remaining warships of the Yundian Upper Realm and the transportation boats behind them were getting into a turmoil.","The paladins’ auras were powered by spiritual essence; so, it was another method of essence activation.","Different from other warriors, many of the elite warriors of Jiuhua Army were among the first group of players of Diablo with Gong He and An Huwei. Although they couldn’t learn all of the paladin’s skills, each of them had mastered at least one aura.","Their advantage showed at this moment!","“Might! Activate!”","“Fanaticism! Activate!”","Huge amounts of spiritual essence spread outward and gathered in their bodies. It circulated swiftly in their bodies and formed auras on the ground around their feet.","The color was clear and faint, but this small troop suddenly gained a different presence!","The Jiuhua Army gained great speed instantly, and they swung their sabers like a gale and a storm! They charged into the group of cultivators like tigers in a herd of sheep. Before the cultivators could react, their array was torn apart!","“Block them! Block them for me!” Gongyang Jun roared hoarsely. He believed that these cultivators could never be defeated by these warriors!","The cultivators ignored the warriors who were charging at them, and they only concentrated on casting spiritual spells as pale blue rune characters appeared one after another before surrounding them from all directions.","Gongyang Jun was sure that his cultivators’ protective spiritual artifacts could defend against the warriors for a long while. After all, the elites of the Gongyang Family had the best protective spiritual artifacts.","However, what happened next dumbfounded him!","“Block us?!” Gong He sneered, “How can you block us?!”","The warriors in the front row hacked out their long sabers, and many huge sword energies pierced the light barriers and cut the cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm who were still chanting and casting spells.","The Yundian Upper Realm’s cultivators who were standing in the front row spat out blood and were sent flying!","The sword energies of the Assassination Sword Technique were the natural counter of magic shields and armor. The strong penetration ability could break most of the ordinary defenses.","“Kill for me!” With many soldiers of Dajin swarming up, it was obvious that the Yundian Upper Realm would be defeated.","The cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm who had always looked down upon others were finally shocked and frightened, finding that Dajin’s army was different from any previous ones since it was undefeatable!","While the cultivators had used up 80% of their spiritual essence, the counter attacks of Dajin’s army had just begun!","“Hahahaha!” Faced with imminent defeat, Gongshu Kuo still laughed in a crazy and somewhat disdainful way. He gazed at Dajin’s army and said, “I have to say that I’m surprised the mixed army of 30,000 warriors and cultivators defeated the cultivator army of our Yundian Upper Realm.”","He led elders of the Gongshu Family and Gongyang Family to fly up and hover in the sky while violent winds blew against them.","Each of them emitted a presence above the Divine Ocean Realm, and some of them even reached the fourth level of the Divine Ocean Realm. As for Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun, they were at the seventh level of the Divine Ocean Realm.","About a dozen grandmasters of the Divine Ocean Realm hovered in the sky and released horrifying and powerful presences, looking like immortals descending into the mortal world from heaven.","“However, you’re naïve if you think that you can win!” Gongshu Kuo snickered and said, “Do you think that you can defeat the grand masters of our two families?”","“What do you think?” Su Tianji stood in the air and pointed her index and middle finger up to the sky. Countless horrifying spiritual essence currents gathered around her from all directions from the sky and the earth, forming an overwhelmingly great power!","She gathered the clouds in the sky and pulled down the lightning from the heavens!","Even the spiritual essence released by the attacks of the countless cultivators was drawn here by a mysterious force. Everything in the world seemed to dim around the dazzling light of the sword!","“Does anyone in your Yundian Upper Realm dare to block my strike?” With a cold expression, Su Tianji stood in the air like a fairy descending from the heavens. Right now, her index and middle fingers were pointing at a huge and horrifying sword condensed by the spiritual essence from the sky and the earth!","It was the Heavenly Sword, the ultimate sword technique of the Shu Mountain Faction!","Meanwhile, another huge heavenly sword was condensed as Ye Songtao said in a loud voice, “Does anyone in your Yundian Upper Realm dare to take my strike?!”","The second Heavenly Sword was created!","They were an elder and a faction master respectively and had extremely high talents. Also, as the earliest players of the Legend of the Sword and Fairy, they had understood the Heavenly Sword after reading the ultimate truth from the Heavenly Book in Jade Dynasty.","At this moment, Jun Yangzi waved his big sleeves, and the whole sky was covered in blue flames as if the whole world were engulfed by fire!","“I’ve never tested our faction’s Blue Flame Heavenly Scroll on people after I improved it. Would you want me to test its power on you?”","Meanwhile, the elders of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance and the generals of Dajin’s army also revealed their cultivation strengths. Instantly, a surge of presences even more horrifying than that of the Yundian Upper Realm elders engulfed the sky!","“I’m surprised that Yundian Upper Realm is so weak!”","“Do you dare to fight us?!”","Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun’s expressions changed drastically. “Retreat! Yundian cultivators! Retreat now!”","Seeing their enemies activating heavenly power, their hearts lurched and then sank!","“Stop!”","“Don’t run!”","They looked back and saw two horrifying Heaven Swords crashing toward them; they ran faster!","Gongshu Kuo bit his tongue tip and spat out a mouthful of essence blood. “Use the Escape Technique! Hurry! We’ll be safe once we’re back in the Yundian Upper Realm!”","He turned into a bloody light beam and flew in the direction of the Yundian Upper Realm!","He was even faster than the top speed of the large spiritual boats of his family. Soon, he came to the border of Yundian Upper Realm with Gongyang Jun and some elders.","“When we get back to Yundian Upper Realm, we’ll ask the Gongyi Family to send troops to Dajin and kill all the cultivators and warriors!”","They looked mad with blood-red eyes. “You uncivilized tiny cultivators can never catch up with us! Hurry! We’re almost in Yundian Upper Realm!”","At this moment, they heard a series of laughter.","One voice said loudly, “The sword arrives with the wind, eliminating evil from heaven and earth!”","Another voice continued, “I will be thrilled if I have liquor, but I’m still insane when I don’t!”","“I will drink the lakes and rivers and then swallow the sun and the moon.”","“I am the Liquor Sword Immortal, the only person who is left standing after a thousand drinks!!”","With those words chanted, several cultivators of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance flew up stepping on swords like shooting stars and blocked their enemies instantly!","Stepping lightly on the swords, they didn’t move an inch in the howling violent wind, looking like sword immortals descending into the mortal world!"]},{"number":288,"title":"Chapter 288 - A Glorious Victory","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“How did they catch up to us!?”","They looked at the enemies who stood around them. The Yundian Upper Realm was right before them, but these enemies created a deep chasm, blocking their entry!","These cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm had lost their sense of superiority, and in its place was deep shock and horror beyond words!","In fact, they had never investigated the force behind Dajin and didn’t know why the Wuwei Daoist Alliance refused to attend the Cultivation Realm Conference and dared to even rebel against the Yundian Upper Realm.","However, in their eyes, the Three Saint Gates in the Cultivation Realm had been in the lofty position for many years, and the Yundian Upper Realm had gained lots of benefits from them; how could a small force that suddenly popped up offer any benefits as good as those from the Cultivation Realm?","The reality gave them a heavy blow.","This blow shattered the dream of the Yundian Upper Realm, where many cultivators gathered and paid their homage. In this dream, the cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm could dominate and obtain whatever they wanted with a wave of their hands!","The dream was shattered as if it were as brittle as glass; it left nothing but shards on the ground.","At this moment, except for those few lines of the poem, Gongshu Kuo and the others’ minds were completely blank.","They couldn’t even flee!","“What is this technique that you are using to fly on swords and catch up with our escaping technique?” Gongshu Kuo murmured.","“The sword control technique.” Xue Daolv, the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master, said, “We respect you as seniors in the cultivation world and hope that you will come with us obediently. If you want to fight us again, I can’t guarantee your safety.”","“Got it.” Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun inhaled deeply and knew that they had turned from the lofty family masters of the Yundian Upper Realm into captives in a flash.","“Things change too fast. I can’t understand the turn of events.” Gongshu Kuo smiled stiffly in resignation. “However, despite your victory today, the Three Saint Gates and the Gongyi Family are not people that you can deal with easily. Keep that in your mind.”","...","On the deck of a spiritual boat which was so damaged that it could fall at any moment, an elite soldier of Dajin who was wearing black armor lifted a broken shield in his left hand and waved a long saber with the other. Right now, several cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm surrounded him.","A soldier who had lost an arm struggled to get up from the ruins with the support of the big shield in his other hand.","With blood and dirt on his face, a cultivator of Dajin in a tattered black robe was viciously chasing after a panicking cultivator of Yundian.","Even equipped with all kinds of spells, these elite soldiers of Dajin still had their inborn disadvantages when they faced the cultivator army of Yundian; it was a hard battle for them.","They fought on the battlefield with the conviction that they would die in the battle; they had never imagined that they could come out alive!","At this moment, the dazzling sunlight shone on their heads, and they looked up subconsciously at the figures racing toward them from the distant sky.","The high-level figures of Yundian Upper Realm in the center of the group were tied up by golden ropes.","“We won!” A voice came from the high sky and resonated in the whole battlefield!","“Won? We won?!”","A soldier licked his chapped lips and murmured in disbelief.","He was afraid that it was just a dream, and he would wake up from it anytime.","They entered the battle with the mindset that they would die, but the result was beyond everyone’s expectation.","The mixed army of 30,000 warriors and cultivators defeated 30,000 elite cultivators of the Yundian Upper Realm; it was a battle that was worthy of recording in the history book!","They laughed, cried, and screamed hysterically, and cheers rose on the battlefield. It was the only way that they woke up their bodies that were numbed from the hard battle, telling themselves that it wasn’t a dream.","“Pass my order! Gather all the injured soldiers to this place!” Ji Wu did the last arrangement with a solemn expression. “Heal them together here!”","“Your Majesty,” an old general said, “We must celebrate this huge victory all over the country!”","Ji Wu nodded. “Pass my order! I’ll hold a celebration banquet!”","“A celebration banquet?”","“Yeah.” Ji Wu nodded solemnly. “The Dajin Joint Army (Internet Café Army) will celebrate the victory in Jiuhua. Reward each of them with a bottle of Coke and a bowl of instant noodles with one sausage!”","“Ugh... Okay!”","...","“Hahahaha!” Right now, the Jiuhua City Shop was boisterous with crowds. In Qzone, Mr. Fang lounged on his chair and listened to Su Tianji and the others recounting the incident. He laughed so hard that his belly ached. “You mean that the emperor is holding a celebration banquet outside? He bought each of them a bowl of instant noodles and then invited them to go online and play the Legend of Mir 2?”","“Yeah.” Su Tianji glanced at Fang Qi curiously. “It’s nothing strange. After all, the reward for each person is worth nearly ten crystals, and many ordinary people can’t afford these things.”","Fang Qi held his laughter and said, “Ugh. It’s not funny. It’s very good. Why aren’t you going?”","“Master thinks that it’s too noisy,” Yuexin explained for her.","Song Qingfeng was drinking the tea offered by Mr. Fang by the side. This tea was beneficial to cultivation strength, and he couldn’t get enough of it. “I heard that you two girls also participated in the battle?”","He sounded surprised since these girls looked soft and cute, not the warrior type.","“Yeah. After all, we’re direct disciples of our master, and we’ve reached the Spiritual River Realm!” Feng Hua said proudly, “Don’t underestimate us!”","Mr. Fang shuffled the cards on the table and said, “Were you afraid? There were so many enemies.”","“There’s nothing to be afraid of,” Feng Hua said, “After all, we fight this way every day in the game, and the number of opponents range from dozens to hundreds. We’re used to the scenario.”","Yuexin stuck out her tongue. “We were indeed frightened when the Master of the Gongshu Family sneak-attacked with the Sky Falling Awl. Fortunately, I stood on the edge of the crowd. Otherwise, I might not have been able to block it even with the shield.”","“It was a narrow escape!” Fenghua also looked scared when she recalled the battle. “Fortunately, Master told us not to stand in the center of the crowd.”","“I taught her that,” Mr. Fang said contemptuously, “If you attack a large group of people, you must cast the spell at the center. In that situation, people standing on the edge of the crowd are smarter. Now, I’m dealing the cards now!”","“Yeah, you are right.” Although Su Tianji didn’t like Fang Qi’s attitude, she had to admit that he was right.","Although Qzone wasn’t as action-packed as other games, people could gather in this place even though Mr. Fang was in the distant Morning Star Sea Realm.","After the storm of the war, this simple and clean small house felt like a small haven. While drinking the fresh-smelling tea, one felt serene and relaxed as if they were far away from all the conflicts in the world.","Of course, it would only feel this way if they didn’t yell things like, ‘Big Joker”, “Small Joker”, and “Bomb”."]},{"number":289,"title":"Chapter 289 - The crazy trade of virtual items","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Today, all the forces around Dajin fell silent, and those who had followed the Yundian Upper Realm to suppress the Wuwei Daoist Alliance changed their attitudes and chose to become neutral.","Overnight, the situation on the whole continent seemed to experience a transformation!","Even the neighboring small countries and small forces who had been ready to make trouble for Dajin now settled down, not daring to make a move.","– Taixi Faction –","The old man who was wearing a white robe of golden patterns sat cross-legged on the bank of the lake with the fishing rod in his hand; the fishing line on the rod didn’t have a hook dangling in the water. He watched the fish frolic in the water.","If he weren’t in the Taixi Faction, people would take him as an ordinary old man who was fishing.","At this moment, a disciple strode up respectfully.","“Was the Yundian Upper Realm defeated?!” Before the disciple spoke, the old man asked mildly.","“You...” The disciple asked in surprise, “You knew it?”","While stroking his beard, the old man smiled faintly as if everything was in his control. “If the force supporting them is so weak, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance wouldn’t have dared to leap out of the big lake even if it was a golden carp.","“Good! Very good!” The old man said with a laugh, “I’ll see how strong you are!”","“We don’t need to intervene?” the disciple asked.","“With Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun captured, the Gongyi Family of Yundian Upper Realm must be restless!” The old man said with a chuckle.","...","To the west of Dajin, the mountainous area which was called the Yundian Upper Realm had many huge cities built on the mountains.","Many big and small cultivation forces and families gathered here, and it was an auspicious place in every cultivator’s heart!","Today, two of the four major families were gone, which was a huge earthquake for the whole Yundian Upper Realm!","– In Yujing, the most dazzling pearl city in this region –","Gongyi Xiu had white hair, but time had left few marks on his face; he looked to be about 40 years old at first the glance, seeming to be a cultivator in the younger generation.","Beside him, the white-haired Master of Gongsun Family looked like an ancient man who didn’t have a long time left to live. If not for his clear and bright eyes, no one would believe that he was the master of the second major family in the Yundian Upper Realm.","“Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun are now captured. The joint force of the No. 3 family and the No. 4 family of our Yundian Upper Realm was defeated by a kingdom of warriors, and the family masters were captured...” Gongsun Chui’s voice was very deep. “These two families are getting weaker by the day!”","“However, even though they are living backwards, Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun shouldn’t have lost to Dajin,” Gongyi Xiu said, “At least they could have escaped.”","While shaking his head, he continued, “I’m afraid that the force behind the Wuwei Daoist Alliance isn’t as simple as we had thought.”","“Oh?” Gongsun Chui was displeased that Gongyi Xiu rebuffed him, but he couldn’t ignore the latter’s opinion. “Master of Gongyi, what tricks do you think that this small force, which appeared out of nowhere in Dajin, is playing? Could it be that you really think it’s another Cultivation Realm?”","Gongsun Chui obviously didn’t think that there would be any force that could match the Three Saint Gates.","Gongyi Xiu analyzed the situation and said, “When we put pressure on Wuwei Daoist Alliance, we thought that it would obey us. What happened?”","“It only shows that the Wuwei Daoist Alliance is short-sighted,” Gongsun Chui sneered.","Gongyi Xiu continued, “Then, we thought that the Wuwei Daoist Alliance would soon be crushed by our economic sanction. What happened?”","“Ugh...” Gongsun Chui stroked his beard and said with a cold expression, “Because they were lucky and found a new spiritual artifact making technique named magic instillations which could empower their current treasures.”","Gongyi Xiu nodded. “Guided by this thought, we launched the third round of attacks and even resorted to military force. What happened then?”","“Ugh...” Gongsun Chui was obviously at a loss for words. After all, coincidences couldn’t repeat again and again so quickly.","By now, it had happened three times!","Even though Dajin and the Wuwei Daoist Alliance were only lowly ants beside their feet that they didn’t care to spare a glance at, they began to sense that something wasn’t right.","“Maybe this force has unusual abilities.” Gongsun Chui had to admit this fact. “But I think they probably have reached their limit.”","He was obviously combative. “Master of Gongyi, are you afraid of them?”","“Afraid?” Gongyi Xiu sneered and stood up from his chair. “Even if the three holy ones from the Three Saint Gates were here, I, Gongyi Xiu, wouldn’t be afraid!”","“Then, what’s your plan, Master of Gongyi?” Gongsun Chui asked, “Should we go to Dajin and destroy that force?”","“Master of Gongsun!” Gongyi Xiu gazed at Gongsun Chui and said, “If that force is easy to destroy, Feng Xi, the messenger of the Taixi Faction, wouldn’t have come to enlist our help!”","“I believe that you also got the information on the whereabouts of the Demon-Suppressing Cauldron.” Gongyi Xiu squinted his eyes while a flash of light appeared in them. “Master of Gongsun, you don’t have to test me anymore. After all, one must follow the trend if they want to live long in this world.","“Gongshu Kuo and Gongyang Jun are captives now, but they are still from our Yundian Upper Realm,” Gongyi Xiu said, “I’ll send people to talk with Dajin and ransom for them.”","“As for the issue of whether if we should fight them or come into a peace pact with them...” Gongyi Xiu continued, “We can make the decision after we take a look at the shop that is operated by that force.”","“Should we go personally?”","“Of course!” Gongyi Xiu said firmly, “The scouts always returned with the reports about games and cultivation strength increases.”","“This time, I’ll go and investigate the shop in person!” Gongyi Xiu said in a cold voice.","Obviously, he was sure that all their trouble with Dajin and Wuwei Daoist Alliance came from this shop.","“Then I’ll go with you, Master of Gongyi!”","...","– Meanwhile in Half City –","“It’s said that Dajin went to a war lately?”","“It even beat a big force made purely of cultivators senseless?”","“Cultivators were beaten senseless by an army of warriors? How weak and lame are these cultivators?”","“You won’t say it if you know the truth,” a black-clothed cultivator said, “It’s said that there were not many cultivators in this army, but the cultivators of the True Lake Realm blocked the heavy attacks of spiritual artifacts launched by high-level cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm with magic shields! The concentrated firing of the Lightning Spell almost killed grand cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm!”","“Really?” another cultivator said in surprise, “The Magic Shield Spell is so powerful? I saw a Magic Shield Spell Skill Book the day before yesterday, and it sold for only 200 crystals!”","“You didn’t buy it for 200 crystals?” the black-clothed cultivator laughed and said, “It’s selling it for almost 2,000!”","“Ah?!”","“Skill books for Holy Armor Spell, Ghost Spiritual Shield, and the Assassination Sword Technique are each selling for about 1,000!”"]},{"number":290,"title":"Chapter 290 - The QQ Trading Net","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[New task: Virtual Trading Net]","At this moment, Fang Qi received a new task.","[Task Content: Cross-regional online trading reaching 200 times","Task Description: Members can buy virtual items with crystals deposited in the membership cards","Task Completion: Activate QQ Trading Net and level up privileges","Rewards after this privilege level-up:","1. Set up the shop employees in the System Interface and provide small-range protection measures (it will consume the system’s energy)","2. Increase the number of employee dorm rooms in each shop to 2]","“What are you doing?” Mr. Fang was playing ‘Fight the Landlord’ when he received a message on QQ.","Nalan Mingxue? What does she want? Fang Qi replied her with a question mark.","[I plan to buy some books from The Morning Star Sea Realm. Please do the deal for me.] Her reply came soon.","Buy books? Buy some books ? Mr. Fang was puzzled. [You’re a warrior, and there are only a few skills for your profession. How many do you want to buy?]","Nalan Mingxue replied, [Not only for me. I also need skill books for wizards and Taoists, and I’ll buy from you if you have them. 2,000 crystals for Magic Shield Spell; 700 crystals for Holy Armor Spell; 10,000 crystals for Enchanting Light...]","She finished the long list of prices and followed up with a picture of a Husky’s dumb expression.","“Guild President! Look! Someone is offering to buy the Magic Shield Spell for 2,000 crystals, Holy Shield Spell for 700 crystals, and other skills books for hundreds of crystals each. Let’s sell the skill books! The buyer is someone named ‘New Snow’, and she has been flooding the World Channel with the price list!” Sitting next to Fang Qi, Ruan Ning almost jumped up at the offers. Her warehouse was full of skill books that the guild had collected.","“Don’t sell!” Mr. Fang sent Nalan Mingxue the picture of the Akita Inu’s disdainful face before saving the picture of her Husky’s dumb face that she sent. “She’s so audacious that she tried to get my skill books!”","“Why not?” Ruan Ning said in disapproval, “The prices that she is offering are ten times higher than before, and they can’t get any higher! If we don’t sell them now, we won’t find a better buyer!”","“Don’t be dumb.”","With a sneer, Mr. Fang sent Nalan Mingxue a message, [What? You want to be a yellow cow?]","[TL Note: Yellow cow means scalper in Chinese.]","Ruan Ning leaned over and looked at his screen. “Hey! This is New Snow. You won’t let me sell the skill books, but you’re selling them?”","“She’s my friend, and that is why I’m talking to her. Don’t be dumb.” Mr. Fang felt helpless. “I’m warning you now. Don’t have dealings with this girl. She is smart enough to sell you, and make you count the money for her.”","“You’ll be sold by her, and you will count the money for her.” Ruan Ning was instantly furious. “The prices are so high! Why can’t I sell them?!”","Nalan Mingxue replied after a long pause, [What’s a yellow cow?]","[It is a scheming merchant who buys things out and sells them for much higher prices to gain unreasonable profits!] Fang Qi sent her an unamused face emoji. [The war has just ended, and the skill books’ prices increased tenfold overnight. There must be someone behind all this.]","[Did you start it?] Fang Qi asked tentatively.","[(Husky’s snickering face) It wasn’t really me.] Nalan Mingxue put the words into QQ with a faint smile on her face. [Before the war, I saw that the Royal Family was buying skill books in preparation for the war, and I followed suit. At this moment, there aren’t many skill books on the market even at higher prices. In a couple of days, I guess I need to buy the Magic Shield Spell Skill Book for as high as 3,000 to 4,000. I won’t buy them if the prices go any higher.”","“You... You guys...” While reading the conversation, Ruan Ning immediately sensed the stink of speculation.","“Of course, players wouldn’t hold many skills books right now, and they are hard to get. The players who had the intention of selling skill books would have sold them long ago. The players who still have skill books with them are waiting to see if the prices will go higher,” Fang Qi said contemptuously, “You’ve become a big scalper overnight. Tell me how many books have you collected?”","[It’s a secret. 😁]","“The prices have gone so high. Can she sell them?” Ruan Ning frowned.","“Right now, many old players still need skill books. From the looks of it, many new players will enter the game. If some new players are rich and are willing to buy skill books at high prices...” Fang Qi patted her on the shoulder. “Girl, you’re still young and naive.”","“Humph! Old Demon Fang!”","“What did you say?”","“The Guild President is handsome and dashing!”","...","At this moment, two figures stood in front of the Jiuhua shop.","“Master of Gongyi, is this the place?” Gongsun Chui gazed at the shopfront which stood among residential houses. “It looks ordinary.”","They pushed open the door and entered. The tremendous space inside the shop immediately drew their attention.","“...”","Gongsun Chui who had been commenting about the ordinary look of the shop widened his old eyes. “How come the space inside is so huge?!”","“I remember that the Gongsun Family once obtained the building method of a spatial array from the Cultivation Realm,” Gongyi Xiu asked, “How is that method compared to this one?”","Gongsun Chui’s face turned dark. “I don’t want to talk about it.”","The Gongsun Family had only obtained an incomplete array blueprint, but the array in this shop was obviously complete.","“Where’s the shop owner?” Feeling embarrassed at the inferiority of his spatial array, Gongsun Chui became even more displeased when no one greeted them.","After all, when they went to the Three Saint Gates, the latter would send two important figures to receive them. Therefore, he was displeased by the lack of reception in this shop. “How come no one is receiving us? This shop is really rude. I think we shouldn’t waste our time on it.”","They walked further into the shop and read the words on the small blackboard until they came to the line that said, [If you want to play, then play. If you don’t, please leave smoothly.]","“What does it mean by ‘leave smoothly’?” They were baffled.","“It’s a polite way of saying ‘get out’!” Xiao Yulv was sitting on a couch. “I’ve never seen you guys before. Are you new players?”","He had a deck of poker cards in his hands. “Do you want to join me and play Fight the Landlord?”","Their faces turned dark. “What’s that?”","Landlord? We are not here to fight a landlord with you! We’re here to investigate the shop and have no time to play with you! They thought in disdain, No! We don’t want to fight the landlord with y ou.","After reading the rules and introductions on the small blackboard, they asked, “Where’s the shop owner? We want to try the games!”","“Sorry, guys.” A cute loli sitting beside the counter put down her virtual reality headset and said, “There’re no seats available now. If you want to play, please wait in line! If you’re bored, you can play Fight the Landlord with Gongzi Xiao in the lounge area.”","The two men were at a loss for words.","Enraged, Gongsun Chui pointed his finger at his own chest and said, “Do you know who I am? Even the people from the Three Saint Gates don’t dare to order me to wait in line!”","“What are the Three Saint Gates?” Jiang Xiaoyue snorted with her hands on her waist. “The boss said that even if gods came here, they have to wait in line when the house is full!”","“You! Little girl, you’re bold!” Gongsun Chui’s old face turned red with fury, and he had the urge to attack!","“Brother Gongsun!” Gongyi Xiu said in a low voice, “The situation is still unclear, and it’s not wise for us to make a move!”","“Humph!”","They sat on the couch in the lounge area.","“Gongzi Xiao, we heard that you’re very familiar with this shop?”","“Of course!” Xiao Yulv patted his chest while dealing the cards, saying, “I know everything about the shop including the game walkthroughs and the secrets of the shop! I call Landlord!”","Gongsun Chui was aggressive. “I’ll rob the Landlord from you!”","Gongyi Xiu said, “Pass!”","..."]},{"number":291,"title":"Chapter 291 - It’s you that I want to kill","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the lounge, Xiao Yulv said, “Bomb! Do you have more questions for me?”","“Another bomb?!” Gongsun Chui’s old face turned dark while he looked at the big pile of crystals in front of Xiao Yulv that the latter had earned.","“Are we almost done?” Gongsun Chui asked in a low voice.","Gongyi Xiu nodded. “The shop owner is absent, but he can be contacted by something called QQ; they can even talk online... Humph! He must be playing some tricks!”","“However, it’s said that all the techniques that Dajin’s army used came from this shop. Since this shop doesn’t stop us from playing the games, we can learn these spells too,” Gongsun Chui said in a cold voice, “According to this guy, the Sky Falling Awl that Gongshu Kuo used was blocked by a spiritual spell named Magic Shield. Hehe! If I equip an army of 10,000 cultivators with this spiritual spell, how can Dajin’s army block us?”","“Right!” Gongyi Xiu nodded. “You have a point. According to him, many cultivators bought skill books yesterday at 200 crystals each, and the techniques can be learned at top speed with the spiritual artifacts named computers in this shop. However, after learning the technique, one can only understand it but can’t describe to others and teach them... Interesting.”","“However, it will cost us a fortune if we want to quickly equip an army of cultivators with these techniques!” Gongyi Xiu said, “200 crystals for one Magic Shield Spell Skill Book; 100 crystals for one Ghost Spirit Shield...”","“I’m afraid that an ordinary force can’t afford them!” Gongsun Chui said, “It’s no wonder that not many cultivators in Dajin’s army learned these spiritual spells.”","“However, our Yundian Upper Realm is never in a shortage of crystals!” They laughed, “Seats are available now. Let’s get online!”","After they were gone, Xiao Yulv remained in the lounge playing cards when he heard someone say, “Did you hear that the price for a Magic Shield Spell Book has increased to 3,000 today!”","“3,000?! It was 200 yesterday, right?”","“3,000?” Xiao Yulv leaned toward them immediately and asked, “Friends, how come it has increased to 3,000? I just told people that it costs 200!”","“3,000? To tell you the truth, you can’t buy one at 3,000 since no one is selling it!” Another guy said proudly, “Fortunately, I bought one the day before yesterday! I’m so smart!”","...","Gongyi Xiu and Gongsun Chui stood on the other side.","Gongsun Chui asked, “Brother Gongyi, which one should we try first?”","“Which one?” Gongyi Xiu snickered and said, “Activate them all, and we’ll try them one by one. Didn’t that Little Xiao say that each one is highly useful, but some of them are faster to master than the others?”","“However, before we try the games, we must see the owner of this shop and test the waters!”","He clicked open QQ.","“The Morning Star Sea Realm... Mr. Fang... Add as friend...” They followed Xiao Yulv’s instruction. “Ugh? It worked!”","“I don’t think that guy dares to lie to us!” Gongsun Chui sneered and then sent a message as a stranger, [Are you the owner of the shop?]","[(Husky’s disdainful face) Who are you?] Mr. Fang sent them a meme he got from Nalan Mingxue.","“What does this guy mean by sending us a picture of a dog head?!” Their expressions turned dark while they looked at the dog who stared back at them with an intense, contemptuous expression. They felt like they were being mocked just by looking at it.","He input the words with his cold tone and expression, “I’m Gongsun Chui, the master of the No. 2 Family in the Yundian Upper Realm! I want to talk to you about some important business!”","At this moment, Fang Qi had just coaxed Huang Putao, the Castellan of Black Dragon City, and Liu Ningyun, the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy to play Fight the Landlord with him. He played while replying impatiently, “Tell me what you want! I’m playing Fight the Landlord and have no time to deal with you!”","“This kid is rude!” Gongsun Chui was furious.","Gongyi Xiu rolled his eyes and said cautiously, “This shop shows no respect for the Three Saint Gates; it’s no wonder that he’s rude to us! The shop is extraordinary. I tried to sense the information delivering frequencies using the communication jade but failed, which means that the shop owner probably is not nearby! We must be careful since the spatial array and communication technique are both superior to ours!”","Then, he told Gongsun Chui to reply with this message. [We know how to play Fight the Landlord. Can we talk while we play it?]","[You know how to play Fight the Landlord?] Fang Qi glanced at the message and replied. [I have enough people to play Fight the Landlord ... Okay! Okay! Come in anyway!]","They were at a loss for words since Fang Qi’s tone was filled with slight.","Gongsun Chui’s old face turned dark. “Kid, you better hope that you won’t fall into my hands!”","[You succeeded in adding Mr. Fang as a friend.]","[Your friend, Mr. Fang, invites you to enter Qzone.]","In Mr. Fang’s room, the cultivators of the Black Dragon Office and the Nanhua Faction were all present.","Liu Ningyun said, “This game is no fun! It’s a waste of my time. I’ll quit after this round! A pair of threes!”","With cards in his hand, Fang Qi glanced at the door and saw two cultivators standing there with their hands clasped behind their backs, and they looked dignified.","Of course, their luxurious clothes were now replaced by crude simple clothes, and they had no cultivation strength in their bodies in Qzone.","One of them looked extremely old with white hair and wrinkles.","The other also had white hair but looked to be in his thirties. The white-haired man who looked in his thirties glanced around the room and said, “I’m Gongyi Xiu from the Yundian Upper Realm. May I ask which one of you is the shop owner?”","“A pair of sixes!” Fang Qi dropped the cards on the table and looked up. “Oh, so you are the master of the Gongyi Family.”","Standing by Gongyi Xiu, Gongsun Chui snorted and didn’t show any intention in introducing himself.","Fang Qi glanced at him and asked, “Is this guy... your grandpa?”","“...”","They were livid with fury.","...","Ten minutes later.","No one knew what they talked about with Mr. Fang, but some saw that their faces were as black as the bottom of a pot afterward!","“This kid is stubborn... However, he is not here, and we can do nothing to him,” Gongsun Chui said in a cold voice, “Master of Gongyi, did you see anything special?”","“After entering that space, I didn’t have any cultivation strength; what could I find?!” Gongyi Xiu’s expression was even colder. “Brother Gongsun, have you ever seen such an illusion realm?”","“Each flower, blade of grass, and tree looked real!” Gongsun Chui said, “I plucked a green leaf and could see the distinct veins in it. Illusion realms are full of illusions so everything should be fake. But this illusion realm gave me the feeling that everything was real! I can’t figure it out!”","“Let’s try the games first and make plans later!” Gongyi Xiu’s eyes turned intense. “If all the stuff here were created by the force behind the shop, I’m afraid that it might have the power to block the Three Saint Gates! We’d better not get involved!”","“What if that’s not the case?” Gongsun Chui squinted his eyes slightly.","“We’ll know the truth when the people of the Three Saint Gates try their hands, right?”","“Good idea!” Gongsun Chui laughed and said, “We’ll just watch them fight while we get all the benefits from this shop!”","“We can move the core members of our families here. Since Dajin’s army plays the Legend of Mir 2, we’ll play the Legend of Mir 2 as well! Also, we’ll first learn the sword control technique before we tackle the difficult ones!”","Suddenly, his screen dimmed.","“Brother Gongyi, how come you’re dead?” Gongsun Chui looked at Gongyi Xiu who had just walked out of the newbie village.","On the screen, a little warrior named ‘Long Live Dajin’s Army’ cussed, “Who is this little b*tch that dares to get the name of ‘Gongyi’? As a citizen of Dajin, you dare to kiss the a*s of the Yundian Upper Realm? Yeah, I will kill you when I see you! Scum!”","Gongsun Chui and Gongyi Xiu looked at each other, and murderous light shot out of their eyes. “Who is this kid?!”","“Play games and don’t yell!” Not far from them, Jiang Xiaoyue said in disapproval. “If you do it again, I’ll kick you out!”","..."]},{"number":292,"title":"Chapter 292 - A Little Game - the King of Fighters","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While Gongsun Chui and Gongyi Xiu played the Legend of Mir 2 sulkily, Mr. Fang was in a good mood, “Enough! I finally have enough money to buy the King of Fighters and the joysticks!”","“What are those?” People like Liu Ningyun and Huangpu Tao, who were visiting Mr. Fang in his Qzone, looked baffled.","“The King of Fighters? Is it related to King Warrior?”","“Look at how smug you are!”","“What’s the use of this thing?” They watched Mr. Fang while he attached the joysticks to the computer that he had bought earlier.","“Computer?” Ruan Ning had been wanting to ask this question long ago. “Why did you buy a computer in Qzone? It’s so expensive!”","“I’m gonna use it to play games,” Fang Qi answered.","“Play games?!” The others were at a loss for words. “Can we play the Legend of Mir 2 in here?”","“There’s no Legend of Mir 2 here,” Fang Qi said, “There are some small games to train your reflexes and combat rhythm, but they are not important.”","He clicked open the list of items in the shop and pointed at some of the items, saying, “Look at this fist technique scroll.”","“Ugh? Why is it grey? There’s a lock on it.”","“Because we have to unlock it.” Fang Qi flipped through the following pages of the shop. “The grey items all need to be unlocked. For example, the Mind-Cleansing Tune needs the guzheng skill to unlock it; the Wind Pattern Elixir’s receipt needs a certain level of elixir-making skill to unlock it; this...”","He pointed at the King of Fighters’ page and said, “These needs this computer game to unlock.”","“We can do this?” They listened to Fang Qi’s explanation of the small clues in Qzone. “However, the fist techniques are for warriors; what can they do for us?”","“You don’t have to play the game if you don’t want to,” Mr. Fang said. “Anyway, I’m going to play it. Do any of you want to try it?”","After the familiar music, the game came to the interface to choose characters. Mr. Fang found that this game was also a remake, and its quality was much more exquisite than the original version.","“How do we play?” The others all looked shocked at this weird item in Qzone.","“Want to try it?” Mr. Fang showed them a warm smile.","All of them expressed that they didn’t want to accept Mr. Fang’s invitation.","“The friends in Dajin are more reliable.” Fang Qi rolled his eyes at them and opened QQ.","[Young Master Song!]","Song Qingfeng: [I’m playing the Legend of Mir 2. What’s up?]","Fang Qi: [Come and play the King of Fighters.]","Song Qingfeng: [What’s that? Another new game? (Husky’s disdainful face) I have no money, Sir!]","Fang Qi: [It’s free this time!]","Song Qingfeng: [Really?]","Fang Qi: [Of course. I have even prepared a pot of Green Spiritual Tea. Are you coming?]","Fang Qi received a basic ‘Okay’ sign in QQ.","Soon, Song Qingfeng arrived briskly with Lin Shao and Xu Luo, and Fang Qi introduced the game to them.","After Fang Qi’s explanation, they were surprised, “We can play computer games this way?!”","“The characters are the same as a puppet, right?” Song Qingfeng moved the joystick and watched the figure in the game move under his control. “Each command corresponds to each move... It seems more complicated than the mouse and keyboard play style of Resident Evil and Counter Strike...”","Song Qingfeng chose the character of Kyo Kusanagi and began to try the moves...","Down Forward + Weak Punch – 114 Shiki: Ara Kami","After 114 Shiki: Ara Kami connected, Down Forward + Weak Punch – 128 Shiki Kono Kizu!","“We can make moves this way?!” He rolled the joystick for two and half circles and saw a light flash on the screen before flames appeared on Kyo Kusanagi’s hands.","Then, he shot out a big flame. “Wow! This can burn a lot of HP!”","“These strong and aggressive moves suit me!” Lin Shao copied the move of raising flames in his hands and yelled as the character did on the screen!","“Very aggressive!”","While watching them, the people from the Morning Star Sea Realm looked contemptuous. “So silly...”","Xu Luo asked immediately, “Can I learn this?!”","“Ugh... Maybe.” After all, Shingo Yabuki could use all of Kyo Kusanagi’s moves. The only thing was that he didn’t have the bloodline of the Kusanagi Family so that he couldn’t use the Kusanagi Flames.","On the other hand, these guys had warrior qi, and it was hard to say what they could create.","“Come on! I’ve finished testing the moves!” Snickering, Song Qingfeng looked at Mr. Fang who had been beaten so hard by him that he had only a sliver of HP left. “Let’s begin the fight!”","“Ara Kami! Kono Kizu!” Song Qingfeng followed the rules and launched his attacks.","Mr. Fang took Iori Yagami, and he moved his body, dodging Kyo Kusanagi’s attacks. Then, with a shake of his joystick, Iori Yagami grabbed Kyo Kusanagi when the latter was off balance and tossed him to the side.","Strong claw!","A light flashed across the screen, and he launched Kin 1211 Shiki Ya Otome.","“How come I can’t move?!” Song Qingfeng moved the joystick wildly and slammed on the buttons. “Hit! Hit! Hit! Fight back!”","On the screen, Iori Yagami’s claws moved violently, and Kyo Kusanagi’s blood gushed out. Even though they were separated from the characters by the screen, the image looked extremely real, and it was an exciting sight.","Furthermore, the System had adjusted the moves and combos, and they were used as logically and smoothly as possible!","Each strike landed on the flesh, and they were vicious.","Finally, Iori Yagami grabbed his opponent and slammed the latter’s head on the ground. Looking at the purple flames covering almost half of the screen which kept shaking, the viewers were dumbfounded!","Kyo Kusanagi who was played by Song Qingfeng got up from the ground but received another round of heavy beatings of consecutive punches and kicks, and he fell to the ground!","“Hahahaha...” On the screen, Iori Yagami pushed his fingers into his blood-red hair and laughed hysterically.","“F*ck! This guy is wild!”","“That claw technique was so powerful!”","“Can we learn that?!”","The three guys were eager to learn.","“Young Master Song is trash; he couldn’t even defeat his opponent who had only a trace of HP left. Let me try!” Lin Shao wanted to play the next round.","Behind them, people like Huangpu Tao and Liu Ningyun, who were only new players of the Legend of Mir 2, were baffled. “Games can be played this way?”","Then, Mr. Fang explained to them the advanced playing methods.","In fact, combos could be achieved in the real world, but they couldn’t be used as smoothly as in the King of Fighters.","After all, warriors and cultivators understood things much faster than ordinary people, and they soon mastered the key points.","“It sounds interesting,” Ruan Ning murmured to herself. “It feels like a chess game in which you must predict your opponent’s intention before you make your moves. You must calculate what to do after you are attacked and what to do if your prediction is wrong...”","Liu Ningyun said, “It sounds to be a game of depth...”","“Yeah,” Huangpu Tao nodded and said, “When you meet a rival on your own level, there will be many battles on the psychological level. During a chess game, you have time to consider your next move. But in this game, if you take too much time to think, your opponent will overwhelm you with a storm of attacks... Interesting.”","“Shall we try it?”"]},{"number":293,"title":"Chapter 293 - Various Beating and Crazy Torture","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, Lin Shao had entered the game. In one match in King of Fighters, each player could choose three characters. After Kyo Kusanagi left the battlefield, the next was Yashiro Nanakase.","“This white-haired guy looks impressive. He must be powerful.” Lin Shao tested the moves.","“How come this guy can only use punches and kicks?” On the screen, Yashiro Nanakase punched and kicked without any special effects. Although Kyo Kusanagi was beaten senseless by Mr. Fang, he was at least cool. Lin Shao was very disappointed with Yashiro Nanakase, and he said, “He’s even worse than the previous one. I want to change to another character!”","“Do you want to play my character?” Mr. Fang asked casually.","After winning a round, the character who won would get some HP back. Right now, Iori Yagami’s HP had increased by a bit.","“Okay!” Lin Shao was eager to try Iori Yagami since he had seen that this character’s sharp claw technique was powerful at close range. If he could take half of HP from Mr. Fang, it was enough for him to brag about.","They changed positions and tested the moves. After several 108 Shiki Yami Barai and three 127 Shiki Aoi Hana combos, Yashiro Nanakase, who was played by Mr. Fang, soon had less than half of his HP left.","“Come on!” Seeing that Mr. Fang’s HP was close to his own, Lin Shao was more confident. “I’ll give you some purple flames first!”","On the screen, Iori waved his right hand and used Shiki Yami Barai, and a mass of purple fire shot toward Fang Qi swiftly!","“Hehehe!” Lin Shao was smug while he saw Fang Qi trying to block the attack by squeaking down by the corner. After all, the biggest advantage of cultivators over warriors was their long-range attacks. Now that he had this advantage, he wasn’t afraid of the white-haired guy, who knew nothing but punches.","“This guy is indeed strong...” Xu Luo murmured to himself while he watched the game from behind.","Ruan Ning looked at the screen and said, “This is the difference between cultivators and warriors.”","“Does this warrior practice both spiritual spells and combat techniques?” Huangpu Tao asked in bafflement.","Lin Shao was happy with his maneuvers. While pushing and pulling the joystick with his left hand and slamming on the buttons with his right hand, he watched the screen light up with the purple flames in Iori Yagami’s hands.","A thick beam of purple fire shot out across the space toward the other side of the screen!","“Is this a spiritual spell?!”","“This is dominating!”","“This guy is indeed powerful! The shop owner chose this strong character to bully us!” Someone protested.","Song Qingfeng and the others stared at the screen with wide eyes.","Huangpu Tao, who was watching the game from behind, looked even more baffled. “Is he really a warrior?!”","However, the next scene dumbfounded them. Under Mr. Fang’s control, Yashiro Nanakase rolled on the ground and avoided this attack, dodged the next Shiki Yami Barai, and drop kicked. After Lin Shao blocked it, he squatted and knocked down Lin Shao with a strong kick.","“Your stance and lower body are weak, Young Master Lin!” A red light flashed on Yashiro Nanakase who had little HP left in his body.","When his opponent got up, he launched the final heavy, knock-out punch!","Boom!","Tremendous earthly power gushed out from his fist and broke his opponent’s defense, sending the latter flying for more than 20 meters. Everyone shrugged at the sight and knew that Iori Yagami was destroyed!","Parched Earth Yashiro Nanakase possessed the power of the earth and was the leader of Hakkesshu; his true power was only a bit weaker compared to the three main characters: Iori Yagami, Kyo Kusanagi, and Chizuru Kagura. He was powerful in the game.","“How come he can’t defend against this punch?”","Slap! Slap! Slap! Lin Shao punched the joystick in frustration.","Xu Luo said, “You’re all trash! Let me try!”","Ruan Ning said, “Let me try it!”","-One minute later-","They looked at Chizuru Kagura and Shermie who were lying on the ground and said, “F*ck! The scummy shop owner must have gotten private lessons for this game!”","“Damn it! Instead of admitting that you are weak, you accuse me of taking private lessons!” Mr. Fang said contemptuously and taunted them, “Who else wants to play it? I’ll play with only one hand!”","“One hand?” Many people were displeased. After all, this game needed two hands to issue commands. With only one hand operating the gamepad, the players couldn’t press buttons and move joysticks at the same time, so they couldn’t use smooth combos.","“It’s just a small game.” Many people in the room wanted to give him a hard lesson so that he wouldn’t be so arrogant.","“I’ll play it!” Liu Ningyun didn’t think that this small game was difficult. Although she was only a beginner, she had watched the others play several rounds and was familiar with the moves and combos. She didn’t believe that Fang Qi could beat her with only one hand.","He was too arrogant!","Then, she plunked down on the seat next to Mr. Fang contemptuously and began to choose her character.","The first one was Iori Yagami; he was the top choice.","The second was Chizuru Kagura; Xu Luo had just played her, and Liu Ningyun remembered her moves.","The third was Shermie who looked strong since she could cast lightning.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang chose Joe Higashi, who was wearing a big pair of shorts. Then, he chose two other characters randomly.","Joe Higashi was the first to enter the fight.","Before the fight, Liu Ningyun had tested the moves and felt good. She remembered Iori Yagami’s combos; Kuzu Kaze, Strong Punch, and Shiki Aoi Hana were easy to memorize.","At the beginning of the game, she cleverly used Shiki Yami Barai to test her opponent!","“Alika!” Joe Higashi swung out his fist, and a tornado shot toward Iori Yagami at a great speed.","Then, “Alika! Alika!”","Joe Higashi shot out small tornadoes one after another without stopping. Liu Ningyun had just used Shiki Yami Barai once, and the tornado hit her character in the face when she tried to use the second Shiki Yami Barai. Then, it came the third, fourth, and fifth tornado...","Liu Ningyun tried to jump over a tornado to attack Fang Qi.","“Don’t move!” Mr. Fang hit his opponent’s leg with one Hurricane Upper-cut.","Not wanting to admit defeat, Liu Ningyun struggled up and dodged the next punch.","“You dare to dodge?” Mr. Fang quickly launched the second Hurricane Upper-cut onto his opponent’s face.","She got up and used Shiki Yami Barai one after another.","Mr. Fang yelled, “Alika! Alika!”","Iori Yagami was swallowed by many tornadoes!","“Ahhh!” Liu Ningyun frantically slammed her fist on the buttons and moved the joystick violently.","Clap! Clap...","She gritted her teeth and slammed her hands on the gamepad, but her character still couldn’t get over!","Then, her second character, Chizuru Kagura, entered the fight.","Katso Tenjin no Kotowari!","Katsu Tamayura no Shintsune!","At the beginning of the fight, Liu Ningyun was steady with her moves.","Mr. Fang yelled, “Alika! Alika!”","Tornadoes came up one after another.","Clap! Clap...","Liu Ningyun pulled the joystick wildly and slammed her hand on the table, but her character died!","The third character Shermie entered the fight.","Mr. Fang yelled, “Alika! Alika!”","He tortured his opponent mercilessly.","Liu Ningyun could neither move nor attack. Red-eyed, she gritted her teeth and slammed her fist on the buttons on the table, wishing that she could leap over and punch Mr. Fang hard!","Boom! Boom! Boom...","Even the screen was shaking.","“Damn it! Don’t destroy my desk with your fist!” Mr. Fang couldn’t bear it anymore."]},{"number":294,"title":"Chapter 294 - Join or get out","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I quit!” While the others were defeated by Fang Qi only once, Liu Ningyun was beaten senseless by him with one hand three times in front of everyone.","She was so angry that she stopped playing.","“Scummy Shop Owner, show some manners to your guests and go easy on them.” Ruan Ning was indignant for Liu Ningyun. “You said that you’d fight with only one hand, but you used this shameless move that couldn’t be dodged or leaped over. How could she continue the battle?”","“Young Master Song, shall we play another round?”","“Come on! I’ll choose the character that the shop owner just played!” Lin Shao entered the game again and chose Joe Higashi. He was having a great time using Hurricane Upper-cut one after another the moment the fight began.","On the other side, Mr. Fang controlled Iori Yagami with one hand.","“Humph! I’ll see what you can do this time!” Ruan Ning smugly comforted Liu Ningyun who was too angry to play this small game again. “Mr. Fang taught us this shameless battle style, and his opponent will be using it on him.”","Mr. Fang calmly hooked his little finger around the metal stick part of the joystick while he pressed his thumb and index finger on the buttons leisurely. After finding an opening, Iori Yagami leaped over the tornadoes and interrupted his opponent’s attack with swift light punches!","Looking at Joe Higashi who had been knocked down to the ground, Mr. Fang opened his hands and shrugged while singing in Cantonese, “Today I saw snow drifting through the cold night...”","It was The Boundless Sea and Sky , a song by Beyond.","“What’s he singing?” Song Qingfeng and the others were baffled by the Cantonese song.","“I don’t understand one word of it!” Xu Luo said.","“The words sound like, ‘Iron pot... With tears in eyes... shout repair pots’?” Ruan Ning tried to copy the sounds of the words.","[TL Note: these are the meanings of the Cantonese lyrics when they are interpreted in Mandarin.]","Song Qingfeng was at a loss for words.","Liu Ningyun had deep doubts about Mr. Fang’s taste in music.","Huangpu Tao was embarrassed. “I didn’t know that Mr. Fang liked these down-to-earth folk songs...”","Fang Qi was at a loss for words.","Then, he said contemptuously, “Damn it! You’ve never heard of Wong Ka Kui’s songs!”","[TL Note: Wong Ka Kui, was a Hong Kong musician, singer-songwriter and record producer. He rose to prominence as lead vocalist, rhythm guitarist, main songwriter, and founder of the rock band Beyond in a large majority of Asian countries.]","“Who’s Wong Ka Kui?” they asked simultaneously.","Mr. Fang decided to ignore them since they knew nothing.","At this moment, he received a message on QQ.","Gongyi Xiu, “Mr. Fang, some people killed and cussed at me in your game. Isn’t anyone managing this!”","Gongsun Chui sent an angry face emoji with the following words. [I only killed two to three monsters but have been killed five to six times by other players! Don’t you have rules against this behavior?!]","“Rules?” There was no law here, but Fang Qi had to admit that it was a cruel fate for a newbie. So, he asked in a milder tone, [Why did they kill you, two newbies? Did you cuss at them?]","Gongsun Chui: [I’m not that kind of person!]","Fang Qi: [You didn’t?]","Gongsun Chui: [Of course not!]","Fang Qi: [Did you encounter someone named ‘Three Season Rice’?]","[TL Note: This is an infamous WoW player in China who killed a lot of newbies]","Gongsun Chui: [Who’s Three Season Rice?]","Fang Qi: [Someone who likes to kill low-level players.]","Gongsun Chui: [No!]","He thought to himself, Are there such people in the world who wait and kill the low-level players? When I level up in the future, I’ll...","Fang Qi: [Here’s my suggestion. It seems that the Royal Clan Guild is big in your area, and you can join it. With their protection, I’m sure no one dares to kill you.]","Gongsun Chui: [Royal Clan Guild? What Royal Clan Guild???]","Fang Qi: [Dajin’s Royal Family’s guild.]","Gongsun Chui: [What did you say??!!]","Fang Qi: [Oh. I forgot that you’re from Yundian Upper Realm... They just beat you? It doesn’t seem right...]","Gongsun Chui was enraged.","Damn it! What does this guy mean by ‘it doesn’t seem right’?!","By his side, Gongyi Xiu was lying on the ground and couldn’t get up. “What did the shop owner say?”","Gongsun Chui gritted his teeth and said in fury, “This kid told us to join the Dajin Royal Clan Guild! With its protection, we won’t be killed!”","“Did this guy explode?” Fang Qi immediately sent a follow-up message. [Do you want me to recommend a guild from the Morning Star Sea Realm to you? If not, you can join our Heaven-Defying Online Games Guild.]","Gongsun Chui asked, “Brother Gongyi, what do we do now?”","“...”","How do I know?!","Gongsun Chui said with a dark expression, “Maybe we should put the Legend of Mir 2 aside and play other games first?”","Gongyi Xiu narrowed his eyes. He had discovered that even if he had a lot of people with him, he couldn’t establish a force in the world of the Legend of Mir 2. After all, he was lower than level 10; how could he battle with other players?","If I’m right, the places that are producing skill books and treasures have probably been all taken by these major forces. Gongyi Xiu thought for a while and knew that if they didn’t seek protection from the big forces, they could never prosper in this virtual world, let alone building a new cultivator army.","Then, the most that they could get from this game was some left-overs.","With a treasure mountain standing before him, he could do nothing but look at it; this wasn’t a situation he liked.","“It’s just a virtual guild! It’s no big deal if we join this guild! After all, they won’t be able to interfere with our business in Yundian Upper Realm, right? They won’t be able to force us to do anything with our positions, right?” Gongyi Xiu made the decision.","“While we are in the guild, we might be able to know more information about this shop!” A clever light flashed across Gongyi Xiu’s eyes.","“Maybe we can talk with him about other issues...”","Soon, Fang Qi received their reply. [We must warn you that we can’t be bounded and restrained by rules. If your guild has lots of rules, we will quit at any time! Besides, with our background, Mr. Fang, do you have any special benefits for us after we join your guild?]","Fang Qi: [Join or get out.]","Special benefits? What a joke! Mr. Fang thought to himself.","The two guys were stunned and were at a loss for words.","...","– Meanwhile in the Taixi Faction –","“Gongyi Xiu and Gongsun Chui went to make trouble in that shop in Jiuhua personally?” The white-robed old man withdrew the fishing pole and asked mildly.","“Yes, Master.” A white-robed disciple stood behind him deferentially; he had just delivered the intelligence report. “With these two men’s abilities, I’m afraid that the force is now in ruins.”","“If those two men join hands, few people are their match...” The white-robed old man smiled. “However, that force must have a special ability. Otherwise, it couldn’t have done what it has done. The two parties might hurt each other and both get injured.","“Master, you seem to have a high opinion of that force which came out of nowhere,” the disciple said, “In my opinion, it’s just a small frog looking up at the sky from the bottom of a well.”","The old man laughed. “Then, it’s good to show them how big the sky is.”","...","Meanwhile, Gongsun Chui got up from the ground after being killed again. Shaking with fury, he exited the game. “I... quit!”","“Forget it! Let’s play the Legend of Sword and Fairy first. Brother Gongsun, calm down!” Gongyi Xiu sent Fang Qi a message with a cold expression, [Please let us think over the decision of joining the guild.]","He thought, I’ll let this kid worry and be anxious for a while, and we can join the guild in a couple of days."]},{"number":295,"title":"Chapter 295 - The auction of virtual items?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Sir! I want to buy a magic staff from the Royal Clan Guild! Please do the deal for me!”","“Sir! I want to buy a Holy Armor Spell Skill Book. Please do the deal for me!”","“Sir...”","In the last few days, Fang Qi felt harassed by the cross-regional deals after the virtual trading became popular.","With the skill books getting even more expensive, the valuable places that had monsters that dropped these skill books witnessed more conflicts. As for the bosses, such as the Wilma Clan Master who could drop skill books for skills above level 30, their appearance would cause a blood storm.","Now that all the elite members of the major forces had gotten most of the skill books, they turned their eyes to items.","Although items didn’t bring players benefits as directly as the spell books, things like killing and robbing other players for treasures and fighting for Bosses were crucial; that was why the items that could increase players’ strengths became hotshot objects.","Some players’ mindset even began to change subtly.","For example, Black Demon was now in possession of an ultimate magic staff, and all the Black Demon Guards wanted to have one as well since it was an honor to have the same item as the Big Boss!","...","“Guild President, how expensive will the Magic Shield Spell eventually get? And how about Limitless (Wu Ji) Stike? I think the prices will drop if I keep them for too long...” Different from Ruan Ning whose warehouse was stocked with many resources of the guild, Xi Yue’s warehouse had some personal items that she got herself.","“I plan to sell one or two things.”","“How?” Fang Qi frowned. “The game is now full of profiteers!”","“I don’t know how long I must wait...” Xi Yue said, “I think I can try to auction them.”","The inner city of Half City was the power center where the high-level residents lived.","All the forces in the outer city must register with the inner city to gain its acknowledgement, and that was only the first step to gain a footing in the city.","Even the Coiled Dragon Office was only a low-level force in the inner city.","It was heard that the deepest part of Half City hid many horrifying old monsters. The forces in the Morning Star Sea Realm hated Half City but didn’t dare to get rid of it due to these old monsters’ existences.","Half City accepted any cultivators and warriors who wanted to live here and follow the rules of this place. No matter if they had been ferociously evil or just and righteous before they entered the city, they were protected by the city from the laws of outside after entering the city.","Even though half of the city had been destroyed, the other half was intact, and so was its rules and traditions.","No one had ever been able to change this.","In the inner city, it was said that one could buy anything they could name as long as they had enough money.","There were even objects that people had never imagined to be in existence.","That was why the auctions in Half City were so famous; even the grand masters of the Morning Star Sea Realm would come here sometimes to buy rare items that couldn’t be seen in other places.","“You plan to sell them at Half City’s auction?” Fang Qi asked in surprise. “The problem is... My shop doesn’t have any tangible items; how are you doing to auction them?”","“That’s simple,” Xi Yue said, “In the past, the auctions also had some special objects which couldn’t be handed to the inner city for safekeeping, but they could be entrusted to the executives of the inner city. For example, we can create an account and take it as an intermediary warehouse. We can store the items in this account, which could show that we have these items and allow others to get the items.","“You’re quite thoughtful...” Fang Qi thought for a moment. “We can try it. When is the auction?”","“It will be happening soon.”","...","Mr. Fang discovered that it was easier for people in this world to like classical music than rock and roll. Rock and roll seemed to be beyond their understanding, let alone getting them to like it.","For example, Su Tianji played the Boundless Sea and Sky in her Qzone and hummed along from time to time.","As for Song Qingfeng, he listened to the song before.","But when Fang Qi tried to explain the lyrics to him, he said that Mr. Fang was not subtle; when Fang Qi tried to be subtle, he said that Mr. Fang was not graceful. The incident when Mr. Fang was laughed at will be ignored for now.","Mr. Fang decided not to talk about the song with them. Whenever he had time, he would play the Boundless Sea and Sky. Anyone who wanted to play the King of Fighters or came to his place to have spiritual tea would have to listen to it.","It was why Song Qingfeng and Lin Shao began to hum while they walked on the street in front of the shop, “Gam tin ngoh hon ye lui hon seuit piu gwoh waai jeuk laang keuk liu dik sam woh piu yuan fong...”","[TL Note: this is what it sounds like in Mandarin – Steel pot; with tears in eyes, yelling repairing pots; change broken pots for new ones and place them in a mess. Chasing after pots in the wind and rain. This is the original meaning – Today I saw snow drifting through the cold night. With the cold, my heart and mind drift off to faraway places. Trying to catch up in the wind and rain.]","The song was catchy after hearing it countless times, and it would replay itself in their heads.","“Colorless!” Lin Shao copied Iori Yagami’s Shiki Yami Barai and yelled while he launched a mass of warrior qi, sending a small rock flying.","It was early morning in the Nanhua Faction in the distant the Morning Star Sea Realm.","Liu Ningyun was strolling on the forest path leading to the cultivation place for elders. In a good mood, she hummed subconsciously, “Yuen leung ngoh je yat saang bat gei fong jung oi ji yau...”","[TL Note: In mandarin, it sounds like – In all my life, I like freedom and love gay guys. The original meaning in Cantonese – Forgive me, I’ve been an unruly, untamed freedom-lover all my life.]","Some very inaccurate Cantonese words came from her mouth.","She looked around and blushed when she saw some junior brothers and sisters gaping while looking at her.","Damn it! She stomped her foot in a huff. How come I sang it out loud?","She felt her image was instantly ruined by her careless mistake!","More importantly, she ran into a person at this moment, and this person was glaring at her with a dark expression.","It was an oval-faced woman who looked to be in her thirties. She looked more mature than Liu Ningyun with coldness and an aloof presence.","“Ma...Master?!”","“You still know that I’m your master?” The woman snorted. “I sent your second senior sister to fetch you the day before yesterday, but you were out. Yesterday, you didn’t come back from Half City until the night. I heard that you aren’t cultivating in the faction lately. Instead, you went to Half City each day and didn’t come back until sunset. Am I right?”","“Yes,” Liu Ningyun had a bad feeling. “I went there to...”","“To do what?” The woman said in a cold voice, “Don’t tell me that you go to Half City to cultivate diligently!”","Liu Ningyun was frustrated since she couldn’t rebuff her master and tell her that she had indeed gone to Half City to cultivate. With everyone watching, it would be a humiliation to her master if she voiced anything.","No matter if she was in the right or not, she knew what the consequences would be.","“Well.” The woman said in a cold voice, “You will stay in the faction and cultivate for in the coming days.”","This is...","Liu Ningyun, who had been on her way to the internet café, was frustrated.","What should I do?!","..."]},{"number":296,"title":"Chapter 296 - New Movie, and Plants vs Zombies","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Senior Sister Liu, what should we do now?” Now that Liu Ningyun was grounded, the disciples of Nanhua who usually went to the Origins Internet Club with her had similar fates.","Standing in the courtyard before Liu Ningyun’s room, the female disciples looked worried. “The stuff in that shop is fun and powerful. Why can’t we go there?”","“Yeah. I feel like my cultivation has sped up lately!” one of them complained.","“The problem is that we don’t have proof,” Liu Ningyun said, “Besides, if you explain it to our master, she probably will think that we’re disgracing her by cultivating in another force instead of doing it in the cultivation rooms of our faction!”","“What should we do now? The whole thing sounds complicated...”","“I don’t know...” Liu Ningyun looked worried.","...","In fact, things were not as harmonious as they looked in this big faction.","Not many people knew that Liu Ningyun was grounded, but some people asked around purposefully and got wind of it.","“I heard the rumors from the outside that Nanhua Heavenly Fairy Liu Ningyun was defeated by a young man who appeared out of nowhere?”","“It’s true, Elder Senior Sister.” Standing by this woman, there was a girl who looked a bit older than Liu Ningyun. “According to the rumors circulating outside of our faction, the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell has unrivaled power, and even the Nanhua Heavenly Light of our faction is no match for it!”","“That’s ridiculous!” The woman sneered. “Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell? Where did it come from? Which faction does it belong to? I’ve never heard of it before; how can it defeat the Nanhua Heavenly Light of our faction?”","“I guess Junior Sister Liu hasn’t mastered Nanhua Heavenly Light yet and thus brought disgrace to the ultimate technique of our faction. She’s not as good as you, Elder Senior Sister... The master said that she is a rare genius in the last 1,000 years of Nanhua Faction, but I think she’s no match for you, Elder Senior Sister. The title of Heavenly Fairy should belong to you!”","“Right! Elder Senior Sister, you entered our branch the earliest, and we admire you the most. I don’t understand why they gave the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy to the young Liu Ningyun! They even taught her Nanhua Heavenly Light!”","“Humph!” The woman sneered. “Now that Junior Sister Liu is grounded by Master, I think it gives you a perfect opportunity, Elder Senior Sister.”","“Opportunity?”","“Right. If we can defeat the young man who defeated Junior Sister Liu, Master might see you in a different light and will probably think that Junior Sister Liu doesn’t deserve the title of Nanhua Heavenly Fairy; she might put more value on you, Elder Senior Sister!”","“This... seems unfair to Junior Sister Liu.” The Elder Senior Sister seemed worried.","“Elder Senior Sister, you’re too kind for your own good!”","“In my opinion, only you deserve this position!”","The Elder Senior Sister followed their tone and said, “I can’t refuse your kind advice. Let’s get ready and go to Half City. We’ll find that kid and give him a hard lesson to redeem the honor for our Nanhua Faction and Junior Sister Liu!”","“Right. Elder Senior Sister, your cultivation strength is much higher than that Liu Ningyun, and it will be easy for you to capture that kid who came from nowhere.”","...","“Guild President, Sister Xi and I are going to burn pigs in the Stone Tomb. Are you coming?” At Fang Qi’s advice, Ruan Ning had found a new place to level up, and she was enjoying it.","“You guys go ahead. I plan to go to Zuma Temple with Xiaoyue... Ugh?”","Mr. Fang’s QQ beeped, and he received a new task at the same time.","[New task: A fresh wind in the era of online games","Task Description: The number of players of the little game, Qzone, reaches 200","Task Reward: Movie – Harry Potter and the Sorcerer’s Stone; one day access to the Game Cultivation Room","Task Clarification: This is a basic magic class]","Although the Legend of Mir 2 got more popular each day, and the players of the Legend of Mir 2 increased continuously, the fact was that the Legend of Mir 2 wasn’t a game for independent players except for those who loved exploring every day without a specific purpose.","For new players, they either joined a force or developed their own in a low profile. The latter would eventually get used to being killed after a while.","Some players didn’t like fighting and battling everyday. For example, Su Tianji preferred to stay in her Qzone to play guzheng and grow vegetables with her two disciples.","As for the Legend of Mir 2, she just followed the main force of the Liuyun Guild to gain some experience points each day; she was a big burden for the team.","For the same reason, Liu Ningyun had time to play the King of Fighters and drink tea in Mr. Fang’s place.","Since Su Tianji watched her vegetable garden closely and was diligent with removing pests and weeds, Mr. Fang didn’t have the opportunity to steal her vegetable. Therefore, she had quite a decent income now.","Even her daikon was bigger than those in the others’ gardens. More importantly, she had grown some high-level spiritual plants, and the land that she could use for growing had doubled.","Fang Qi glanced at the message on QQ. Su Tianji?","[What’s it? I’m playing the Legend of Mir 2!] Mr. Fang replied impatiently. Every time he saw her well-grown vegetables and fruits filled with spiritual essence, he was tempted to steal them. However, she guarded her garden closely, which made Mr. Fang very frustrated.","[I have something to ask you.] Su Tianji sent him a message, [Why can’t I unlock the higher leveled spiritual plants? I have enough nurturing and cultivating experience and skills, but it says that I need to unlock them through Plants vs Zombie.]","“Pu!” Mr. Fang almost spat the Coke onto his screen. [What do you need to unlock them?!]","[Plants vs Zombies!] Su Tianji replied, [How can plants fight zombies? What is this? (Husky’s baffled face)?]","Su Tianji was confused, and the Husky’s baffled face showed what she was feeling.","“Wait a moment,” Mr. Fang came into Su Tianji’s Qzone. Her space was now exquisite under her management, and the green pine and bamboo forest made the scenery more pleasant. The green bamboo fence surrounding her courtyard had various sprinkling small flowers on it, and all kinds of vegetables and fruits were either vivid red or bright green in the garden.","The original crude cottage with the straw roof was now changed into an exquisite house with a tiled roof. On the snow-white walls crawled green ivies and bright wild flowers. It was a pretty picture.","On the side was an elixir room with sandalwood fragrance floating out; it was a celestial sight.","Beside the green creek on one side of the house was a simple guzheng platform. When she was free, she played it, and the clear sounds resonated in the forest. It was a celestial life that was rarely seen in the mortal world.","It was an elegant place to be enjoyed by herself or with a group of friends.","Of course, the celestial atmosphere wouldn’t be disturbed if she didn’t say, “Here you are! Come and show me how to do this Plants vs Zombies!”"]},{"number":297,"title":"Chapter 297 - Friend Circle in QQ","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“It’s just Plants vs Zombies!” Fang Qi opened the store for her. “Did you buy a computer?”","“I did.” After spending some time on growing vegetables, Su Tianji had grown from a penniless person who hurt inside when Mr. Fang stole one daikon from her to a well-to-do woman who could even afford a computer.","However, after she bought the computer, she found that she needed other related items to play.","“Good that you have it.” Fang Qi clicked open the store and showed her the item. “On the third page, you can buy the game disk of Plants vs Zombies. Then, I’ll show you how to install it.”","Soon, under Mr. Fang’s direction, a game logo appeared on the screen of Su Tianji’s computer after it finished installing; it showed one hand sticking out from the ground and grabbing a small flower.","“Ding Dong Ding Dong...”","With the familiar background music, the game started.","It resembled the original version except that the pictures were sillier and cuter, which was why it was cheap.","“Look! Fenghua! Is that a zombie? It’s so silly. Giggle...” Yuexin giggled while she watched the game from behind.","“That sunflower is so cute!” Fenghua said with a laugh, “I didn’t know that there were such games in the world!”","“Look at the wall-nut beside it. Hahaha! Its bulging eyes are so silly!”","Obviously, this game appealed to the girls.","A box appeared on the center of the screen: [Click to Start].","Su Tianji clicked it, and a red brick farmhouse appeared in the distance under the blue sky studded with white clouds. On the hill before the house was a tombstone, and there was only one option for now: [Adventure].","When Su Tianji clicked it open, they heard the zombie’s symbolic hoarse laughter as a dark green arm stuck out from the ground. The game began!","At the beginning of the game, there was a beginner’s manual. Su Tianji followed the instructions in the manual and put down a peashooter. Soon, the zombie came close.","The peashooter shot peas at the zombie one after another","“Giggle... this is so dumb!” Fenghua giggled while she watched it from behind. “They are both dumb! How come the zombies are so dumb!”","“This pea is so cute! I want to play it too...”","“This game is simple and silly!” Su Tianji said contemptuously while she played. “I just need to put down the peas and watch them shoot the zombies?”","Su Tianji waved her hand in boredom. “Okay! I know how to play it now. You’re free to go.”","Then, she murmured to herself, “What’s fun about this game? It’s boring!”","Fang Qi who had walked to the door paused, and he said while his face twitched, “You don’t have to play it if you don’t like it.”","“I wouldn’t play it if I didn’t need it to unlock things!” Su Tianji snorted. “Disciples, see off our guest!”","Then, she got busy planting the peashooters. After passing level 1, she got a wall-nut card.","“Ugh? Now, I can grow two plants?” Su Tianji clicked and picked up the card to activate level 2.","With the more items that she picked up, the game gradually went faster. It was clear that that the game was a bit more difficult than the original version. Su Tianji’s fingers clicked on the mouse rapidly as she clicked on the screen...","Sometime later, a message appeared. [Excellent! Congratulations to you for passing level 5! You rank No. 1 among your friends. Do you want to share this in the Friend Circle on QQ?]","[Accept!]","Su Tianji got a sense of achievement and thought that it wasn’t a big deal to share it.","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang had resumed playing the Legend of Mir 2.","Suddenly, a message shot out of QQ. [Your friend, Yuji Immortal, is playing Plants Vs. Zombies and passed level 5. She ranks No. 1 among all her friends. Come and have a look!]","“What’s this damn thing?!” His hand shook and almost hit Jiang Xiaoyue’s head.","“Sir! What are you doing?” Surprised, Jiang Xiaoyue jumped away like a bunny. “What’s Plants vs Zombies?!”","Obviously, she had also received the message in her QQ Friend Circle.","Her little face was full of curiosity.","A while later, another message jumped out of QQ, [Your friend, Yuji Immortal, is playing Plants Vs. Zombies and passed level 10. She ranks No. 1 among all her friends. Come and have a look!]","[Sister Su, what are you playing?]","[What is Plants vs Zombies?]","[How did you get No. 1 among friends?]","[Awesome!]","“Master... Can we play as well?” Fenghua and Yuexin watched the game eagerly behind her.","“Ugh... Let me pass two more levels!”","Replies filled her QQ, and the logo of the penguin jumped on her screen. She had received lots of messages.","The messages released in the Friend Circle can be seen by so many people? Su Tianji froze for a moment and replied to the people she was familiar with. [It’s just a small game in Qzone.]","[It sounds amazing.]","[Is it fun?]","[Can I watch you play?]","Su Tianji soon received replies.","[Your friend, Yuji Immortal, invites you to enter her Qzone.]","Nalan Mingxue, Dong Qingli, Xu Zixin, Ye Xiaoye, and many other girls were invited to watch Su Tianji play Plants vs Zombies.","Of course, Xue Daolv, the Liuyun Daoist Palace Master, was also invited into her place, as were Ye Songtao and the others.","A large group of people stood behind Su Tianji and watched her place the wall-nuts to the front, sunflowers to the back, and then filling the screen with peashooters.","The grandmasters watching the game from behind froze in confusion.","What on earth is this thing?!","“Is this Plants vs Zombies?!” Xue Daolv was feeling awkward, regretting that he had wasted his precious computer time, which cost crystals for every minute, on this stuff.","Ye Songtao said, “Ugh... I’ve something to tend to. I’ve got to go now!”","However, the girls’ reactions were different.","“Sister Su, how do we play this game? It’s so cute!”","“Do you need this game to unlock the high-level spiritual plants?” Dong Qingli said, “I remember that several special plant seeds need this game to be unlocked.”","“Hahaha! Look at this squash’s expression! It’s so funny!”","Nalan Mingxue said, “It’s indeed cute. Maybe I’ll play it too.”","“Boss.” Jiang Xiaoyue looked at Fang Qi eagerly. “Can I borrow your computer? I want to play the game too...”","Fang Qi’s face turned dark. “Aren’t you growing vegetables each day? Where’s your money?”","Since Su Tianji could buy a computer, how come this girl couldn’t afford a computer?!","“Those oranges and daikon are delicious, and I ate them when they matured...” Jiang Xiaoyue said in embarrassment.","Fang Qi was at a loss for words.","This girl ate all of her produce!","Mr. Fang could only say, “You are high maintenance!”","He glanced at the task list and saw a piece of good news; the number of players of the little game, Qzone, had reached 32, and it was still growing."]},{"number":298,"title":"Chapter 298 - My Senior Sister Who Is a Drama Queen","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Mo Xian (This name means black immortal in Chinese) was Liu Ningyun’s Elder Senior Sister. Her skin was fair and smooth like snow and jade, and her black dress accentuated her dazzling white skin.","She had cloud-like hair, red lips, and white teeth.","As Liu Ningyun’s Elder Senior Sister, she was probably more beautiful than Liu Ningyun and was known as the Black Fairy.","The disciples of the Nanhua Faction, including Mo Xian, were well known for their beauty, but they rarely went out of the faction. They spent most of the time on cultivation or gossiping about others before their master. In short, they were cultivators of big factions who knew little about the tough life in the real world.","At this moment, Fang Qi was doing cross-regional trading at the counter, and Zou Mo was walking around the shop leisurely. Suddenly, Zou Mo froze. “Someone’s outside of the shop?”","His eyes widened a bit. “No? No people? Was I too sensitive?”","Suddenly, his eyes widened, and he pointed at the door. “Bo... Boss! Look at the entrance...”","“What is it?” Fang Qi looked in the direction of Zou Mo’s gaze and saw that snowflakes seemed to be falling outside the door.","He looked closer and found that they were not snowflakes but many white flower petals!","Through the glass door, they saw the flower petals float in the breeze as if there was a flower shower. At this moment, several pretty figures landed slowly from the sky.","“These people bring special effects with them wherever they go?!” Fang Qi froze. “Who are they?”","“Celestials!” Stunned, Zou Mo gaped at the entrance and saw an extremely beautiful woman wearing a black long dress landing on the ground outside of the shop flanked by a group of white-clothed female cultivators.","As the only one wearing black among the women in white, the woman in black was very eye-catching!","Two female cultivators pushed open the door while the two behind, who were holding flower baskets, tossed flower petals into the air. Fang Qi was dazed by the sight. Manual special effects?!","They brought not only special effects but also BGM (background music) as well!","Fang Qi saw another four female cultivators walking into the shop after the woman in black while playing guqin, guzheng, and pipa.","[TL Note: They are all traditional music instruments.]","The woman in black standing in the center was extremely beautiful, and the other female cultivators were also pretty. Coming with these special effects, they looked like fairies descending from heaven into the shop.","“So beautiful!”","“I can’t believe that I can see such a beautiful goddess in this small shop!”","All the people sitting close to the entrance looked toward them involuntarily with exclamations.","The women thought, Yeah, they are stunned!","We come prepared. Now, we have the advantage in terms of presence!","Look at those guys in the shop!","Seeing the reactions of the customers in the shop, Mo Xian felt smug as she smiled. Although her talent wasn’t as high as Liu Ningyun’s, her beauty was unrivalled!","At this moment, she was proud of herself.","Silently, she had imagined what would happen next.","She would look up at the sky with a frost-like expression with her hands clasped behind her back, looking like an immortal.","Then, she would say, “I’ve defeated you with one move. Do you submit to me?”","Mr. Fang would kowtow toward her. “I submit to you! Black Fairy’s spiritual power is boundless, and your reputation stuns the Morning Star Sea Realm!”","She would then reply, “Humph! Since you know your place, I’ll forgive you this time. Don’t force my hand again!”","“...”","After reviewing this scenario in her mind, Mo Xian walked to the counter with a cold expression. She glanced around with cold eyes, and the atmosphere of the entire shop seemed as chilly as frost.","“Who is the shop owner?” Her voice was extremely cold.","It was completely silent.","No one answered her; the shop fell silent instantly.","She turned her head and saw a row of black-robed cultivators on her left. The leader wore a black cloak, with his hair falling to his shoulders. His expression was cold, and his eyes emitted a chilling and vicious light!","The row of black-robed cultivators behind him had the same profound presences as if they had fought through mountains of corpses and seas of blood. The auras they emitted were frightening and ominous!","She turned her head to the right and saw a middle-aged cultivator wearing a deep blue robe with a wide forehead. With squinted eyes, his expression was chillingly solemn. Beside him was a middle-aged man who was smiling, but his smile sent chills down her spine for some reason.","It looked like the teasing smile of an ancient ferocious beast who had its eyes on a prey.","“Ugh?” Black Fairy snorted in displeasure. “The people in this shop are so rude!”","Instantly, she released the huge suppressive aura of a True Lake Realm cultivator towards the people around her.","Beside her, Zou Mo felt as if a huge mountain crashed down on him with vicious force, and he was almost suffocated by this frightening presence!","“Bo... Boss!” Zou Mo said with difficulty. “This woman is powerful...”","Mo Xian’s lips curved up. “You’re weak.”","Then, she looked toward Fang Qi and was surprised that he was not affected. After sensing his cultivation strength, she was disappointed to find that he wasn’t even at the Grand Ancestral Warrior Realm. “Little Brother, did you defeat my useless junior sister with luck? Now that I came here in person, it’s not too late for you to apologize.”","“Ugh?” Fang Qi froze.","“Erm?” Mo Xian was displeased, feeling like something wasn’t right.","In the next instant, the auras of all the people around her shot up!","The auras of the black-robed men on the left suddenly rose, some of them having cultivation strengths at the pinnacle stage of the True Lake Realm!","The leader who wore the big black cloak was at...","The Divine Ocean Realm?!","Then, the auras of the middle-aged man in the blue robe and the people beside him also shot up!","Divine Ocean Realm again?!","“Kid Fang, who’s this girl?” Baffled, Mo Tianxing looked over and revealed a trace of his aura.","Another Divine Ocean Realm?!","“So many cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm!”","The female cultivators of the Nanhua Faction felt chilled inside.","They were lofty in the Nanhua Faction, but this place wasn’t the Nanhua Faction.","Seeing so many grand cultivators in this place, their hearts sank.","“That man’s eyes are ferocious...”","“Elder Senior Sister... It’s said that the people in Half City are all demons who kill people without blinking an eye. Will we...”","“Don’t say it... I was fine before you said it, but now...”","“Should we leave?”","“Elder Senior Sister, you’re different. You have the great dream of defeating that Liu Ningyun! You must hold on!”","“You can’t admit defeat!”","“Elder Senior Sister, you can do it!”","Mo Xian nodded and said with gritted teeth, “They are just cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm!”","Beside her, Black Demon said in a cold voice, “Don’t you know the rules?! Go and get in line!”","“Okay...”","The other female cultivators instantly submitted, and they went to the rear to stand in line.","Mo Xian was silent.","Under everyone’s stare, she moved to the rear and stood in line."]},{"number":299,"title":"Chapter 299 - I’ll turn off your computers if you yell again!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“They are so rude!” Seeing that the cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm ignored them, they were relieved. Then, they began talking again.","“They are crude and mean!”","“They didn’t greet the Black Fairy of our Nanhua Faction. Even if we could endure that, they also forced Senior Sister to wait in line!” a female cultivator whispered indignantly.","“They are uncivilized countrymen and don’t know better. We will just ignore them!” Another female cultivator comforted them, and their voices gradually got louder.","“Ugh?!” Several Black Demon Guard at the pinnacle stage of the True Lake Realm looked back with chilly eyes and released their full cultivation strengths.","Instantly, the women felt like they were engulfed by a horrifying suppression, and they immediately shut up.","Having finished his deal, Black Demon had a bowl of instant noodles in his left hand and a bottle of Coke in his right hand. Then, he looked at the female disciples of Nanhua Faction up and down with chilly eyes.","The frightening glint in his eyes and the hellish presence emitting from his body engulfed these low-level female cultivators who felt like small chickens swept into a storm in the ocean!","A few female cultivators almost shrunk behind Black Fairy and hid there!","“Humph!” The cold snort hit their hearts like a heavy hammer!","Looking at the tall man in the big black cloak who began looking for his seat while drinking Coke, the women wondered, Who is that guy? His aura is horrifying!","At this moment, Xi Chenzhou of the Coiled Dragon Office walked into the shop and frowned when he saw all the stuff on the ground since the neat and clean environment was a key feature that they liked about this shop. He yelled, “Sir! How come the ground at the entrance is so dirty? Why didn’t you clean it up?”","Fang Qi looked up and saw the mess at the entrance. “Who did it? Go and clean it up!”","“Why must we clean it?!” A beautiful white-clothed female cultivator said in a cold voice, “You’re rude!”","“Ugh?!” At this moment, Master Tang Yuan and Second Master Tao Kun of the Yuanheng Pavilion had just finished their deals, and they bought a box of spicy sticks. While looking toward the women, Tao Kun sneered. “Mr. Fang has a mild temperament. If this happened in my Yuanheng Pavilion, the people who dare to make such a mess at the shop entrance would be tied up and their legs and hands would be broken before we hang them in front of the shop for seven days and seven nights with salt water dripping onto their bodies!”","“Hello! Master Tang and Second Master Tao! Nice to meet you,” Xi Chenzhou said, “If anyone dares to do this in front of my Coiled Dragon Office, they would have been beaten into a meat pie!”","A female disciple shook and said in a trembling voice, “This guy is also a cultivator of the Divine Ocean Realm!”","Mo Xian said, “I know!”","Fang Qi scratched his head. “According to the rules of the shop, any trouble makers would have their legs broken and their cultivations destroyed before being tossed out of the shop. I wonder if making a mess at the entrance is a kind of troublemaking?”","“Break our legs?”","“Destroy our cultivation?!”","Looking around at the many grand cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm, the white-clothed female disciples’ legs turned into jelly under these powerful auras, feeling as if they were a group of sheep surrounded by lions.","While thinking of the consequences of having their legs broken and cultivation strengths destroyed in this place, they felt like many sneaky eyes turned toward them.","Even Mo Xian was pale, and she didn’t dare to declare that her true purpose here was to beat the shop owner. She screamed, “No! It’s not making trouble!”","The other female cultivators yelled in horror, “We’ll clean it up now!”","They hurried over to sweep the ground!","At this moment, a beast carriage stopped before Fang Qi’s shop, and Fang Qi felt like the big black dog that was dragging the cart was very familiar.","A guy wearing a short vest got off the carriage, revealing himself to be Wang Xian, the carriage driver who had driven Fang Qi to this place.","“Ugh? Sir, your shop is getting more luxurious!” He looked at the white-clothed beauties who were sweeping the ground at the entrance and said, “Even the janitors in your shop are as beautiful as fairies!”","“Who are janitors?”","“You’re a janitor!”","“Don’t you have eyes?”","“...”","They exploded in a fury.","...","After they cleaned up the ground, Mr. Fang had finished dealing with things and resumed playing the Legend of Mir 2.","Zou Mo asked, “Do you want to play games or watch a TV Series?”","The female cultivators didn’t answer, and Mo Xian’s face looked so cold that it seemed to be covered in ice. Also, a storm seemed to be brewing in her chilly eyes.","“Ugh?” When they kept silent, Zou Mo asked curiously, “Are you not here to play games or watch a TV Series?”","“Senior Sister, we’re no match for them, so we shouldn’t act boldly...” a female cultivator murmured.","Mo Xian froze. “We’re here to play games and watch the TV Series!”","“Yes! Yes...” The others nodded eagerly; their legs were still soft under the suppression of so many cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm.","Zou Mo was feeling awkward. “Do you want to play games or watch the TV Series?”","They answered in unison, “Both! Both!”","After paying, they suppressed their fury and glared at Mr. Fang who was playing the Legend of Mir 2 while whispering to themselves, “You can do nothing but hide behind the powerful cultivators!”","“Shameless!”","“Look! What’s that guy eating?!”","“It smells so good!”","“Elder Senior Sister! Look at this TV drama! So powerful!”","[Nature is indifferent; it treats creation like sacrificial straw-dogs!]","“This guy can even fly while stepping on a sword!”","All of them were shocked by this scene.","“...”","Inside Su Tianji’s Qzone. “Master, let me play for a bit... Didn’t you say it wasn’t fun...”","Fenghua and Yuexin watched Su Tianji plant peashooters and wall-nuts while humming some unknown tune.","“Wait a second!” Su Tianji said, “I’m going to pass level 20. After I pass another five levels, five more levels! I’ll let you play!”","“Okay...”","“Then, we’ll wait a little more...”","“Look! The zombie is eating the wall-nut that Master planted. Haha! It looks so dumb!”","– Sometime later in Half City –","“Senior Sister... Shouldn’t we give the shop owner a hard beating to redeem the reputation of our Nanhua Faction?”","“We... will watch the TV Series first! Watch the TV Series first!” Mo Xian had a vicious light in her eyes. “After I master all the ultimate techniques in this TV Series, I’ll redeem the reputation of the Nanhua Faction!”","At this moment, she began to imagine the scenario where she mastered the Godly Sword Lightning-Controlling True Spell, using it to beat all the big forces in the Origins Internet Club and Mr. Fang, who was hiding behind them, and also return to the faction and defeat the Nanhua Heavenly Fairy, Liu Ningyun, with one sword strike.","“Great heavenly power, turn into godly lightning and follow the direction of my sword!” With a cold expression, Mo Xian chanted the incarnation in a low voice.","The other female disciples shrieked in excitement, “Senior Sister chanted the incantation perfectly!”","“I think she’s as good as Lu Xueqi!”","“She’ll look majestic when she uses this technique!”","“I’ll turn off your computers if you yell again!” Sitting nearby, Mr. Fang who was annoyed by all the noises, roared impatiently."]},{"number":300,"title":"Chapter 300 - I’m not smoking a cigarette but loneliness","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Embarrassed, the girls whispered to each other.","“He knows nothing but how to hide behind the grand cultivators!”","“Humph! His cultivation strength is even lower than the Ancestral Warrior Realm. I can beat him with one hand!”","“If not for the grand cultivators of the Divine Ocean Realm, Senior Sister would have defeated him long ago!”","“The stuff in this shop is miraculous, I wonder which senior master created them...”","“He must have benefited from that senior!”","“Humph!” Mo Xian snorted in disdain.","The girls imagined many satisfying scenarios to alleviate their frustration of being interrupted by Mr. Fang. “Let’s continue watching the TV Series!”","“After we reach the realm of the Earthly Immortal, as Green Leaf Ancestral Master did...” This scenario seemed distant, but it felt good to imagine it.","...","After playing the Legend of Mir 2 for a while, Mr. Fang returned to Qzone.","“Usero! Usero!” Song Qingfeng controlled Iori Yagami and copied this character’s shout while using Shiki Yami Barai.","On the other side, Lin Shao controlled Kyo Kusanagi and leaped over the purple flames created by Shiki Yami Barai. Then, Lin Shao pushed the joystick violently when Kyo Kusanagi landed on the ground!","On the screen, a huge fire beam rose around Kyo Kusanagi!","Desperation Move – Mu Shiki","Boom! Boom...","“You guys! Time is up!” Loli Jiang Xiaoyue had watched them play for a long time, and she was disgusted with them for occupying the computer in her boss’ Qzone. “It’s my turn to play Plants vs Zombies!”","“After this match! After this match!” Song Qingfeng yelled, “Light Kick! Kuzu Kaze! Ugh? Why didn’t I release it?”","“Trash Young Master Song, you can’t even use your moves! Watch me!”","Then, Xu Luo said, “Ugh? The shop owner is here. Would you like to play a few rounds, Sir?”","“Let’s do it!” Mr. Fang was eager to play. “I’ll fight you with one hand!”","“What?!” Jiang Xiaoyue exploded in fury. “I want to play Plants vs Zombies!”","“Why play Plants vs Zombies!” Mr. Fang looked contemptuous. “It’s fun to play the King of Fighters. Watch how I beat three guys senseless with only one hand!”","Then, he plunked on the seat.","“I will choose my characters randomly!” Mr. Fang clicked on three question marks which represented three random characters.","“Hey! Get off!” Displeased, Jiang Xiaoyue sat beside Fang Qi, trying to push him off with her petite body.","She tried her best but failed.","She pouted in anger, and her little face was full of disdain.","“I’ll only play for ten minutes!” Mr. Fang compromised.","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked away in disdain.","...","– On the other side –","“Master! Master!” Having watched for a long time, Fenghua and Yuexin asked weakly with tears on their faces, “Can you let us play for a bit?”","“We can buy computers in a couple of days... Let us have a try first...”","“Okay... Just one try!” Su Tianji had passed dozens of levels in one sitting. She felt like the game was average; it was simple and the zombies were stupid.","However, she still wanted to play it. Why?","It was thrilling when a big group of zombies swarmed up...","Besides, it was a good scene after she created a big group of cute and silly plants to fight zombies. It was a totally different experience from those other fancy games which featured life-like battles!","Fenghua and Yuexin fought to play the game. “I’ll play it first!”","“Hey! Let’s decide with rock-paper-scissors!” The girls waved their small fists...","“Your computer time is up!”","“Ahhh!”","The two girls felt like crying...","Su Tianji covered her forehead in embarrassment. “Ugh... You can play it tomorrow...”","...","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue finally got to play Plants vs Zombies.","“Boss, do you know how to play this game?” Jiang Xiaoyue had watched it, but she still felt uncertain since it was her first time playing it.","“Of course. It’s a simple game. Why not?”","“Put a peashooter here.” Mr. Fang directed her.","“Put it so far away?” Jiang Xiaoyue was baffled.","“Put a sunflower here and try to create a line.”","“Ugh? Why?” Jiang Xiaoyue was confused.","– Sometime later –","With intense background music, zombies walked leisurely into Jiang Xiaoyue’s house.","[Zombies invaded your house mercilessly!]","“Ahh!” Jiang Xiaoyue screamed when she heard the sound of the zombies gnawing brains.","She glared at Mr. Fang angrily and bared her teeth, wishing that she could bite him. “Scummy Boss!”","“What happened? What happened?” At this moment, people like Ruan Ning and Xi Yue also came into Fang Qi’s Qzone and saw Jiang Xiaoyue’s sulky face.","Hearing her recount the incident, they turned toward Fang Qi in unison and said in disdain, “You even bully Xiaoyue!”","“Old Demon Fang is heartless!”","“Scummy shop owner!”","“Xiaoyue, don’t heal him in the future!”","“Ignore him! Let’s play it. It’s very simple!”","“Okay!” They dumped Mr. Fang and began enjoying the game themselves.","They even sent a message in a small chat room named ‘Morning Star Dajin Small Chat Group’ where Mr. Fang wasn’t a member. [Scummy Mr. Fang even bullied Xiaoyue! He’s heartless!]","[Agreed. Old Demon Fang is heartless!]","[He’s an old pervert!]","[???] Nalan Mingxue sent three question marks.","Then, she sent a message to Mr. Fang. [What did you do this time?]","At this moment, Mr. Fang opened the door and walked out. After lighting a cigarette which he bought from the store in Qzone, he leaned on the doorframe and took a puff.","He spat out the smoke which floated up into the sky.","Nalan Mingxue walked in, nonplussed.","Curious about what had happened, people like Song Qingfeng and Lin Shao also came in.","“Hey! Sir, why are you here smoking all by yourself?”","“What do you know?” Mr. Fang exhaled a mouthful of smoke. “I’m not smoking a cigarette but loneliness.”","Nalan Mingxue touched her forehead.","Song Qingfeng: “...”","Lin Shao: “...”","Xu Luo: “...”","In the two QQ groups named ‘Morning Star Dajin Small Chat Group’ and ‘Dajin Game Center’, someone posted a picture of Mr. Fang leaning on the doorframe while smoking. Engulfed by smoke, he looked celestial. The words below the picture said, [I’m not smoking a cigarette but loneliness.]","[The shop owner is awesome!]","[What can I say?]","[He deserves this treatment...]","[These words are a perfect match for his expression...]","[Very dashing!]","[This kid is a damned genius...] An Huwei followed that up with an 😅 emoji.","After a while, a user with the ID of Junior Castellan An posted a picture of An Huwei smoking on a tobacco pipe in his Qzone with the words, [I’m not smoking tobacco but loneliness.]","An Huwei tried hard to explain, “Very dashing!”","Nalan Hongwu also posted a picture of himself smoking on a tobacco pipe while he lounged on an armchair. [I’m not smoking tobacco but loneliness.]","...","Sometime later, in the Dajin Royal Family’s Internal Chat Group, a picture was posted with the words, [I’m not smoking tobacco but loneliness]; it was from Emperor Ji Wu.","All the other members of the Royal Family fell silent."]}]);
